multiple in case they break)\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Runes for any charge orb spell you have the level to cast\",\"Unpowered orb\",\"Blessed gold bowl\",\"Yommi tree seeds\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Nezikchened (level 187) 3 times\"]},{\"n\":\"The water\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Defeat Nezikchened.\"},{\"t\":\"Push one of the boulders in the south room.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the blessed bowl on the sacred water.\",\"i\":[\"Blessed gold bowl\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the surface. Teleporting out will evaporate the water but the pool above ground is restored and can be used.\"}],\"i\":[\"Radimus notes\",\"A machete\",\"Rune or Dragon axe\",\"Lockpick (multiple in case they break)\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Runes for any charge orb spell you have the level to cast\",\"Unpowered orb\",\"Blessed gold bowl\",\"Yommi tree seeds\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Nezikchened (level 187) 3 times\"]},{\"n\":\"Making a totem\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to the Kharazi Jungle and be prepared for some fights.\",\"i\":[\"Radimus notes\",\"Rune or Dragon axe\",\"A machete\",\"Blessed gold bowl\",\"Yommi tree seeds\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a machete on the tall reeds next to the Kharazi's water pool.\",\"i\":[\"A machete\",\"Blessed gold bowl\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the reed on the water pool.\",\"i\":[\"Hollow reed\",\"Blessed gold bowl\"]},{\"t\":\"Plant the seeds in any patch of fertile soil. It's a bare patch that shows brown on the map. One is about 8 steps north and 5 steps west of the water pool. Another is in the west of the Kharazi Jungle, due west of the pool and south of the Mossy Rocks.\",\"i\":[\"Yommi tree seeds\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the golden bowl on the sapling.\",\"i\":[\"Golden bowl\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your axe on the adult yommi tree.\",\"i\":[\"Rune or Dragon axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your axe on the felled yommi tree.\",\"i\":[\"Rune or Dragon axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your axe once more on the tree.\",\"i\":[\"Rune or Dragon axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the totem pole.\"}],\"i\":[\"Radimus notes\",\"A machete\",\"Rune or Dragon axe\",\"Blessed gold bowl\",\"Yommi tree seeds\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Placing the totem\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Put Protect from Melee on, and use the new totem on one of the old brown totem poles in the jungle, such as the one east of the water pool. If you investigated the totem accidentally, wait for a few seconds before trying again.\",\"i\":[\"Yommi totem\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if you killed Viyeldi: kill San when he appears. If you saved Viyeldi, tap Done.\"},{\"t\":\"Only if you killed Viyeldi: kill Irvig when he appears. If you saved Viyeldi, tap Done.\"},{\"t\":\"Only if you killed Viyeldi: kill Ranalph when he appears. If you saved Viyeldi, tap Done.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Nezikchened.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the new totem on one of the corrupted totems.\",\"i\":[\"Yommi totem\"]}],\"i\":[\"Radimus notes\",\"A machete\",\"Rune or Dragon axe\",\"Yommi totem\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Nezikchened (level 187) 3 times\"]},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Swing the Bullroarer until Gujuo appears.\",\"i\":[\"Bullroarer\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Gujuo for a gilded totem.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Radimus Erkle inside the Legends' Guild's grounds.\",\"i\":[\"Gilded totem\",\"Radimus notes\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Radimus Erkle inside the Legends' Guild.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'll train now.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Radimus Erkle inside the Legends' Guild once more.\"}],\"i\":[\"Gilded totem\",\"Radimus notes\"]}]}"
        "Lost City" -> "{\"n\":\"Lost City\",\"items\":[\"Any axe\",\"Knife\"],\"rec\":[\"Runes, or a way of dealing damage which you can smuggle onto Entrana. Runes for Crumble Undead (level 39 Magic) are best\",\"Teleport, preferably to Lumbridge. Home teleport will work if off cooldown\"],\"enemies\":[\"Multiple zombies (level 25) (can be safespotted)\",\"Dramen Tree Spirit (level 101) (can be safespotted)\"],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"Access to Zanaris.\",\"Ability to craft Cosmic Runes\",\"Ability to buy and wield Dragon Daggers & Longswords\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Warrior south east of Draynor Village.\",\"s\":[\"What are you camped out here for?\",\"What makes you think it's out here?\",\"If it's hidden how are you planning to find it?\",\"Looks like you don't know either.\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Shamus\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Long-press the tree just to the west and choose Chop. The right tree says Chop, not Chop down.\",\"s\":[\"I've been in that shed, I didn't see a city.\"],\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Shamus.\",\"s\":[\"I've been in that shed, I didn't see a city.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Getting a Dramen branch\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bank all weapons and armour you have (including the axe), and go to Port Sarim to get a boat to Entrana.\",\"i\":[\"Runes, or a way of dealing damage which you can smuggle onto Entrana. Runes for Crumble Undead (level 39 Magic) are best\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the ladder on the north side of the island. Once you go down, you can only escape via teleport.\",\"s\":[\"Well that is a risk I will have to take.\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill zombies until one drops an axe.\"},{\"t\":\"Go south-east past the two level 92 Greater Demons to the Dramen tree. Don't go through the magic door: it takes you into the Wilderness. Attempt to cut a branch from the tree. Be prepared for a Tree Spirit (level 101) to appear, which you can safespot behind nearby fungus.\",\"i\":[\"Bronze or Iron axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Tree Spirit. They can be safespotted behind nearby fungi to the east.\"},{\"t\":\"Cut at least one branch from the Dramen tree. It's recommended you cut at least 4 branches so you don't have to return in future quests.\"},{\"t\":\"Teleport away with the branches, preferably to Lumbridge.\",\"i\":[\"Dramen branch\"]}],\"tr\":[\"Teleport, preferably to Lumbridge. Home teleport will work if off cooldown\"],\"r\":[\"Runes, or a way of dealing damage which you can smuggle onto Entrana. Runes for Crumble Undead (level 39 Magic) are best\"]},{\"n\":\"Entering Zanaris\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use a knife on the dramen branch to craft a dramen staff.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Dramen branch\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the shed south of Lumbridge with your Dramen Staff equipped.\",\"i\":[\"Dramen staff\"]}],\"i\":[\"Knife\"]}]}"
        "Lunar Diplomacy" -> "{\"n\":\"Lunar Diplomacy\",\"items\":[\"Bullseye lantern\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Guam leaf\",\"Marrentill\",\"Dramen staff\",\"Access to the Air Altar\",\"Access to the Earth Altar\",\"Access to the Fire Altar\",\"Access to the Water Altar\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Hammer\",\"Thread\",\"Needle\",\"Spade\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Combat runes\",\"Moonclan Teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"Multiple Suqah (level 111)\",\"Me (level 79)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"5,000 Magic XP\",\"5,000 Runecraft XP\",\"50 x Astral Runes\",\"A Seal of Passage\",\"A set of Lunar Equipment\",\"Access to Lunar Island\",\"Access to the Lunar Spellbook\",\"Access to the Astral Altar\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Investigating\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Lokar Searunner on Rellekka's docks.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"You've been away from these parts a while?\",\"Why did you leave?\",\"Why not, I've always wondered what the state of my innards are!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brundt in Rellekka's longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about a Seal of Passage.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Lokar Searunner on Rellekka's docks.\",\"s\":[\"Arrr! Yar! Let's be on our way, yar!\"],\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb up to the ship.\"},{\"t\":\"Equip the seal of passage, then talk to Captain Bentley.\",\"s\":[\"Can we sail to Lunar Isle now?\"],\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bullseye lantern\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"n\":\"The curse\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go down to talk to 'Birds-Eye' Jack.\"},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs to talk to Bentley again.\",\"s\":[\"Perhaps it's the Navigator's fault?\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down to talk to 'Birds-Eye' Jack again.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up to the main deck and talk to 'Eagle-eye' Shultz at the north end of the ship.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the bottom deck to talk to 'Beefy' Burns.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the top deck to talk to 'Lecherous' Lee.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down to the deck to talk to First mate 'Davey-boy'.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up to the Cabin Boy.\"},{\"t\":\"If your bullseye lantern is lit, extinguish it first. Then use the emerald lens on the lantern.\",\"i\":[\"Emerald lens\",\"Bullseye lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Light the emerald lantern.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Emerald lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the top deck and use the lit emerald lantern on the east cannon to remove its symbol. If that doesn't work, try the other cannon.\",\"s\":[\"Rub away!\"],\"i\":[\"Emerald lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the main deck and use the lit emerald lantern on the wallchart in the south room to remove its symbol.\",\"s\":[\"Rub away!\"],\"i\":[\"Emerald lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the emerald lantern on the chest in the north of the bottom deck.\",\"s\":[\"Rub away!\"],\"i\":[\"Emerald lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the emerald lantern on the pillar next to the kitchen of the bottom deck.\",\"s\":[\"Rub away!\"],\"i\":[\"Emerald lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the emerald lantern on the crate in the kitchen of the bottom deck.\",\"s\":[\"Rub away!\"],\"i\":[\"Emerald lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Bentley to set sail.\"}],\"i\":[\"Bullseye lantern\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"n\":\"Starting diplomacy\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the town on Lunar Isle.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Oneiromancer in the south east of Lunar Isle.\",\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baba Yaga in the chicken-legged house in the north of Lunar Isle's town.\",\"s\":[\"The Oneiromancer told me you may be able to help...\"],\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave Baba Yaga's house and fill the vial with water at the sink just south-east of it.\",\"i\":[\"Empty vial\"]},{\"t\":\"Add guam to the vial of water.\",\"i\":[\"Empty vial\",\"Guam leaf\"]},{\"t\":\"Add marrentill to the guam vial.\",\"i\":[\"Marrentill\",\"Guam vial\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Suqah outside the town on Lunar Isle for a tooth. You'll also need 4 hides for later, so pick them up.\"},{\"t\":\"Grind the suqah tooth.\",\"i\":[\"Suqah tooth\",\"Pestle and mortar\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the ground tooth to the guam-marr potion.\",\"i\":[\"Ground tooth\",\"Guam-marr vial\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the Oneiromancer with the waking sleep vial.\"}],\"i\":[\"Guam leaf\",\"Marrentill\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Seal of passage\",\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Making the staff\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Air Altar and use a dramen staff on it.\",\"i\":[\"Access to the Air Altar\",\"Dramen staff\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Fire Altar and use a partially made lunar staff on it.\",\"i\":[\"Access to the Fire Altar\",\"Lunar staff - pt1\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Water Altar and use the partially made lunar staff on it.\",\"i\":[\"Access to the Water Altar\",\"Lunar staff - pt2\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Earth Altar and use a partially made lunar staff on it.\",\"i\":[\"Access to the Earth Altar\",\"Lunar staff - pt3\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lokar Searunner on Rellekka's docks and choose Go now. Climb up to the ship, talk to Captain Bentley to sail to Lunar Isle, then climb down to the island. Bring the staff to the Oneiromancer in the south east of Lunar Isle.\",\"s\":[\"Go now.\"],\"i\":[\"Lunar staff\",\"Seal of passage\"]}],\"i\":[\"Dramen staff\",\"Access to the Air Altar\",\"Access to the Fire Altar\",\"Access to the Water Altar\",\"Access to the Earth Altar\"]},{\"n\":\"Making the helmet\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the mine in the north east of Lunar Isle.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine a lunar ore from one of the stalagmites in the area. (Tip: Grab 3 extra ores to save time during The Fremennik Exiles quest)\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Smelt the ore at a furnace, or cast Superheat Item on it. The closest furnace and anvil are in Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Lunar ore\"]},{\"t\":\"Make the lunar helmet on an anvil.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Lunar bar\",\"Hammer\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"n\":\"Getting the cape\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Pauline Polaris in the west of Lunar Isle's town.\",\"s\":[\"Pauline?\",\"Jane Blud-Hagic-Maid\"],\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Getting the amulet\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Meteora in the south of Lunar Isle's town.\",\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Suqah outside the town for a special tiara. You'll also need 4 hides for making clothes, so pick them up.\"},{\"t\":\"Return the tiara to Meteora in the south of Lunar Isle's town.\",\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\",\"A special tiara\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Getting the ring\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Selene in the west of Lunar Isle's town.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for a ring.\"],\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the town and run south, then west past the two bridges. In the far south-west of Lunar Isle, dig on the blue flowers furthest west. Read the message to the end, or you won't get the ring.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]}],\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"n\":\"Making the clothing\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Have Rimae in the east of Lunar Isle's town tan 4 suqah hides, and craft them into the torso, gloves, boots and legs.\",\"s\":[\"You know the ceremonial clothes?\",\"That seems like a fair deal.\"],\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\",\"Suqah hide (4)\",\"Coins (400)\",\"Needle\",\"Thread\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins (400)\",\"Needle\",\"Thread\",\"Suqah hide (4)\"]},{\"n\":\"Return to Oneiromancer\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bring all the items to the Oneiromancer in the south east of Lunar Isle.\",\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\",\"Lunar amulet\",\"Lunar boots\",\"Lunar cape\",\"Lunar gloves\",\"Lunar helm\",\"Lunar legs\",\"Lunar ring\",\"Lunar torso\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Entering the Dreamland\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use the waking sleep potion on the kindling\",\"i\":[\"Waking sleep vial\",\"Kindling\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip your lunar equipment, some combat runes, and light the Brazier in the west of Lunar Isle's town.\",\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Soaked kindling\",\"Lunar helm\",\"Lunar torso\",\"Lunar legs\",\"Lunar boots\",\"Lunar gloves\",\"Lunar cape\",\"Lunar amulet\",\"Lunar ring\",\"Lunar staff\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the soaked kindling to the Brazier in the west of Lunar Isle's town.\",\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\",\"Soaked kindling\",\"Lunar helm\",\"Lunar torso\",\"Lunar legs\",\"Lunar boots\",\"Lunar gloves\",\"Lunar cape\",\"Lunar amulet\",\"Lunar ring\",\"Lunar staff\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Ethereal Being.\"}],\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"n\":\"Racing challenge\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"From the centre of the Dream World, go on the yellow-green platform to the east for the race challenge.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Ethereal Expert. Be prepared to race!\",\"s\":[\"Ok.\"]},{\"t\":\"Race to the end of the course to win!\"}]},{\"n\":\"Number challenge\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"From the centre of the Dream World, go on the pink platform to the south-east for the number challenge.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Ethereal Numerator to begin the challenge.\"},{\"t\":\"Complete the numbers challenge.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Mimic challenge\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"From the centre of the Dream World, go on the teal platform to the south, just west of the pink one, for the mimic challenge.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Ethereal Mimic. Watch which emote he does (cry, bow, dance, wave or think) and do the same one from your Emotes tab. He then teleports: long-press him and choose Talk-to (a plain tap can step you onto the platform and restart the challenge), then copy the next emote. After 5 correct emotes he sends you back.\",\"s\":[\"Suppose I may as well have a go.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Chance challenge\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"From the centre of the Dream World, go on the green and yellow platform to the south-west for the chance challenge.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Ethereal Fluke, then solve the dice challenge.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Memory challenge\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"From the centre of the Dream World, go on the white platform to the north-west for the memory challenge.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Ethereal Guide, then solve the memory puzzle.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Tree challenge\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"From the centre of the Dream World, go on the blue platform to the north-north-east for the trees challenge.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ethereal Perceptive to begin. Cut 20 logs and deposit them on the log piles faster than he does.\",\"s\":[\"Ok, let's go!\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Final challenge\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Ethereal Being. Be prepared to fight.\",\"s\":[\"Of course. I'm ready.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight your dream self, the level 79 enemy called Me. It attacks with melee and teleports you around the arena now and then.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back to the centre of the Dream World and talk to the Ethereal Being, then read My Life on the lectern there to return to Lunar Isle.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Oneiromancer in the south east of Lunar Isle to finish the quest! (Remember to equip the seal of passage)\",\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1}]}"
        "Mage Arena I" -> "{\"n\":\"Mage Arena I\",\"items\":[\"Knife or sharp weapon to cut through a web\",\"Runes for fighting Kolodion\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Kolodion in 5 forms, up to level 112\"],\"rewards\":[\"A God Staff\",\"A God Cape\",\"Ability to unlock 3 new God Spells.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Getting to the Mage Arena\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the Mage Arena in the deep Wilderness. The quickest way is the lever in the Edgeville ruins, or the one in the small building near the gate to West Ardougne: both teleport you to the Deserted Keep. Run north, cut the web with your knife or slash weapon, then go west to the small broken-down house north-west of the arena. Cut the webs inside and pull the lever on its wall. This is IN THE WILDERNESS, so don't bring anything you don't want to lose.\",\"i\":[\"Knife or sharp weapon to cut through a web\"]}],\"i\":[\"Knife or sharp weapon to cut through a web\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Defeating Kolodion\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Kolodion, ready for fighting him in the Mage Arena.\",\"s\":[\"Can I fight here?\",\"Yes indeedy.\",\"Okay, let's fight.\"],\"i\":[\"Runes for fighting Kolodion\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat Kolodion's 5 forms using Magic, the only style that hurts him. Protect from Magic blocks his attacks.\"}],\"i\":[\"Runes for fighting Kolodion\"]},{\"n\":\"Getting your rewards\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the sparkling pool.\"},{\"t\":\"Pray at the statue of the god whose cape you want. Pick up the cape which appears.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Chamber Guardian for your staff.\",\"i\":[\"God cape\"]}]}]}"
        "Mage Arena II" -> "{\"n\":\"Mage Arena II\",\"items\":[\"Knife or sharp weapon to cut through a web\",\"Zamorak staff\",\"Guthix staff\",\"Saradomin staff\",\"Runes for 50+ casts of god spells\"],\"rec\":[\"Magic combat gear\",\"Saradomin brews\",\"Super restores\",\"Food\",\"Rings of recoil\"],\"enemies\":[\"Porazdir (level 235)\",\"Justiciar Zachariah (level 348)\",\"Derwen (level 235)\"],\"rewards\":[\"Ability to upgrade your God Cape\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Upgrading the God Cape\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pull the lever in the building north of the Mage Arena. This is IN THE WILDERNESS, so don't bring anything you don't want to lose.\",\"i\":[\"Knife or sharp weapon to cut through a web\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Kolodion.\",\"s\":[\"Are there any more challenges available?\",\"Great, I've been waiting for an improvement!\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the Enchanted Symbol to locate the 3 bosses. It's recommended to find where a boss is with just food and the symbol, then once you have the location gear up and come fight it. Fight bosses with their respective god staff and spell, food, potions, and armour you're willing to risk. Protect from Magic, and once you've killed them take their drop to Kolodion.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a god cape of your choice on Kolodion to have it imbued.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"God cape\"]}],\"i\":[\"Knife or sharp weapon to cut through a web\",\"Saradomin staff\",\"Guthix staff\",\"Zamorak staff\",\"Runes for 50+ casts of god spells\"],\"c\":1}]}"
        "Making Friends with My Arm" -> "{\"n\":\"Making Friends with My Arm\",\"items\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Bolt of cloth\",\"Mahogany plank (5)\",\"Cadava berries\",\"Combat gear, preferably ranged or melee\"],\"rec\":[\"Draynor teleport (2)\",\"Trollheim teleports\",\"Varrock teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"Don't Know What (level 163)\",\"Mother (level 198)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"10,000 Construction XP\",\"40,000 Firemaking XP\",\"50,000 Mining XP\",\"50,000 Agility XP\",\"Access to the Salt Mines.\",\"Ability to build fire pits\",\"Ability to tune a house portal to Troll Stronghold.\",\"Access to a disease free herb patch in Weiss.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Troll Stronghold and go down the staircase to the south. Talk to Burntmeat in the kitchen there.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'll take your quest.\",\"Why in the heck would you choose My Arm?\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back up the stairs, then climb the ladder in the west of the Troll Stronghold to the roof. Talk to My Arm by the herb patch.\",\"s\":[\"I'm doing another quest for Burntmeat.\",\"Wolfbone said we should go by sea.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Getting to Weiss\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Larry north east of Rellekka.\",\"s\":[\"Can I transport My Arm in your boat?\",\"Never mind, I just need to borrow your boat.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Larry again.\",\"s\":[\"Can I transport My Arm in your boat?\",\"Never mind, I just need to borrow your boat.\"]},{\"t\":\"Board Larry's boat to Weiss.\",\"s\":[\"Travel to Weiss.\"]},{\"t\":\"Attempt to mine the cave entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the wrecked boat for a pickaxe and rope.\",\"s\":[\"Take rope\",\"Take pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the rockslide.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the nearby tree.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the rope.\"},{\"t\":\"Cross the ledge.\"},{\"t\":\"Continue climbing.\"},{\"t\":\"Pass the fallen tree.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Boulder.\",\"s\":[\"You only need to let My Arm in, not me.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Infiltrating Weiss\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Sneak into Weiss via the fence to the east.\",\"s\":[\"I'll be back!\"]},{\"t\":\"Go south along the city's edge, then west, stopping in safe spots between runs. Keep going until you reach a small alleyway to the north, east of the ice wolf pen. Stop there and let your run energy recover.\"},{\"t\":\"Run to the bucket spawn a little to the north-west and stand there for a moment.\",\"tip\":\"To get into the hole: tap the Little Boulder just north of you, and just before you reach it, tap the hole further north. It may take a few tries.\"},{\"t\":\"Wait a few seconds, and run into the hole.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the narrow gap to the south quickly.\"},{\"t\":\"Take off your weapon and shield so your hands are empty. Enter the water and swim east across it, avoiding the rocks the trolls throw. Wait a few seconds before making for the east shore.\"},{\"t\":\"You now need a path of 5 stones in the water, each touching the last, ending at the north shore. Swim to the square 5 squares south of that shore. When the troll starts its throwing animation, move one square north, towards the cave exit, so the rock lands where you stood. Repeat until the stones reach the shore. If you fail, you're sent back to just before these trolls.\"},{\"t\":\"Mine the cave exit.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Mother in Weiss.\",\"s\":[\"Let's move on with the chat.\",\"Tell him goutweed is delicious.\",\"Tell him how tough Stronghold trolls are.\",\"Tell him to show respect to his daughter.\",\"Tell him you love his daughter!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm in Weiss.\",\"s\":[\"Odd Mushroom, why are you here with us?\",\"Does Mother respect anything except fighting?\",\"I did some fishing and fetched some stuff.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Mother (level 198)\"]},{\"n\":\"Faking death\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about My Arm.\",\"Can you pretend you're dead?\",\"You owe me a favour after the Fishing Colony quest.\"]},{\"t\":\"Build the coffin in the Wise Old Man's house.\",\"i\":[\"Saw\",\"Hammer\",\"Mahogany plank (5)\",\"Bolt of cloth\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Apothecary in Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about Making Friends with My Arm.\"],\"i\":[\"Cadava berries\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the cadava potion to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about My Arm.\"],\"i\":[\"Reduced cadava potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the coffin in the Wise Old Man's house.\"}],\"i\":[\"Saw\",\"Hammer\",\"Mahogany plank (5)\",\"Bolt of cloth\",\"Cadava berries\"]},{\"n\":\"Rising up\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to Larry's boat north-east of Rellekka and board it to travel to Weiss.\",\"s\":[\"Travel to Weiss.\"],\"i\":[\"Old man's coffin\",\"Combat gear, preferably ranged or melee\"]},{\"t\":\"Go through the cave entrance by the landing. You cleared it earlier, and it leads straight into the city.\",\"i\":[\"Old man's coffin\",\"Combat gear, preferably ranged or melee\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm by the north entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Old man's coffin\",\"Combat gear, preferably ranged or melee\"]},{\"t\":\"After the cutscene you're in the prison: talk to Odd Mushroom there. If you've left the prison, first talk to Boulder in Weiss, ready to fight, to get back in.\",\"s\":[\"I'll never leave you.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Snowflake. Be prepared to fight Don't Know What. Protect from Ranged, and move around to avoid his attacks.\",\"s\":[\"So I can't teleport, and I may lose stuff? Okay.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, preferably ranged or melee\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Don't Know What. Move around and Protect from Ranged to avoid his attacks.\"},{\"t\":\"You now need to put out the fire. Pick up a bucket from the bucket pile.\"},{\"t\":\"Fill the bucket on the barrel of water.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the full bucket on the Fire of Domination.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Mother. Protect from Ranged, keep moving and keep your distance.\"}],\"i\":[\"Old man's coffin\",\"Combat gear, preferably ranged or melee\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Don't Know What (level 163)\",\"Mother (level 198)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm in Weiss.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Wise Old Man in Weiss.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Snowflake in Weiss.\",\"s\":[\"Okay, I'll be back.\"]},{\"t\":\"If you don't have an empty bucket, pick up a bucket of water in the north east building of Weiss and empty it. Then use the bucket to pick up some goat poo in the same building.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the goat poo to Snowflake.\",\"i\":[\"Goat dung\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the Weiss fire notes.\",\"i\":[\"Weiss fire notes\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Snowflake to finish.\"}]}]}"
        "Making History" -> "{\"n\":\"Making History\",\"items\":[\"Spade\",\"Sapphire amulet\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleports to Ardougne (3)\",\"Ectophial, or method of getting to Port Phasmatys\",\"Ring of Dueling\",\"Necklace of passage\",\"Relleka Teleport\",\"Potions/Items to restore run energy\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"1,000 Crafting XP\",\"1,000 Prayer XP\",\"750 x Coins\",\"An Enchanted Key\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Jorral at the outpost south of the Tree Gnome Stronghold. You can teleport there with a Necklace of Passage.\",\"s\":[\"The Outpost\",\"Tell me more.\",\"Ok, I'll make a stand for history!\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Find the book\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Silver Merchant in the East Ardougne Market.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the outpost.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to Castle Wars and cross both bridges to the north. Stop about 4 steps north of the east side of the second bridge. When the enchanted key feels steaming, you're on the spot: dig there with a spade.\",\"i\":[\"Enchanted key\",\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the enchanted key on the chest.\",\"i\":[\"Enchanted key\",\"Chest\"]}],\"i\":[\"Spade\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Fremennik tale\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Blanin in south east Rellekka.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Dron in north Rellekka.\",\"s\":[\"I'm after important answers.\",\"Why, you're the famous warrior Dron!\",\"An iron mace\",\"Breakfast\",\"Lunch\",\"Bunnies\",\"Red\",\"36\",\"8\",\"Fifth and Fourth\",\"North East side of town\",\"Blanin\",\"Fluffy\",\"12, but what does that have to do with anything?\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Find the scroll\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter Port Phasmatys and talk to Droalak outside the general store.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Give Melina a sapphire amulet in the house north east of the general store.\",\"i\":[\"Sapphire amulet\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Droalak outside the general store.\"}],\"i\":[\"Sapphire amulet\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Jorral north of West Ardougne with the scroll and journal.\",\"i\":[\"Scroll\",\"Journal\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in East Ardougne castle, in the centre of the city just across the river, and talk to King Lathas on the 1st floor.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the outpost.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Jorral north of West Ardougne with the letter to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Letter\"]}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Meat and Greet" -> "{\"n\":\"Meat and Greet\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[\"Stamina potion\",\"Prayer potion\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Teleport to Civitas illa Fortis (3)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Dire Wolf Alpha (lvl 113)\",\"Minotaur (lvl 193)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"8,000 Cooking XP\",\"Access to Emelio's Kebab Shop\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Supply chain issues\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Emelio in Outer Fortis at the south-eastern entrance of Civitas illa Fortis to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Spice Merchant in the Bazaar in the middle of Civitas illa Fortis about the missing delivery.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here about a missing delivery.\",\"Could I have a look at that locked box?\",\"About that missing delivery...\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the code 2546 on the locked box of spices, then tap the right-facing arrow to open it.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Alba in the farmhouse west of Civitas illa Fortis.\"},{\"t\":\"Head west from the farm and enter the Wolf Den, prepared to kill the Dire Wolf Alpha.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Dire Wolf Alpha. Use Protect from Melee to avoid most damage. His pups deal ranged damage.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Alba in the farmhouse west of Civitas illa Fortis to tell them about the Dire Wolf Alpha's demise.\"}],\"i\":[\"Stamina potion\",\"Prayer potion\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Dire Wolf Alpha (lvl 113)\"]},{\"n\":\"The golden ratio\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Emelio in Outer Fortis at the south-eastern entrance of Civitas illa Fortis to find the perfect ratio of ingredients for the kebab.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Emelio and set the recipe to 4 portions of meat, 2 of salad, 1 of spice and 3 of sauce.\",\"s\":[\"I think so.\",\"Adjust meat (currently at one portion).\",\"Adjust meat (currently at two portions).\",\"Adjust meat (currently at three portions).\",\"Adjust salad (currently at one portion).\",\"Adjust salad (currently at three portions).\",\"Adjust salad (currently at four portions).\",\"Adjust spice (currently at two portions).\",\"Adjust spice (currently at three portions).\",\"Adjust spice (currently at four portions).\",\"Adjust sauce (currently at one portion).\",\"Adjust sauce (currently at two portions).\",\"Adjust sauce (currently at four portions).\",\"Cancel.\",\"Four (current).\",\"Four.\",\"Two (current).\",\"Two.\",\"One (current).\",\"One.\",\"Three (current).\",\"Three.\"]},{\"t\":\"Tell Emelio the recipe is perfect. He gives you a test kebab.\",\"s\":[\"I think that's perfect!\",\"Sounds good to me.\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the test kebab to Renata outside. Vincens or Lucas will do as well.\",\"i\":[\"Test kebab\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Emelio with news of your kebab success!\"}],\"i\":[\"Stamina potion\",\"Prayer potion\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Guerilla marketing\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Head into the Fortis Colosseum, then into the southern room and talk to Lelia about kebab sales.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Test kebab (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lelia after letting her taste your test kebab.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Test kebab\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lelia in the southern room, ready to fight the Minotaur.\",\"s\":[\"I think so.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Test kebab\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight the Minotaur. Protect from Melee to avoid most damage. When it shouts Moo! switch to Protect from Magic for one attack.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lelia in the southern room of the Fortis Colosseum after defeating the Minotaur.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Emelio in Outer Fortis at the south-eastern entrance of Civitas illa Fortis and tell him about your success.\"}],\"i\":[\"Prayer potion\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Minotaur (lvl 193)\"]}]}"
        "Merlin's Crystal" -> "{\"n\":\"Merlin's Crystal\",\"items\":[\"Combat gear + food for Sir Mordred (level 39)\",\"Bread\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Bucket of wax\",\"Bat bones\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport to Varrock\",\"Teleport to Camelot\",\"Teleports to Falador (2)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Sir Mordred (level 39)\"],\"rewards\":[\"6 Quest points\",\"Excalibur\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to King Arthur in Camelot Castle to start.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"I want to become a Knight of the Round Table!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sir Gawain about how Merlin got trapped.\",\"s\":[\"Do you know how Merlin got trapped?\"]},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs to talk to Lancelot.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sir Lancelot about getting into Morgan Le Faye's stronghold.\",\"s\":[\"Any ideas on how to get into Morgan Le Faye's stronghold?\",\"Thank you for the information.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Infiltrate the fortress\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Hide in Arhein's crate behind the Candle Maker's shop in Catherby.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in the fortress.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up another floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Attack Sir Mordred down to 0hp to cause Morgan Le Faye to spawn.\",\"s\":[\"Tell me how to untrap Merlin and I might.\",\"Ok I will do all that.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go through Morgan le Faye's dialog. IF YOU EXIT FROM THIS DIALOG YOU WILL HAVE TO FIGHT MORDRED AGAIN.\",\"s\":[\"Tell me how to untrap Merlin and I might.\",\"Ok I will do all that.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear + food for Sir Mordred (level 39)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Sir Mordred (level 39)\"]},{\"n\":\"Get bat bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb down from Keep Le Faye and step through the front door.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill a Giant bat outside Keep Le Faye for some bat bones.\",\"i\":[\"Bat bones\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Get a Black Candle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Catherby.\"},{\"t\":\"If you already have a bucket of wax, skip to talking to the Candle Maker in Catherby. If you still need wax, go grab the insect repellent in a house in north Catherby.\",\"i\":[\"Insect repellent\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if you still need wax: go grab the bucket in the bee field west of Catherby.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if you still need wax: use the insect repellent on a bee hive, then try to take some wax.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\",\"Insect repellent\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Candle Maker in Catherby twice until he gives you a black candle.\",\"s\":[\"Have you got any black candles?\"],\"i\":[\"Bucket of wax\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Get Excalibur\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Lady of the Lake in Taverley.\",\"s\":[\"I seek the sword Excalibur.\"]},{\"t\":\"Attempt to enter the jewelery store in Port Sarim.\",\"s\":[\"Yes certainly.\",\"Yes, here you go.\"],\"i\":[\"Bread\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the beggar who appears and give him some bread.\",\"s\":[\"Yes certainly.\",\"Yes, here you go.\"],\"i\":[\"Bread\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bread\"]},{\"n\":\"Learn magic words\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Check the altar in the Zamorak Temple in south east Varrock. If you've already learnt the spell, tap Done.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Perform the spell\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the gates towards Camelot Castle.\",\"i\":[\"Excalibur\",\"Black candle\",\"Bat bones\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Go stand in the star symbol north east of Camelot Castle.\",\"i\":[\"Excalibur\",\"Black candle\",\"Bat bones\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Light the Black candle with your tinderbox.\",\"i\":[\"Black candle\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Standing in the star, long-press the bat bones in your inventory and choose Drop. Don't bury them.\",\"s\":[\"Snarthon Candtrick Termanto\"],\"i\":[\"Bat bones\",\"Excalibur\",\"Lit black candle\"]},{\"t\":\"Say the spell 'Snarthon Candtrick Termanto'. Be careful not to tap the wrong option or you'll have to get another Black Candle.\",\"s\":[\"Snarthon Candtrick Termanto\"],\"i\":[\"Excalibur\"]}],\"i\":[\"Black candle\",\"Bat bones\",\"Excalibur\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"n\":\"Free Merlin\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go up the ladder in the south east of Camelot castle.\",\"i\":[\"Excalibur\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the next ladder.\",\"i\":[\"Excalibur\"]},{\"t\":\"Use Excalibur on the Giant Crystal to smash it. You don't need to be able to wield it.\",\"i\":[\"Excalibur\"]},{\"t\":\"Tell King Arthur you've freed Merlin.\"}]}]}"
        "Misthalin Mystery" -> "{\"n\":\"Misthalin Mystery\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"600 Crafting XP\",\"Uncut Ruby\",\"Uncut Emerald\",\"Uncut Sapphire\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Talk to Abigale\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Abigale in the south east corner of Lumbridge Swamp.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Enter the manor\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Board the rowboat south of Abigale.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the bucket near the fountain.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the barrel of rainwater north of the fountain to trigger a cutscene.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bucket on the barrel of rainwater.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the barrel of rainwater for the manor key.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the manor.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Solve the first puzzle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Take the knife from the table.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Try to open the door with the pink handle.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the note that appeared.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the notes.\",\"i\":[\"Notes\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the room south-west of the entrance hall. Use your knife on the painting on the east wall, the one with mountains, a blue river and the sun on the horizon.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the painting for a ruby key.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the door with the ruby handle.\",\"i\":[\"Ruby key\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Solve the second puzzle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the shelves for a tinderbox.\"},{\"t\":\"Light the unlit candles in the room.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Light the fuse on the barrel.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the room to trigger the explosion.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb over the damaged wall.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Solve the third puzzle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"After climbing over the wall, walk north along the outside of the manor, then west along its north side to the trees at the far end. Observe Lacey through the trees.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the note that appeared by the fence.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the notes.\",\"i\":[\"Notes\"]},{\"t\":\"Walk back east along the north side of the manor to its north-east corner and go in through the damaged wall there to the piano room. Play the piano for the emerald key. Press D, E, A, D, using the first D, E and A keys from the left. If you press a wrong key, start again.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the piano and choose Search to get the emerald key.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Witness another murder\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb back over the damaged wall into the manor.\",\"i\":[\"Emerald key\"]},{\"t\":\"Go through the door with the green handle.\",\"i\":[\"Emerald key\"]},{\"t\":\"Try to open the kitchen doors just past the green door. Mandy and a Bandos godsword are in the room behind them.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Solve the fourth puzzle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pick up the note that appeared by the door.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the notes.\",\"i\":[\"Notes\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back to the south-east room with the damaged wall and go through its north door. Use a knife on the unlit fireplace in that room.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the fireplace and solve the puzzle for the sapphire key. Tap the sapphire, diamond, zenyte, emerald, onyx, then ruby.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the fireplace again for the sapphire key.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Confront the killer\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go back to the room where you slashed the painting, south-west of the entrance hall, and go through the door with the blue handle on its west side.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the mirror to bounce the killer's knives back at him. A black swirl appears briefly around the wardrobe he'll throw from. Push the mirror into that wardrobe's row or column, then push it at least once more towards the wardrobe so it faces it. Keep going until a cutscene starts. If your phone won't let you move the mirror, log out and back in, or take off your weapon.\"},{\"t\":\"Watch the killer's reveal cutscene.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the killer's knife.\",\"i\":[\"Killer's knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip the killer's knife, then select Fight on Abigale (no actual combat will occur).\",\"i\":[\"Killer's knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Attempt to go through the sapphire door.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Mandy just outside the manor to complete the quest.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Monk's Friend" -> "{\"n\":\"Monk's Friend\",\"items\":[\"Jug of Water\",\"Logs\"],\"rec\":[\"Ardougne cloak 1 or higher for teleports to the monastery\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"2,000 Woodcutting XP\",\"8 x Law Runes\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Brother Omad in the monastery south of East Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Why can't you sleep, what's wrong?\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Jug of Water\",\"Logs\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finding the blanket\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go down the ladder in a circle of stones west of the monastery.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the Child's blanket in the room to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Child's blanket\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back up the ladder.\",\"i\":[\"Child's blanket\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the blanket back to Brother Omad in the monastery.\",\"i\":[\"Child's blanket\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Help Cedric\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Brother Omad again.\",\"s\":[\"Is there anything else I can help with?\",\"Who's Brother Cedric?\",\"Where should I look?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brother Cedric north of the monastery, directly south of Ardougne Zoo, near the well.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brother Cedric again.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'd be happy to!\"],\"i\":[\"Jug of Water\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brother Cedric once again with logs.\",\"i\":[\"Logs\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Brother Omad to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Monkey Madness I" -> "{\"n\":\"Monkey Madness I\",\"items\":[\"Gold bar\",\"Ball of wool\",\"Banana (5)\",\"Monkey bones or corpse\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\",\"Antipoison\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Tree Gnome Stronghold teleport via Spirit Tree (2), Gnome Glider (Ta Quir Priw), or Grand Seed Pod (4)\",\"Any teleport to leave Ape Atoll (3)\",\"Ardougne teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"Jungle Demon (level 195)\"],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"55,000 Experience Combat Lamp (Over multiple Skills)\",\"10000 x Coins\",\"3 x Diamonds\",\"Ability to purchase and wield the Dragon Scimitar.\",\"Full access to Ape Atoll.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to King Narnode Shareen in the Tree Gnome Stronghold.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Stamina potions\"]}],\"i\":[\"Tree Gnome Stronghold teleport via Spirit Tree (2), Gnome Glider (Ta Quir Priw), or Grand Seed Pod\"]},{\"n\":\"Investigate the shipyard\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb the ladders in the Grand Tree to the top floor, choosing Climb Up on the way. Talk to Captain Errdo and fly to Gandius.\",\"s\":[\"Climb Up.\"],\"i\":[\"Gnome royal seal\"]},{\"t\":\"Go north from the glider landing site and enter the shipyard through its gate, with the gnome royal seal in your inventory. Talk to G.L.O. Caranock in the building in the south of the shipyard, near the fence.\",\"i\":[\"Gnome royal seal\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to King Narnode Shareen in the Tree Gnome Stronghold.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Traveling to Ape Atoll\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Daero in the bar on the 1st floor of the Grand Tree, on its east side. Ask about each topic in turn, going back to the menu after each one, then choose Leave..., Who is it? and, if he asks, Yes. Choose list: Talk about the journey... / Return to previous menu / Talk about the 10th squad... / Return to previous menu / Talk about Caranock... / Return to previous menu / Leave... / Who is it? / Yes\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the journey...\",\"Return to previous menu\",\"Talk about the 10th squad...\",\"Return to previous menu\",\"Talk about Caranock...\",\"Return to previous menu\",\"Leave...\",\"Who is it?\"],\"i\":[\"Narnode's orders\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Antipoison\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Any teleport to leave Ape Atoll\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Daero in the hangar. Choose Talk-to, not Travel.\"},{\"t\":\"Operate the reinitialisation panel in the south-east of the hangar, by the southern glider, and solve the sliding puzzle. The Solution button shows the finished picture, and spare controls from the nearby crate show it too. To skip the puzzle, you can pay Glough in the Stronghold 200,000 coins instead. If you pay him, skip the two puzzle tips below and go on to talking to Daero in the hangar again.\"},{\"t\":\"Number the pieces from the top left, reading across each row. Put 1, 2 and 3 in place. Move 4 to the top right corner with 5 under it, then slide 4 left and 5 up to finish the row. Do the second and third rows the same way.\"},{\"t\":\"For the last two rows, put 16 and 21 next to each other on the right of the bottom row, with 16 on the left, then slide the loose pieces clockwise to bring them into place. Do the same with 17 and 22, then 18 and 23. Pieces 19, 20 and 24 then move into place easily.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Daero in the hangar again.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Waydar.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lumdo.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Waydar on Crash Island. Make sure you choose Talk-to, not Travel, which would fly you back to the Grand Tree.\",\"s\":[\"I cannot convince Lumdo to take us to the island...\"]}],\"i\":[\"Prayer potions\",\"Food\",\"Antipoison\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Any teleport to leave Ape Atoll\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Garkor\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Lumdo again to sail to Ape Atoll. Then head west and enter the valley going north WITH PROTECT FROM RANGED ON. Be wary of poison and taking damage.\"},{\"t\":\"Near the gate you're knocked out and put in a cell. That's meant to happen. Stay one square back from the north wall of the cell so the guards can't punch you.\"},{\"t\":\"When the guard walks away from your cell, tap the cell door to pick the lock. Follow behind him to the exit, then go to the north side of the prison.\"},{\"t\":\"Stick to the east edge of the town, and make your way to Garkor to the south east.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Getting amulet parts\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Head west and enter the large open building via the south door. DO NOT STAND ON THE LIGHT FLOOR IN THE BUILDING.\"},{\"t\":\"DO NOT WALK ON THE LIGHT FLOOR. Keep to the dark floor along the walls, stand on the square just east of the stacked crates and search them for monkey dentures.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the crate in the south east corner and go down into the cavern.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'm sure.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the crate in the north west of the room for a M'amulet mould.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Teleport out to prepare for a dangerous portion. You'll want energy/stamina potions, food and prayer potions.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Making an Enchanted Bar\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get food, antipoison, energy / stamina / prayer potions. Then return to Ape Atoll: climb to the 1st floor of the Grand Tree and travel with Daero, then with Waydar in the hangar, then with Lumdo on Crash Island.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Gold bar\",\"Monkey dentures\",\"M'amulet mould\",\"Food\",\"Antipoison\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Any teleport to leave Ape Atoll\"]},{\"t\":\"From the dock, head west and climb down the ladder into the dungeon in south Ape Atoll.\",\"i\":[\"Gold bar\",\"Monkey dentures\",\"M'amulet mould\"]},{\"t\":\"The dungeon is a long maze. From the ladder go east, north, west, north, east, south, east, then north. Go west along the whole dungeon, then south, east, south, west, south, east, south, and west to the far west side. Go north all the way, then east all the way. Talk to Zooknock in the north east of the dungeon.\",\"s\":[\"What do we need for the monkey amulet?\",\"I'll be back later.\"],\"i\":[\"Gold bar\",\"Monkey dentures\",\"M'amulet mould\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the monkey dentures on Zooknock in the north east of the dungeon. If you've already done so, tap Done.\",\"i\":[\"Monkey dentures\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the m'amulet mould on Zooknock in the north east of the dungeon. If you've already done so, tap Done.\",\"i\":[\"M'amulet mould\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the gold bar on Zooknock in the north east of the dungeon. Then talk to Zooknock again to get the enchanted bar and your m'amulet mould back.\",\"i\":[\"Gold bar\"]}],\"i\":[\"Gold bar\",\"Monkey dentures\",\"M'amulet mould\"],\"tr\":[\"Tree Gnome Stronghold teleport via Spirit Tree (2), Gnome Glider (Ta Quir Priw), or Grand Seed Pod\",\"Any teleport to leave Ape Atoll\"],\"r\":[\"Antipoison\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Stamina potions\"]},{\"n\":\"Making an amulet\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Teleport out to prepare to make the amulet. You'll want some food, prayer potions, antipoisons, the mould and the enchanted bar.\"},{\"t\":\"Get food, antipoison, prayer potions. Then return to Ape Atoll: climb to the 1st floor of the Grand Tree and travel with Daero, then with Waydar in the hangar, then with Lumdo on Crash Island.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Enchanted bar\",\"M'amulet mould\",\"Ball of wool\",\"Food\",\"Antipoison\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Any teleport to leave Ape Atoll\"]},{\"t\":\"Head west and enter the valley going north WITH PROTECT FROM RANGED ON. Be wary of poison and taking damage.\",\"i\":[\"Enchanted bar\",\"M'amulet mould\",\"Ball of wool\"]},{\"t\":\"Near the gate you're knocked out and put in a cell again. When the guard walks away from your cell, tap the cell door to pick the lock. Follow behind him to the exit, then go to the north side of the prison.\",\"i\":[\"Enchanted bar\",\"M'amulet mould\",\"Ball of wool\"]},{\"t\":\"Turn on Protect from Melee, go east along the north side of the prison, then south, then east into the temple, and go down the trapdoor on its east side. If bearded guards block you, go upstairs and climb down the ladder on the east side.\",\"i\":[\"Enchanted bar\",\"M'amulet mould\",\"Ball of wool\"]},{\"t\":\"With the m'amulet mould in your inventory, use the enchanted bar on the wall of flame. Then use the ball of wool on the unstrung amulet to make the M'speak amulet, and wear it.\",\"i\":[\"Enchanted bar\",\"M'amulet mould\",\"Ball of wool\"]}],\"i\":[\"Enchanted bar\",\"M'amulet mould\",\"Ball of wool\"],\"tr\":[\"Tree Gnome Stronghold teleport via Spirit Tree (2), Gnome Glider (Ta Quir Priw), or Grand Seed Pod\",\"Any teleport to leave Ape Atoll\"],\"r\":[\"Banana (5)\",\"Antipoison\",\"Food\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Stamina potions\"]},{\"n\":\"Getting the talisman\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb the rope out. If you plan on doing Recipe for Disaster, also kill a Zombie Monkey for its bones whilst here, and a gorilla upstairs.\",\"i\":[\"Zombie monkey bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Wear your M'speak amulet and go to the banana garden by the building just west of the jail, then talk to the monkey child there. You'll talk to him three times in all, here and in the next two steps. If you didn't bring 5 bananas, pick them from the garden's trees. Only go near him while the monkey's aunt is away, otherwise she'll call the guards on you.\",\"s\":[\"Well I'll be a monkey's uncle!\",\"How many bananas did Aunty want?\"],\"i\":[\"M'speak amulet\",\"Banana (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the monkey child again.\",\"i\":[\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the monkey child again.\",\"i\":[\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the monkey child 5 bananas.\",\"i\":[\"M'speak amulet\",\"Banana (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Wait for the aunt to make another round, then talk to the monkey child for the talisman.\",\"s\":[\"Wow - can I borrow it?\",\"Ok, I promise!\"],\"i\":[\"M'speak amulet\"]}],\"i\":[\"M'speak amulet\",\"Banana (5)\"]},{\"n\":\"Bones for RFD (optional)\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"This section will help you get ready for Recipe for Disaster. If you aren't interested in this, skip this section. Talk to the monkey child until you have 4 talismans. Tell him you lost it, and he will cry until the aunt comes back around (make sure to hide!). Talk to him again for another.\",\"s\":[\"I've lost that toy you gave me...\",\"Wow - can I borrow it?\",\"Ok, I promise!\"],\"i\":[\"M'speak amulet\",\"Monkey talisman (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill a monkey archer for their bones. From the monkey child's garden, climb the ladder in the building to the east and cross the bridge east to reach the archers.\",\"i\":[\"Ninja monkey bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill a gorilla in the temple for their bones. If they can attack you they will heal on hit, so it's recommended to safespot or flinch one.\",\"i\":[\"Gorilla bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter into the temple's basement to kill a zombie monkey for their bones.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill a zombie monkey for their bones.\",\"i\":[\"Zombie monkey bones\"]}],\"i\":[\"M'speak amulet\"],\"r\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"n\":\"Making a greegree\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Teleport out to prepare to make the greegree. You'll want some food, prayer potions, and antipoisons. Only if you're making the extra greegrees for Recipe for Disaster: bring 4 monkey talismans in all, and the zombie, ninja and gorilla bones.\",\"i\":[\"Monkey talisman\",\"Monkey bones or corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Get food, antipoison, prayer potions. Then return to Ape Atoll: climb to the 1st floor of the Grand Tree and travel with Daero, then with Waydar in the hangar, then with Lumdo on Crash Island.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Monkey talisman\",\"Monkey bones or corpse\",\"Food\",\"Antipoison\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Ardougne teleport\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the dungeon in south Ape Atoll.\",\"i\":[\"Monkey talisman\",\"Monkey bones or corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the same winding route through the dungeon as before to Zooknock in the north east. Use the monkey talisman on him. If you've already done so, tap Done.\",\"i\":[\"Monkey talisman\"]},{\"t\":\"Use regular monkey bones or a monkey corpse on Zooknock in the north east of the dungeon, not zombie, ninja or gorilla bones. Then talk to Zooknock for the Karamjan monkey greegree.\",\"s\":[\"What do we need for the monkey talisman?\"],\"i\":[\"Monkey bones or corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if you're making the zombie, ninja and gorilla greegrees for Recipe for Disaster: talk to Zooknock, then use a talisman and one kind of bones on him. Repeat for each kind. Otherwise, or once you're done, teleport away for the next step.\",\"s\":[\"Can you make another monkey talisman?\",\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Ninja monkey bones\",\"Gorilla bones\",\"Zombie monkey bones\"]}],\"i\":[\"Monkey talisman\",\"Monkey bones or corpse\"],\"tr\":[\"Ardougne teleport\"],\"r\":[\"Prayer potions\",\"Food\",\"Antipoison\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Ninja monkey bones\",\"Gorilla bones\",\"Zombie monkey bones\",\"Monkey talisman (4)\"]},{\"n\":\"Save a monkey\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Monkey Minder in the Ardougne Zoo whilst wielding the Karamjan monkey greegree.\",\"i\":[\"Karamjan monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\",\"Stamina potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Wear your M'speak amulet, then talk to the monkey in the pen that has a Talk-to option. It jumps into your bag.\"},{\"t\":\"UNEQUIP the greegree, then talk to the Monkey Minder again to leave.\"},{\"t\":\"WALK/RUN to Daero on the 1st floor of the Grand Tree. If you teleport, you'll have to start again. Travel with Daero, then with Waydar in the hangar, then with Lumdo on Crash Island. On Ape Atoll, EQUIP THE GREEGREE and enter the gate to Marim. The monkeys will not attack you while you're holding it.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Karamjan monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\",\"Monkey\",\"Stamina potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Garkor.\",\"i\":[\"Karamjan monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\",\"Monkey\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to a guard outside the building in the south east of Marim. If you already have, tap Done.\"},{\"t\":\"Wearing the greegree and M'speak amulet, run west across Marim to the western shore, past the main gate but without going out through it. Head slightly south, follow the path up the western hill and climb the bamboo ladder at the top. Cross the bamboo bridge, climb down the ladder on the far side and talk to Kruk.\",\"i\":[\"Karamjan monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\",\"Monkey\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Awowogei twice. Then talk to the Elder Guard to be let out.\",\"i\":[\"Karamjan monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\",\"Monkey\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Garkor and watch the cutscene. Then talk to him again to get the 10th squad sigil. Don't equip it until you're ready to fight.\",\"i\":[\"Karamjan monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]}],\"i\":[\"Karamjan monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"],\"r\":[\"Stamina potions\"]},{\"n\":\"Defeat the demon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Prepare to fight the Jungle Demon. Once you're ready, equip the 10th squad sigil.\",\"i\":[\"10th squad sigil\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Jungle Demon. Use Protect from Magic and keep your distance to kill it safely.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to King Narnode Shareen in the Tree Gnome Stronghold.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"tr\":[\"Tree Gnome Stronghold teleport via Spirit Tree (2), Gnome Glider (Ta Quir Priw), or Grand Seed Pod\"],\"r\":[\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Jungle Demon (level 195)\"]}]}"
        "Monkey Madness II" -> "{\"n\":\"Monkey Madness II\",\"items\":[\"Lemon\",\"Grapes\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Logs\",\"A lightsource\",\"Translation book\",\"Hammer (obtainable in quest)\",\"Chisel (obtainable in quest)\",\"M'speak amulet\",\"Monkey talisman or 1000 coins\",\"Ninja greegree\"],\"rec\":[\"Magic logs\",\"Food\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Antidote\",\"Combat gear\"],\"enemies\":[\"Kruk (level 149, flinchable)\",\"Keef (level 178, safespottable)\",\"Kob (level 185, safespottable)\",\"9 Tortured gorillas (level 141)\",\"2 Demonic Gorillas (level 275)\",\"Glough (level 431)\"],\"rewards\":[\"4 Quest points\",\"80,000 Slayer XP\",\"60,000 Agility XP\",\"50,000 Thieving XP\",\"50,000 Hunter XP\",\"2 x 50,000 Experience Lamps (Any Combat Skill)\",\"A Royal Seed Pod\",\"A pet monkey\",\"Access to Demonic Gorillas\",\"A new Gnome Glider location\",\"Access to a bank on Ape Atoll\",\"Ability to wield the Heavy Ballista\",\"Access to Maniacal Monkey hunting area\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to King Narnode Shareen in the Tree Gnome Stronghold.\",\"s\":[\"I'll help you look for Glough.\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the ladder into Glough's house, just south-east of the Grand Tree, then climb the tree on the other side of the house to the next floor. Long-press the tree branch there and choose Investigate.\"},{\"t\":\"Go talk to Anita in her house in the far north-west of the Tree Gnome Stronghold, up the most north-western staircase.\",\"s\":[\"What's wrong?\",\"He might be in trouble, I could help.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Glough's house and climb the tree to the 2nd floor, then climb the northern branch to the 3rd floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Investigate the nearby statue and turn it.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the fire remains.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the crates.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on a lemon\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Lemon\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the notes on the candles.\",\"i\":[\"Mysterious note\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on some grapes.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Grapes\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the brush on the note.\",\"i\":[\"Juice-coated brush\",\"Mysterious note\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the note.\",\"i\":[\"Scrawled note\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the translation book on the scrawled note. If you don't have the book, talk to King Narnode for another, then use it on the note.\",\"i\":[\"Translation book\",\"Scrawled note\"]},{\"t\":\"Go talk to Narnode.\"},{\"t\":\"Go talk to Anita in the west of the Tree Gnome Stronghold.\",\"s\":[\"Could you translate these notes?\"],\"i\":[\"Scrawled note\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Narnode with the translation.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Auguste on Entrana. You can take the hot air balloon there from south of the Grand Tree with a log, or travel from Port Sarim.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about Assistant Le Smith.\",\"Thanks for the information.\"],\"i\":[\"No combat items to travel to Entrana\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to King Narnode Shareen in the Grand Tree.\"}],\"i\":[\"Lemon\",\"Grapes\",\"Translation book\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"No combat items to travel to Entrana\"],\"r\":[\"Logs\",\"Magic logs\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Glough (level 431)\"]},{\"n\":\"Going undercover\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Wear your ninja greegree and M'speak amulet, then talk to Garkor on the eastern side of Ape Atoll. If you have fairy rings, CLR takes you to the island.\",\"s\":[\"King Narnode has sent me.\",\"It's worth a shot.\"],\"i\":[\"Ninja greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\",\"Monkey talisman or 1000 coins\",\"A lightsource\",\"Food\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Awowogei.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to discuss military strategies.\",\"Of course, my king.\"],\"i\":[\"Ninja greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Garkor again.\",\"i\":[\"Ninja greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to a monkey archer on the hill on the west of Ape Atoll. If you still need a monkey talisman, buy one for 1000 coins at Tutab's Magical Market, the magic shop on Ape Atoll.\",\"i\":[\"Ninja greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Find the trapdoor hidden under jungle grass at the foot of a palm tree, just north-west of the bamboo gate. Keep one inventory space free: your greegree comes off as you enter and drops to the ground if your inventory is full. Enter the trapdoor.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"A lightsource\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Stamina potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the agility route: head south then east from the entrance. On dodgy ground, walk only on the flat tiles and avoid the ones with an X pattern. Protect from Melee if you fall. The right way differs per player: whenever the game says \\\"Something about this route feels wrong.\\\", \\\"Something about this tunnel feels wrong.\\\" or \\\"Something in the tunnel attacks you. Maybe this is the wrong route.\\\", turn back and take another way. The Solution button shows a map of the dungeon.\",\"i\":[\"A lightsource\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Stamina potions\"]},{\"t\":\"If you fall, find the rope back up. Depending on where you land, go up the rope to the west (use Protect from Melee), to the south east (use Protect from Ranged) or to the north west (use Protect from Melee).\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the chest in the cavern to the east and choose Unlock, then search it to get a bronze key.\"},{\"t\":\"Make your way north then through the bronze door.\",\"i\":[\"Bronze key\"]},{\"t\":\"Traverse the next section of the dungeon. PROTECT FROM MISSILE if you fall.\"},{\"t\":\"Continue through the dungeon to the west and south-west. PROTECT FROM MELEE if you fall. Near the end the path splits into a western and an eastern route; remember which one you take.\"},{\"t\":\"After the last obstacle, before you step onto the final dodgy ground, investigate the wall that faces the route you did NOT take (the western wall if you came the eastern way, the eastern wall if you came the western way). This opens a shortcut back to the entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Prepare to fight Kruk, then enter the hole to the south. If you're back near the entrance, enter the shortcut there first.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Kruk. He can be flinched on a corner in the room by keeping him on a north east tile to you.\"},{\"t\":\"Search Kruk's Corpse.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the dungeon up the rope to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the dungeon in south Ape Atoll.\",\"i\":[\"Greegree\",\"Kruk's paw\",\"Monkey talisman\"]},{\"t\":\"Go through the long maze to Zooknock in the north east of the dungeon. Wearing a greegree stops the monkeys and spiders attacking you. From the ladder go east, north, west, north, east, south, east, then north. Go west along the whole dungeon, then south, east, south, west, south, east, south, and west to the far west side. Go north all the way, then east all the way. Talk to Zooknock.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about your mission.\"],\"i\":[\"Greegree\",\"Kruk's paw\",\"Monkey talisman\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Awowogei as Kruk.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Garkor on Ape Atoll.\"}],\"i\":[\"Ninja greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\",\"Monkey talisman or 1000 coins\",\"A lightsource\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Stamina potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Defeating trolls and ogres\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Troll Stronghold, ready to fight Kob.\",\"i\":[\"Climbing boots\",\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"From the Troll Stronghold's entrance, go south-west into the room with Kob. Turn on Protect from Melee and talk to him, ready to fight.\",\"s\":[\"I know about your deal with the monkeys.\",\"You won't be around to crush anyone when I'm done with you.\",\"I accept your challenge.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Kob. He can be safespotted from the doorway.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Keef in Gu'Tanoth, past all the bridges. With 71 Agility you can use the agility shortcut next to him. Otherwise bring 20 coins to pass the bridges. Be prepared to fight him and pray Protect from Melee.\",\"s\":[\"I know about your deal with the monkeys.\",\"I offer to spare your life.\",\"I accept your challenge.\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (20), unless you have 71 Agility\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Keef. He can be safespotted.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Climbing boots\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Keef (level 178, safespottable)\"]},{\"n\":\"Sabotage\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Garkor on Ape Atoll.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Wearing your Kruk greegree, find Assistant Le Smith. He's in one of four high places in Marim: 1) On the bridge joining the two watchtowers of the main gate. 2) On the top floor, up two ladders, of the broken building next to the monkey child's garden. 3) On the top floor of the jail: climb the ladder by Solihib's Food Stall, walk north, and climb the ladder at the back of the room with the bamboo bed. 4) On the top floor of the building west of the magic stall: climb the ladder at the south end of the temple, then the ladder in that building's north-west corner, and run all the way south-west.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Assistant Le Smith.\",\"s\":[\"I was going to ask you the same question.\",\"Why is that?\",\"Awowogei has already informed me about the battleships.\",\"Where is the fleet, currently?\"],\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Garkor.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the monkey guard on the north west of Ape Atoll.\",\"s\":[\"What's going on here?\",\"Construction platform?\",\"Can I visit the platform?\",\"I would like to go back to the construction platform.\"],\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Navigate through the platform, avoiding the monkey guards, to the east side and climb the ladder there.\"},{\"t\":\"Make your way south then west, and go down the ladder there.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the path around and search the crates there for 6 satchels. There are no monkeys here to avoid.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (6)\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb back up the ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Make your way east then north, and go down the ladder there.\"},{\"t\":\"Navigate through the platform, avoiding the monkey guards, back to the first ladder you passed, on the north wall, and climb it.\"},{\"t\":\"Make your way east then south and go down the ladder there. Avoid the monkey on the way.\"},{\"t\":\"Fill your satchels with gunpowder from the barrel to the north. If a guard catches you from now on, your satchels are soaked: come back here and refill them. Charges you have already placed stay put.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled) (6)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back up the ladder to the first floor.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a satchel on the weakened floorboards just south of the ladder.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the ladder to the north west.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a satchel on the support to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the east side and climb the ladder there.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Make your way to the west across the vine, then north then east to the end of the path. Place a satchel on the weakened floorboards there.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the east side where you came from and go up to the 2nd floor.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a satchel on the gas cylinder to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Make your way to the west then north and place a satchel on the gas cylinder there.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back to the bottom floor.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back towards the boat and place the final satchel on the support beams in the west fork near the entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Satchel (filled)\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the platform via the boat. DON'T teleport away. You can shortcut here by getting caught.\"}],\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"n\":\"Glough's experiments\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Garkor on Ape Atoll.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the trapdoor under some grass in the north west of Ape Atoll.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Your greegree came off as you entered. Wear the Kruk monkey greegree again, then climb across the monkey bars to the north.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the passage to the north.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Walk through the big doors ahead, climb onto the stunted gorilla, then go down the stairs.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight the tortured gorillas. When you're done, be careful NOT to tap out of the cutscene or you'll need to do this again.\"},{\"t\":\"Dismount the gorilla on a holding area. If you didn't bring a chisel and hammer, search the crates nearby for them.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb back up the stairs, take off your greegree, then tamper with the device to the north.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the charged onyx.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Charged onyx\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the onyx back on the device.\",\"i\":[\"Deconstructed onyx\"]},{\"t\":\"Investigate one of the incubation chambers in the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Garkor.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Awowogei.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Garkor again.\",\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\"]}],\"i\":[\"Kruk monkey greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Kruk (level 149, flinchable)\",\"9 Tortured gorillas (level 141)\"]},{\"n\":\"Defending the tree\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to King Narnode Shareen in the Tree Gnome Stronghold. Be prepared for fighting, and bring 2 combat styles.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Nieve south of the Grand Tree. Be prepared to fight with 2 combat styles.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about Monkey Madness II.\",\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"2 styles of combat gear\",\"Food\"]},{\"t\":\"Walk around the north-west part of the Gnome Stronghold with Nieve and kill the tortured gorillas that appear, 4 in all, until Nieve tells you to move on. Each must come from a different spot: a second kill at the same spot doesn't count. If you lose Nieve, you can get her again from the Grand Tree.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the breach north west of the Grand Tree with Nieve.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, let's go.\"],\"i\":[\"2 styles of combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cavern to the north east.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Glough in the north of the cavern. After, defeat the tortured and demonic gorillas.\",\"i\":[\"2 styles of combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat Glough. He has 3 phases, changing rooms each time. You can safe spot the first 2 phases. Protect from Melee if you're next to him, or Protect from Magic if not in the third phase. The easiest way to do phase 3 is to attack him from 1 tile away, have Protect from Magic on, and step away a tile whenever he pulls you closer.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Zooknock to teleport to the Grand Tree.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Narnode to finish the madness!\"}],\"i\":[\"2 styles of combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"2 Demonic Gorillas (level 275)\",\"Glough (level 431)\"]}]}"
        "Mountain Daughter" -> "{\"n\":\"Mountain Daughter\",\"items\":[\"Rope\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Any axe\",\"Any plank\",\"Almost any gloves\",\"A staff or a pole\"],\"rec\":[\"Slayer ring for teleports\",\"Combat gear for The Kendal fight\"],\"enemies\":[\"The Kendal (level 70)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"1,000 Attack XP\",\"2,000 Prayer XP\",\"A Bearhead\",\"Access to the Mountain Camp\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Speak to Hamal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use your rope on the boulder outside the Mountain Camp east of Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Hamal the Chieftain in the Mountain Camp.\",\"s\":[\"Why is everyone so hostile?\",\"So what are you doing up here?\",\"I will search for her!\"],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Any axe\",\"Any plank\",\"A staff or a pole\",\"Almost any gloves\"]}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Any plank\",\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"n\":\"Go to the centre of the lake\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Head south of Hamal's tent and take some mud from the roots along the edge of the bubbling mud pond.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the pole north of Hamal's tent.\",\"i\":[\"A staff or a pole\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the path west along the lake to the Tall Tree and use mud on it.\",\"i\":[\"Mud\",\"A staff or a pole\",\"Any plank\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the Tall Tree on the lake north of the camp.\",\"i\":[\"A staff or a pole\",\"Any plank\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your pole or a staff on the clump of rocks.\",\"i\":[\"A staff or a pole\",\"Any plank\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a plank on the flat stone.\",\"i\":[\"Any plank\"]},{\"t\":\"Listen to the Shining Pool.\",\"s\":[\"Hello! Who are you?\",\"So what exactly do you want from me?\",\"That sounds like something I can do.\",\"I'll get right on it.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a plank on the flat stone to return to shore.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Any plank\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Find out how to help\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Hamal the Chieftain in the Mountain Camp.\",\"s\":[\"About the people of Rellekka...\"],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Any axe\",\"Any plank\",\"A staff or a pole\",\"Almost any gloves\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Jokul north of Hamal's tent.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Making peace with Rellekka\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Find Svidi, who runs around the woods between Rellekka and the Keldagrim entrance, north-west of the rockslide you climbed to reach the camp. He moves fast, so run to catch him. Choose \\\"Can't I persuade you to go in there somehow?\\\": the other option makes him walk off.\",\"s\":[\"Can't I persuade you to go in there somehow?\"],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Brundt the Chieftain in Rellekka's longhall and ask about the mountain camp.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the mountain camp.\",\"Did it contain vast magical powers?\"],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Any axe\",\"Any plank\",\"A staff or a pole\",\"Almost any gloves\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the Mountain Camp over the rockslide just south-west of the boulder you tied your rope to. Enter the large tent south-west of Hamal and use a pickaxe on the Ancient Rock inside. If you're wielding the pickaxe, long-press the rock to mine it.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Brundt the Chieftain in the Rellekka's longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the mountain camp.\"],\"i\":[\"Half a rock\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Svidi who roams in the forest east of Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Safety Guarantee\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Find a new food source\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the top of White Wolf Mountain and pick the Thorny Bushes whilst wearing gloves.\",\"i\":[\"Almost any gloves\"]},{\"t\":\"Eat the White Pearl.\",\"i\":[\"White pearl\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Almost any gloves\"]},{\"n\":\"Prepare for a fight\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Prepare to fight The Kendal (level 70)\"}],\"i\":[\"A staff or a pole\",\"Any plank\",\"Any axe\",\"White pearl seed\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"The Kendal (level 70)\"]},{\"n\":\"Tell Hamal about your success\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Hamal the Chieftain in the Mountain Camp and tell him about both the food and the people of Rellekka.\",\"s\":[\"About your food supplies...\",\"About the people of Rellekka...\"],\"i\":[\"White pearl seed\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Tell Asleif about your success\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to the centre of the pool north of the Mountain Camp and listen to it.\",\"i\":[\"A staff or a pole\",\"Any plank\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Find Asleif's corpse\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Attempt to jump across the flat stone WITHOUT a plank to return to the north shore. Then cut through the trees north east of the lake and enter the cave there. Bring combat gear.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to the Kendal, then kill him.\",\"s\":[\"It's just me, no one special.\",\"You mean a sacrifice?\",\"You look like a man in a bearsuit!\",\"Can I see that corpse?\",\"I humbly request to be given the remains.\",\"I will kill you myself!\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the Corpse of Woman.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"The Kendal (level 70)\"]},{\"n\":\"Bring Asleif's corpse to Hamal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bring the corpse to Hamal.\",\"s\":[\"But he's not a god!\",\"I will.\"],\"i\":[\"Corpse of woman\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Bury Asleif\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pick up 5 muddy rocks from the mountain goat pen in the camp, just north of Hamal's tent near Jokul. They grow back quickly, so you can keep picking up the same rock.\",\"i\":[\"Muddy rock (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Ragnar, just south-west of the Tall Tree by the lake.\",\"s\":[\"Thank you. I will make sure she's given a proper burial now.\"],\"i\":[\"Corpse of woman\",\"Muddy rock (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the centre of the lake and bury the corpse.\",\"i\":[\"Corpse of woman\",\"A staff or a pole\",\"Any plank\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the Muddy rocks on the Burial Mound at the centre of the Mountain Camp's lake.\",\"i\":[\"Muddy rock (5)\"]}]}]}"
        "Mourning's End Part I" -> "{\"n\":\"Mourning's End Part I\",\"items\":[\"Bear fur\",\"Silk (2)\",\"Red dye\",\"Yellow dye\",\"Blue dye\",\"Green dye\",\"Bucket of water\",\"Feather\",\"Rotten apple\",\"Toad crunchies (can be Premade t'd crunch)\",\"Magic logs\",\"Leather\",\"Ogre bellows\",\"Barrel of coal tar + 10-20 coal, or a barrel of naphtha\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport to the Outpost. Necklace of passage (The Outpost [2])\",\"Teleport to Taverley. Taverley Teleport, Games necklace (Burthorpe. [1])\",\"Lletya teleport. Teleport crystal\",\"West ardougne teleport (3)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Mourner (level 11) (will decrease all combat skills to 20, including Hitpoints)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"40,000 Thieving XP\",\"25,000 Hitpoints XP\",\"Elven Teleport Crystal\",\"Access to the Mourner HQ\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Find Islwyn and Eluned in the woods of Isafdar, either north-east of Tyras Camp or west of Lletya. If they aren't there, hop worlds until they appear. Talk to Islwyn to start the quest. If he doesn't offer it, talk to Eluned.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready now.\",\"I'm ready.\",\"Yes.\",\"Yes, I should go see him now.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"Okay, let's begin.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Get Mourner's outfit\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Kill a mourner travelling through the Arandar pass. This is more easily accessed from the north entrance. You'll need 7 free inventory spaces.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up everything the mourner dropped.\",\"i\":[\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner cloak\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Ripped mourner trousers\",\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner letter\",\"Bloody mourner top\"]}],\"i\":[\"Teleport to the Outpost. Necklace of passage (The Outpost [2])\",\"Teleport to Taverley. Taverley Teleport, Games necklace (Burthorpe. [1])\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Mourner (level 11) (will decrease all combat skills to 20, including Hitpoints)\"]},{\"n\":\"Clean Mourner top\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search Tegid's laundry basket in south Taverley for some soap.\",\"s\":[\"Steal the soap.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the soap on the bloody mourner top\",\"i\":[\"Tegid's soap\",\"Bucket of water\",\"Bloody mourner top\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\",\"Bloody mourner top\"],\"tr\":[\"Teleport to Taverley. Taverley Teleport, Games necklace (Burthorpe. [1])\",\"Lletya teleport. Teleport crystal\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Mourner (level 11) (will decrease all combat skills to 20, including Hitpoints)\"]},{\"n\":\"Repair Mourner trousers\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Teleport to Lletya using a crystal teleport seed and talk to Oronwen to have them repair your trousers. Buy dyes here if you still need them.\",\"s\":[\"Do you mend clothes?\",\"I have all I need to mend my trousers.\"],\"i\":[\"Ripped mourner trousers\",\"Bear fur\",\"Silk (2)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bear fur\",\"Silk (2)\",\"Ripped mourner trousers\"],\"tr\":[\"Lletya teleport. Teleport crystal\"]},{\"n\":\"Infiltrate the Mourners\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Equip the full mourners outfit and enter the Mourners' Headquarters in West Ardougne.\",\"i\":[\"Toad crunchies (can be Premade t'd crunch)\",\"Feather\",\"Magic logs\",\"Leather\",\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner top\",\"Mourner trousers\",\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Mourner cloak\",\"Mourner letter\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the trapdoor in the north west corner of the HQ.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Essyllt in the south room.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the gnome on a rack.\",\"s\":[\"You talked about toad crunchies and being tickled.\"],\"i\":[\"Tarnished key\",\"Feather\",\"Toad crunchies (can be Premade t'd crunch)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a feather on the gnome with toad crunchies in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Tarnished key\",\"Feather\",\"Toad crunchies (can be Premade t'd crunch)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the gnome again with the required items.\",\"i\":[\"Toad crunchies (can be Premade t'd crunch)\",\"Magic logs\",\"Leather\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the gnome on the rack and choose Release, with the items in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Tarnished key\",\"Magic logs\",\"Leather\",\"Toad crunchies (can be Premade t'd crunch)\",\"Broken device\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the gnome a magic log, some soft leather and some toad crunchies.\",\"i\":[\"Tarnished key\",\"Magic logs\",\"Leather\",\"Toad crunchies (can be Premade t'd crunch)\",\"Broken device\"]},{\"t\":\"Ask the gnome about ammo.\"}],\"i\":[\"Full mourners' outfit\",\"Mourner letter\",\"Feather\",\"Toad crunchies (can be Premade t'd crunch)\",\"Magic logs\",\"Leather\"],\"tr\":[\"West ardougne teleport\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Mourner (level 11) (will decrease all combat skills to 20, including Hitpoints)\"]},{\"n\":\"Dye the sheep\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"You need to make some dyed toads. Go to Feldip Hills (AKS), use a dye on your empty bellows, then use the bellows to inflate a toad. Get at least one toad of each colour.\",\"i\":[\"Red toad\",\"Yellow toad\",\"Green toad\",\"Blue toad\"]},{\"t\":\"Dye one sheep of each colour north of Ardougne. The red flock is closest to the city, green is north-east of red, yellow is furthest north, and blue is far to the west. Use the matching toad on the fixed device and wield it. Near the flock, choose Aim and Fire in your combat options, aim the crosshair at a sheep and press the red button in its centre. A miss uses up the toad.\",\"i\":[\"Red toad\",\"Yellow toad\",\"Green toad\",\"Blue toad\",\"Fixed device\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip the full mourners outfit and enter the Mourners' Headquarters in West Ardougne.\",\"i\":[\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner top\",\"Mourner trousers\",\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Mourner cloak\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the trapdoor in the north west corner of the HQ.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Essyllt in the south room.\"}],\"i\":[\"Full mourners' outfit\",\"Fixed device\",\"Ogre bellows\",\"Red dye\",\"Yellow dye\",\"Green dye\",\"Blue dye\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Mourner (level 11) (will decrease all combat skills to 20, including Hitpoints)\"]},{\"n\":\"Poison the citizens\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Squeeze through the gap in the western fence north-west of the Mourner HQ and pick up the rotten apple there.\",\"i\":[\"Rotten apple\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in north-west of East Ardougne.\",\"i\":[\"Rotten apple\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the apple orchard directly west of the Combat Training Camp, north-east of the Outpost, and pick up a barrel there.\",\"i\":[\"Barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the barrel on a rotten apple pile.\",\"i\":[\"Barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the rotten apples on the apple press.\",\"i\":[\"Rotten apples\"]},{\"t\":\"Make some Naphtha. Grab another barrel, fill it on the swamp south of the elven lands, then refine it on the fractionalising still at the Chemist in Rimmington with 10-20 coal. To do this, rotate the 'Tar regulator' wheel twice. Wait until the 'Pressure' indicator is in the green, then rotate the 'Pressure valve' regulator clockwise once. Now all you need to do is occasionally tap the 'Add coal' text to add coal, to push the 'Heat' into the green. Be careful to do this slowly so as to not hit the orange heat and ruin the tar.\",\"i\":[\"Barrel of coal tar + 10-20 coal, or a barrel of naphtha\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a barrel of naptha on the apple barrel.\",\"i\":[\"Barrel of naphtha\",\"Apple barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the sieve on the naphtha apple mix\",\"i\":[\"Sieve\",\"Naphtha apple mix\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the toxic naphtha on a range. DO NOT USE IT ON A FIRE, and MAKE SURE TO HAVE TWO FREE INVENTORY SPACES.\",\"i\":[\"Toxic naphtha\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the toxic powder on the food store in the room north west of West Ardougne's town centre.\",\"i\":[\"Toxic powder\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the toxic powder on the food store in the church south of West Ardougne's town centre.\",\"i\":[\"Toxic powder\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Essyllt in the Mourner HQ basement.\"}],\"i\":[\"Barrel of coal tar + 10-20 coal, or a barrel of naphtha\",\"Full mourners' outfit\"],\"tr\":[\"West ardougne teleport\",\"Lletya teleport. Teleport crystal\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Mourner (level 11) (will decrease all combat skills to 20, including Hitpoints)\"]},{\"n\":\"Report back to Arianwyn\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Arianwyn in Lletya.\"}]}]}"
        "Mourning's End Part II" -> "{\"n\":\"Mourning's End Part II\",\"items\":[\"Full mourners' outfit\",\"Chisel\",\"Access to the Death Altar or 50 items asked of you by a dwarf\",\"Rope\"],\"rec\":[\"Stamina potions\",\"Prayer potions for Protect from Melee\",\"Food\",\"West ardougne teleport\",\"Lletya teleport. Teleport crystal\"],\"enemies\":[\"Able to survive Shadows (level 73) continually attacking you\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"60,000 Agility XP\",\"A Crystal Trinket\",\"A Death Talisman\",\"Ability to craft Death Runes.\",\"Ability to kill Dark Beasts and receive them as a slayer task.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Explore the caves\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Wear your full mourner gear and enter the Mourner HQ in the north-east of West Ardougne. Go down the trapdoor inside to the basement and talk to Essyllt.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner top\",\"Mourner trousers\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner cloak\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave Essyllt's room and open the door on the west wall of the basement, using the new key he gave you, to enter the Mourner Caves.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the caves to the west until you reach the Temple of Light. Search the guard corpse nearby.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the caves to the west to the Temple of Light. Go up the stairs in it.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the south staircase.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down the staircase north of you.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs to the north.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the dark crystal to the east.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the crystal to Arianwyn in Lletya.\",\"i\":[\"Blackened crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Eluned in Lletya next to Arianwyn.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\"}],\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Full mourners' outfit\"],\"tr\":[\"West ardougne teleport\",\"Lletya teleport. Teleport crystal\"]},{\"n\":\"Return to the Temple\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to the Temple of Light wearing your mourner gear. Bring your rope, the new key and the newly made crystal from Eluned (Arianwyn can give you another if you've lost it). Make sure you're prepared for shadows to be continuously attacking you. Bring a death talisman if you have one. If you don't, you can earn one later at the Death Altar.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Full mourners' outfit\",\"Access to the Death Altar\"]},{\"n\":\"Puzzle 1\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs to the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the Crystal Dispenser in the east room.\",\"s\":[\"Pull the lever.\",\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar next to the dispenser and have the light point north.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the north and point it west.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the west and point it south.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a yellow crystal in the pillar to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Yellow crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the south and point it east.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the wall support just east of the pillar, on the south side, to cross the gap to the east. You may fail this multiple times. If you fall, go back up the stairs and try again. Agility boosts help your chances.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the blue light room.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Puzzle 2\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Cross back over the gap using the wall support. If you fall, go back up the stairs to the first floor. Then pull the Crystal Dispenser in the east room to reset the puzzle and take everything.\",\"s\":[\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar next to the dispenser and have the light point north.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the north and point it west.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a cyan crystal in the pillar to the west.\",\"i\":[\"Cyan crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the west and point it north.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the north and point it east.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a yellow crystal in the pillar to the east.\",\"i\":[\"Yellow crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the magenta room in the north east corner.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Puzzle 3\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Take the yellow crystal out of the pillar, and replace it with a mirror pointing up.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the north ladder to the second floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar next to you and point it west.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the north ladder to the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the south staircase to the second floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the far north-west corner's pillar pointing down.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down to the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down to the ground floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the room in the far north west corner.\"},{\"t\":\"Turn the mirror in the pillar in the room to point the light south.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the room south of you.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back to the room with the mirror and turn the mirror in its pillar to point east, then leave through the east barrier. The way out stays shut until you do.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Puzzle 4\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs to the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the cyan crystal out of the pillar north of the stairs, and replace it with a yellow crystal.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the south staircase to the second floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the far north-west corner's pillar and turn the mirror already in it to point south.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the far south-west corner and place a mirror pointing down.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down to the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the rocks in the small room in the south of the first floor.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the rope you tied in the south room of the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the south west room.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"n\":\"Puzzle 5 P1\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to the first floor and reset the puzzle.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the Crystal Dispenser in the east room to reset the puzzle, and take all the items.\",\"s\":[\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar next to the dispenser and have the light point north.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the north and point it west.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the west and point it south.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a yellow crystal in the pillar to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Yellow crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the south and point it east.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Make sure you have the blue crystal, then climb the wall support just east of the pillar, on the south side, to cross the gap. You may fail this multiple times. If you fall, go back up the stairs and try again.\",\"i\":[\"Blue crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a blue crystal in the pillar in the blue room.\",\"i\":[\"Blue crystal\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Puzzle 5 P2\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Cross back over the gap using the wall support. If you fall, climb back up to the first floor and try again. Then REMOVE the mirror from the pillar in the south of the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Have the mirror in the pillar north west of the dispenser point up.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the south staircase to the second floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down the staircase north of you.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs to the north.\"},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the pillar north east of you and face it south.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back to the south side of floor 2.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the fractured crystal in the pillar a bit east.\",\"i\":[\"Fractured crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the pillar to the west and point it down.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the pillar to the south east and point it east.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the pillar to the east and point it down.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down to the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down to the ground floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Add a mirror to the pillar where green light is coming down, and point it south.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Add a mirror to the pillar to the south, and point it east.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the south east room, and add a mirror pointing to the north.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the room north of you.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Reach the Death Altar\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs to the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the Crystal Dispenser in the east room to reset the puzzle, and take all the items.\",\"s\":[\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar next to the dispenser and have the light point north.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the north and point it down.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down to the ground floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar north of the stairs and have the light point west.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the fractured crystal (dark/light side split down middle) in the pillar to the west.\",\"i\":[\"Fractured crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar north and have the light point up.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the other fractured crystal in the pillar south of the other fractured crystal.\",\"i\":[\"Fractured crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Add a mirror to the pillar to the west, and point it up.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar to the east and have the light point up.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs to the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the far north where the ladder going up is, and place the yellow crystal there.\",\"i\":[\"Yellow crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the north ladder to the second floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Put a mirror in the pillar next to you and point it west.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the north ladder to the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the south staircase to the second floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the pillar to the north of the stairs and point it west.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the pillar to the far east, and point it west.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror to the west and point it north.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the staircase north of you.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs to the north.\"},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the pillar north east of the stairs pointing west.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Place the blue crystal in the pillar to the west.\",\"i\":[\"Blue crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the far north-west corner's pillar pointing south.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a mirror in the south pillar pointing east.\",\"i\":[\"Hand mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the middle stairs twice to reach the central area.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the central area, and turn the pillar's mirror west.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Repair the defences\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the barrier to the death altar to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"If you already have a death talisman, or another way into the Death Altar, tap Done. Otherwise get one: buy one, kill Dark Beasts for one (needs 90 Slayer), or bring Thorgel the dwarf at the Death Altar the 50 items he asks for. If you leave to fetch anything, FIRST TURN THE MIDDLE PILLAR'S MIRROR TO POINT EAST, or you'll have to come back through the Underground Pass. When you return, turn it west again.\",\"s\":[\"Okay sure thing, what do you need?\",\"I've got some of them with me.\",\"Yeah sure.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the death altar ruins.\",\"i\":[\"Access to the Death Altar\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the newly made crystal on the death altar.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the Death Altar. In the central area, turn the pillar's mirror to point east again. If you leave it pointing west, getting back in later means a trip through the Underground Pass.\"},{\"t\":\"From the central area, go up the stairs, then go up the stairs to the north. Use the charged crystal on the dark crystal to the east.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Arianwyn in Lletya.\"}],\"i\":[\"Access to the Death Altar\"]}]}"
        "Murder Mystery" -> "{\"n\":\"Murder Mystery\",\"items\":[\"Pot\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"1,406 Crafting XP\",\"2000 x Coins\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Go to the Sinclair Manor\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Guard in the Sinclair Manor north of Camelot.\",\"s\":[\"Sure, I'll help.\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Pot\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Collect evidence\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the mansion and search the smashed window in the east room for a clothing thread. The colour of the thread will match the killer's trousers.\",\"i\":[\"Criminal's thread\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the mansion and pick up the pungent pot inside the east room.\",\"i\":[\"Pungent pot\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the criminal's dagger.\",\"i\":[\"Criminal's dagger\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Collect fingerprints\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the gardener's shed, the small building outside the west side of the mansion. Investigate the sacks there for flypaper. Get 4 pieces: one for the dagger, one for each suspect's item, and a spare.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, it might be useful.\"],\"i\":[\"Flypaper (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Your thread colour gives two suspects. Red: Bob (barrel on the ground floor) and Carol (barrel upstairs). Green: Anna (ground floor) and David (upstairs). Blue: Elizabeth and Frank (both upstairs). Search both suspects' barrels for their silver items: Bob's cup, Carol's bottle, Anna's necklace, David's book, Elizabeth's needle, Frank's pot.\"},{\"t\":\"Fill your pot with flour from the barrel in the mansion's kitchen.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the pot of flour on the Criminal's dagger.\",\"i\":[\"Pot of flour\",\"Criminal's dagger\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the flypaper on the dagger.\",\"i\":[\"Flypaper\",\"Criminal's dagger\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill your pot with flour from the barrel in the mansion's kitchen.\",\"i\":[\"Pot\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the flour on one suspect's silver item. Fill your pot again from the barrel in the mansion's kitchen, and use it on the other suspect's silver item.\"},{\"t\":\"Use flypaper on each suspect's silver item.\"},{\"t\":\"Use each suspect's print on the killer's print from the dagger to compare them. The one that matches is the killer, so remember that name.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Gossip, just south of the Sinclair Mansion.\",\"s\":[\"Who do you think was responsible?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Poison Salesman in the Seers' Village pub about his customers.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Murder Mystery Quest\",\"Who did you sell Poison to at the house?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Poison Salesman in the Seers' Village pub about the pungent pot.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Murder Mystery Quest\",\"I have this pot I found at the murder scene...\"],\"i\":[\"Pungent pot\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the killer, the suspect whose print matched, about what they used the poison for. Make sure to finish the chat. Anna, David and Frank are in the mansion, Carol and Elizabeth are upstairs in it, and Bob is south of the mansion.\",\"s\":[\"Why'd you buy poison the other day?\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the thing the killer said they used the poison on. Anna: compost heap south west of the mansion. Bob: beehive south west of the mansion. Carol: drain south of the mansion. David: spider's nest upstairs, in the south of the mansion. Elizabeth: fountain south east of the mansion. Frank: family crest on the south side of the mansion, to the east. If no message comes up, talk to the killer about the poison again and finish the chat.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the guard outside the Sinclair Mansion and tell him your findings.\",\"s\":[\"I know who did it!\"]}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "My Arm's Big Adventure" -> "{\"n\":\"My Arm's Big Adventure\",\"items\":[\"Climbing boots\",\"Ugthanki dung (3)\",\"Supercompost (8)\",\"Rake\",\"Seed dibber\",\"Spade\",\"Bucket\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear, preferably magic\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Games necklace for Burthorpe teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"Baby Roc (level 75)\",\"Giant Roc (level 172)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"10,000 Herblore XP\",\"5,000 Farming XP\",\"Access to a disease-free herb patch on top of the Troll Stronghold.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Troll Stronghold, head south and go down the south staircase to the kitchen. Talk to Burntmeat there.\",\"s\":[\"What do you want now?\",\"Alright, I'll lend him a hand.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm near Burntmeat.\",\"s\":[\"Alright, I'll lend him a hand.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Climbing boots\"],\"tr\":[\"Games necklace for Burthorpe teleport\"]},{\"n\":\"Preparing to grow\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use a bucket on the cooking pot on the Death Plateau. You can find a bucket next to the pot.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to My Arm with the goutweedy lump.\",\"i\":[\"Goutweedy lump\"]},{\"t\":\"If you aren't on the roof already, go up the stairs from the kitchen, then climb the ladder in the west room of that upper level, where the Troll Generals are. Talk to My Arm on the roof of the Troll Stronghold.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the farming manual.\",\"i\":[\"Farming manual\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm on the roof of the Troll Stronghold.\"},{\"t\":\"Add 3 ugthanki dung on My Arm's soil patch.\",\"i\":[\"Ugthanki dung (3)\",\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Add 7 supercompost on My Arm's soil patch.\",\"i\":[\"Supercompost (7)\",\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm on the roof of the Troll Stronghold.\"}],\"i\":[\"Climbing boots\",\"Bucket\",\"Spade\",\"Supercompost (7)\",\"Ugthanki dung (3)\"],\"tr\":[\"Games necklace for Burthorpe teleport\"]},{\"n\":\"Karamja adventure\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Barnaby on Ardougne dock.\",\"s\":[\"This is My Arm. We'd like to go to Karamja.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm on Brimhaven dock.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm east of the Tai Bwo Wannai general store.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Murcaily in east Tai Bwo Wannai, near the hardwood grove. You need at least 60% Tai Bwo Wannai favour, so raise it first if you have less. This uses up that much favour.\",\"s\":[\"A troll called My Arm wants a favour...\",\"I was asking you about goutweed...\",\"I was asking you about hardy goutweed...\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm again east of the Tai Bwo Wannai general store.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Troll farming\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm on the roof of the Troll Stronghold.\"},{\"t\":\"Give My Arm a rake. If the rake head comes off, pick it up, repair the rake, and give it to him again.\",\"i\":[\"Rake\"]},{\"t\":\"Give My Arm some supercompost.\",\"i\":[\"Supercompost\"]},{\"t\":\"Give My Arm some hardy gout tubers.\",\"i\":[\"Hardy gout tubers\"]},{\"t\":\"Give My Arm a seed dibber.\",\"i\":[\"Seed dibber\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm. Be prepared to fight a baby and giant Roc.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the Baby Roc.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm. Be prepared to fight the Giant Roc.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Giant Roc. Use protect from missiles, and keep your distance. You can dodge the boulders it throws.\"},{\"t\":\"Give My Arm a spade.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to My Arm.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Burntmeat in the Troll Stronghold.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back up to the roof of the Troll Stronghold and talk to My Arm to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, preferably magic\",\"Rake\",\"Supercompost\",\"Seed dibber\",\"Spade\",\"Hardy gout tubers\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Baby Roc (level 75)\",\"Giant Roc (level 172)\"]}]}"
        "Nature Spirit" -> "{\"n\":\"Nature Spirit\",\"items\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Silver sickle\"],\"rec\":[\"Salve Graveyard Teleports (2)\",\"Combat gear to kill the ghasts\"],\"enemies\":[\"3 Ghasts (level 30)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"3,000 Crafting XP\",\"2,000 Defence XP\",\"2,000 Hitpoints XP\",\"Access to Mort Myre Swamp\",\"Ability to fight Ghasts.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Start the quest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Drezel under the Paterdomus Temple.\",\"s\":[\"Well, what is it, I may be able to help?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Pass through the Holy Barrier next to Drezel and cross the nearby bridge. Go south and enter Mort Myre Swamp through the north gate. You must use the gate, or Filliman won't appear.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Attempt to enter the Grotto in the south of Mort Myre.\",\"s\":[\"How long have you been a ghost?\"],\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Filliman Tarlock.\",\"s\":[\"How long have you been a ghost?\"],\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the washing bowl from the bench next to the grotto. The mirror is underneath it.\",\"i\":[\"Washing bowl\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the mirror.\",\"i\":[\"Mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the mirror on Filliman Tarlock.\",\"s\":[\"How long have you been a ghost?\"],\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Mirror\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the grotto tree and choose Search.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the journal on Filliman Tarlock.\",\"s\":[\"How can I help?\"],\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Journal\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Silver sickle\"]},{\"n\":\"Helping Filliman\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Drezel under the Paterdomus Temple to get blessed.\"},{\"t\":\"Cast the druidic spell next to a rotten log in Mort Myre to grow a mushroom, then pick it. If you've lost the spell, ask Filliman for another.\",\"s\":[\"Could I have another bloom scroll please?\"],\"i\":[\"Druidic spell\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the mushroom on the brown stone outside the grotto. If you've already done this, tap Done. If you aren't sure, search the stone: it says it seems complete once it has the mushroom.\",\"i\":[\"Mort myre fungus\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the used spell on the gray stone outside the grotto. If you've already done this, tap Done. If you aren't sure, search the stone: it says it seems complete once it has the spell.\",\"i\":[\"A used spell or druidic spell\"]},{\"t\":\"Stand on the orange stone outside the grotto.\"},{\"t\":\"While standing on the orange stone, tell Filliman Tarlock you're ready. If he isn't there, attempt to enter the grotto so he appears, then stand on the orange stone again.\",\"s\":[\"I think I've solved the puzzle!\"],\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Grotto in the south of Mort Myre.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Silver sickle\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the grotto inside.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Filliman in the grotto to bless your sickle.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Silver sickle\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Nature Spirit in the grotto to bless your sickle.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Silver sickle\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Silver sickle\"]},{\"n\":\"Killing Ghasts\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Stand next to a rotten log, long-press the blessed sickle and choose Cast Bloom for mort myre fungi. Pick them and use them to fill the druid pouch.\",\"i\":[\"Silver sickle (b)\",\"Druidic pouch\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the filled druid pouch on a ghast to make it attackable and kill it. You'll need to kill 3.\",\"i\":[\"Druidic pouch\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Grotto in the south of Mort Myre.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the grotto in the middle of the cave so the Nature Spirit appears, then talk to him to finish the quest!\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Silver sickle (b)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"3 Ghasts (level 30)\"]}]}"
        "Observatory Quest" -> "{\"n\":\"Observatory Quest\",\"items\":[\"Plank (3)\",\"Bronze bar\",\"Molten glass\"],\"rec\":[\"Ring of dueling\",\"Antipoison (there is a spawn of superantipoison near the Observatory)\",\"Food\"],\"enemies\":[\"Goblin Guard (level 42, or you can lure it/have someone else kill it)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"2,250 Crafting XP\",\"A reward depending on which constellation you observed.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Helping the Professor\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Observatory professor north of Castle Wars.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Observatory quest.\",\"An Observatory?\",\"Sounds interesting. How can I help?\",\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Plank (3)\",\"Molten glass\",\"Bronze bar\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the professor 3 planks.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Observatory quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Plank (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the professor a bronze bar.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Observatory quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Bronze bar\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the professor some molten glass.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Observatory quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Molten glass\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the dungeon east of the Professor.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chests in the dungeon until you find the goblin kitchen key. The right chest differs per player. Try the two chests south-east of the stairs first; if neither has it, it's in the last chest in the dungeon. Read the chat to the end when you find it, or you won't get the key. Wrong chests can hold a poisonous spider (level 31).\"},{\"t\":\"Prod the sleeping guard by the kitchen gate in the north of the dungeon. He wakes and attacks you. Either kill him (level 42), or lure him north of the gate, about five squares north of where he slept, until he gets stuck behind the column there. A trapped guard attacks you again when you come back out.\"},{\"t\":\"With the guard dead or stuck, open the kitchen gate with the goblin kitchen key, then search the goblin stove inside to get the lens mould.\",\"i\":[\"Goblin kitchen key\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the stairs back to the surface.\"},{\"t\":\"Give the professor the lens mould. If you don't have it, check your bank.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Observatory quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Lens mould\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the molten glass on the mould.\",\"i\":[\"Molten glass\",\"Lens mould\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the professor the lens mould and lens.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Observatory quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Observatory lens\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the dungeon east of the Professor.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the dungeon around anti-clockwise to a staircase, then climb it. A cutscene plays: don't tap anything in the observatory while it runs, or it will restart.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the stairs in the observatory.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the telescope and remember the shape of the constellation you see. It differs per player. The star charts on the walls of the floor below show every constellation with its name, so you can match yours there.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the professor and tell him which constellation you saw through the telescope. Pick its name from the list: \\\"~ next ~\\\" and \\\"~ previous ~\\\" show more names. The wiki's Observatory Quest page has a picture of each one.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Observatory quest.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Plank (3)\",\"Bronze bar\",\"Molten glass\"]}]}"
        "Olaf's Quest" -> "{\"n\":\"Olaf's Quest\",\"items\":[\"Any axe\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Spade\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\"],\"enemies\":[\"Skeleton fremennik (level 40)\",\"Ulfric (level 100)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"12,000 Defence XP\",\"4 x Rubies\",\"Access to Brine Rats and the ability to receive them as a slayer task.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Olaf Hradson north east of Rellekka.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Chop a log from the Windswept Tree east of Olaf.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the logs to Olaf Hradson north east of Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Windswept logs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ingrid Hradson near the well in southeast Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Crude carving\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Volf Olafson north of the longhall in Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Cruder carving\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Olaf Hradson north east of Rellekka.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the damp planks on Olaf's embers.\",\"i\":[\"Damp planks\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Olaf again, and give him some food.\",\"s\":[\"Alright, here, have some food. Now give me the map.\"],\"i\":[\"Food\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Spade\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding treasure\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Dig next to the Windswept Tree.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the tunnel east, then north, to the room with the picture wall. Kill a Skeleton Fremennik there and pick up the key it drops.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the picture wall in the north room.\"},{\"t\":\"Tap the east, north, west and south boxes in that order, then tap Confirm at the very bottom. Then search the picture wall again to walk through it.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up 2 rotten barrels and 6 ropes from around the room.\",\"i\":[\"Rotten barrel (2)\",\"Rope (6)\"]},{\"t\":\"WALK onto the walkway to the east, and use a barrel on it to repair it.\",\"i\":[\"Rotten barrel\",\"Rope (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"WALK on the walkway and repair the next hole in it.\",\"i\":[\"Rotten barrel\",\"Rope (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the gate on the walkway and tap the key hole whose shape matches the loop of your key. If you fall after opening the gate, you'll need a new key from a Skeleton Fremennik.\",\"i\":[\"Key\"]},{\"t\":\"WALK off the remaining walkway, and search the chest in the wreck. Be prepared to fight Ulfric.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Ulfric.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest again to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Spade\",\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Skeleton fremennik (level 40)\",\"Ulfric (level 100)\"]}]}"
        "One Small Favour" -> "{\"n\":\"One Small Favour\",\"items\":[\"Steel bar (4)\",\"Bronze bar\",\"Iron bar\",\"Chisel\",\"Guam leaf (2)\",\"Marrentill\",\"Harralander\",\"Hammer\",\"Empty cup\",\"Pot\",\"Bowl of hot water\"],\"rec\":[\"Draynor Teleport with glory, 2 or more charges\",\"Teleports to Lumbridge (4)\",\"Teleports to Varrock (2)\",\"Teleports to Taverley or Falador (2)\",\"Teleports to Camelot or Catherby (2)\",\"Fishing and Mining Guild Teleport for Dwarven Mine with skills necklace, 4 or more charges\",\"Teleports to Ardougne (2)\",\"Teleports to Port Khazard (2)\",\"Teleports to Feldip Hills (2)\",\"Opal (2)\",\"Jade (2)\",\"Red topaz (2)\",\"Coins (3000)\",\"Any pickaxe to kill Slagilith\"],\"enemies\":[\"Slagilith (level 92)\",\"3x Dwarf gang members (level 44)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"2 x 10,000 Experience Lamps (Any skill over level 30)\",\"A Steel Keyring\",\"The ability to make Guthix Rest tea.\",\"Gnome Glider in Feldip Hills.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Yanni Salika in Shilo Village. CKR fairy ring or take cart from Brimhaven.\",\"s\":[\"Is there anything else interesting to do around here?\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"A few small favours\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to a Jungle Forester south of Shilo Village.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about red mahogany.\",\"Okay, I'll take your axe to get it sharpened.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brian in the Port Sarim axe shop.\",\"s\":[\"Do you sharpen axes?\",\"Look, can you sharpen this cursed axe or what?\",\"Ok, ok, I'll do it! I'll go and see Aggie.\"],\"i\":[\"Blunt axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Aggie in Draynor Village.\",\"s\":[\"Could I ask you about being a character witness?\",\"Let me guess, you're going to ask me to do you a favour?\",\"Oh, okay, I'll see if I can find Jimmy.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the trapdoor into the H.A.M. Hideout west of Lumbridge, picking its lock to open it. Talk to Johanhus Ulsbrecht in the south-east corner of the hideout.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for Jimmy the Chisel.\",\"And I suppose you need me to do you a favour?\",\"Ok, Jimmy has to be worth more than a few scrawny chickens!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Fred the Farmer north of Lumbridge.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about Jimmy.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Seth Groats in the farm north east of Lumbridge, across the river.\",\"s\":[\"Oh, ok! I guess it's not that much further to Varrock!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Horvik in the armour shop north east of the Varrock square.\",\"s\":[\"Hi, I need to talk to you about chicken cages!\",\"Ok, I guess one good turn deserves another.\"],\"i\":[\"Steel bar (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Apothecary in west Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about One Small Favour.\",\"Oh, ok, I guess it's not that far to the Barbarian Village.\",\"I guess I can go to the Barbarian Village.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Tassie Slipcast in the Barbarian Village pottery building.\",\"s\":[\"Ok, I'll deal with Hammerspike!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Hammerspike Stoutbeard in the west cavern of the Dwarven Mine.\",\"s\":[\"Oh, come on...do something nice for Tassie.\",\"Have you always been a gangster?\",\"Ok, another favour...I think I can manage that.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sanfew upstairs in the Taverley herblore store.\",\"s\":[\"Are you taking any new initiates?\",\"Do you accept dwarves?\",\"A dwarf I know wants to become an initiate.\",\"Yep, it's a deal.\"]},{\"t\":\"Make Guthix Rest by using a bowl of hot water on an empty tea cup, then using 2 guams, a marrentill and a harralander on it.\",\"i\":[\"Empty cup\",\"Bowl of hot water\",\"Guam leaf (2)\",\"Marrentill\",\"Harralander\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press Captain Bleemadge on top of White Wolf Mountain and choose Talk-to.\",\"s\":[\"I have a special tea here for you from Sanfew!\",\"Ok, I'll go and get you some T.R.A.S.H.\"],\"i\":[\"Guthix rest(3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arhein in Catherby.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk T.R.A.S.H. to you.\",\"Yes, Ok, I'll do it!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Phantuwti in the south west house of Seers' Village.\",\"s\":[\"Hi, can you give me a weather forecast?\",\"What can I do to help?\",\"Yes, Ok, I'll do it.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave south east of the Fishing Guild.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the sculpture in the wall in the north east corner of the cave and choose Search.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Wizard Cromperty in north east Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Chat.\",\"I need to talk to you about a girl stuck in some rock!\",\"Oh! Ok, one more 'small favour' isn't going to kill me...I hope!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Tindel Marchant in Port Khazard.\",\"s\":[\"Wizard Cromperty sent me to get some iron oxide.\",\"Ask about iron oxide.\",\"Okay, I'll do it!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Rantz in the Feldip Hills. AKS fairy ring or Feldip Hills Teleport.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about a mattress.\",\"Can you fill this mattress with feathers?\",\"Ok, I'll see what I can do.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Gnormadium Avlafrim west of Rantz.\",\"s\":[\"Rantz said I should help you finish this project.\",\"Yes, I'll take a look at them.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search each of the 8 landing lights on the landing strip to take out its uncut gem. Cut the gem with a chisel and put it back in the same light. The lights stand in two rows of four: from east to west, each row holds jade, red topaz, opal and sapphire. If you crush a gem, keep the crushed gem: Gnormadium sells up to 2 new ones of each type for 500 coins each.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\"]}],\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Steel bar (3)\",\"Empty cup\",\"Bowl of hot water\",\"Guam leaf (2)\",\"Marrentill\",\"Harralander\"],\"r\":[\"Opal (2)\",\"Jade (2)\",\"Red topaz (2)\",\"Coins (3000)\"]},{\"n\":\"Completing the favours\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Gnormadium Avlafrim again.\",\"s\":[\"I've fixed all the lights!\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Rantz in the Feldip Hills. AKS fairy ring or Feldip Hills Teleport.\",\"s\":[\"Ok, I've helped that Gnome, he shouldn't bother you anymore.\"],\"i\":[\"Stodgy mattress\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Tindel Marchant in Port Khazard.\",\"s\":[\"I have the mattress.\"],\"i\":[\"Comfy mattress\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Wizard Cromperty in north east Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Chat.\",\"I have that iron oxide you asked for!\"],\"i\":[\"Iron oxide\"]},{\"t\":\"Get 5 pigeon cages from behind Jerico's house in central East Ardougne.\",\"i\":[\"Pigeon cages (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave south east of the Fishing Guild. Be prepared to fight the Slagilith(level 92, takes reduced damage from anything other than pickaxes).\",\"i\":[\"Pigeon cages (5)\",\"Animate rock scroll\",\"Any pickaxe to kill Slagilith\"]},{\"t\":\"Stand in front of the sculpture in the north-east cavern, then read the animate rock scroll.\",\"i\":[\"Animate rock scroll\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Slagilith. They take reduced damage from anything other than a pickaxe.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the animate rock scroll again.\",\"i\":[\"Animate rock scroll\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Petra Fiyed.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Phantuwti in the south west house of Seers' Village. Keep asking until he tells you about his weather vane.\",\"s\":[\"I've released Petra, she should have returned.\",\"I'll run you through if you don't give me that weather report.\",\"Why can't you get a clear picture?\",\"Which special Seers tools do you mean?\",\"You're talking in riddles, just give me a straight answer!\",\"What do you mean, 'special combination of items'?\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the ladder in Phantuwti's house, walk east and climb the next ladder to the roof (needs 36 Agility). Long-press the weathervane and choose Search.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a hammer on the weathervane.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the weathervane on top of the Seers' building and choose Search again.\"},{\"t\":\"Repair the vane parts on an anvil. You can find one in the north of Seers' Village.\",\"i\":[\"Broken vane part\",\"Hammer\",\"Steel bar\",\"Iron bar\",\"Bronze bar\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back up to the Seers' roof by the two ladders. Use the ornament, the directionals and the weathervane pillar on the weathervane.\",\"i\":[\"Ornament\",\"Directionals\",\"Weathervane pillar\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Phantuwti in the south west house of Seers' Village.\",\"s\":[\"I've fixed the weather vane!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arhein in Catherby.\",\"s\":[\"What did you want me to do again?\",\"I have the weather report for you.\"],\"i\":[\"Weather report\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press Captain Bleemadge on White Wolf Mountain and choose Talk-to.\",\"s\":[\"Hey there, did you get your T.R.A.S.H?\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Sanfew upstairs in the Taverley herblore store.\",\"s\":[\"Hi there, the Gnome Pilot has agreed to take you to see the ogres!\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Hammerspike Stoutbeard in the west cavern of the Dwarven Mine.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill 3 dwarf gang members until Hammerspike gives in. One dwarf gang member should appear after each kill.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Hammerspike Stoutbeard in the west cavern of the Dwarven Mine after killing his dwarf gang members.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Tassie Slipcast in the Barbarian Village pottery building.\"},{\"t\":\"Spin the clay into a pot lid.\",\"i\":[\"Soft clay\"]},{\"t\":\"Fire the unfired pot lid.\",\"i\":[\"Unfired pot lid\"]},{\"t\":\"Get a pot to put your lid on. There's one in the Barbarian Village helmet shop.\",\"i\":[\"Pot\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the pot lid on a pot.\",\"i\":[\"Pot\",\"Pot lid\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the Apothecary in west Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about One Small Favour.\"],\"i\":[\"Airtight pot\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Horvik in the armour shop north east of the Varrock square.\",\"s\":[\"I have the tincture and the breathing salts.\"],\"i\":[\"Pigeon cages (5)\",\"Breathing salts\",\"Herbal tincture\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Horvik once more in the armour shop north east of the Varrock square.\",\"s\":[\"I have the five pigeon cages you asked for!\"],\"i\":[\"Pigeon cages (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Seth Groats in the farm north east of Lumbridge, across the river.\",\"i\":[\"Chicken cage (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Johanhus Ulsbrecht in the south of the H.A.M hideout.\",\"s\":[\"You're in luck, I've managed to swing that chicken deal for you.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Aggie in Draynor Village.\",\"s\":[\"Good news! Jimmy has been released!\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Brian in the Port Sarim axe shop.\",\"s\":[\"I've returned with good news.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to a Jungle Forester south of Shilo Village. CKR fairy ring or take cart from Brimhaven.\",\"s\":[\"Good news, I have your sharpened axe!\"],\"i\":[\"Sharpened axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Yanni Salika in Shilo Village.\",\"s\":[\"Here's the red mahogany you asked for.\"],\"i\":[\"Red mahogany log\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bronze bar\",\"Iron bar\",\"Steel bar\",\"Hammer\",\"Pot\"],\"r\":[\"Combat gear to fight Slagilith and the dwarf gang members\",\"Any pickaxe to kill Slagilith\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Slagilith (level 92)\"]}]}"
        "Pandemonium" -> "{\"n\":\"Pandemonium\",\"items\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"300 Sailing XP\",\"25 x Sawmill Coupon (wood plank)\",\"2 x Repair kits\",\"Spyglass\",\"Access to the Sailing Skill\",\"Access to Pandemonium\",\"Your very own mighty ship!\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"You got the job!\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Will or Anne on the docks of Port Sarim to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"Okay.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Will or Anne on the docks to board the ship.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"What's the job?\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Will or Anne on the boat to hear about the job.\"},{\"t\":\"Navigate using the helm.\"},{\"t\":\"Raise your sails: tap the sails on the ship, or tap them under Facilities in the Sailing side panel.\"},{\"t\":\"Tap the water or the minimap to steer. Sail south through the Bay of Sarim until you're east of the Karamja Shipyard, where the wreck is. When Will says you've arrived, lower the sails.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Will or Anne on the boat to learn about the other part of your job.\"},{\"t\":\"Deploy the Salvaging Hook.\"},{\"t\":\"Watch the salvaging cutscene.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"You lost the job!\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"You wash up on the Pandemonium after the cutscene, so if you're there, tap Done. If you've left it, travel back with Captain Tobias on Port Sarim dock for 30 coins.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please.\",\"I'd like to go to the Pandemonium.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to 'Squawking' Steve Beanie behind the bar to learn about where you are.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to 'Squawking' Steve Beanie about Will and Anne.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ribs near the door to learn about the map.\",\"s\":[\"No, tell me about him.\",\"Now's not really the time for tales.\"]},{\"t\":\"Ask 'Squawking' Steve Beanie behind the bar about Will and Anne's location.\",\"s\":[\"About Will and Anne...\",\"Do you have any idea where Will and Anne might have gone?\"]},{\"t\":\"Ask Junior Jim by the docks about getting a ship.\",\"s\":[\"I think I might have lost a cup here.\"],\"i\":[\"Old cup\"]},{\"t\":\"Hand over the cup to Junior Jim and receive your mighty vessel!\",\"s\":[\"I think I might have lost a cup here.\"],\"i\":[\"Old cup\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Your mighty vessel\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Junior Jim to enter the shipyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up a saw from the crate of saws.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up a hammer from the crate of hammers.\"},{\"t\":\"Board your vessel.\"},{\"t\":\"Build the Cargo Hold.\"},{\"t\":\"Disembark your vessel.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the shipyard using the portal.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Junior Jim to get a log book.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"You got the job... again!\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Junior Jim for a new job.\"},{\"t\":\"Board your ship, or reclaim it with a shipwright/ teleport it to you at your preferred dock.\"},{\"t\":\"Navigate using the helm.\"},{\"t\":\"Raise your sails: tap the sails under Facilities in the Sailing side panel.\"},{\"t\":\"Sail north past the shipyard to Port Sarim. Dock by tapping the buoy just south of the southernmost dock.\"},{\"t\":\"Let go of the helm.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave your ship.\"},{\"t\":\"Take off your weapon and shield first: you need empty hands to carry cargo. Then pick up the cargo from the ledger table at the western end of the dock.\"},{\"t\":\"Board your ship.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Deliver the cargo.\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Deposit the crate into your cargo hold.\"},{\"t\":\"Navigate using the helm.\"},{\"t\":\"Raise your sails: tap the sails under Facilities in the Sailing side panel.\"},{\"t\":\"Sail south back to the Pandemonium's docks and stop inside the ring of buoys there.\"},{\"t\":\"Let go of the helm.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the cargo from your ship's cargo hold.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave your ship.\"},{\"t\":\"Deliver the cargo at the ledger table on the docks.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finishing up\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Tell Junior Jim about your delivery.\"},{\"t\":\"Meet 'Squawking' Steve Beanie and Old Grog at the bar.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to 'Squawking' Steve Beanie to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Perilous Moons" -> "{\"n\":\"Perilous Moons\",\"items\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Big fishing net\",\"Knife\",\"Rope\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"],\"rec\":[\"Stamina potions\",\"Antipoison\"],\"enemies\":[\"Sulphur Nagua (level 98)\",\"Blue Moon (level 329)\",\"Blood Moon (level 329)\",\"Eclipse Moon (level 329)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"40,000 Slayer XP\",\"5,000 Runecraft XP\",\"5,000 Hunter XP\",\"5,000 Fishing XP\",\"Access to Neypotzli and the Moons of Peril\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Ruined\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Attala, stood south of Ralos' Rise.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the sulphur nagua (level 98) on the ledge north-east of Attala. With 47 Agility, cross the bridge to the east and climb the rocks to the north. Without it, take the western path north towards the Teomat, then go round to the south-east of the exposed altar. Protect from Melee blocks its attacks.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Attala.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the entrance to Cam Torum.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Jessamine in the far north end of Cam Torum.\",\"s\":[\"Can I be of any help with the dig?\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Neypotzli entrance in the far north of the cavern.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Attala near the entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Zuma near the entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Jessamine near the entrance.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Sulphur Nagua (level 98)\"]},{\"n\":\"Camping up\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Make sure you have 5 free inventory spaces, then take building supplies from the crates just west of Jessamine. You get a hammer, a saw and three building supplies.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the south-west entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Building supplies\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\"]},{\"t\":\"Make your way to the camp spot, marked on the minimap with a cooking range icon, and build it.\",\"i\":[\"Building supplies\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the antechamber.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the north-west entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Building supplies\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\"]},{\"t\":\"Make your way to the camp spot, marked on the minimap with a cooking range icon, and build it.\",\"i\":[\"Building supplies\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the antechamber.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the north-east entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Make your way to the camp spot, marked on the minimap with a cooking range icon, and build it.\",\"i\":[\"Building supplies\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the antechamber.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Enchanting\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Jessamine near the Monolith.\",\"s\":[\"What does the inscription say?\",\"What do we do now?\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Cam Torum through the south entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Nahta in the magic shop.\",\"s\":[\"Actually, I've been sent by Attala.\"],\"i\":[\"Earth talisman\",\"Water talisman\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the blacksmith near the anvils.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help with these talismans.\",\"Can you help?\"],\"i\":[\"Enchanted earth talisman\",\"Enchanted water talisman\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Neypotzli entrance in the far north of Cam Torum, then talk to Attala near the Monolith.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the talismans to find the correct location. Earth tells you if it's east/west, and the water talisman tells you north/south. Despite how the world map looks, the antechamber counts as being directly in the middle of the 4 areas, so if it says to go south and east when in there, you should go to the ancient shrine, accessed through the prison or the streambound cavern. Keep using them as you move: Eyatlalli appears when you reach the right spot.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Eyatlalli.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the antechamber and talk to Jessamine near the Monolith. Eyatlalli appears again. When that chat ends, talk to Eyatlalli.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Ritual\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the north-east entrance to the streambound cavern.\"},{\"t\":\"Take herblore supplies from the supply crates in the camp. You only need the pestle and mortar.\",\"s\":[\"Take herblore supplies.\"]},{\"t\":\"Collect a grub from the grubby sapling east of the camp.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on the moonlight grub.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Moonlight grub\"]},{\"t\":\"Take fishing supplies from the supply crates in the camp.\",\"s\":[\"Take fishing supplies.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fish a bream from the stream east of the camp.\",\"i\":[\"Big fishing net\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a knife on the raw bream.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Raw bream\"]},{\"t\":\"Take hunter supplies from the supply crates in the camp. You only need the rope, and the knife from the fishing supplies.\",\"s\":[\"Take hunting supplies.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the entrance north of the camp.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Walk west to the Hunter icon on the minimap. Set up a trap there by tapping two rocks near one another.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Rustle the nearby bush to trap a lizard.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the raw moss lizard.\",\"i\":[\"Raw moss lizard\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a knife on the raw moss lizard.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Raw moss lizard\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the area back to the antechamber via the south-east entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Eyatlalli with the items.\",\"i\":[\"Moonlight grub paste\",\"Bream scales\",\"Moss lizard tail\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Blue moon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the north-west entrance to the earthbound cavern when you're ready for the blue moon fight. Make food and potions from the lizards, breams, and grubby saplings before the fights.\",\"i\":[\"Crush weapon\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the trail to the camp spot, then keep going east past it to the entrance to the blue moon fight.\",\"i\":[\"Crush weapon\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the blue moon. Use a crush weapon. Protection prayers have no effect. Remain inside of the highlighted circle on the floor to remain safe. It will move periodically. When the highlighted circle is the full or new moon, they will use a special attack: Weapon freeze - Your weapon is unequipped and put into ice. Attack the ice to get it back. Brazier - two braziers will extinguish. Re-ignite them whilst avoiding the tornadoes.\"}],\"i\":[\"Crush weapon\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Blue Moon (level 329)\"]},{\"n\":\"Blood moon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the south-west entrance to the ancient prison when you're ready for the blood moon fight. Make food and potions from the lizards, breams, and grubby saplings before the fights.\",\"i\":[\"Slash weapon\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the north-east entrance to the blood moon fight.\",\"i\":[\"Slash weapon\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the blood moon. Use a slash weapon. Protection prayers have no effect. Remain inside of the highlighted circle on the floor to remain safe. It will move periodically. When the highlighted circle is the full or new moon, they will use a special attack: Raining blood - Blood falls from the ceiling. Avoid the blood puddles. Blood jaguar - Jaguars appear. Attack the highlighted jaguar, avoiding the blood square. Step away from the jaguar just before each of its attacks.\"}],\"i\":[\"Slash weapon\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Blood Moon (level 329)\"]},{\"n\":\"Eclipse moon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the streambound cavern when you're ready for the eclipse moon fight. Make food and potions from the lizards, breams, and grubby saplings before the fights.\",\"i\":[\"Stab weapon\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the south entrance to the eclipse moon fight.\",\"i\":[\"Stab weapon\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the eclipse moon. Use a stab weapon. Protection prayers have no effect. Remain inside of the highlighted circle on the floor to remain safe. It will move periodically. Only use food and potions made inside of Neypotzli. When the highlighted circle is the full or new moon, they will use a special attack: Eclipse shield - A moon shield appears. Keep behind the shield as it moves. Mimic - Clones of the moon will appear. Face the clones to avoid taking damage.\"}],\"i\":[\"Stab weapon\",\"Combat armour with high defensive bonuses\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Eclipse Moon (level 329)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Jessamine near the Monolith again.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Zuma.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Eyatlalli to finish the quest. If the quest doesn't finish, talk to Attala near the Monolith, then talk to Eyatlalli again.\"}]}]}"
        "Pirate's Treasure" -> "{\"n\":\"Pirate's Treasure\",\"items\":[\"Coins (60)\",\"Spade\",\"Bananas (10)\"],\"rec\":[\"A teleport to Varrock\",\"A teleport to Falador\"],\"enemies\":[\"Gardener (level 4)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"A Gold Ring\",\"An Emerald\",\"450 x Coins\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Talk to Redbeard Frank\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Redbeard Frank in Port Sarim.\",\"s\":[\"I'm in search of treasure.\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins (60)\"]},{\"n\":\"Rum smuggling\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to one of the Seamen on the docks in Port Sarim to go to Musa Point.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Zembo in the Karamja Wines, Spirits and Beers bar. Buy one Karamjan rum.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please.\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick 10 bananas nearby, and then talk to Luthas about working for him.\",\"s\":[\"Could you offer me employment on your plantation?\",\"Will you pay me for another crate full?\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the Karamjan rum on the crate outside the south-east corner of Luthas's hut, not the crate in the bedroom.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the crate outside and choose Fill to add the rest of your bananas, then talk to Luthas.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Luthas and tell him you finished filling the crate.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Back to Port Sarim\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Head back to Port Sarim. Pay the Customs Officer to sail there.\",\"s\":[\"Thank you, I'll be on my way\",\"Can I journey on this ship?\",\"Search away, I have nothing to hide.\",\"Ok.\",\"Search away. I have nothing to hide.\",\"Okay.\"]},{\"t\":\"Grab the white apron from the Fishing Shop.\",\"i\":[\"White apron\"]},{\"t\":\"Wear your white apron and talk to Wydin in the Port Sarim food shop to get a job. Then search the crate with the banana on it in the back room.\",\"s\":[\"Well, can I get a job here?\"],\"i\":[\"White apron\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the Karamjan rum to Redbeard Frank in Port Sarim.\",\"s\":[\"Ok thanks, I'll go and get it.\"],\"i\":[\"Karamjan rum\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Discover the treasure\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb up the stairs in The Blue Moon Inn in Varrock.\",\"i\":[\"Chest key\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the chest by using the key on it.\",\"i\":[\"Chest key\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the Pirate message.\",\"i\":[\"Pirate message\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to Falador Park and find the statue of Saradomin in the middle. See where it points: the dirt there makes a rough X. Stand in the middle of the X and dig. Kill the Gardener (level 4) who appears, or run out of the park to lose him, then dig again in the same spot.\"}],\"i\":[\"Spade\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Gardener (level 4)\"]}]}"
        "Plague City" -> "{\"n\":\"Plague City\",\"items\":[\"Dwellberries\",\"Spade\",\"Rope\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Chocolate dust\",\"Snape grass\"],\"rec\":[\"Bucket of water (4)\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"2,425 Mining XP\",\"Ability to use Ardougne teleport spell and tablets\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Start the quest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Edmond in the north-west corner of East Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"What's happened to her?\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Dwellberries\",\"Spade\",\"Rope\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Chocolate dust\",\"Snape grass\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Infiltrate West Ardougne\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Alrena and give her the dwellberries.\",\"i\":[\"Dwellberries\"]},{\"t\":\"Grab the Picture from Edmond's house.\",\"i\":[\"Picture\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Edmond again.\"},{\"t\":\"Use four buckets of water on the mud patch in Edmond's garden patch.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of water (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a spade on the mud patch.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the hole.\"},{\"t\":\"Attempt to pull the grill in the south of the sewer.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the grill.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Edmond and ask him to help you pull off the grill.\"},{\"t\":\"Equip the gas mask and climb through the pipe.\",\"i\":[\"Gas mask\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Discover Elena's location\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Jethick east of where you emerge.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'll return it for you.\"],\"i\":[\"Gas mask\",\"Picture\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the tall house in north West Ardougne.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Martha or Ted Rehnison\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Milli upstairs.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Freeing Elena\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Try to enter the house in the south-east corner of West Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"I fear not a mere plague.\",\"I want to check anyway.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Clerk in the large building north of the manhole.\",\"s\":[\"I need permission to enter a plague house.\",\"This is urgent though! Someone's been kidnapped!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Bravek in the room to the east.\",\"s\":[\"This is really important though!\",\"Do you know what's in the cure?\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your chocolate dust on the bucket of milk.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of milk\",\"Chocolate dust\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the snape grass on the chocolatey milk\",\"i\":[\"Chocolatey milk\",\"Snape grass\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the hangover cure to Bravek.\",\"i\":[\"Hangover cure\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Bravek to receive the warrant you need to enter the plague house.\",\"s\":[\"They won't listen to me!\"]},{\"t\":\"Try to enter the plague house again.\",\"i\":[\"Warrant\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the barrel in the room for a small key.\"},{\"t\":\"Go downstairs in the plague house.\",\"i\":[\"A small key\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the jail and talk to Elena.\",\"i\":[\"A small key\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go back upstairs and return to the town square. Go down the manhole, follow the sewer and climb the mud pile, then return to Edmond at his house to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Priest in Peril" -> "{\"n\":\"Priest in Peril\",\"items\":[\"Rune or Pure Essence (50)\",\"Bucket\"],\"rec\":[\"Ranged or melee weapon + armour\",\"Varrock teleports (3)\",\"Essence pouches for carrying essence\"],\"enemies\":[\"Temple Guardian (level 30). You cannot use Magic. Rings of recoil will not award the kill.\",\"Monk of Zamorak (level 30)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,406 Prayer XP\",\"Wolfbane Dagger\",\"Access to Canifis and Morytania\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Start the quest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to King Roald in Varrock Castle.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for a quest!\",\"Yes, I think I've heard of it.\",\"Yes.\",\"I'll get going.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Go to the temple\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the temple east of Varrock by the river and tap the large door.\",\"s\":[\"Roald sent me to check on Drezel.\",\"Sure. I'm a helpful person!\"],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee weapon + armour\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the trapdoor just north of the temple door. Kill the Temple Guardian (level 30). It is immune to magic so you will need to use either ranged or melee.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to King Roald.\",\"s\":[\"About that job I'm doing...\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee weapon + armour\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Temple Guardian (level 30). You cannot use Magic. Rings of recoil will not award the kill.\"]},{\"n\":\"Return to the temple\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to the temple.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\",\"As much essence as you can carry, you'll need to bring 50 UNNOTED in total\",\"Combat gear, ranged or mage to safespot\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill a Monk of Zamorak (level 30) for a golden key. You can safespot using the pews.\",\"i\":[\"Golden key\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Drezel on the top floor of the temple.\",\"s\":[\"So, what now?\",\"Yes, of course.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee weapon + armour\",\"Bucket\",\"As much essence as you can carry, you'll need to bring 50 UNNOTED in total\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Monk of Zamorak (level 30)\"]},{\"n\":\"Freeing Drezel\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go down the ladder and the stairs to the ground floor and leave the temple. Go down the trapdoor just north of it, where you killed the Temple Guardian.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the central room, and study the monuments to find which has a key on it. Use the Golden Key on it.\",\"i\":[\"Golden key\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bucket on the well in the central room.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back up to the top floor of the temple.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the cell door.\",\"i\":[\"Iron key\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Drezel to bless the water.\",\"i\":[\"Murky water\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the blessed water on the coffin.\",\"i\":[\"Blessed water\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Drezel again.\"}],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee weapon + armour\",\"Bucket\",\"As much essence as you can carry, you'll need to bring 50 UNNOTED in total\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Curing the Salve\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Drezel in the east of the underground temple area.\",\"i\":[\"As much essence as you can carry, you'll need to bring 50 UNNOTED in total\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring Drezel 50 UNNOTED rune/pure essence in the underground of the Salve Temple to finish the quest!\",\"i\":[\"Rune/Pure essence (50)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Rune or Pure Essence (50)\"]}]}"
        "Prince Ali Rescue" -> "{\"n\":\"Prince Ali Rescue\",\"items\":[\"Soft clay\",\"Balls of wool (3)\",\"Yellow dye\",\"Redberries\",\"Ashes\",\"Bucket of water\",\"Pot of flour\",\"Bronze bar\",\"Pink skirt\",\"Beers (3)\",\"Rope\",\"Coins minimum (100)\"],\"rec\":[\"Amulet of Glory for Al Kharid and Draynor Village teleports\"],\"enemies\":[\"Able to survive jail guards (level 26) attacking you\"],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"700 x Coins\",\"Free use of the Al Kharid toll gates.\",\"Access to Sorceress's Garden Minigame (Members)\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Hassan in the Al Kharid Palace.\",\"s\":[\"Is there anything I can help you with?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Osman north of the Al Kharid Palace.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Make a blonde wig\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Have Ned in Draynor Village make you a wig from 3 balls of wool. He can also sell you a rope for 15 coins via dialogue (or bought from his shop for 18 coins) or 4 balls of wool.\",\"s\":[\"Could you make other things apart from rope?\",\"How about some sort of wig?\",\"I have them here. Please make me a wig.\"],\"i\":[\"Balls of wool (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Dye the wig with yellow dye. Buy a yellow dye with two onions and 5 coins if you still need it from Aggie in Draynor Village.\",\"i\":[\"Yellow dye\",\"Wig\"]}],\"i\":[\"Yellow dye\",\"Balls of wool (3)\"]},{\"n\":\"Make paste\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Aggie in Draynor Village to get some paste.\",\"s\":[\"Can you make skin paste?\",\"Yes please. Mix me some skin paste.\"],\"i\":[\"Redberries\",\"Ashes\",\"Pot of flour\",\"Bucket of water\"]}],\"i\":[\"Redberries\",\"Ashes\",\"Pot of flour\",\"Bucket of water\"]},{\"n\":\"Make a key print\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Lady Keli in the jail east of Draynor Village, with soft clay in your inventory, to make a key print. If you already have the key print, skip this step.\",\"s\":[\"Heard of you? You're famous in Gielinor!\",\"What's your latest plan then?\",\"How do you know someone won't try to free him?\",\"Could I see the key please?\",\"Could I touch the key for a moment please?\"],\"i\":[\"Soft clay\"]}],\"i\":[\"Soft clay\"]},{\"n\":\"Make the key\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use the key print on any furnace with a bronze bar in your inventory to make a key.\",\"i\":[\"Key print\",\"Bronze bar\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bronze bar\",\"Key print\"]},{\"n\":\"Return with the items\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Leela east of Draynor Village.\",\"i\":[\"Beers (3)\",\"Wig (dyed)\",\"Paste\",\"Rope\",\"Pink skirt\"]}],\"i\":[\"Wig (dyed)\",\"Paste\",\"Rope\",\"Beers (3)\",\"Pink skirt\"]},{\"n\":\"Free Ali\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bring everything to the jail and give Joe there three beers.\",\"s\":[\"I have some beer here. Fancy one?\"],\"i\":[\"Beers (3)\",\"Bronze key\",\"Wig (dyed)\",\"Paste\",\"Rope\",\"Pink skirt\"]},{\"t\":\"Use rope on Keli.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the key on the prison door. If Lady Keli respawned you'll need to tie her up again.\",\"i\":[\"Bronze key\",\"Wig (dyed)\",\"Paste\",\"Pink skirt\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Prince Ali and free him.\",\"i\":[\"Bronze key\",\"Wig (dyed)\",\"Paste\",\"Pink skirt\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bronze key\",\"Wig (dyed)\",\"Paste\",\"Rope\",\"Beers (3)\",\"Pink skirt\"]},{\"n\":\"Return to Al Kharid\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Hassan in the Al Kharid Palace to complete the quest.\"}]}]}"
        "Prying Times" -> "{\"n\":\"Prying Times\",\"items\":[\"Hammer\",\"Steel bar\",\"Redberry pie\",\"Captain's log\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Drink Troll (level 14) (can be ignored)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"800 Sailing XP\",\"1,000 Smithing XP\",\"25 x Sawmill Coupon (oak plank)\",\"Unlimited Crowbars from the crate of crowbars\",\"Ability to chart forgotten drinks\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Looty!\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to 'Squawking' Steve Beanie behind the Pandemonium bar to start the quest. You can travel there via Captain Tobias on Port Sarim docks for 30gp.\",\"s\":[\"Any word from Old Grog?\",\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Captain's log\"]},{\"t\":\"Sail to Port Sarim.\"},{\"t\":\"With both hands empty, pick up the cargo from the ledger table on the docks of Port Sarim.\"},{\"t\":\"Board your ship.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the cargo in the cargo hold of your ship.\"},{\"t\":\"Sail to the Pandemonium.\"},{\"t\":\"Pickup the cargo from the cargo hold of your ship.\"},{\"t\":\"Deliver the cargo to the ledger table on the docks of the Pandemonium.\"},{\"t\":\"Let 'Squawking' Steve Beanie behind the bar know you delivered the looty.\",\"s\":[\"I delivered that cargo for you.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Captain's log\"]},{\"n\":\"A key!\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get the key from Thurgo in the shed near Mudskipper's Point.\",\"s\":[\"I need some help with a 'special key'.\",\"So, can you help me make a crowbar?\",\"Can you help me make another crowbar?\",\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Steel bar\",\"Redberry pie\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the 'key' to 'Squawking' Steve Beanie behind the Pandemonium bar. You can travel there via Captain Tobias on Port Sarim docks for 30gp.\",\"s\":[\"I made that 'special key' you needed.\"],\"i\":[\"Crowbar\"]},{\"t\":\"Sail to the crate north-west of Pandemonium.\",\"i\":[\"Crowbar\"]},{\"t\":\"If the crowbar isn't in your inventory, take it out of your ship's cargo hold. Then, still aboard your ship, open the Sealed crate with the crowbar.\",\"i\":[\"Crowbar\"]},{\"t\":\"Drink the stout. Warning: you will be attacked by a level 14 Drink Troll.\",\"i\":[\"Bottle of fish bladder stout\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Drink Troll, or log out.\"},{\"t\":\"Tell 'Squawking' Steve Beanie behind the Pandemonium bar the key works.\",\"s\":[\"About that crate...\"],\"i\":[\"Crowbar\"]},{\"t\":\"Open Steve's crate in the corner behind the bar.\",\"i\":[\"Crowbar\"]}],\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Steel bar\",\"Redberry pie\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Drink Troll (level 14) (can be ignored)\"]}]}"
        "Rag and Bone Man I" -> "{\"n\":\"Rag and Bone Man I\",\"items\":[\"Coins (8)\",\"Pot (8)\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Varrock teleport\",\"Lumbridge teleport\",\"Digsite pendant\",\"Draynor teleport\",\"Karamja teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"8 low leveled monsters for their bones\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"500 Cooking XP\",\"500 Prayer XP\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting out\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Odd Old Man in Silvarea, north-east of Varrock, on the path to the Paterdomus temple.\",\"s\":[\"Anything I can do to help?\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Collecting bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Kill a giant rat south east of Varrock. After this kill and every other kill in this section, pick up the bone it drops.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the unicorn south east of Varrock.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the bear south east of Varrock.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill a ram south of Varrock.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill a goblin east of Lumbridge.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill a big frog in the Lumbridge Swamp.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill a monkey on Karamja.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill a giant bat in the Karamja Volcano Dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"Check that you have all 8 bones: one from each kill above. Go back for any you left behind.\"}],\"r\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"n\":\"Preparing the bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Fortunato in Draynor Village, and then buy 8 jugs of vinegar from him.\",\"i\":[\"Coins (8)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the vinegar on pots for 8 pots of vinegar.\",\"i\":[\"Jug of vinegar (8)\",\"Pot (8)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bones on the pots of vinegar.\",\"i\":[\"Pot of vinegar\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Cleaning the bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use one bone in vinegar on the fire by the Odd Old Man. All your bones in vinegar then boil one after another by themselves, leaving you with 8 polished bones. Any fire or range works too.\",\"i\":[\"Bone in vinegar (8)\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Handing the bones in\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Give the Odd Old Man the bones.\"}]}]}"
        "Rag and Bone Man II" -> "{\"n\":\"Rag and Bone Man II\",\"items\":[\"Coins (902)\",\"Pot (27)\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Light source\",\"Rope\",\"Ranged weapon for killing vultures\",\"Ice coolers (10)\",\"Fishing explosive (10)\",\"Mirror shield\",\"Any axe\"],\"rec\":[\"Antifire shield\",\"Inoculation bracelet or a potion for Disease\",\"Digsite pendant\",\"Ectophial\",\"Ring of dueling\",\"Games necklace\",\"Varrock teleport\",\"Lumbridge teleport\",\"Nardah teleport\",\"Draynor teleport\",\"Karamja teleport\",\"Taverley teleport\",\"Rellekka teleport\",\"Teleport to Gnome Stronghold (Spirit tree/Gnome Glider\",\"Teleport to Feldip Hills (Gnome Glider or Fairy Ring (AKS))\",\"Dramen staff\"],\"enemies\":[\"27 low to mid leveled monsters for their bones\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"5,000 Prayer XP\",\"A Bonesack\",\"A Ram Skull Helm\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Morytania bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"If you haven't spoken to the Odd Old Man since finishing Rag and Bone Man I, talk to him. He's in Silvarea, north-east of Varrock by the Limestone Mine, on the path to Paterdomus.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill bats south of the Odd Old Man. On this quest each monster has a 1 in 4 chance to drop its bone, so keep killing until it drops, and pick it up every time.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill undead cows west of the Ectofuntus.\"},{\"t\":\"Push the easternmost memorial in the graveyard south-east of Fenkenstrain's Castle to enter the Experiment Cave. You need to be part way through Creature of Fenkenstrain.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Experiments.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the citizens/werewolves in Canifis. (Do not use Wolfbane)\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Ghouls west of Canifis.\"}],\"i\":[\"Ectophial\"]},{\"n\":\"Varrock Sewer bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go down into Varrock Sewer via the Manhole south east of Varrock Castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill zombies in the sewer.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill rats in the sewer. Most giant rats don't drop the rat bone, but the level 26 ones do.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Lumbridge Swamp bone\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"If no rope is tied to the hole yet, use a rope on it. Then enter the hole to the Lumbridge Swamp caves.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Light source\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Cave Goblins in the far east of the Lumbridge Swamp Caves. Wall Beasts on the way there can grab you, so wear a spiny helmet or slayer helmet if you have one, and keep running as you pass them.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Light source\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"n\":\"Desert bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Kill Jackals north of Nardah.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill desert snakes north of Nardah.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill a level 42 lizard north of Nardah. The level 24 desert lizards don't drop the bone. When it's nearly dead, use an ice cooler on it to finish it off.\",\"i\":[\"Ice coolers (10)\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill vultures south west of Nardah.\",\"i\":[\"Ranged weapon for killing vultures\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ice coolers (10)\",\"Ranged weapon for killing vultures\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Port Sarim bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Kill seagulls on the Port Sarim docks.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the Asgarnia Dungeon by Mudskipper Point.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Ice Giants at the end of the dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"On Mudskipper Point, use a fishing explosive on the Ominous Fishing Spot to bring up a Mogre. You need to have finished Skippy and the Mogres.\",\"i\":[\"Fishing explosive (10)\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Mogre.\"}],\"i\":[\"Fishing explosive (10)\"]},{\"n\":\"Karamja bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Kill Jogres on Karamja, near the crashed gnome glider east of Tai Bwo Wannai (fairy ring DKP is close). Pick up the jogre bone, not the ordinary jogre bones.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter Brimhaven Dungeon.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Coins (875)\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Moss Giants near the entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill fire giants deep in the dungeon.\"}],\"i\":[\"Coins (875)\",\"Any axe\"]},{\"n\":\"Taverley Dungeon bone\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to Taverley Dungeon. Bring an antifire shield if you can. The baby blue dragons are in the deeper part: squeeze through the obstacle pipe (needs 70 Agility), or use a dusty key on the gate to the deeper dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"Only if you need a dusty key: travel through Taverley Dungeon to the Black Knights' Base. Kill the Jailer in the east side of the base and pick up the jail key. Use it on the south door and talk to Velrak for a dusty key.\",\"s\":[\"So... do you know anywhere good to explore?\",\"Yes please!\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill baby blue dragons. South east near the lava is a good spot without any adult dragons.\"}],\"tr\":[\"Taverley teleport\"],\"r\":[\"Antifire shield\"]},{\"n\":\"Fremennik bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the cave north east of Rellekka.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill trolls.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill bunnies south east of Rellekka.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the Fremennik Slayer Dungeon.\",\"i\":[\"Mirror shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill basilisks in the middle of the dungeon.\",\"i\":[\"Mirror shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Jarvald on the Rellekka docks to travel to Waterbirth Island.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter waterbirth dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill dagannoths.\"}],\"i\":[\"Mirror shield\"],\"tr\":[\"Rellekka teleport\",\"Fairy Ring (DKS)\"]},{\"n\":\"Gnome Stronghold bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Kill a Terrorbird in the pen on the west side of the Tree Gnome Stronghold, across the river. Mounted terrorbird gnomes don't drop the bone.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Feldip Hills bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Kill wolves in Feldip Hills.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill ogres in Feldip Hills.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill a Zogre at Jiggig, south of Castle Wars (fairy ring BKP is close). Most weapons barely hurt them, so use Crumble Undead, an ogre bow with ogre arrows, or a comp ogre bow with brutal arrows. They can give you disease.\",\"i\":[\"Inoculation bracelet or a potion for Disease\"]}],\"i\":[\"Teleport to Feldip Hills (Gnome Glider or Fairy Ring (AKS))\"]},{\"n\":\"Preparing the bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Buy 27 jugs of vinegar from Fortunato in Draynor Village, then use them on 27 pots.\",\"i\":[\"Jug of vinegar (27)\",\"Pot (27)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bones on the pots of vinegar.\",\"i\":[\"Pot of vinegar\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Cleaning the bones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use one bone in vinegar on the fire by the Odd Old Man. All your bones in vinegar then boil one after another by themselves, leaving you with 27 polished bones. Any fire or range works too.\",\"i\":[\"Bone in vinegar (27)\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Handing the bones in\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Give the Odd Old Man the bones.\"}]}]}"
        "Ratcatchers" -> "{\"n\":\"Ratcatchers\",\"items\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Cheese (4)\",\"Marrentill\",\"Unicorn horn dust\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Catspeak amulet\",\"Empty vial\",\"Clean kwuarm\",\"Red spiders' eggs\",\"Pot of weeds\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Coins (101)\",\"Snake charm\",\"Fish or more, raw or cooked (8)\"],\"rec\":[\"Rat poison\",\"Varrock teleport\",\"Port Sarim teleport\",\"Pollnivneach teleport\",\"Ardougne teleport\",\"Mine cart access to Keldagrim from the GE\",\"Coins for magic carpet travel (1000)\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"4,500 Thieving XP\",\"A Rat Pole\",\"Access to the Rat Pits\",\"Ability to train Overgrown Cats into Wiley and Lazy Cats\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Gertrude west of Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Catspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down into Varrock Sewer via the Manhole south east of Varrock Castle.\",\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Phingspet in Varrock Sewer.\",\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\"]},{\"t\":\"Have your cat catch 8 rats near Phingspet. With your cat following you, long-press it and choose Chase. Repeat until a message says it has caught all 8.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Phingspet in Varrock Sewer again.\"}],\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Helping Jimmy\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Jimmy Dazzler in the house just west of the Flying Horse Inn in East Ardougne, north of Ardougne Castle.\",\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the directions.\",\"s\":[\"Follow the directions to the house.\"],\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Directions\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the trellis around the back of the mansion, avoiding the guards. Go west, then north around the building, with run on. Guards notice you by how close you are as well as by what they can see, so a turned back isn't enough. If you're caught you go back to the last safe spot, and your cat keeps the rats it has caught.\"},{\"t\":\"Catch the rat in the north west room with your cat.\"},{\"t\":\"Hide in the north east room. Wait until one guard is on the porch and the other is at the end of the hallway, or until both guards step out onto the balcony. Then run to the south east room and catch the 2 rats there. If the guards never line up, try another world.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Catch the 3 rats down here.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb back down the trellis to return to Ardougne, or use any teleport. Then talk to Jimmy Dazzler again.\",\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\"]}],\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Helping Jack\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Hooknosed Jack in south east Varrock. You can give Jack your vial, kwuarm, and red spiders' eggs for the rat poison\",\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Clean kwuarm\",\"Empty vial\",\"Red spiders' eggs\"]},{\"t\":\"Add rat poison to your cheese.\",\"i\":[\"Rat poison\",\"Cheese\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb up the ladder south of Jack.\",\"i\":[\"Cheese (4)\",\"Rat poison\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a poisoned cheese on each of the 4 rat holes in this room.\",\"i\":[\"Poisoned cheese\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Jack.\",\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Apothecary in west Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about something else.\",\"Talk about the Ratcatchers Quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Bucket of milk\",\"Unicorn horn dust\",\"Marrentill\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Jack again.\",\"i\":[\"Cat antipoison\",\"A non-overgrown cat\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb up the ladder south of Jack.\",\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Fish or more, raw or cooked (8)\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up your cat, then use it on the hole in the corner of the wall. You'll need to feed it by using fish ON THE WALL whenever its health gets low.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\",\"Be careful in there, cat!\"],\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Fish or more, raw or cooked (8)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use fish on the wall whenever your cat's health gets low. Keep doing this until the fight is over.\",\"i\":[\"Fish or more, raw or cooked (8)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Jack.\"}],\"i\":[\"Cheese (4)\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Marrentill\",\"Unicorn horn dust\",\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Fish or more, raw or cooked (8)\",\"Empty vial\",\"Clean kwuarm\",\"Red spiders' eggs\",\"Rat poison\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Helping Joe\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Travel to Keldagrim: go down the trapdoor in the north-west of the Grand Exchange and take the mine cart, or use the minigame teleport to the Blast Furnace.\",\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Pot of weeds\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Smokin' Joe in the north east of Keldagrim.\",\"s\":[\"I could help you.\"],\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Pot of weeds\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"If you haven't made your pot of weeds yet, use weeds on a pot. Then use a tinderbox on the pot of weeds.\",\"i\":[\"Pot of weeds\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the smouldering pot on the hole east of Joe with your cat following you and your catspeak amulet equipped.\",\"i\":[\"Smouldering pot\",\"Catspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the smouldering pot on the rat hole again.\",\"i\":[\"Smouldering pot\",\"Catspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Smokin' Joe again.\"}],\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Catspeak amulet\",\"Pot of weeds\",\"Tinderbox\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Helping Felkrash\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to Port Sarim and go down the Rat Pits manhole next to The Face, beside the fishing shop. Look for the minigame icon on the minimap.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Felkrash in the Port Sarim Rat Pits.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the rat pits.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to The Face in Port Sarim again.\",\"s\":[\"I just don't think Felkrash was that impressive.\"],\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Catspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Carry exactly 101 coins: with more, he asks for all your money unless you wear a Ring of Charos (a). Use a coin on the pot next to the Snake Charmer, just south of the bar in Pollnivneach, then talk to him.\",\"s\":[\"I want to talk to you about animal charming.\",\"What if I offered you some money?\",\"Forget about it. I don't care that much.\",\"Walk away slowly\",\"Stop\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (101)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to just outside the Port Sarim Rat Pits.\",\"i\":[\"Snake charm\",\"Music scroll\"]},{\"t\":\"Stand on the docks near the Port Sarim Rat Pits manhole, with nothing in your hands. Tap your snake charm and play it. If the tune does nothing there, try right beside the manhole.\",\"i\":[\"Snake charm\",\"Music scroll\"]},{\"t\":\"The tune has 8 pages with one note on each. Set them in this order, moving to the next page each time: D, G, E, F#, high D, B, C#, A. Your music scroll shows the same tune.\"},{\"t\":\"For the high D on page 5, tap the raise octave button at the top left first, then tap D.\"},{\"t\":\"When all 8 pages are set, tap Play.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Felkrash to finish.\"}],\"i\":[\"Snake charm\",\"Coins (101)\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Recipe for Disaster" -> "{\"n\":\"Recipe for Disaster\",\"items\":[\"Eye of newt\",\"Greenman's ale\",\"Rotten tomato\",\"Ashes\",\"Fruit blast\",\"Coins (320)\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Pot of flour\",\"Egg\",\"Bowl of water\",\"Asgarnian ale (4)\",\"Ice gloves/smiths gloves(i)/normal gloves/telekinetic grab\",\"Bread\",\"Orange\",\"Knife\",\"A blue, green, or purple dye\",\"Spice or gnome spice\",\"Fishing bait\",\"Bucket of water\",\"Charcoal\",\"Empty fishbowl\",\"Needle\",\"Bronze wire (3)\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Raw cod (more if you burn cake)\",\"Bread (more if you burn cake)\",\"Cake tin\",\"A non-overgrown cat for catching rats\",\"Many stews\",\"M'speak amulet\",\"Banana\",\"Monkey nuts\",\"Rope\",\"Gorilla greegree\",\"Ninja greegree\",\"Zombie greegree\",\"Any axe\",\"Any machete\",\"Dramen/lunar staff\",\"Raw chicken\",\"Pot of cream\",\"Pot of cornflour\",\"Dramen branch\",\"Vanilla pod\",\"Ice gloves or smiths gloves(i)\",\"Raw chompy\",\"Iron spit\",\"Any log to burn\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Ogre bellows\",\"Balls of wool\",\"Ogre bow + ogre arrows\",\"Ice gloves\",\"Restore potions for Karamel\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport to Falador (2)\",\"Teleport to Lumbridge\",\"Teleport to Taverley\",\"Teleport to Falador\",\"Combat gear\",\"Teleport to Khazard\",\"Lumbridge Teleport\",\"Necklace of Passage for Wizards' Tower teleport\",\"Teleport to Edgeville\",\"Anti-dragon shield\",\"Antifire potion\",\"Draynor Village teleport\",\"Lumbridge teleport (2)\",\"Feldip teleport. Fairy Ring (AKS), Gnome Glider\",\"Karamja teleport. Brimhaven Teleport tablet, Fairy Ring (CKR)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Icefiend if you don't have Ice Gloves\",\"5 Mudskippers (level 30/31)\",\"Crab (level 21/23)\",\"Big Snake (level 84)\",\"If you need the greegrees still, a zombie, ninja, and guard monkey\",\"Evil Chicken (level )\",\"Black dragon (level 227) (Can be safespotted)\",\"Jubbly (level 9)\",\"Agrith-Na-Na (level 146)\",\"Flambeed (level 149)\",\"Karamel (level 136)\",\"Dessourt (level 121)\",\"Gelatinnoth Mother (level 130)\",\"Culinaromancer (level 75)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"20,000 Experience Lamp (Any skill over level 50)\",\"Full access to the Culinaromancer's Chest\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Another Cook's Quest: Help the Cook\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Lumbridge Cook.\",\"s\":[\"Do you have any other quests for me?\",\"Angry! It makes me angry!\",\"I don't really care to be honest.\",\"What seems to be the problem?\",\"YES\"],\"i\":[\"Eye of newt\",\"Greenman's ale\",\"Rotten tomato\",\"Ashes\",\"Fruit blast\"]},{\"t\":\"Use ashes on the fruit blast.\",\"i\":[\"Ashes\",\"Fruit blast\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Lumbridge Cook with the required items.\",\"s\":[\"About those ingredients you wanted for the banquet...\"],\"i\":[\"Eye of newt\",\"Greenman's ale\",\"Rotten tomato\",\"Dirty blast\"]},{\"t\":\"Go through the door behind the Cook, in the Lumbridge Castle kitchen, to enter the dining room and watch the cutscene.\"}],\"i\":[\"Eye of newt\",\"Greenman's ale\",\"Rotten tomato\",\"Ashes\",\"Fruit blast\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Mountain Dwarf: Saving the Dwarf\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect the dwarf in the Lumbridge Castle dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Kaylee in the pub in Falador.\",\"s\":[\"What can you tell me about dwarves and ale?\",\"I could offer you some in return, how about 200 gold?\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (320)\"]},{\"t\":\"Add coins to asgarnian ale to make 4 asgoldian ale. You can buy ale from Kaylee for 3gp each.\",\"i\":[\"Coin\",\"Asgarnian ale\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the tunnel under White Wolf Mountain.\",\"i\":[\"Asgoldian ale (4)\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Pot of flour\",\"Egg\",\"Bowl of water\",\"Ice gloves/smiths gloves(i)/normal gloves/telekinetic grab\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the old dwarf, Rohak, in the tunnel. Keep talking to him until he's drunk on your 4 asgoldian ales and agrees to make the rock cake.\",\"i\":[\"Asgoldian ale (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Rohak more, about 3 times, until he puts a dwarven rock cake on the table.\",\"i\":[\"Coins (100)\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Pot of flour\",\"Egg\",\"Bowl of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the dwarven rock cake. If you have ice gloves, wear them to pick it up. Otherwise, wear other gloves or telegrab it. If it despawns you'll need to bring Rohak more ingredients.\",\"i\":[\"Dwarven rock cake\"]},{\"t\":\"If you didn't pick up the rock cake with ice gloves, kill an icefiend on Ice Mountain to cool the rock cake.\",\"i\":[\"Dwarven rock cake\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the dwarven rock cake on the dwarf.\",\"i\":[\"Dwarven rock cake\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins (320)\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Pot of flour\",\"Egg\",\"Bowl of water\",\"Asgarnian ale (4)\",\"Ice gloves/smiths gloves(i)/normal gloves/telekinetic grab\"]},{\"n\":\"Wartface & Bentnoze: Saving the Generals\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect Wartface or Bentnoze in the Lumbridge Castle dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Go talk to the Goblin Cook down the ladder in the Goblin Village.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help...\",\"What do you need? Maybe I can get it for you.\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the Goblin Cook some charcoal.\",\"s\":[\"I've got the charcoal you were after.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Goblin Cook again.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help...\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a bucket of water on some bread.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\",\"Bread\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a knife on an orange and SLICE it.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Orange\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a dye on the sliced orange.\",\"i\":[\"A blue, green, or purple dye\",\"Orange slices\"]},{\"t\":\"Use spices on the fishing bait.\",\"i\":[\"Spice or gnome spice\",\"Fishing bait\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Goblin Cook again with the ingredients.\",\"s\":[\"I've got the ingredients we need...\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the slop on Wartface or Bentnoze.\",\"i\":[\"Slop of compromise\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bread\",\"Orange\",\"Knife\",\"A blue, green, or purple dye\",\"Spice or gnome spice\",\"Fishing bait\",\"Bucket of water\",\"Charcoal\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Pirate Pete: Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect Pirate Pete in the Lumbridge Castle dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Lumbridge Cook and ask him all the options about Pirate Pete.\",\"s\":[\"Protecting the Pirate\",\"Where do I get Ground Cod?\",\"Where do I get Ground Kelp?\",\"Where do I get Ground Giant Crab Meat?\",\"Where do I get Breadcrumbs?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Murphy in Port Khazard.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about Recipe for Disaster.\"],\"i\":[\"Empty fishbowl\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Murphy again.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about Recipe for Disaster.\"],\"i\":[\"Empty fishbowl\"]}],\"i\":[\"Empty fishbowl\"]},{\"n\":\"Pirate Pete: Get Crab and Kelp\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Wear the fishbowl helmet and diving apparatus, make sure you weigh less than 27 kg, and have at least 7 free inventory spaces. You can't go down with a pet. Then talk to Murphy again to go diving.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about Recipe for Disaster.\",\"Yes, Let's go diving.\"],\"i\":[\"Diving apparatus\",\"Fishbowl helmet\",\"Bronze wire (3)\",\"Needle\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick some kelp. Get 3 or so in case you burn a fishcake or two.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Nung in the north of the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up 5 rocks in the west of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Rock (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the underwater cave entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill mudskippers for 5 hides.\",\"i\":[\"Mudskipper hide (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the hides to Nung.\",\"i\":[\"Mudskipper hide (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring bronze wire and a needle to Nung.\",\"i\":[\"Bronze wire (3)\",\"Needle\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the crab pen and kill the crabs for some crab meat. Get 2-3 to be safe. You need 5 rocks for this: if you no longer have yours, pick up 5 more in the west of the area first.\",\"i\":[\"Crab meat\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the anchor to the south to return to the surface.\"}],\"i\":[\"Fishbowl helmet\",\"Diving apparatus\",\"Bronze wire (3)\",\"Needle\",\"Empty inventory slots at minimum (6)\"],\"r\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"5 Mudskippers (level 30/31)\",\"Crab (level 21/23)\"]},{\"n\":\"Pirate Pete: Saving Pete\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on the crab.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Crab meat\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on the kelp.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Kelp\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on a raw cod.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Raw cod (more if you burn cake)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a knife on some bread and make BREADCRUMBS.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Bread (more if you burn cake)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Lumbridge Cook about Pirate Pete again.\",\"s\":[\"Protecting the Pirate\"],\"i\":[\"Ground cod\",\"Ground crab meat\",\"Ground kelp\",\"Breadcrumbs\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the ingredients together to make the cake.\",\"i\":[\"Ground crab meat\",\"Ground kelp\",\"Ground cod\",\"Breadcrumbs\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the fishcake. It's possible to burn it.\",\"i\":[\"Raw fishcake\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the fishcake to Pirate Pete to finish the quest. BE CAREFUL NOT TO EAT IT.\",\"i\":[\"Cooked fishcake\"]}],\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Knife\",\"Raw cod (more if you burn cake)\",\"Bread (more if you burn cake)\",\"Crab meat\",\"Kelp\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Crab (level 21/23)\"]},{\"n\":\"Lumbridge Guide: Saving the Guide\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect the Lumbridge Guide in the Lumbridge Castle dining room.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'm sure I can make a cake.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs in the Wizards' Tower and talk to Traiborn.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about helping the Lumbridge Guide.\"],\"i\":[\"Egg\",\"Pot of flour\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Cake tin\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Traiborn again to enchant the egg, and name the people he shows you. Ponytail and book: Reldo. Ghostly green woman: Velorina. Desert robes and white beard: Ali Morrisane. Elf: Islwyn. Purple shirt: Unferth. Brown vest: Observatory Professor Gronigen. Pink top: Gertrude. Green witch: Hetty. Hooded man: Pirate Pete. Crown: King Lathas.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about helping the Lumbridge Guide.\",\"Okay. Let's start!\"],\"i\":[\"Egg\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Traiborn again to enchant the milk, and answer his questions. Defence to wear a Mystic hat: 20. Ingredients in a cake: Flour, Eggs and milk. Combat level of goblins near Lumbridge: 2. Coins to bribe an Al Kharid gate guard: 10. Not between Morytania and Asgarnia: Keep Le Faye. Gold ring is to 5 as a holy symbol is to: 16. Glass vial is to 33 as a glass orb is to: 46. Guild closest to the Fishing Platform: Legends'. Bar west of Pollnivneach: Bandit camp. The River Salve runs: North to South. Howling one way and buzzing the other: Catherby. To make glass you first need: Sand, bucket, soda ash, glass blowing pipe. Tower closest to the Crafting Guild: Dark Wizards'. The sum using Fire Strike, Wind Strike and Earth Wave runes: 10.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about helping the Lumbridge Guide.\",\"Okay. I'm ready!\"],\"i\":[\"Bucket of milk\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Traiborn again to enchant the flour. Close the window of items with its X button, then answer. Item beginning with M: Mind Talisman. Item not shown: Trout. How many weapons: Three. How many types of rune: Two. Items you were shown: Guthix Prayer Book, Magic Logs, Pike.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about helping the Lumbridge Guide.\",\"Quiz me!\"],\"i\":[\"Pot of flour\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Traiborn for the enchanted ingredients, then mix them in a tin.\",\"i\":[\"Enchanted egg\",\"Enchanted flour\",\"Enchanted milk\",\"Cake tin\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the Guidance Cake.\",\"i\":[\"Raw guide cake\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the Guidance Cake on the Lumbridge Guide to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Guidance cake\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bucket of milk\",\"Egg\",\"Pot of flour\",\"Cake tin\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Evil Dave: Saving Evil Dave\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect Evil Dave in the Lumbridge Castle dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter Doris's basement in Edgeville.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Evil Dave.\",\"s\":[\"What did you eat at the secret council meeting?\",\"You've got to tell me because the magic requires it!\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up to Doris.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Doris.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back down to Evil Dave with your cat and about 10 stews.\",\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat\",\"Stew (10)\"]},{\"t\":\"Have your cat catch Hell-Rats in the basement: long-press the cat and choose Chase. They give red, orange, yellow and brown spices. Collect at least 3 of each colour.\"},{\"t\":\"Find the right amount of each colour, which is 1, 2 or 3 and differs per player. Add 1 of a colour to a stew and use the stew on Evil Dave. If he says you've got the amount of one spice right, note it down. If not, try 2 of that colour; if 2 is wrong as well, the answer is 3. Let him finish talking each time. If you add too much of a spice, eat the stew and start again.\"},{\"t\":\"Add the right amount of all four colours to one stew and use it on Evil Dave in the basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the spicy stew on Evil Dave in the Lumbridge Castle dining room to finish.\",\"i\":[\"Spicy stew\"]}],\"i\":[\"A non-overgrown cat for catching rats\",\"Many stews\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"King Awowogei: Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect Awowogei in the Lumbridge Castle dining room.\"}]},{\"n\":\"King Awowogei: Saving Awowogei\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Wearing a greegree and your M'speak amulet, talk to Awowogei on Ape Atoll, south of the temple.\",\"i\":[\"Any greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to any one of the three monkeys sitting in the north-west corner of the temple.\",\"s\":[\"Do you know anything about the King's favourite dish?\"],\"i\":[\"Any greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a banana on any of the three monkeys.\",\"i\":[\"Banana\",\"Any greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Use some monkey nuts on any of the three monkeys.\",\"i\":[\"Monkey nuts\",\"Any greegree\",\"M'speak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lumdo at the landing area on the south coast of Ape Atoll and travel to Crash Island.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole on Crash Island. Protect melee when entering as you'll be attacked straight away by snakes.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'm as hard as nails.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill a Big Snake for its corpse. Kill a few in case you burn it.\",\"i\":[\"Snake corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the hole.\"},{\"t\":\"Travel back to Ape Atoll with Lumdo.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the red banana tree on the north west of Ape Atoll as a gorilla.\",\"i\":[\"Gorilla greegree\",\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip your ninja greegree and start the Ape Atoll Agility Course. After swinging on the rope, go down the hole.\",\"i\":[\"Ninja greegree\"]},{\"t\":\"Take a nut from the bush. Take a few in case you burn the final meal.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on the tchiki nuts.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Tchiki monkey nuts\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a knife/slash weapon on the red banana.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Red banana\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the tchiki nut paste and the sliced red banana on the snake corpse to stuff it.\",\"i\":[\"Tchiki nut paste\",\"Sliced red banana\",\"Snake corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the trapdoor in the monkey temple.\",\"i\":[\"Zombie greegree\",\"Raw stuffed snake\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down one of the ramps and enter the crack in the wall between the two ramps.\",\"i\":[\"Zombie greegree\",\"Raw stuffed snake\"]},{\"t\":\"Go across the hot rocks with the zombie greegree equipped. Cook the stuffed snake on the rock at the end of the room.\",\"i\":[\"Zombie greegree\",\"Raw stuffed snake\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the snake to Awowogei to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Stuffed snake\"]}],\"i\":[\"M'speak amulet\",\"Banana\",\"Monkey nuts\",\"Rope\",\"Knife\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Zombie greegree\",\"Ninja greegree\",\"Gorilla greegree\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Big Snake (level 84)\"]},{\"n\":\"Sir Amik Varze: Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect Sir Amik Varze in the Lumbridge Castle dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Lumbridge Cook and ask him all the options about Sir Amik Varze.\",\"s\":[\"More...\",\"Protecting Sir Amik Varze\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village (an amulet of glory teleports you there) about strange beasts and the Evil Chicken. Finish the whole chat, or you can't go on.\",\"s\":[\"I'd just like to ask you something.\",\"Strange beasts\",\"The Evil Chicken\"]}],\"i\":[\"Draynor Village teleport\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Evil Chicken (level )\"]},{\"n\":\"Sir Amik Varze: Get token and egg\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Travel to Zanaris.\",\"i\":[\"Dramen/lunar staff\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a raw chicken on the Chicken Shrine in the north east of Zanaris.\",\"i\":[\"Raw chicken\",\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"The shrine takes you to the Evil Chicken's lair. Run north past the black dragons and kill the Evil Chicken. Pray Protect from Magic against it.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the evil chicken egg.\",\"i\":[\"Evil chickens egg\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill a black dragon.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Anti-dragon shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the dragon token.\",\"i\":[\"Dragon token\"]}],\"i\":[\"Dramen/lunar staff\",\"Raw chicken\",\"Combat gear\",\"Anti-dragon shield\",\"Antifire potion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Evil Chicken (level )\",\"Black dragon (level 227) (Can be safespotted)\"]},{\"n\":\"Sir Amik Varze: Making the brulee\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use a bucket of milk on a pot of cream.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of milk\",\"Pot of cream\"]},{\"t\":\"Use cornflour on the milky mixture.\",\"i\":[\"Pot of cornflour\",\"Milky mixture\"]},{\"t\":\"Add a vanilla pod to the cornflour mixture.\",\"i\":[\"Vanilla pod\",\"Cornflour mixture\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the evil chickens egg on the brulee.\",\"i\":[\"Evil chickens egg\",\"Brulee\",\"Pestle and mortar\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on the dramen branch.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Dramen branch\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the cinnamon on the brulee.\",\"i\":[\"Cinnamon\",\"Brulee\"]},{\"t\":\"If you're still in the Evil Chicken's lair, leave through the portal in the south to return to Zanaris.\"},{\"t\":\"In Zanaris or Lumbridge, equip your Ice Gloves and rub the dragon token. Ask the fairy dragon to cook your brulee.\",\"s\":[\"Please flambe this creme brulee for me.\"],\"i\":[\"Dragon token\",\"Brulee\",\"Ice gloves or smiths gloves(i)\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the Brulee to Sir Amik Varze to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Brulee supreme\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bucket of milk\",\"Pot of cream\",\"Cornflour mixture\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Dramen branch\",\"Vanilla pod\",\"Evil chickens egg\",\"Dragon token\",\"Ice gloves or smiths gloves(i)\"],\"tr\":[\"Lumbridge Teleport\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Evil Chicken (level )\"]},{\"n\":\"Skrach Uglogwee: Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect Skrach Uglogwee in the Lumbridge Castle dining room.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'm sure I can get some Jubbly Chompy.\",\"Oh Ok then, I guess I'll talk to Rantz.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Lumbridge teleport\"]},{\"n\":\"Skrach Uglogwee: Help Rantz\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Rantz in Feldip Hills.\",\"s\":[\"I'm trying to free Skrach, can you help?\",\"Ok, I'll do it.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Rantz on the east coast of Feldip Hills.\",\"s\":[\"Ok, here I am...I guess this is the watery place? What now?\"]},{\"t\":\"Use an axe on the old tree near Rantz.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Use an axe on the old tree near Rantz again.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Rantz again on the east coast of Feldip Hills.\",\"s\":[\"Ok, the boat's ready, now tell me how to get a Jubbly?\"]},{\"t\":\"Use an iron spit on a chompy.\",\"i\":[\"Iron spit\",\"Raw chompy\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to Karamja's west coast, just south of the transportation icon west of Tai Bwo Wannai (fairy ring CKR, then run north along the coast). Find the small tree with an arrow in it. Light a fire right next to that tree, then use your skewered chompy on the fire.\",\"i\":[\"Any log to burn\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Skewered chompy\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel back with Rantz's kids and talk to Rantz again.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please, I'll get a lift back with you.\",\"Ok, now tell me how to get Jubbly!\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Any log to burn\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Raw chompy\",\"Iron spit\",\"Ogre bow + ogre arrows\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Ogre bellows\",\"Balls of wool\"],\"tr\":[\"Feldip teleport. Fairy Ring (AKS), Gnome Glider\",\"Karamja teleport. Brimhaven Teleport tablet, Fairy Ring (CKR)\",\"Lumbridge teleport\"]},{\"n\":\"Skrach Uglogwee: Save Skrach\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Fill your ogre bellows at the swamp bubbles a short walk east of the Feldip Hills fairy ring, then use them on a toad nearby to blow it up. Keep at least 1 charge in the bellows for later.\",\"i\":[\"Ogre bellows\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine a pile of rocks near the Feldip Hills Fairy Ring for a rock.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bellows on your toad with a ball of wool in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Ogre bellows\",\"Bloated toad\",\"Balls of wool\"]},{\"t\":\"Drop the balloon toad in the dark area south of Rantz's cave and wait for a Jubbly to arrive.\",\"i\":[\"Balloon toad\",\"Ogre bow + ogre arrows\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill then pluck jubbly.\",\"i\":[\"Ogre bow + ogre arrows\"]},{\"t\":\"Pluck the jubbly's carcass.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the raw jubbly.\",\"i\":[\"Raw jubbly\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the raw jubbly on Rantz's spit.\",\"i\":[\"Raw jubbly\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the jubbly to Skrach Uglogwee to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Cooked jubbly\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ogre bow + ogre arrows\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Ogre bellows\",\"Balls of wool\"],\"tr\":[\"Lumbridge teleport\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Jubbly (level 9)\"]},{\"n\":\"Culinaromancer: Defeating the Culinaromancer\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the portal in Lumbridge Castle, ready to fight. You can leave between fights to re-gear. Have your ice gloves pre-equipped for the second fight against Flambeed to avoid them making you drop your weapon on the floor.\",\"i\":[\"Ice gloves\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Agrith-Na-Na. He uses magic at ranged, and melee up close.\"},{\"t\":\"Equip ice gloves and kill Flambeed. Water spells are especially effective. FLAMBEED WILL MAKE YOU DROP YOUR WEAPON ON THE FLOOR if you do not have ice gloves on and have a full inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Ice gloves\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Karamel. Stand in melee distance, and bring restore potions, as she drains your stats. Fire spells are especially effective.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\",\"Restore potions for Karamel\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Dessourt.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the Gelatinnoth mother. You'll need to use air spells when she's white, earth when brown, fire when red and water when blue, melee when orange and ranged when green.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the Culinaromancer. Try to keep your distance.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Agrith-Na-Na (level 146)\",\"Flambeed (level 149)\",\"Karamel (level 136)\",\"Dessourt (level 121)\",\"Gelatinnoth Mother (level 130)\",\"Culinaromancer (level 75)\"]}]}"
        "Recruitment Drive" -> "{\"n\":\"Recruitment Drive\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Sir Leye (level 20) with no items\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,000 Prayer XP\",\"1,000 Agility XP\",\"1,000 Herblore XP\",\"Initiate Helm\",\"3000 x Coins\",\"Ability to respawn in Falador\",\"Access to Initiate Armor\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting out\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"In the west part of Falador Castle, climb the stairs to the first floor, then the next stairs a few steps east to the second floor. Talk to Sir Amik Varze there.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Start the testing\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bank everything you carry and wear: the test needs an empty inventory and nothing worn. Then talk to Sir Tiffy Cashien on the bench at the entrance of Falador Park.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, let's go!\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Sir Tinley\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"You get five of these seven rooms, in a random order, and one is always Sir Kuam Ferentse's fight with Sir Leye. Use the section named after whoever is in your room. For Sir Tinley's room, read the next step before you talk to him.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sir Tinley. Once you have pressed continue do not do anything or you will fail.\"},{\"t\":\"Press Continue and do nothing. Sir Tinley will eventually talk to you and let you pass.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the portal to continue.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Ms. Hynn Terprett\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ms Hynn Terprett and answer her riddle. Death sentence riddle: the wolves. Husband and daughter riddle: 10. Identical stones riddle: Bucket A (32 degrees). Fingers on the left hand riddle: zero. Which statement is true riddle: the number of false statements here is three. A wrong answer fails the test: you go back to Falador and start the rooms again.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the door to enter the portal and continue.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Sir Kuam Ferentse\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sir Kuam Ferentse to have him spawn Sir Leye.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Sir Leye to win this challenge. Four steel weapons are in the room: pick up the steel warhammer and wield it, or fight bare-handed. If you are wielding a bladed weapon when he dies, you fail the test.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the portal to continue.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Sir Leye (level 20) with no items\"]},{\"n\":\"Sir Spishyus\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pick up the Chicken on the east and move it to the west side by crossing the bridge, then drop the Chicken from your equipped items.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the Fox on the east and move it to the west side by crossing the bridge, then drop the Fox from your equipped items.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the Chicken on the west and move it to the east side by crossing the bridge, then drop the Chicken from your equipped items.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the Grain on the east and move it to the west side by crossing the bridge, then drop the Grain from your equipped items.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the Chicken on the east and move it to the west side by crossing the bridge, then drop the Chicken from your equipped items.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the portal to continue.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Sir Ren Itchood\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sir Ren Itchood to receive the clue.\",\"s\":[\"Can I have the clue for the door?\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the door to be prompted to enter a code.\"},{\"t\":\"Solve the door combination lock. The code is the four-letter word made from the first letter of each line of Sir Ren Itchood's clue: BITE, FISH, LAST, MEAT, RAIN or TIME.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the door to enter the portal and continue.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Miss Cheevers\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the bookshelves, shelves and crates and take everything, including a knife, the vials, and the tin from the crate.\",\"s\":[\"Take both vials.\",\"Take all three vials\",\"YES\"]},{\"t\":\"First door: take the metal spade from the table and use it on the Bunsen burner, use the spade on the stone door, then use cupric sulfate on the door, then a vial of liquid on the door, and open it, but don't walk through it yet.\"},{\"t\":\"Second door: use a vial of liquid on the tin, then gypsum on the tin, then the tin on the key on the ground by the entrance portal.\"},{\"t\":\"Use cupric ore powder and tin ore powder on the tin, use the tin on the Bunsen burner, then use the knife on the tin to get a bronze key.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the key on the second door and leave through it to the portal.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Lady Table\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Solve Lady Table's puzzle. One of the 12 statues is missing when you enter and you only have a few seconds, so take a screenshot straight away (talking to Lady Table holds the room as it is until the chat ends). Find the colour (bronze, silver or gold) with only three statues and see which weapon that colour is missing. When the missing statue returns, tap it. Tapping the wrong statue fails the test: you go back to Falador and start the rooms again.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the door to enter the portal and continue.\"}]}]}"
        "Regicide" -> "{\"n\":\"Regicide\",\"items\":[\"Bow (not crossbow)\",\"Arrows (metal, unpoisoned)\",\"Rope (2)\",\"Spade\",\"Limestone\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Strip of cloth\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Gloves which fully cover your hand\",\"Pot\",\"Coal (20)\",\"Cooked rabbit\"],\"rec\":[\"Stamina Potions\",\"Antidotes/antipoisons\",\"Summer pie as food + agility boost\",\"Plank\",\"Falador teleport\",\"Combat Equipment\",\"West Ardougne teleport (4)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Tyras guard (level 110)\"],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"13,750 Agility XP\",\"15000 x Coins\",\"Access to Tirannwn & Arandar\",\"Ability to wield the Dragon Halberd\",\"Ability to charter a ship to Port Tyras.\",\"Ability to use Iorwerth Camp teleport scrolls.\",\"Ability to use Zul-Andra teleport scrolls and battle Zulrah.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting out\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in Ardougne Castle to the first floor and talk to King Lathas.\",\"s\":[\"I assume you have a plan?\",\"I can handle it.\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"To the Elven Lands\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Underground Pass at the far west of West Ardougne. Climb over the three rockslides to reach Koftik.\",\"i\":[\"Bow (not crossbow)\",\"Arrows (metal, unpoisoned)\",\"Rope\",\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the abandoned equipment next to the fire for an oily cloth. Use it on an arrow, light the arrow on the fire and wield it with your bow. Walk to the room north of Koftik and shoot the guide-rope.\",\"i\":[\"Bow (not crossbow)\",\"Arrows (metal, unpoisoned)\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the plank in the north room if you didn't bring one. Head south, then east, and swing across the pit with a rope.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb over the next two rockslides. Cross the grid by the path you found in the Underground Pass quest. It's different for every player, so if you've forgotten it, use trial and error: keep heading west, never diagonally or back east, and don't go north or south on the middle column. A wrong tile drops you in a pit for 15 damage, so keep your Hitpoints above 15. Then pull the lever to raise the gate.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the odd markings to get past the spear traps, or walk past them. Climb down the well. You don't need the four orbs again.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick the lock of the first cell to the south, dig the loose mud with your spade and cross the ledge. Go through the maze, or take the shortcut to the south with 50 Thieving.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Go south and enter the pipe, go through the tunnel and head north-east to where the paladins were. Use a plank on the flat rocks and open the doors at the end of the path.\",\"i\":[\"Plank\"]},{\"t\":\"In the large area beyond, head south to Iban's Temple in the centre, going in from the north-east. Climb down the well inside, then leave the cave to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"WAIT OUTSIDE AROUND the cave entrance for Idris to appear, and talk to Idris. If nobody appears within a couple of minutes, enter and exit the cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the path west and hop over the leaves. Head west and cross the sticks: stand next to them and keep tapping until you cross. Go north and jump over the next leaves, then cross the log to the north. Talk to Lord Iorwerth in the camp, in the north west of the elven forest.\"},{\"t\":\"Cross the log south out of the camp, jump over the leaves and go back towards the sticks. Don't cross them: go south-east from there to the Elven Tracker, at a small camp just north of the Poison Waste, and talk to him.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Lord Iorwerth in the north west of the elven forest, with 1 free inventory space for the crystal pendant he gives you.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the Elven Tracker in the south of the forest.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the footprints leading into the dense forest west of the Tracker and choose Follow.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Elven Tracker again.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb through the dense forest just west of the Tracker (needs 56 Agility) and defeat the guard who attacks you. If he doesn't appear, cross the tripwire to the north-west (it may poison you if you fail), go through the dense forest to the north, head west and fight the guard there.\"},{\"t\":\"If you killed the first guard, step over the tripwire to the north-west, go through the dense forest to the north and head west. Then go south through the dense forest below the catapult into the Tyras Camp.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to General Hining in the Tyras Camp.\"},{\"t\":\"Take 2 barrels from the Tyras Camp. If you can't find any there, two barrels are in the north-east tent of Lord Iorwerth's camp: take them before you fill them in the next step.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back out of the camp to the east, then south to the traps, and cross them. Fill the barrels from the waste just south of the Elven Tracker, and pick up some sulphur right next to it.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Lord Iorwerth with 1 free inventory space for the book he gives you.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the big book of bangs.\",\"i\":[\"Big book of bangs\"]},{\"t\":\"Ask Lord Iorwerth about all five parts needed for the barrel bomb. If a line isn't showing, tap More options... or Previous options... to find it.\",\"s\":[\"I need some quicklime.\",\"I need some naphtha.\",\"I need some sulphur.\",\"I need a barrel.\",\"I need a fuse.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bow (not crossbow)\",\"Arrows (metal, unpoisoned)\",\"Rope\",\"Spade\",\"Antidotes/antipoisons\",\"Combat Equipment\",\"Agility boosting items like Summer Pie (+5) or Agility potion (+3) (5)\"],\"r\":[\"Stamina Potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Making a bomb\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use some limestone on a furnace whilst wearing gloves.\",\"i\":[\"Limestone\",\"Gloves which fully cover your hand\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on the quicklime with a pot in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Quicklime\",\"Pot\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on some sulphur.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Sulphur\"]},{\"t\":\"With the Big book of bangs in your inventory, talk to the Chemist in Rimmington. If you've lost it, get another from Lord Iorwerth.\",\"s\":[\"Your quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Big book of bangs\",\"Barrel of coal tar (2)\",\"Coal (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a barrel of coal tar on the still outside the Chemist's house.\",\"i\":[\"Barrel of coal tar\"]},{\"t\":\"Operate the still, with all your coal in your inventory. Stay on the still's screen until you finish, as leaving it loses your progress.\"},{\"t\":\"Turn the tar regulator valve, on the right, all the way to the right.\"},{\"t\":\"Wait until the pressure needle is in the green, then turn the pressure valve, on the left, to the middle. If the needle reaches the red, turn this valve right for a moment, then back to the middle. After that, leave both valves alone.\"},{\"t\":\"Add 2 coal, then 1 more each time the heat gauge falls below the green zone, until the tar is distilled. Add it slowly: too much at once overheats the still and you start again from the first valve, though you keep your barrel.\"},{\"t\":\"Make another barrel of naphtha for Mourning's End if you'd like, then add the quicklime to the naphtha.\",\"i\":[\"Pot of quicklime\",\"Barrel of naphtha\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the ground sulphur to the naphtha mix.\",\"i\":[\"Ground sulphur\",\"Naphtha mix\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the cloth on the barrel bomb.\",\"i\":[\"Strip of cloth\",\"Barrel bomb (unfused)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Limestone\",\"Gloves which fully cover your hand\",\"Sulphur\",\"Pot\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Strip of cloth\",\"Barrel of coal tar (2)\",\"Coal (20)\"]},{\"n\":\"Regicide\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Traverse the Underground Pass again by the same route as the first time, from the far west of West Ardougne to the well in Iban's Temple, and leave the cave to the west.\",\"i\":[\"Bow (not crossbow)\",\"Arrows (metal, unpoisoned)\",\"Rope\",\"Spade\",\"Barrel bomb (fused)\",\"Cooked rabbit\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"From the cave, follow the path west and hop over the leaves, then head west towards the sticks. Don't cross them: go south-east to the Elven Tracker's camp.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb through the dense forest just west of the Tracker. Step over the tripwire to the north-west, go through the dense forest to the north and head west to the catapult, just north of the Tyras Camp.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a cooked rabbit on the guard by the catapult.\",\"i\":[\"Cooked rabbit\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the barrel bomb on the catapult.\",\"i\":[\"Barrel bomb (fused)\"]},{\"t\":\"Report back to Lord Iorwerth.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn outside Ardougne Castle.\",\"i\":[\"Iorwerth's message\"]},{\"t\":\"Report back to King Lathas to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Bow (not crossbow)\",\"Arrows (metal, unpoisoned)\",\"Rope\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Spade\",\"Antidotes/antipoisons\",\"Barrel bomb (fused)\",\"Cooked rabbit\",\"Agility boosting items like Summer Pie (+5) or Agility potion (+3) (5)\"]}]}"
        "Romeo & Juliet" -> "{\"n\":\"Romeo & Juliet\",\"items\":[\"Cadava berries\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"5 Quest points\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Helping Romeo\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Romeo in Varrock Square.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I have seen her actually!\",\"Yes, ok, I'll let her know.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in the house west of Varrock West Bank and talk to Juliet on the upper floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Bring the letter to Romeo in Varrock Square.\",\"i\":[\"Message\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Hatching a plan\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Father Lawrence in north east Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Ok, thanks.\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring cadava berries to the Apothecary in south west Varrock. If you don't have any, pick some from the bushes just west of the south-east Varrock mine.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about something else.\",\"Talk about Romeo & Juliet.\"],\"i\":[\"Cadava berries\"]}],\"i\":[\"Cadava berries\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Enact the plan\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bring the potion to Juliet in the house west of Varrock.\",\"i\":[\"Cadava potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Romeo in Varrock Square to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Roving Elves" -> "{\"n\":\"Roving Elves\",\"items\":[\"Spade\",\"Rope\",\"Glarial's pebble (obtainable in quest)\",\"Key (obtainable in quest)\"],\"rec\":[\"Antipoison potion\",\"A few prayer potions\",\"Food\",\"Super combat potion\",\"Teleport to Baxtorian Falls. Skills necklace (Fishing Guild [1]), Games necklace (Barbarian Outpost [2]) (2)\",\"Teleport near to Elven Forest. Iorwerth camp teleport, Charter Ship to Port Tyras (3)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Moss Guardian (level 84) without runes, weapons, or armour\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"10,000 Strength XP\",\"A used Crystal Shield\",\"or Crystal Bow\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Islwyn in Isafdar. He and Eluned are either north-east of the Tyras Camp or west of Lletya. If he's at neither place, hop worlds until he appears.\",\"s\":[\"Tell the truth?\",\"Maybe I could help.\",\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Antipoison potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Eluned.\"}],\"i\":[\"Antipoison potion\",\"Teleport near to Elven Forest. Iorwerth camp teleport, Charter Ship to Port Tyras\",\"Teleport to Baxtorian Falls. Skills necklace (Fishing Guild [1]), Games necklace (Barbarian Outpost [2])\"]},{\"n\":\"Get the seed\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"If you don't have Glarial's pebble, get another from Golrie in the Tree Gnome Village Dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"Bank everything besides the pebble, some potions, and some food. After, go use Glarial's pebble on Glarial's Tombstone east of Baxtorian Falls. Be prepared to fight a level 84 Moss Guardian bare-handed.\",\"i\":[\"Glarial's pebble\",\"Food\",\"A few prayer potions\",\"Super combat potion\",\"Teleport near to Elven Forest. Iorwerth camp teleport, Charter Ship to Port Tyras\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Moss Guardian for a Consecration seed.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the consecration seed.\",\"i\":[\"Consecration seed\"]},{\"t\":\"Return the seed to Eluned.\",\"i\":[\"Consecration seed\",\"Antipoison potion\"]}],\"i\":[\"Glarial's pebble\"],\"tr\":[\"Teleport to Baxtorian Falls. Skills necklace (Fishing Guild [1]), Games necklace (Barbarian Outpost [2])\",\"Teleport near to Elven Forest. Iorwerth camp teleport, Charter Ship to Port Tyras\"],\"r\":[\"Food\",\"A few prayer potions\",\"Antipoison potion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Moss Guardian (level 84) without runes, weapons, or armour\"]},{\"n\":\"Plant the seed\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Board the log raft on the top of Baxtorian Falls.\",\"i\":[\"Consecration seed\",\"Rope\",\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the rock to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the dead tree.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the falls.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the northernmost crates in the east room for a key. Skip this if you already have the key.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the doors from the west room.\",\"i\":[\"Key\"]},{\"t\":\"Plant the consecrated seed anywhere in the room.\",\"i\":[\"Consecration seed\",\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Islwyn in Isafdar to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Spade\",\"Rope\",\"Consecration seed\"],\"tr\":[\"Teleport to Baxtorian Falls. Skills necklace (Fishing Guild [1]), Games necklace (Barbarian Outpost [2])\",\"Teleport near to Elven Forest. Iorwerth camp teleport, Charter Ship to Port Tyras\"],\"r\":[\"Antipoison potion\"]}]}"
        "Royal Trouble" -> "{\"n\":\"Royal Trouble\",\"items\":[\"Either 5 coal or a pickaxe\",\"Combat gear\"],\"rec\":[\"Any antipoison\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Potions/Items to restore run energy\"],\"enemies\":[\"Giant Sea Snake (level 149)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"5,000 Agility XP\",\"5,000 Slayer XP\",\"5,000 Hitpoints XP\",\"20000 x Coins\",\"Increased rewards from Managing Miscellania\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Travel to Miscellania. You can take a boat from Rellekka. You can also use Fairy Rings to teleport there with the code CIP If you've unlocked them.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in Miscellania castle and talk to Advisor Ghrim.\",\"s\":[\"Has anything been happening in the kingdom recently?\",\"Very well, I'll sort it out.\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Investigating\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the royal you chose in Throne of Miscellania, in Miscellania castle: Princess Astrid or Prince Brand.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Vargas.\",\"s\":[\"Right away, your Majesty.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Gardener Gunnhild outside the castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to King Vargas in Miscellania castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Queen Sigrid in Etceteria Castle.\",\"s\":[\"Of course, it's my duty.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Matilda in the south of Etceteria Castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Queen Sigrid in Etceteria Castle.\",\"s\":[\"I suppose so...\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Digging deeper\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the bank in the north of Etceteria and get your combat gear and antipoisons out. Keep about 10 inventory spaces free. Also bring 5 coal. With 30 Mining you can bring a pickaxe instead and mine the coal in the dungeon.\",\"i\":[\"Either 5 coal or a pickaxe\",\"Combat gear\",\"Any antipoison\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to King Vargas in Miscellania castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Advisor Ghrim in Miscellania castle.\",\"s\":[\"King Vargas asked me to talk to you.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Sailor on the Miscellania docks.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for a sailor...\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to King Vargas in Miscellania castle to get a scroll.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down the ladder south of Miscellania castle.\",\"i\":[\"Scroll\"]}],\"i\":[\"Either 5 coal or a pickaxe\",\"Combat gear\",\"Any antipoison\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Repair the lift\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Donal in the pub in the dungeon.\",\"s\":[\"Of course. Dealing with monsters is what I do best!\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the mining prop on the crevice in the north west corner of the dungeon.\",\"i\":[\"Mining prop\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the crevice in the north west corner of the dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"Take a Pulley Beam.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the Pulley Beam on the Broken Scaffold\",\"i\":[\"Pulley beam\"]},{\"t\":\"Take a Pulley Beam.\"},{\"t\":\"Take a Beam.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a beam on a pulley beam.\",\"i\":[\"Beam\",\"Pulley beam\"]},{\"t\":\"Take another Beam.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a beam on the long pulley beam.\",\"i\":[\"Beam\",\"Long pulley beam\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the Longer pulley beam on the Scaffold\",\"i\":[\"Longer pulley beam\"]},{\"t\":\"Take a Pulley Beam.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the pulley beam on the Scaffold\",\"i\":[\"Pulley beam\"]},{\"t\":\"Take a rope from the crate.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the rope on the broken scaffold\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Take another Beam.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a beam on the platform.\",\"i\":[\"Beam\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up an Engine\",\"i\":[\"Engine\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the Engine on the engine platform\",\"i\":[\"Engine\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the nearby lift manual, then put 5 coal into the engine. If you brought a pickaxe instead of coal, mine 5 coal from the rocks in this room first.\",\"i\":[\"Coal (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Take a rope from the crate in the lift room.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Investigate the caves\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Take the lift up.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the plank.\",\"i\":[\"Plank\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the tunnel.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the rock over the water blocking the path.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Swing over the water on the ropeswing.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the fire remains.\"},{\"t\":\"Use your plank on each of the 4 rocks in turn to cross them. You keep the plank.\",\"i\":[\"Plank\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the 2nd fire remains further along the path.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the 3rd fire remains further along the path.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the 4th fire remains further along the path.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the 5th fire remains further along the path.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the Diary\",\"i\":[\"Burnt diary\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the crevice at the end of the path.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Defeat the Giant Sea Snake\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Armod.\"},{\"t\":\"Prepare to fight the Giant Sea Snake, then follow the passage and enter the crevice at the end of it. It will only use ranged attacks if you stand at a distance. It can poison you.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the Giant Sea Snake.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the heavy box\",\"i\":[\"Heavy box\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the rope that's appeared.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Queen Sigrid in Etceteria Castle.\",\"i\":[\"Heavy box\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to King Vargas to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Letter\"]}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Giant Sea Snake (level 149)\"]}]}"
        "Rum Deal" -> "{\"n\":\"Rum Deal\",\"items\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Seed dibber\",\"Rake\",\"Slayer gloves\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Evil spirit (level 150)\",\"Fever spider (level 49)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"7,000 Fishing XP\",\"7,000 Prayer XP\",\"7,000 Farming XP\",\"A Holy Wrench\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Pirate Pete north east of the Ectofuntus.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"Yes!\",\"Of course, I fear no demon!\",\"Nonsense! Keep the money!\",\"I've decided to help you for free.\",\"Okay!\"]},{\"t\":\"Finish talking to Captain Braindeath after the cutscene, with 1 free inventory space for the blindweed seed he gives you.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rake\",\"Seed dibber\",\"Slayer gloves\",\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Get blindweed\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave the brewery by the south stairs and go south past the zombie swabs to the south-eastern farming patch, the only one you can use. If a swab attacks, long-press it and choose Intimidate.\",\"i\":[\"Blindweed seed\",\"Rake\",\"Seed dibber\"]},{\"t\":\"Rake the blindweed patch.\",\"i\":[\"Rake\"]},{\"t\":\"Plant the seed in the blindweed patch.\",\"i\":[\"Blindweed seed\",\"Seed dibber\"]},{\"t\":\"Wait 5 minutes for the blindweed to grow.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick the blindweed on Braindeath Island.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the blindweed back to Captain Braindeath.\",\"i\":[\"Blindweed\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the ladder in the south-east corner of the big room to the top floor, then put the blindweed into the hopper in the north-west corner.\",\"i\":[\"Blindweed\"]}],\"i\":[\"Rake\",\"Seed dibber\"]},{\"n\":\"Get stagnant water\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Braindeath.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the brewery by the south stairs and go out through the fence. Head north-west to 50% Luke, go through the small gate behind him, and go up the volcano to the north. Fill your bucket with the stagnant water there.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the water back to the hopper on the top floor.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Get sluglings\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Braindeath.\"},{\"t\":\"Fish 5 sluglings or karamthulu from around the coast of the island.\",\"i\":[\"Fishbowl and net\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the sea creatures to the pressure barrel on the top floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the pressure lever.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Kill evil spirit\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Braindeath.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Davey in the room with the bunk beds, south-west of Captain Braindeath. You need at least 47 Prayer points available or he won't bless the wrench. It doesn't use them up.\",\"i\":[\"Wrench\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the holy wrench on the brewing control. Be prepared to fight an evil spirit.\",\"i\":[\"Holy wrench\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Evil Spirit.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Evil spirit (level 150)\"]},{\"n\":\"Get spider carcass\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Braindeath.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the ladder in the north-west corner of the brewery, near Captain Braindeath, and kill a fever spider in the basement. If you're not wearing slayer gloves they'll afflict you with disease.\",\"i\":[\"Slayer gloves\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the fever spider body.\",\"i\":[\"Fever spider body\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the spider body to the hopper on the top floor.\",\"i\":[\"Fever spider body\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Slayer gloves\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Fever spider (level 49)\"]},{\"n\":\"Giving swill to Donnie\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Braindeath.\"},{\"t\":\"Fill a bucket from the output tap in the south west of the brewery.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the unsanitary swill to Captain Donnie south of the Brewery.\",\"i\":[\"Unsanitary swill\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Braindeath to finish.\"}]}]}"
        "Rune Mysteries" -> "{\"n\":\"Rune Mysteries\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[\"Varrock teleport\",\"A teleport to the Wizard's Tower\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"Air Talisman\",\"Ability to mine Rune and Pure Essence.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Duke Horacio on the first floor of Lumbridge castle.\",\"s\":[\"Have you any quests for me?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the Air Talisman to Sedridor in the Wizard Tower's basement.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for the head wizard.\",\"Okay, here you are.\"],\"i\":[\"Air talisman\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Discovering the lost incantation\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sedridor in the Wizard Tower's basement and accept the Research Package.\",\"s\":[\"Go ahead.\",\"Actually, I'm not interested.\",\"Yes, certainly.\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the Research Package to Aubury in south east Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"I've been sent here with a package for you.\"],\"i\":[\"Research package\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Aubury again in south east Varrock.\"},{\"t\":\"Bring the notes to Sedridor in the Wizard Tower's basement.\",\"i\":[\"Research notes\"]}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Scorpion Catcher" -> "{\"n\":\"Scorpion Catcher\",\"items\":[\"Dusty Key\"],\"rec\":[\"Anti-dragon shield or DFS\",\"Antipoison\",\"Food\",\"Teleport to Falador\",\"Teleport to Camelot\",\"Games Necklace\",\"A charged glory or a combat bracelet\"],\"enemies\":[\"The ability to run past level 172 black demons and level 64 poison spiders\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"6,625 Strength XP\",\"Ability to have Thormac turn a Battlestaff into a Mystic Staff for 40,000 Coins.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Talk to Thormac\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Thormac on the top floor of the Sorcerer's Tower south of Seer's Village.\",\"s\":[\"What do you need assistance with?\",\"So how would I go about catching them then?\",\"Ok, I will do it then\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"The first scorpion\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to a seer in Seer's Village.\",\"s\":[\"I need to locate some scorpions.\",\"Your friend Thormac sent me to speak to you.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to Taverley Dungeon.\",\"i\":[\"Scorpion Cage\",\"Dusty Key\"]},{\"t\":\"If you have 80 Agility, go over the strange floor. If you have 70 Agility, squeeze through the obstacle pipe. Either way, skip to Search the Old wall. With less than 70 Agility you need a dusty key: if you have one, skip to entering the gate.\"},{\"t\":\"Only if you need a dusty key: travel through Taverley Dungeon to the Black Knights' Base. Kill the Jailer in the east side of the base and pick up the jail key. Use it on the south door and talk to Velrak for a dusty key.\",\"s\":[\"So... do you know anywhere good to explore?\",\"Yes please!\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if you are using a dusty key: enter the gate to the deeper Taverley dungeon.\",\"i\":[\"Dusty Key\"]},{\"t\":\"In the poison spider area, search the Old wall directly south of the strange floor (the 80 Agility shortcut) to enter a small room.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the scorpion cage on the scorpion.\",\"i\":[\"Scorpion Cage\"]}],\"i\":[\"Dusty Key\"]},{\"n\":\"The second scorpion\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb the south-east ladder in the Edgeville Monastery to the upper floor. If you're stopped, ask to join the order (you need 31 Prayer). The scorpion is at the top of the ladder or in the bedroom just north of it.\",\"s\":[\"Well can I join your order?\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the scorpion cage on the scorpion.\",\"i\":[\"Scorpion Cage\"]}]},{\"n\":\"The third scorpion\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Barbarian Outpost.\"},{\"t\":\"Go into the fenced area by the Agility course entrance (this needs Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl), then into the building in its north-east corner. The scorpion wanders just inside. Use the scorpion cage on it.\",\"i\":[\"Scorpion Cage\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Finishing up\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Thormac to finish the quest.\"}]}]}"
        "Scrambled!" -> "{\"n\":\"Scrambled!\",\"items\":[\"Hammer, saw, 6 nails, 2 planks (all found during the quest)\",\"An empty bowl (found during the quest)\",\"Combat gear\"],\"rec\":[\"Antifire shield (for the red dragon)\",\"40 Agility (for a shortcut to the dragon cave)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Large chicken (level 16)\",\"Black jaguar (level 88)\",\"Red dragon (level 106, can be safespotted)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"5,000 Construction, Cooking and Smithing XP\",\"Your very own egg\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Humphrey Dumphrey sat on a wall\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Alan in Tal Teok Temple, north of Tal Teklan, to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"Of course!\"]}],\"i\":[\"Nothing\"],\"c\":0,\"tr\":[\"Get to Tal Teok Temple, north of Tal Teklan, e.g. with a quetzal whistle.\"]},{\"n\":\"Wumty Scrumpty had a great fall\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect the egg in front of you.\"},{\"t\":\"Head south into Tal Teklan and talk to King in the pub.\",\"s\":[\"Are you the king?\",\"…fell off a wall!\"]}],\"i\":[\"Nothing\"],\"c\":0,\"tr\":[\"Walk: Tal Teklan is just south of the temple.\"]},{\"n\":\"All the king's horses and all the king's men…\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get an empty bowl from the Tal Teklan pub. You'll need it later.\",\"tip\":\"If it's not there, hop worlds or wait for it to respawn.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Acatzin inside the Tal Teklan pub.\",\"s\":[\"I can talk to the blacksmith.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Blacksmith, west of the Tal Teklan pub.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the hammer from the table in the blacksmith's.\",\"tip\":\"If it's not there, hop worlds or wait for it to respawn.\"},{\"t\":\"Get some nails from the blacksmith's workbench. You'll need them later.\",\"s\":[\"Take the nails.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fix the whetstone.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Blacksmith again to get a damaged axe.\"},{\"t\":\"Repair the axe on the whetstone.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Acatzin's damaged axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Get the saw from the house to the south. You'll need it later.\",\"tip\":\"If it's not there, hop worlds or wait for it to respawn.\"},{\"t\":\"Return the repaired axe to Acatzin in the Tal Teklan pub.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick the damiana bush at the east entrance of Tal Teklan for damiana leaves. You'll need them later.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up two planks beside the lake, a short walk south-west of the damiana bush.\",\"tip\":\"If they're not there, hop worlds or wait for them to respawn.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Kauayotl at the east entrance of Tal Teklan.\",\"s\":[\"I see. Well, maybe I can help out with that?\"],\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"6 nails\",\"2 planks\"]},{\"t\":\"Repair Kauayotl's cart.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"6 nails\",\"2 planks\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Kauayotl again.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Nezketi in the Tal Teklan temple. He gives you an empty cup.\",\"s\":[\"I can get you some tea.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill your empty bowl with water at the water pump near the east entrance of Tal Teklan.\",\"i\":[\"Empty bowl\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the damiana leaves on the bowl of water.\",\"i\":[\"Damiana leaves\",\"Bowl of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the damiana water on the oven in the Tal Teklan General Store, just south of the bank, to boil it.\",\"i\":[\"Damiana water\"]},{\"t\":\"Pour the damiana tea from the bowl into the empty cup.\",\"i\":[\"Damiana tea\",\"Empty cup\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the cup of damiana tea to Nezketi in the Tal Teklan temple.\",\"i\":[\"Cup of damiana tea\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Tal Teok Temple, north of Tal Teklan, and talk to one of King's men.\"}],\"i\":[\"Nothing to bring. You pick up a bowl, hammer, nails, saw and planks along the way\"],\"c\":0,\"tr\":[\"Everything is in and around Tal Teklan, so walk.\"]},{\"n\":\"Couldn't put Bumpty Numpty back together again…\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the Eggs in the chicken coop south of the large temple. A level 16 large chicken appears: kill it, then search the Eggs again for a Large egg.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Cross the log balance towards the dragon cave.\",\"tip\":\"Needs 40 Agility. Without it, walk round to the cave entrance.\",\"o\":1},{\"t\":\"Enter the dragon cave, south-east of the large temple across the river.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Antifire shield (recommended)\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the Eggs in the dragon cave. Kill the red dragon that appears, then search the Eggs again for a Dragon egg.\",\"tip\":\"Safespot: stand just south-east of the Eggs.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the dragon cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the Eggs at the camp east of the dragon cave. Kill the black jaguar that appears, then search the Eggs again for a Jaguar egg.\",\"tip\":\"Safespot: stand just north-east of the camp.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Tal Teok Temple. Give Kauayotl the Dragon egg, Nezketi the Jaguar egg and Acatzin the Large egg.\",\"i\":[\"Large egg\",\"Dragon egg\",\"Jaguar egg\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to one of King's men to judge the replacement eggs.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to one of King's men again to work out how to fix the broken egg.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the broken egg and put it back together.\",\"tip\":\"It's a jigsaw of 26 pieces. Tap a piece to turn it: it only fits once it's the right way up. Then drag it into place. Press and hold the puzzle-piece icon to see the finished egg.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to one of King's men to finish the quest!\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear and food\",\"Antifire shield (recommended, for the red dragon)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Large chicken (level 16)\",\"Red dragon (level 106, can be safespotted)\",\"Black jaguar (level 88, can be safespotted)\"],\"tr\":[\"Walk: the chicken coop is just south of Tal Teok Temple, the dragon cave is to the east, and the jaguar camp is further east of the dragon cave.\"]}]}"
        "Sea Slug" -> "{\"n\":\"Sea Slug\",\"items\":[\"Swamp paste\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"7,175 Fishing XP\",\"Oyster pearls\",\"Access to the Fishing Platform\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Caroline just north of Witchaven, east of East Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"I suppose so, how do I get there?\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Swamp paste\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Investigation\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Holgart nearby and give him some swamp paste.\",\"i\":[\"Swamp paste\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel with Holgart to the fishing platform.\",\"s\":[\"Will you take me there?\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the ladder in the north east corner of the platform.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Kennith from inside the cabin on the west side of the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back down the ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Travel with Holgart to a nearby island.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Talking with Kent\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Kent on the island.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the platform with Holgart.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Saving Kennith\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Bailey in the small room in the south-west corner of the fishing platform for an unlit torch.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the broken glass in the room.\",\"i\":[\"Broken glass\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the damp sticks in the north east corner of the platform.\",\"i\":[\"Damp sticks\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the broken glass on damp sticks to dry them.\",\"i\":[\"Broken glass\",\"Damp sticks\"]},{\"t\":\"Rub the dry sticks to light the unlit torch.\",\"i\":[\"Dry sticks\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the ladder in the north east corner of the platform.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Kennith to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Go outside Kennith's cabin and kick in the badly repaired wall on the east side of his room.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Kennith again.\"},{\"t\":\"Rotate the crane east of Kennith's cabin.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back down the ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Travel with Holgart back to the mainland.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Caroline to complete the quest.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Secrets of the North" -> "{\"n\":\"Secrets of the North\",\"items\":[\"Coins (100)\",\"Lockpick\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Combat Gear\",\"Food\"],\"rec\":[\"Antipoisons\",\"Any Ardougne Cloak\",\"Icy Basalt\"],\"enemies\":[\"Evelot (level 148)\",\"Assassin (level 262)\",\"Strange Creature (level 368)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"60,000 Agility XP\",\"50,000 Thieving XP\",\"40,000 Hunter XP\",\"Ability to mine ancient essence crystals in the Ghorrock Dungeon\",\"Access to a new boss, the Phantom Muspah\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting Off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the guard outside of the Carnillean Mansion in East Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the stairs in Carnillean Mansion and talk to the guard there.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect Ceril Carnillean's body.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the broken Window on the East side of the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Knock-at the wall on the North side of the room.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the Ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the chest.\"},{\"t\":\"Descend the ladder and talk to the guard about what you've found. Tell him all three things, then say that is everything.\",\"s\":[\"The window was broken from the outside.\",\"Ceril was stabbed from behind.\",\"A hidden room above us was broken into.\",\"I think that's everything.\",\"I think I've gone over everything.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Hunting Down Evelot\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb down the staircase.\"},{\"t\":\"Head to the Fight Arena Bar and talk to the Khazard Barman.\",\"s\":[\"Do you know anyone called Evelot?\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (100)\",\"Combat Gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the barrels outside the Fight Arena Bar entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the boulder to the north.\",\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Continue north and inspect the bush there.\",\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the stump to the east.\",\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the boulder to the south east.\",\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the bush to the east.\",\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Approach Evelot to the east to start the fight. Protect from melee and reactivate prayer after she special attacks.\",\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Evelot again after the fight.\"}],\"i\":[\"Coins (100)\",\"Combat Gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Evelot (level 148)\"]},{\"n\":\"The Mysterious Benefactor\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the cave that leads to the Ardougne sewers, near the Clock Tower.\",\"i\":[\"Lockpick\"]},{\"t\":\"Board the raft. If it takes you across, skip the valve steps below. If it doesn't move, go back up out of the cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Only if the raft didn't move: turn the valve just north of the cave to the left.\",\"s\":[\"Turn it to the left.\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if the raft didn't move: go west to the south end of the bridge by the Carnilleans' house and turn the valve there to the right.\",\"s\":[\"Turn it to the right.\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if the raft didn't move: cross the bridge, go north-east and turn the next valve to the right.\",\"s\":[\"Turn it to the right.\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if the raft didn't move: cross back over the river, head east towards the zoo's penguin cage and turn the valve there to the right.\",\"s\":[\"Turn it to the right.\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if the raft didn't move: go south-east past the monk and turn the last valve to the right.\",\"s\":[\"Turn it to the right.\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if the raft didn't move: go back into the cave and board the raft.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Alomone or Clivet inside the cult area.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Hazeel.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the Carnillean Mansion and speak to the Guard.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the ladder into the basement of the mansion.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Claus the Chef.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the cooking shelves for a button.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the wall next to the noticeboard.\",\"s\":[\"Enter the passage.\"]},{\"t\":\"Picklock the chest. The answer stays the same between attempts, and several pins can share a number. Green means a pin is right.\",\"i\":[\"Lockpick\"]},{\"t\":\"Set every pin to 1 and confirm. Leave the green pins as they are, change all the others to 2 and confirm again. Carry on with 3, 4 and so on until every pin is green. It takes 6 tries at most.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the dusty scroll.\",\"i\":[\"Dusty Scroll\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Hazeel and tell him about the scroll.\",\"i\":[\"Dusty Scroll\"]}],\"i\":[\"Lockpick\"]},{\"n\":\"In The North\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Big Fish at the north entrance to Weiss.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Snowflake.\",\"s\":[\"Have you seen anything odd around here recently?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Big Fish (Hazeel) at the north entrance to Weiss again.\",\"s\":[\"Why would the killer come here?\",\"What is this ritual you keep talking about?\",\"Okay, I'm done asking questions. What now?\",\"I'm done asking questions. What now?\"]},{\"t\":\"Prepare for a fight and climb down the stairs in the middle of Weiss.\",\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\",\"Antipoisons\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave to the south.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\",\"Antipoisons\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the assassin. Put the Assassin in the smoke bombs so you can hit him and dodge the poison vials he throws out.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to General Khazard.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Hazeel to the west and tell him about what happened.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the barrel south of the centre room. The centre room is the gated room south of where you fought the assassin.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the centre room. Use the code \\\"BLOOD\\\" to unlock the gate.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the north chest using the code \\\"7402\\\".\"},{\"t\":\"Get a tinderbox from the crate in the west of the central room.\"},{\"t\":\"Light the North West Brazier.\"},{\"t\":\"Light the South East Brazier.\"},{\"t\":\"Light the North East Brazier.\"},{\"t\":\"Light the South West Brazier.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the western chest.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the north gate using the code LEFT - UP - LEFT - DOWN.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the handle on the lever mechanism\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Lever Handle\"]},{\"t\":\"Pull the lever.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the south west pillar in the room where you fought the assassin.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the jewel shards on one another.\",\"i\":[\"Jewel shard\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the ancient jewel on the icy chest.\",\"i\":[\"Ancient jewel\",\"Icy chest\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the gate near the barrel you found the lever handle in.\",\"i\":[\"Icy key\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\"],\"r\":[\"Antipoisons\",\"Icy Basalt\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Assassin (level 262)\"]},{\"n\":\"Secrets of the Dungeon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Resupply if you haven't already. Bring Ranged and Magic gear, stamina potions and prayer potions for a challenging fight, then enter the crevice.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat the Strange Creature.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Jhallan in the Muspah room.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Hazeel inside the ruins for a teleport to Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the guard outside of the Carnillean Mansion in East Ardougne to finish the quest. Talk to Hazeel for a teleport to Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat Gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Strange Creature (level 368)\"]}]}"
        "Shades of Mort'ton" -> "{\"n\":\"Shades of Mort'ton\",\"items\":[\"Tarromin potion (unf) (2)\",\"Tinderbox\",\"A log whose pyre version you can burn\",\"Ashes (2)\",\"Coins for building materials, or 18000 if you want to buy a Flamtaer hammer (5000)\",\"Hammer or Flamtaer Hammer\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"A Mort'ton teleport or Barrows teleport tablet\",\"Food\",\"Flamtaer hammer\",\"Flamtaer bracelet\"],\"enemies\":[\"5 Loar Shades (level 40)\"],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"2,000 Crafting XP\",\"2,000 Herblore XP\",\"Ability to play the Shades of Mort'ton Minigame\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Investigating the town\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the shelf in the south building of Mort'ton.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the diary.\",\"i\":[\"Diary\"]},{\"t\":\"Add ashes to both tarromin potions (unf) to make 2 serum 207. You'll need the second one later.\",\"i\":[\"Tarromin potion (unf) (2)\",\"Ashes (2)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Tarromin potion (unf) (2)\",\"Ashes (2)\",\"Tinderbox\",\"A log whose pyre version you can burn\",\"Coins for building materials, or 18000 if you want to buy a Flamtaer hammer (5000)\",\"Hammer or Flamtaer Hammer\"]},{\"n\":\"Helping Razmire\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use the serum 207 on Razmire in the north of Mort'ton.\",\"i\":[\"Serum 207\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Razmire in the north of Mort'ton.\",\"s\":[\"What are all these shadowy creatures?\",\"Yes, I'll dispatch those dark and evil creatures.\"],\"i\":[\"Serum 207\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill 5 Loar Shades and pick up their remains.\",\"i\":[\"Loar remains (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the serum 207 on Razmire in the north of Mort'ton.\",\"i\":[\"Serum 207\",\"Loar remains (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Razmire in the north of Mort'ton.\",\"i\":[\"Serum 207\",\"Loar remains (5)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Serum 207\",\"Tinderbox\",\"A log whose pyre version you can burn\",\"Coins for building materials, or 18000 if you want to buy a Flamtaer hammer (5000)\",\"Hammer or Flamtaer Hammer\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"5 Loar Shades (level 40)\"]},{\"n\":\"Helping Ulsquire\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Razmire in the north of Mort'ton and buy some olive oil from his general store.\",\"s\":[\"Can you open a store for me?\",\"Can I see the general store please?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Razmire again and buy 5 timber beams, 5 limestone bricks and 25 swamp paste from his builders' store.\",\"s\":[\"Can you open a store for me?\",\"Can I see the building store please?\"]},{\"t\":\"Use some serum 207 on Ulsquire, in the house just south-east of Razmire's store in the east of Mort'ton.\",\"i\":[\"Serum 207\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ulsquire in the east of Mort'ton.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ulsquire again.\",\"s\":[\"What can you tell me about that temple?\"]},{\"t\":\"Repair the walls of the temple north east of Mort'ton with your hammer and materials until it's 100% repaired. Do this on World 377 to make it faster and easier.\",\"i\":[\"Olive oil\",\"Serum 207\",\"Hammer or Flamtaer Hammer\",\"Limestone brick (5)\",\"Timber beam (5)\",\"Swamp paste (25)\"]},{\"t\":\"Light the fire altar\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Keep repairing the temple until 20 sanctity.\",\"i\":[\"Olive oil\",\"Serum 207\",\"Hammer or Flamtaer Hammer\",\"Limestone brick (5)\",\"Timber beam (5)\",\"Swamp paste (25)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the olive oil on the temple's fire.\",\"i\":[\"Olive oil\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a serum 207 (with 2 or more doses) on the temple's fire.\",\"i\":[\"Serum 207\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the sacred oil on a log.\",\"i\":[\"A log whose pyre version you can burn\",\"Sacred oil\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to a group of 4 stone funeral pyres, shown as brown patches on the map, for example west of the general store. Use the pyre log on a funeral pyre, then a loar remain, and light it. Collect your reward from the stone pillar next to the pyre.\",\"i\":[\"A pyre log you can burn\",\"Loar remains\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the serum 208 on Razmire in the north of Mort'ton.\",\"i\":[\"Serum 208\"]},{\"t\":\"Use some serum 208 on Ulsquire in the east of Mort'ton.\",\"i\":[\"Serum 208\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ulsquire to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Serum 207\",\"Tinderbox\",\"A log whose pyre version you can burn\",\"Coins for building materials, or 18000 if you want to buy a Flamtaer hammer (5000)\",\"Hammer or Flamtaer Hammer\"]}]}"
        "Shadow of the Storm" -> "{\"n\":\"Shadow of the Storm\",\"items\":[\"Silverlight\",\"pieces of black clothing (3)\",\"Silver bar\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear + potions\",\"Coins or more for carpet rides (400)\",\"Al Kharid Teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"Agrith-Naar (level 100)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"10,000 Experience Lamp (Any combat skill except Prayer)\",\"Darklight\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Father Reen outside Al Kharid bank.\",\"s\":[\"That's me!\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Infiltrate the cult\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the Ruins of Uzer: take the magic carpet south of Al Kharid and choose Uzer, or use fairy ring DLQ and go north-east. Talk to Father Badden near the ruin entrance.\",\"s\":[\"Uzer\",\"Reen sent me.\",\"So what do you want me to do?\",\"How can I do that?\"],\"i\":[\"Silverlight\",\"pieces of black clothing (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up some black mushrooms beside the staircase into the ruins.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the black mushrooms on Silverlight.\",\"i\":[\"Silverlight\",\"Black mushroom\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Uzer ruins.\",\"i\":[\"Silverlight (dyed)\",\"pieces of black clothing (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the strange implement in the north west corner of the ruin.\",\"i\":[\"Strange implement\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Evil Dave with the dyed Silverlight and 3 dark clothing items equipped.\",\"s\":[\"I want to join your group.\",\"I'm evil!\"],\"i\":[\"Silverlight (dyed)\",\"pieces of black clothing (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the portal next to Evil Dave, if he hasn't taken you through already. Talk to Denath next to the throne.\",\"s\":[\"What do I have to do?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Jennifer.\",\"s\":[\"Do you have the demonic sigil mould?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Matthew.\",\"s\":[\"Do you know what happened to Josef?\"]}],\"i\":[\"Silverlight\",\"pieces of black clothing (3)\"]},{\"n\":\"Uncovering the truth\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Travel to any furnace with the sigil mould and silver bar and smelt a sigil.\",\"i\":[\"Silver bar\",\"Demonic sigil mould\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Golem in Uzer.\",\"s\":[\"Uzer\",\"Did you see anything happen last night?\"],\"i\":[\"Silverlight (dyed)\",\"Demonic sigil\",\"Combat gear + potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the kilns in Uzer until you find a book. There are four kilns; the last two are on the east side of the ruin and by the magic carpet.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the book.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic tome\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the book to Matthew in the Demon Throne Room. Afterwards Denath should start the ritual. If he doesn't, leave and re-enter the throne room and talk to Matthew again.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic tome\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the ritual circle in the throne room and stand in the empty gap in the ring of cultists, next to Denath.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic sigil\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the demonic sigil and say the incantation in the order Denath told you, which is the reverse of the order in the Demonic tome. Write it down, as you need it again later. If you forgot it, talk to Denath and choose 'I forgot the incantation.' If nothing happens, unequip Silverlight.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic sigil\"],\"s\":[\"I forgot the incantation.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Silver bar\",\"Silverlight (dyed)\",\"Combat gear + potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Defeating Agrith-Naar\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pick up the demonic sigil from the circle.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic sigil\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the throne room.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the demonic sigil Tanya dropped.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic sigil\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Evil Dave.\",\"s\":[\"You've got to get back to the throne room!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Father Badden in Uzer.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic sigil (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Father Reen in Uzer.\",\"s\":[\"Oh, don't be so simple-minded!\"],\"i\":[\"Demonic sigil (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Golem in Uzer. He will refuse to help.\",\"s\":[\"I could just reprogram you again.\"],\"i\":[\"Strange implement\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the strange implement on the Golem in Uzer.\",\"i\":[\"Strange implement\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Golem again.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic sigil (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Matthew in the throne room.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Silverlight (dyed)\",\"Demonic sigil\",\"Combat gear + potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Stand in the empty gap in the ritual circle again. This time it's two squares east and one square north of where you stood for the first ritual.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic sigil\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the demonic sigil and say the incantation backwards from last time, which is the order written in the Demonic tome.\",\"i\":[\"Demonic sigil\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Agrith-Naar. You can hurt him with any weapon, BUT YOU MUST DEAL THE FINAL BLOW WITH SILVERLIGHT.\",\"i\":[\"Silverlight (dyed)\",\"Combat gear + potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Unequip Darklight to complete the quest!\"}],\"i\":[\"Silverlight (dyed)\",\"Combat gear + potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Agrith-Naar (level 100)\"]}]}"
        "Shadows of Custodia" -> "{\"n\":\"Shadows of Custodia\",\"items\":[\"Fishing rod\",\"Maple logs (4)\",\"Hammer\",\"Willow longbow (4)\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport to Auburnvale (Fairy ring AIS)\",\"Combat gear\",\"Energy/Stamina potions\"],\"enemies\":[\"3 Strange creatures (level 93)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"10,000 Slayer XP\",\"4,000 Hunter XP\",\"3,000 Fishing XP\",\"3,000 Construction XP\",\"Access to the Custodia Pass Slayer Dungeon\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Read the noticeboard in the Auburnvale bar to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Marcus in the Auburnvale bar about the missing people.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Bartender in the Auburnvale bar.\",\"s\":[\"About the missing people...\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ictus, north of the Auburnvale Quetzal.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Shopkeep in the Auburnvale General store.\",\"s\":[\"About the missing people...\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Aemilia and Francis, north of the Auburnvale General store, about their missing sons.\"}],\"tr\":[\"Teleport to Auburnvale (Fairy ring AIS)\"]},{\"n\":\"Hunting the trail\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect the wall outside Aemilia and Francis' house.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the puddle outside Aemilia and Francis' house.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the puddle trail and inspect the plank in the river, west of Auburnvale.\",\"i\":[\"Fishing rod\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Aemilia and Francis' house, north of the Auburnvale General store, and talk to them about the cloth you found.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the trail west of the city, then through the mountains, and enter the cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Injured boy inside the cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Aemilia and Francis's house, north of the Auburnvale General store, and tell them you found their missing boys.\"}],\"i\":[\"Fishing rod\"]},{\"n\":\"Inform the authorities\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Reinforce the wall outside Aemilia and Francis' house.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Maple logs (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Ariadna, south-west of the Auburnvale General store, and inform her about the missing people.\",\"i\":[\"Willow longbow (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Etz, upstairs of Aemilia and Francis' house, about what he remembers.\"}],\"i\":[\"Maple logs (4)\",\"Hammer\",\"Willow longbow (4)\"]},{\"n\":\"Save Antos\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Follow the trail west of the city, then through the mountains, and enter the cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Run east in the cave to a small side chamber and talk to Antos, ready to fight three Strange creatures. Protect from Melee avoids most damage. Kill all three, then talk to Antos again if he doesn't speak to you first.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Ariadna in Auburnvale to finish the quest!\"}],\"r\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"3 Strange creatures (level 93)\"]}]}"
        "Sheep Herder" -> "{\"n\":\"Sheep Herder\",\"items\":[\"Coins (100)\"],\"rec\":[\"Energy restoring items\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"4 Quest points\",\"3100 x Coins\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting out\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Councillor Halgrive outside the East Ardougne church.\",\"s\":[\"What's wrong?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Doctor Orbon in the East Ardougne Church.\",\"s\":[\"Okay, I'll take it.\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (100)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins (100)\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Killing sheep\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Wear the plague jacket and trousers and go to the fenced enclosure north-west of East Ardougne's north bank. Go in by the gate on its west side.\",\"i\":[\"Plague jacket\",\"Plague trousers\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the nearby cattleprod.\",\"i\":[\"Cattle prod\"]},{\"t\":\"Wield the cattleprod and leave by the west gate.\",\"i\":[\"Cattle prod\",\"Plague jacket\",\"Plague trousers\"]},{\"t\":\"Find the blue sheep north-west of the enclosure. Keep tapping a sheep to prod it: it moves the way you're facing, and wanders back if you wait too long.\",\"i\":[\"Cattle prod\",\"Plague jacket\",\"Plague trousers\"]},{\"t\":\"Drive it to the west gate. It goes in by itself; if it stops just outside, prod it once more.\",\"i\":[\"Cattle prod\",\"Plague jacket\",\"Plague trousers\"]},{\"t\":\"Prod one of the yellow sheep north of the enclosure to the enclosure gate.\",\"i\":[\"Cattle prod\",\"Plague jacket\",\"Plague trousers\"]},{\"t\":\"Prod one of the green sheep east of the enclosure to the enclosure gate.\",\"i\":[\"Cattle prod\",\"Plague jacket\",\"Plague trousers\"]},{\"t\":\"Prod one of the red sheep south east of the enclosure to the enclosure gate.\",\"i\":[\"Cattle prod\",\"Plague jacket\",\"Plague trousers\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the sheep feed on each of the four sheep in the enclosure until they are all dead.\",\"i\":[\"Sheep feed\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the bones.\",\"i\":[\"Sheep bones 1\",\"Sheep bones 2\",\"Sheep bones 3\",\"Sheep bones 4\"]},{\"t\":\"Use all four sets of bones on the incinerator in the enclosure.\",\"i\":[\"Sheep bones 1\",\"Sheep bones 2\",\"Sheep bones 3\",\"Sheep bones 4\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Councillor Halgrive.\"}],\"i\":[\"Plague jacket\",\"Plague trousers\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Sheep Shearer" -> "{\"n\":\"Sheep Shearer\",\"items\":[\"Balls of wool (20)\",\"Shears\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"150 Crafting XP\",\"60 x Coins\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Bring Fred Some Wool\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Fred the Farmer north of Lumbridge to start the quest. Bring 20 balls of wool to autocomplete the quest.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for a quest.\",\"Yes, okay. I can do that.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"If Fred didn't give you shears, pick up the pair in his house.\",\"i\":[\"Shears\"]},{\"t\":\"Shear sheep in the nearby field.\",\"i\":[\"Shears\",\"Wool (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the staircase in the Lumbridge Castle to spin the wool in your inventory into balls of wool.\",\"i\":[\"Wool (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Spin your wool into balls.\",\"i\":[\"Wool (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the staircase.\",\"s\":[\"Climb down the stairs.\"],\"i\":[\"Balls of wool (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring Fred the Farmer north of Lumbridge your balls of wool (UNNOTED) to progress the quest. If you only have some of the balls needed, you can still deposit them with him.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about shearing these sheep!\"],\"i\":[\"Balls of wool (20)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Balls of wool (20)\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Shield of Arrav" -> "{\"n\":\"Shield of Arrav\",\"items\":[\"Coins (20)\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Jonny the beard (level 2)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"600 x Coins\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Phoenix Gang: Locating the Phoenix Gang\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Phoenix Gang route: follow the Phoenix Gang sections. For the Black Arm Gang, skip to Black Arm Gang: Start quest. Your partner must join the other gang, and you can't change gang once accepted. Talk to Reldo in the Varrock Castle library.\",\"s\":[\"I'm in search of a quest.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the bookcase with a blue and white book on its top shelf, on the east side of the short bookcases in the middle of the room, for a book, then read it.\",\"i\":[\"Book\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Reldo again.\",\"s\":[\"Okay, I've read that book about the Shield of Arrav.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baraek in the Varrock Square.\",\"s\":[\"Can you tell me where I can find the Phoenix Gang?\",\"Okay. Have 20 gold coins.\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the ladder into the Phoenix Gang's base in south-east Varrock, a short walk south-west of Aubury's rune shop.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Straven.\",\"s\":[\"I know who you are!\",\"I'd like to offer you my services.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Phoenix Gang: Joining the gang\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go back up to the surface.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Jonny the Beard in the Blue Moon Inn in Varrock.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the Intel Report.\",\"i\":[\"Intel report\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the Phoenix Gang's base.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Straven again.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Jonny the beard (level 2)\"]},{\"n\":\"Phoenix Gang: Returning the shield\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the Phoenix base for half of the Shield of Arrav.\"},{\"t\":\"Trade your weapon store key to your partner. If you can't trade, use the key on them to drop it at their feet. AFTERWARDS, talk to Curator Haig in the Varrock Museum.\",\"i\":[\"Broken shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Trade one of your certificate halves for the other half with another player. If you cannot trade, use the certificate on them to drop it at their feet. They can do the same for you.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the two certificate halves together to create the certificate.\",\"i\":[\"Half certificate\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Roald in Varrock Castle to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Certificate\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Black Arm Gang: Start quest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Black Arm Gang route: follow the Black Arm Gang sections, not the Phoenix Gang ones. Your partner must join the other gang, and you can't change gang once accepted. Talk to Reldo in the Varrock Castle library. If you already did this and the next two steps in the Phoenix Gang section, skip to Charlie the Tramp.\",\"s\":[\"I'm in search of a quest.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the bookcase with a blue and white book on its top shelf, on the east side of the short bookcases in the middle of the room, for a book, then read it.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Reldo again.\",\"s\":[\"Okay, I've read that book about the Shield of Arrav.\"]},{\"t\":\"To start the quest as the Black Arm Gang, talk to Charlie the Tramp in south Varrock to start.\",\"s\":[\"Is there anything down this alleyway?\",\"I'm looking for the Black Arm Gang.\",\"Do you think they would let me join?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Katrine down the alley to the west.\",\"s\":[\"I've heard you're the Black Arm Gang.\",\"I'd rather not reveal my sources.\",\"I want to become a member of your gang.\",\"Well, you can give me a try can't you?\",\"Ok, no problem.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Black Arm Gang: Get the phoenix crossbows\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get the weapon storeroom key from another player. If you cannot trade, have them use the key on you to drop it at your feet.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the weapon store key to the Phoenix Weapon Storeroom, a short walk south of Aubury's rune shop in south-east Varrock, and go up the ladder inside.\",\"i\":[\"Weapon store key\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Weaponsmaster, or have someone else kill him.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up TWO phoenix crossbows\",\"i\":[\"Phoenix crossbow (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Katrine with the crossbows.\",\"i\":[\"Phoenix crossbow (2)\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Black Arm Gang: Return the shield\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in the Black Arm Gang base.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the cupboard for half of the Shield of Arrav.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Curator Haig in the Varrock Museum.\",\"i\":[\"Broken shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Trade one of your certificate halves for the other half with another player. If you cannot trade, use the certificate on them to drop it at their feet. They can do the same for you.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the two certificate halves together to create the certificate.\",\"i\":[\"Half certificate\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Roald in Varrock Castle to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Certificate\"]}]}]}"
        "Shilo Village" -> "{\"n\":\"Shilo Village\",\"items\":[\"Spade\",\"Lit torch or candle\",\"Rope\",\"Bronze wire\",\"Chisel\",\"Bones (3)\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Antipoisons\",\"Prayer potions\",\"A quick teleport for escaping\",\"Papyrus\",\"Charcoal\",\"Crumble undead spell for final boss\"],\"enemies\":[\"Nazastarool 3 times (levels 68, 91, 93) (safespottable)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"3,875 Crafting XP\",\"Access to Shilo Village\",\"Ability to mine gem rocks in Shilo Village\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Exploring\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Mosol Rei east of Shilo Village in south Karamja to receive a wampum belt.\",\"s\":[\"Why do I need to run?\",\"Rashiliyia? Who is she?\",\"What can we do?\",\"I'll go to see the Shaman.\",\"Yes, I'm sure and I'll take the Wampum belt to Trufitus.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the wampum belt on Trufitus, in the north-easternmost house of Tai Bwo Wannai.\",\"s\":[\"Mosol Rei said something about a legend?\",\"Do you know anything more about the temple?\",\"Tell me more.\",\"I am going to search for Ah Za Rhoon!\",\"Yes, I will seriously look for Ah Za Rhoon and I'd appreciate your help.\",\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Wampum belt\"]},{\"t\":\"From Tai Bwo Wannai, cross the wooden log to the east and head south to the mound of earth surrounded by rocks, south-west of the Shipyard. Use a spade on the mound.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"If you only see a mound of earth, look at it first to find the fissure. Then use a lit torch or candle on the fissure. You won't get the light back.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Lit torch or candle\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the fissure.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the fissure and choose Search.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'll give it a go!\"]},{\"t\":\"Head south from where you landed until you see the water, then go west past the column and search the cave-in to go deeper into the caverns.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'll wriggle through.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the loose rocks to the north for a tattered scroll.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'll carefully move the rocks to see what's behind them.\"]},{\"t\":\"Head south-east to a small dead-end branch and search the old sacks next to the smashed table for a crumpled scroll.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the gallows in the north east corner and choose Search to find a corpse.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I may find something else on the corpse.\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the caves: teleport out, or go back through the cave-in, then south and east to the end of the cave and search the rocks there to leave by the waterfall. You can take about 20 damage.\",\"i\":[\"Zadimus corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Bury Zadimus's corpse at the Tribal Statue in the middle of Tai Bwo Wannai, west of Trufitus's hut.\",\"i\":[\"Zadimus corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the tattered scroll.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please.\"],\"i\":[\"Tattered scroll\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the crumpled scroll.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please.\"],\"i\":[\"Crumpled scroll\"]}],\"i\":[\"Spade\",\"Lit torch or candle\",\"Rope\",\"Chisel\"]},{\"n\":\"Free Rashiliyia\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to Cairn Isle, west of Shilo Village, near fairy ring CKR. Climb the rocks (15 Agility) and cross the bridge. Long-press the well stacked rocks on the north side of the island and choose Search.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please, I can think of nothing nicer!\"]},{\"t\":\"Have 3 free inventory spaces. Long-press the tomb dolmen to the south and choose Search. Don't drop the locating crystal.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the pommel.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Sword pommel\"]},{\"t\":\"Use bronze wire on the beads.\",\"i\":[\"Bronze wire\",\"Bone beads\"]},{\"t\":\"Wear the beads of the dead and go south-east from fairy ring DKP, to the area north of the crashed gnome glider. Search the bright green palm trees from their north side. Come equipped for a boss fight.\",\"i\":[\"Beads of the dead\",\"Bone shard\",\"Chisel\",\"Bones (3)\",\"Combat gear\",\"Crumble undead spell for final boss\",\"Food\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the carved doors behind the palm trees and choose Search.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the bone shard.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Bone shard\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bone key on the doors behind the palm trees.\",\"i\":[\"Bone key\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the doors behind the palm trees.\",\"i\":[\"Beads of the dead\",\"Bones (3)\",\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip the beads of the dead. Go through the gate and down the rocks.\",\"i\":[\"Beads of the dead\",\"Bones (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Head west. Don't pick up the stack of coins: it summons undead ones. Then go south, then south-west at the first fork, to the doors at the end.\",\"i\":[\"Beads of the dead\",\"Bones (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press your bones, choose Use and tap the doors. Do this for all 3 bones, then enter the room with the beads still on.\",\"i\":[\"Beads of the dead\",\"Bones (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the tomb dolmen, ready to fight.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Nazastarool's 3 forms. You can safe spot them over the tomb dolmen. The Crumble Undead spell is very strong against them.\"},{\"t\":\"Pickup Rashiliyia's corpse.\",\"i\":[\"Rashiliyia corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the tomb: teleport out, or use the bone key on the doors you came in by. Go back to Cairn Isle, long-press the rocks and choose Search to enter the caverns again.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please, I can think of nothing nicer!\"],\"i\":[\"Rashiliyia corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Use Rashiliyia's corpse on the dolmen to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Rashiliyia corpse\"]}],\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Bronze wire\",\"Bones (3)\"],\"r\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Crumble undead spell for final boss\",\"Prayer potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Nazastarool 3 times (levels 68, 91, 93) (safespottable)\"]}]}"
        "Sins of the Father" -> "{\"n\":\"Sins of the Father\",\"items\":[\"Combat gear + food\",\"Vyrewatch outfit or 1950 coins\",\"Ivandis flail\",\"Any axe\",\"Ruby\",\"Runes or tablet for Enchant Ruby\",\"Knife\",\"Chisel\"],\"rec\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Antipoison\",\"Drakan's medallion\",\"Morytania legs 3/4\"],\"enemies\":[\"Kroy (level 133)\",\"Vampyre juveniles (level 122 and 119)\",\"Nail beasts (level 143 and 67)\",\"Mutated bloodveld (level 123)\",\"Damien Leucurte (level 204)\",\"Vanstrom Klause (level 413)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"6 x 15,000 Experience Tomes (Any skill above 60)\",\"A Blisterwood Flail\",\"Access to Darkmeyer and the Daeyalt Essence Mine\",\"Darkmeyer teleport via Drakan's Medallion.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Investigating Slepe\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf in Slepe.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go into the church and talk to Hameln the Jester about how his friend fell ill.\",\"s\":[\"I'd better get going.\",\"Do you know how he fell ill?\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to The Rat & Bat pub south east of the church and speak to Carl.\",\"s\":[\"Where do you get your Bloody Bracers from?\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the barrel south of the Rat & Bat Pub.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow Carl without being seen; if he spots you, you start again. Go through the church and hide at its north doors until he has passed.\"},{\"t\":\"Hide on the east side of the hollow tree just north of the graves.\"},{\"t\":\"When he reaches the town's centre square, hide on the north side of the hollow tree next to the gallows.\"},{\"t\":\"When he enters the graveyard, hide on the west side of the hollow tree west of the graveyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Kroy in his lab, where the cutscene leaves you. If you've left, go down the stairs in the graveyard south of the church in Slepe. Dodge the potion he sometimes throws to avoid damage and your attack rate being reduced.\",\"s\":[\"Continue the Sins of the Father quest.\"]},{\"t\":\"Destroy both the Lab tables.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the lab through the southern gate, then return to Veliaf in Slepe.\",\"s\":[\"Fair enough, so what now?\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear + food\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Kroy (level 133)\"]},{\"n\":\"Helping the Myreque\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go down the trapdoor on the east side of Paterdomus and talk to Veliaf, next to Drezel in the dungeon below.\",\"s\":[\"I see. So that's why you want to keep him safe, Veliaf?\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Ivan Strom south of Fenkenstrain's Castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Listen to the meeting.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Escorting Ivan\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Ivan Strom outside the east entrance of Paterdomus.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"]},{\"t\":\"If you didn't bring a knife, search the nearby backpack for one.\"},{\"t\":\"Cut 3 vines from the nearby tree.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine the vines together.\",\"i\":[\"Short vine (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the long vine on the nearby branch.\",\"i\":[\"Long vine\"]},{\"t\":\"Swing on the vine.\"},{\"t\":\"Walk to the end of the path and tap its last square to continue the trek.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the nail beasts.\"},{\"t\":\"Continue the trek.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"If you have no axe, kill the nearby zombie for one.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Chop the nearby dead trees for 3 logs.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Wield your axe, or keep a hammer in your inventory. Use your logs on the broken bridge until all 3 gaps are repaired.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Logs (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Cross the bridge.\"},{\"t\":\"Continue the trek.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the juvinates with the Ivandis Flail. Try to attack the one near Ivan before it can attack him.\",\"i\":[\"Ivandis flail\"]},{\"t\":\"Continue the trek.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear + food\",\"Ivandis flail\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Nail beasts (level 143 and 67)\"]},{\"n\":\"Learning of the Icyene\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Finish speaking to Ivan Strom.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf at the boat house in the south of Burgh de Rott.\"},{\"t\":\"Get into the boat to the Icyene Graveyard.\",\"s\":[\"Icyene Graveyard.\"]},{\"t\":\"Finish talking to Veliaf and Safalaan.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk with Vanescula Drakan.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the mausoleum's door.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Verdita Sefalatis in the Icyene Graveyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Kael Forshaw in the Icyene Graveyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Radigad Ponfit in the Icyene Graveyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Polmafi Ferdygris in the Icyene Graveyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Ivan Strom in the Icyene Graveyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Veliaf Hurtz in the Icyene Graveyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Vanescula in the Icyene Graveyard.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Investigating the lab\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the Meiyerditch lab. The fastest way is through the mines: take the boat to Meiyerditch and ask a Vyrewatch to send you to the mines.\",\"s\":[\"Meiyerditch.\",\"Send me to the mines.\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine 15 daeyalt ore (needs 20 Mining) and put it in the cart. If you have no pickaxe, ask one of the miners for a bronze one.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to a Vampyre Juvinate to leave the mine.\"},{\"t\":\"Head south-east to the house against the eastern wall with a red and yellow tapestry. Walk through the slashed tapestry and go down the stairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Safalaan at the Lab.\",\"s\":[\"Shall we get going then?\",\"Let's go.\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the Mutated Bloodveld (lvl-123). If you aren't taken to it, go through the door to the deeper labs, south-west of where you met Safalaan.\"},{\"t\":\"Finish speaking with Safalaan in the Lab.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the bookshelf in the room west of Safalaan in the Lab.\",\"s\":[\"I'll be back soon.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go show Safalaan the Haemalchemy book 2 you found.\",\"s\":[\"Sure. Here you go.\"],\"i\":[\"Haemalchemy volume 2\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear + food\",\"Any pickaxe\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Mutated bloodveld (level 123)\"]},{\"n\":\"Making a disguise\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Vanescula in the Icyene Graveyard. Take the boat south of Burgh de Rott to get there.\",\"s\":[\"Okay. I'll see you soon.\",\"Icyene Graveyard.\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the boat to Meiyerditch and go down the trapdoor in the northern room of Old Man Ral's house, in south-west Meiyerditch. Give Polmafi a Vyrewatch disguise in the hideout below. If you have none, buy the outfit from Trader Sven just south of the house for 1,950 coins, and don't wear it.\",\"s\":[\"Meiyerditch.\",\"Here you go.\"],\"i\":[\"Vyrewatch top\",\"Vyrewatch legs\",\"Vyrewatch shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Vanescula in the Icyene Graveyard with the Vyre noble outfit.\",\"s\":[\"Icyene Graveyard.\"],\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top unscented\",\"Vyre noble legs unscented\",\"Vyre noble shoes unscented\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf outside the church in Slepe.\",\"s\":[\"Slepe.\",\"Let's do this.\"],\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top unscented\",\"Vyre noble legs unscented\",\"Vyre noble shoes unscented\",\"Ivandis flail\"]},{\"t\":\"Wield your Ivandis flail and kill Damien Leucurte (lvl-204). He can poison you. Stomp out any of the fires he spawns.\",\"s\":[\"Slepe.\",\"Let's do this.\"],\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top unscented\",\"Vyre noble legs unscented\",\"Vyre noble shoes unscented\",\"Ivandis flail\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf in Slepe.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Vanescula in the Icyene Graveyard with the Vyre noble outfit.\",\"s\":[\"I'll see you there.\",\"Icyene Graveyard.\"],\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top\",\"Vyre noble legs\",\"Vyre noble shoes\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear + food\",\"Vyrewatch outfit or 1950 coins\",\"Ivandis flail\",\"Antipoison\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Damien Leucurte (level 204)\"]},{\"n\":\"Infiltrating Darkmeyer\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Wear the Vyre noble outfit. Take the boat to Meiyerditch, talk to a Vyrewatch to be sent to the mines, then talk to a Vampyre Juvinate to get out. In the outfit you won't need to mine anything. Go through the crack in Darkmeyer's wall, just north of the mine exit.\",\"s\":[\"Meiyerditch.\",\"Send me to the mines.\"],\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top\",\"Vyre noble legs\",\"Vyre noble shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Head to the Arboretum in the middle of Darkmeyer, shown by the tree icon on the map, east of the bank. Speak to the guard, Desmodus Lasiurus, outside it.\",\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top\",\"Vyre noble legs\",\"Vyre noble shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Mordan Nikazsi in the house with a water symbol on the minimap, north-east of the furnace, along Darkmeyer's east wall.\",\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top\",\"Vyre noble legs\",\"Vyre noble shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Maria Gadderanks in the jail north of the Arboretum in Darkmeyer.\",\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top\",\"Vyre noble legs\",\"Vyre noble shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Desmodus Lasiurus outside the Arboretum in Darkmeyer.\",\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top\",\"Vyre noble legs\",\"Vyre noble shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the shelves in the Arboretum in Darkmeyer. Read the Old Note you get.\",\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top\",\"Vyre noble legs\",\"Vyre noble shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the Old Note. It gives the gallons of water the tree needs, which differs per player. Each turn of the north valve adds 7 gallons and each turn of the south valve adds 4.\"},{\"t\":\"Find your number in this list. The row gives the north valve's setting. Its place in the row gives the south valve's setting: the first number is 0, then 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5. North 0: 0, 4, 8, 12, 16, 20. North 1: 7, 11, 15, 19, 23, 27. North 2: 14, 18, 22, 26, 30, 34. North 3: 21, 25, 29, 33, 37, 41. North 4: 28, 32, 36, 40, 44, 48. North 5: 35, 39, 43, 47, 51, 55.\"},{\"t\":\"Set the south valve and the north valve, by the Arboretum's entrance, to those two numbers.\"},{\"t\":\"Gather 8 logs from the Blisterwood tree.\",\"i\":[\"Vyre noble top\",\"Vyre noble legs\",\"Vyre noble shoes\",\"Blisterwood logs (8)\",\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Vanescula in the Icyene Graveyard with the 8 Blisterwood logs.\",\"s\":[\"Icyene Graveyard.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood logs (8)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"n\":\"Creating a weapon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go speak to Vertida in Old Man Ral's basement with the 8 Blisterwood logs.\",\"s\":[\"Meiyerditch.\",\"Here you go.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood logs (8)\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Vertida Sefalatis.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the nearby crate for a silver sickle.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a ruby on the sickle.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ruby\",\"Silver sickle (b)\",\"Chisel\"]},{\"t\":\"Cast enchant ruby on the sickle.\",\"i\":[\"Runes or tablet for Enchant Ruby\",\"Ruby sickle\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a blisterwood log on the enchanted sickle.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood log\",\"Enchanted ruby sickle (b)\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the flail on the blisterwood sickle.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ivandis flail\",\"Blisterwood sickle\"]}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood logs (8)\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Ruby\",\"Ivandis flail\",\"Runes or tablet for Enchant Ruby\"]},{\"n\":\"Taking on Drakan\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Vanescula in the Icyene Graveyard with the Blisterwood Flail.\",\"s\":[\"Icyene Graveyard.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Safalaan north of the Icyene Graveyard.\",\"s\":[\"Icyene Graveyard.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Vanescula in the Icyene Graveyard.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\"]},{\"t\":\"Prepare for a challenging fight. Speak to Vanescula again.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\"]},{\"t\":\"If the cutscene doesn't take you into the fight, speak to Veliaf next to Vanescula.\",\"s\":[\"Let's go.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Vanstrom Klause. Protect from Magic. He has various special attacks indicated by what he says: My pets will feast on your corpse: A bloodveld will appear which you need to kill from a distance. Blood will be my strength: An orb appears that heals Vanstrom. Lure Vanstrom onto it. Stare into the darkness: Face away from Vanstrom. Once he hits 0hp, he'll heal to 200 and start summoning lightning bolts. Move off tiles where they appear.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\"]},{\"t\":\"If you're not already in the Myreque hideout, climb down the trapdoor in Old Man Ral's house in south-west Meiyerditch. Speak to Veliaf in the hideout to complete the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear + food\",\"Anything to range the bloodveld during bossfight\",\"Blisterwood flail\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Vanstrom Klause (level 413)\"]}]}"
        "Skippy and the Mogres" -> "{\"n\":\"Skippy and the Mogres\",\"items\":[\"Bucket of water\",\"Nettle tea\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Chocolate dust\",\"Snape grass\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"Ability to kill Mogres\",\"Ability to receive Mogres as a Slayer task\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Help Skippy\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Long-press Skippy, south-west of Port Sarim, and choose Sober-up.\",\"s\":[\"Throw the water!\"],\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Skippy.\",\"i\":[\"Nettle tea\"]},{\"t\":\"Use some chocolate dust on a bucket of milk.\",\"i\":[\"Chocolate dust\",\"Bucket of milk\"]},{\"t\":\"Use some snape grass on the chocolatey milk.\",\"i\":[\"Snape grass\",\"Chocolatey milk\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the hangover cure on Skippy.\",\"i\":[\"Hangover cure\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\",\"Nettle tea\",\"Bucket of milk\",\"Chocolate dust\",\"Snape grass\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Sleeping Giants" -> "{\"n\":\"Sleeping Giants\",\"items\":[\"Oak Logs\",\"Wool\",\"Nails\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\"],\"rec\":[\"Ice Gloves\",\"Al Kharid Teleport\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"6,000 Smithing XP\",\"Access to the Giants' Foundry\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting out\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bring 3 oak logs, 10 nails, 1 wool, a hammer and a chisel to the Giants' Foundry on the Desert Plateau, east of Al Kharid, to start the quest. The minigame teleport to Giants' Foundry takes you there. If you have no hammer, take one from the crate north of the Foundry.\",\"i\":[\"Oak Logs\",\"Wool\",\"Nails\",\"Chisel\",\"Hammer\",\"Ice Gloves\"]},{\"t\":\"Attempt to Strike the Hill Giant at the entrance of the cave to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Kovac.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the Giants' Foundry.\"},{\"t\":\"Fix the Broken polishing wheel. It takes 2 oak logs, 5 nails and 1 wool, and you need a hammer.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Oak Logs\",\"Nails\",\"Wool\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Fix the Broken grindstone.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Chisel\"]},{\"t\":\"Fix the Broken trip hammer.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Oak Logs\",\"Nails\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Kovac to continue.\"}],\"i\":[\"Oak Logs\",\"Wool\",\"Nails\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Creating the sword\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Kovac for a commission.\"},{\"t\":\"Make 20 inventory spaces free first (the big chest in the Foundry opens your bank). Take some bars and weapons from the crate near the cave exit.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the Crucible with items & bars until it is full.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Kovac about the mould.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the mould jig, then select a mould for the forte, blade and tip. Pick the ones that best match Kovac's commission; he accepts a sword of any quality.\"},{\"t\":\"Tap Set Mould to confirm the three moulds.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Kovac about pouring the metal.\"},{\"t\":\"Pour the full Crucible into the mould.\"},{\"t\":\"With ice gloves on, pick up the sword from the mould. Without them, take a bucket from the pile of buckets, fill it by using it on the waterfall, use it on the sword, then pick the sword up. Your hands must be free.\",\"i\":[\"Ice Gloves\",\"Bucket of Water\"]},{\"t\":\"Dunk the preform in the lava pool until it's at max heat. Use the trip hammer while the heat bar is in the red, re-heating it in the lava whenever it's close to yellow, until the progress bar reaches the yellow section.\"},{\"t\":\"Get the preform to the lower part of the yellow heat section: cool it on the waterfall if it's too hot, or dunk it in the lava pool if it's too cold. Use the grindstone while it's in the yellow until the progress bar reaches the green section. The grindstone heats the preform as you work.\"},{\"t\":\"Get the preform to the top of the green heat section: cool it on the waterfall if it's too hot, or dunk it in the lava pool if it's too cold. Use the polishing wheel while it's in the green until the sword is complete, heating it in the lava when needed.\"},{\"t\":\"Give the finished sword to Kovac to complete the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Ice Gloves\",\"Bucket\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Song of the Elves" -> "{\"n\":\"Song of the Elves\",\"items\":[\"Steel full helm\",\"Steel platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\",\"Red dye\",\"Purple dye\",\"Silk\",\"Full mourners' outfit\",\"Runite bar\",\"Limestone brick (8)\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Rope\",\"Nature rune\",\"Irit leaf or a flower\",\"Adamant chainbody\",\"Wine of Zamorak or Zamorak brew\",\"Cabbage\",\"Black knife or black dagger\",\"Cadantine seed\",\"Seed dibber\",\"Vial of water\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Any axe\",\"Spade\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport crystal\",\"Iorwerth camp teleport\",\"Games necklace\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\",\"Magic combat gear, food and potions\",\"Saradomin brews\",\"Super restores\",\"or more Stamina potions (6)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Many Mourners, Paladins and Knights of Ardougne\",\"Arianwyn (level 182)\",\"Essyllt (level 236)\",\"Fragment of Seren (level 494)\"],\"rewards\":[\"4 Quest points\",\"40,000 Agility XP\",\"40,000 Construction XP\",\"40,000 Farming XP\",\"40,000 Herblore XP\",\"40,000 Hunter XP\",\"40,000 Mining XP\",\"40,000 Smithing XP\",\"40,000 Woodcutting XP\",\"Access to Prifddinas\",\"Ability to fight Zalcano\",\"Access to The Gauntlet\",\"Access to Trahaearn Mine\",\"Access to Iorwerth Dungeon\",\"Ability to respawn at Prifddinas\",\"Ability to move POH to Prifddinas\",\"Prifddinas Teleport added to Crystal Teleport Seed\",\"Ability to make Divine Potions\",\"Ability to make Crystal Tools, Weapons and Armor\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Edmond in East Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the stairs on the west side of East Ardougne castle and talk to King Lathas upstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Edmond in East Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"How do I get this disguise?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Alrena in East Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Purple dye\",\"Silk\"]},{\"t\":\"Use red dye on a steel full helm.\",\"i\":[\"Red dye\",\"Steel full helm\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the tabard to a steel platebody.\",\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight tabard\",\"Steel platebody\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Edmond in East Ardougne.\",\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\"]},{\"t\":\"Wear the Ardougne knight helm, Ardougne knight platebody and steel platelegs, then enter the basement of East Ardougne castle by the stairs down on its west side.\",\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the cell.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the prison.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to Elena's house in East Ardougne, where you started Biohazard, just west of the log balance. Search the cabinet there.\",\"s\":[\"The thick clear liquid.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Elena in the cell with the clear liquid, wearing your Ardougne knight disguise.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Clear liquid\",\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Edmond in East Ardougne.\"}],\"i\":[\"Steel full helm\",\"Steel platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\",\"Red dye\",\"Purple dye\",\"Silk\",\"Full mourners' outfit\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"n\":\"Inciting the citizens\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the bed in the house west of the Mourner base.\",\"s\":[\"Climb through it.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the hideout.\",\"s\":[\"It's not good, but it might be our only option.\",\"It's all in a day's work.\",\"I am.\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the hideout.\"},{\"t\":\"Wear your full Mourner outfit, including the gas mask, for all of West Ardougne. Use a tinderbox on the grain in the West Ardougne council building, the large building north of the church.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner top\",\"Mourner trousers\",\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Mourner cloak\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the priest in the West Ardougne church and ask him for taxes.\",\"i\":[\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner top\",\"Mourner trousers\",\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Mourner cloak\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a tinderbox on the grain in the West Ardougne church.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner top\",\"Mourner trousers\",\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Mourner cloak\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Nurse Sarah in the building just south-west of the West Ardougne church, and tell her about retraining.\",\"i\":[\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner top\",\"Mourner trousers\",\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Mourner cloak\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a tinderbox on the grain outside the West Ardougne general store, in the far south-west corner of the city.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner top\",\"Mourner trousers\",\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Mourner cloak\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Chadwell in the West Ardougne general store.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Gas mask\",\"Mourner top\",\"Mourner trousers\",\"Mourner boots\",\"Mourner gloves\",\"Mourner cloak\"]},{\"t\":\"Wear the Ardougne knight helm, Ardougne knight platebody and steel platelegs for all of East Ardougne. Talk to the silver merchant in the East Ardougne Market.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to both bakers in the East Ardougne Market, one on the east side and one on the west side.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the gem merchant in the East Ardougne Market.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the fur trader in the East Ardougne Market.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the spice seller in the East Ardougne Market.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the silk merchant in the East Ardougne Market.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the town crier in the East Ardougne Market.\",\"s\":[\"Could you help me tell people about some new taxes?\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Zenesha south of the East Ardougne Market.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Estate Agent, just west of the East Ardougne Market.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Probita the pet insurer, just west of the Estate Agent.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Aemad in the East Ardougne General Store.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the priest in the East Ardougne church.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"You need 80 recruits, and everyone so far gives 83, so you should already have enough. If you skipped anyone, also talk to Doctor Orbon in the East Ardougne church, then move on.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here to tell you about some new taxes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]}],\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Full mourners' outfit\",\"Ardougne knight helm\",\"Ardougne knight platebody\",\"Steel platelegs\"]},{\"n\":\"Overthrowing the King\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the hideout, ready for a fight.\",\"s\":[\"Are you sure you're okay with this Elena?\",\"I'm ready.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the 10 mourners.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the trapdoor in the north building of the Mourner HQ to enter its basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the 11 mourners.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the hideout, ready for a fight.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat 15 knights in the East Ardougne castle courtyard and upstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"When all 15 are dead, a cutscene brings out King Lathas. Speak to him, then choose \\\"We're done here, take him away.\\\" If you end up back in the hideout instead, talk to Elena.\",\"s\":[\"We're done here, take him away.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Watch the cutscenes.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Helping Arianwyn\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb the ladder in the north-east of Lletya and talk to Ysgawyn on the upper middle platform.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the south west of Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"It is. I'm here for you if you need me though.\",\"Go ahead.\",\"I don't know.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn again.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn after the meeting.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Freeing Baxtorian\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Board the log raft west of Almera.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Irit leaf or a flower\",\"Cabbage\",\"Wine of Zamorak or Zamorak brew\",\"Nature rune\",\"Adamant chainbody\",\"Black knife or black dagger\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the rock to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the dead tree.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the falls.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the northern stack of crates in the east room for a key.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the doors from the west room.\",\"i\":[\"Key\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn.\",\"s\":[\"Let's just crack on.\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the Ode to eternity book Arianwyn gave you before placing any items. Then solve the pillar puzzle: inspect the pillars to get their hints. Each hint ends in 1st, 2nd, 3rd, 4th, 5th or 6th. Go by the words of each hint, not by the pillar you read it on: most hints give the item for a different pillar. You can skip the hint that says it is not opposite a number, as that item is the one left over. Placing an item on the wrong pillar fails the puzzle, so you must get the items again and the numbers change.\"},{\"t\":\"The ending of a hint names the item: 1st is the nature rune, 2nd the irit leaf or a flower, 3rd the black knife or black dagger, 4th the wine of Zamorak or Zamorak brew, 5th the adamant chainbody and 6th the cabbage.\"},{\"t\":\"Place each item by the wording of its hint: \\\"I am the\\\" goes on the south west pillar, \\\"I am next to the\\\" on the west pillar, \\\"I am opposite the\\\" on the north west pillar, \\\"I am not next to the\\\" on the east pillar and \\\"I am not the\\\" on the north east pillar. The item left over goes on the south east pillar.\",\"i\":[\"Nature rune\",\"Irit leaf or a flower\",\"Black knife or black dagger\",\"Wine of Zamorak or Zamorak brew\",\"Adamant chainbody\",\"Cabbage\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Irit leaf or a flower\",\"Cabbage\",\"Wine of Zamorak or Zamorak brew\",\"Nature rune\",\"Adamant chainbody\",\"Black knife or black dagger\"],\"tr\":[\"Teleport crystal\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Amlodd\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the south west of Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"Now's not the time for stories, Elena.\"],\"i\":[\"Seed dibber\",\"Cadantine seed\"]},{\"t\":\"Plant a cadantine seed in the Lletya farm patch.\",\"i\":[\"Seed dibber\",\"Cadantine seed\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian in the central building just north of Lletya's bank, next to Arianwyn.\",\"s\":[\"How do I find Lord Amlodd?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Eluned in Lletya, just south of the archery shop and north of the pond.\",\"s\":[\"I have a seed from Baxtorian that I think needs enchanting.\"]},{\"t\":\"Rub the crystal seed to teleport.\",\"i\":[\"Crystal seed\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Mysterious Figure.\"}],\"i\":[\"Seed dibber\",\"Cadantine seed\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Trahaearn\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian in Lletya about Trahaearn.\",\"s\":[\"How do I find Lady Trahaearn?\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave Lletya heading west and pass through the trees north of the dire wolves. Run across the clearing, step over the tripwire and go west through the 3 dense forests. Go north through the leaf trap, then east to the cave. Enter the cave to the Underground Pass from the Elven Lands entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Hammer\",\"Runite bar\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pickaxe on the wall south of the Well of Voyage.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole in the wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a hammer on the elderly elf.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Runite bar\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lady Tangwen Trahaearn.\"}],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Hammer\",\"Runite bar\"]},{\"n\":\"Making the potion\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Elena in the south west of Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\",\"i\":[\"Elder cadantine\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on the crystal.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the cadantine to a vial of water.\",\"i\":[\"Elder cadantine\",\"Vial of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the crystal dust to a cadantine potion.\",\"i\":[\"Crystal dust\",\"Elder cadantine potion (unf)\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the potion to Arianwyn.\",\"i\":[\"Inversion potion\"]}],\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Vial of water\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Entering the Crystal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Lord Amlodd in Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"If you arrive on the ground floor, go up to the middle floor of the library. Touch the Seal of the Forgotten, a short way south of the way up.\"}],\"i\":[\"or more Stamina potions (6)\"]},{\"n\":\"Ithell Seal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the south east room on the middle floor. The light shows you each next mirror. Pillar 1 is the first the light reaches, on the west side of the room. The light must leave it going south, so rotate it if it can turn. If a mirror already sends the light the right way, leave it.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 2 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes east.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 3 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes north.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 4 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes east.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 5 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes north.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 6 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes east.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 7 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes south.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 8 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes west.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 9 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes south.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 10 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes east.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 11 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes north.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 12 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes east.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 13 of 14: rotate the next mirror the light reaches so the light goes north.\"},{\"t\":\"Mirror 14 of 14: rotate it so the light goes east into the Seal of Ithell.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the Seal of Ithell in the south east room.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Cadarn Seal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Solve the Cadarn light puzzle: open its Solution and follow it until the light reaches the Seal of Cadarn.\",\"s\":[\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the Seal of Cadarn in the south of the ground floor.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Crwys Seal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Solve the Crwys light puzzle: open its Solution and follow it until the light reaches the Seal of Crwys.\",\"s\":[\"Pull the lever.\",\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the Seal of Crwys in the north west of the middle floor.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Amlodd Seal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Solve the Amlodd light puzzle: open its Solution and follow it until the light reaches the Seal of Amlodd.\",\"s\":[\"Pull the lever.\",\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the Seal of Amlodd in the middle of the ground floor.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Meilyr Seal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Solve the Meilyr light puzzle: open its Solution and follow it until the light reaches the Seal of Meilyr.\",\"s\":[\"Pull the lever.\",\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back to the middle floor if you aren't on it. Climb the north-west stairs to the top floor, then touch the Seal of Meilyr in the middle of that floor.\",\"s\":[\"Climb up.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Hefin Seal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Solve the Hefin light puzzle: open its Solution and follow it until the light reaches the Seal of Hefin.\",\"s\":[\"Pull the lever.\",\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the Seal of Hefin in the south west of the top floor.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Trahaearn Seal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Solve the Trahaearn light puzzle: open its Solution and follow it until the light reaches the Seal of Trahaearn.\",\"s\":[\"Pull the lever.\",\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the Seal of Trahaearn in the east of the top floor.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Iorwerth Seal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Solve the Iorwerth light puzzle: open its Solution and follow it until the light reaches the Seal of Iorwerth.\",\"s\":[\"Pull the lever.\",\"Pull it.\",\"Take everything.\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the Seal of Iorwerth in the north east of the middle floor.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Finding Crwys and Hefin\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave the library. A quick way to do this is hopping worlds.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Ask Baxtorian about how to find Crwys and Lady Hefin. Ask about both.\",\"s\":[\"How do I find Lord Crwys?\",\"How do I find Lady Hefin?\"]},{\"t\":\"Hop across the stepping stones in the swamp south of the magic trees near Lletya. Talk to the Elf Hermit on the island you reach.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the western side of Isafdar, south of the Iorwerth Camp. The Iorwerth camp teleport is quickest, and Iorwerth elves will attack you now. Cross the log balance and the stick trap south-west of it into the clearing, then chop the dead tree north of the pond. Talk to Crwys when he appears.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lord Crwys.\"}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Retrieving the orb\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Baxtorian in Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave in the Iorwerth camp.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the guards.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest for the orb.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Baxtorian in Lletya.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Locating Ysgawyn\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the south west of Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"That's fair. Anyway, I wanted to ask you about Ysgawyn.\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the mushrooms just outside Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the rocks to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the rocks to the west over the tripwire.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the elven lamp to the south over the leaf trap.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the mushrooms to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the rocks to the north west.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb over the tripwire into the clearing.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ysgawyn.\",\"s\":[\"So what have you been discussing?\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Defending Lletya\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the house to the south and search its east table to find Eoin.\"},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the cooking pots by the south cooking range to find Iona.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Arianwyn. Protect from Ranged. Move when he shoots orange arrows.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Ithell and Meilyr\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian in Lletya about Ithell and Meilyr. Ask for both clues.\",\"s\":[\"What's Lady Ithell's clue?\",\"What's Lady Meilyr's clue?\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol on the bank's wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol in the building north of Elena.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol in the General Store.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up to the top floor of Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol above the General Store.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol at the altar.\"},{\"t\":\"Make a statue in the middle of Lletya.\",\"i\":[\"Saw\",\"Hammer\",\"Limestone brick (8)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lady Kelyn Ithell in Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Dig south-east of Port Tyras, near a yew tree, 4 squares south of a group of three mushrooms. A charter ship to Port Tyras is the quick way: go through the camp, north through the dense forest, east and south through the next dense forest, then over a tripwire and south to the spot. If digging finds nothing, ask the Observatory professor about treasure trails for a sextant, watch and chart, destroy the clue, and get a new one from Baxtorian.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Dig in Zul-Andra, on the east side of the northernmost hut, two squares north of the small hole in the ground (or the STASH unit, if you've built it). A Zul-andra teleport takes you there. You can also use fairy ring BJS and the stepping stones (76 Agility), or charter a ship to Port Tyras and head south, then south-east.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Dig outside Prifddinas's south gate, one square north of the north-eastern elven lamp. The Iorwerth camp teleport is quickest: go east through the dense forests, then north to the gate.\"},{\"t\":\"Spin outside of the Underground Pass's cave entrance with nothing equipped.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lady Meilyr.\"}],\"i\":[\"Limestone brick (8)\",\"Saw\",\"Hammer\",\"Spade\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Defending the Temple\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Make sure you're prepared for battle. Enter the Underground Pass from the Elven Lands entrance, then enter the Well of Voyage. Leave the well area through the door and follow the winding path south. Enter the south cave to go down to the lower level, then go to the dwarven camp.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian in the dwarven camp.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the dwarven camp.\",\"s\":[\"Baxtorian said you had an idea to help our defence.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the 7 holes around the camp's entrance. You can get more explosive potions from Elena.\",\"i\":[\"Explosive potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian in the dwarven camp.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"]},{\"t\":\"Defend the camp for four minutes. You don't have to kill every elf: attack any that are hitting the barricade to draw them onto you.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Essyllt. Protect from melee. He can drain your stats, so drink super restores when needed. When he shoves you, flick to Protect from Ranged then back to Protect from Melee.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Essyllt (level 236)\"]},{\"n\":\"Defeat the Fragment\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"After Essyllt, a cutscene starts the Fragment of Seren fight straight away. Only magic can hurt her. If you aren't in magic gear, teleport out, bank and gear up.\"},{\"t\":\"If you left, go back the way you reached the dwarven camp: enter the Underground Pass from the Elven Lands entrance, then enter the Well of Voyage. Leave the well area through the door and follow the winding path south. Enter the south cave and the fight starts again.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the Fragment of Seren. Protect from Ranged, and keep your distance. She is only susceptible to magic damage, so bring your best magic gear. If she moves you close to her and locks you in place, she is about to hit 99% of your max health. Eat up. If she spawns a healing spell, attack it to destroy it. If she splits into multiple fragments, attack the light coloured one.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian outside of Prifddinas to finish the quest, and unlock Prifddinas!\"}],\"i\":[\"Magic combat gear, food and potions\",\"Saradomin brews\",\"Super restores\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Fragment of Seren (level 494)\"]}]}"
        "Spirits of the Elid" -> "{\"n\":\"Spirits of the Elid\",\"items\":[\"Air Rune\",\"Law Rune\",\"Needle\",\"Thread (2)\",\"Crush Weapon Style\",\"Stab Weapon Style\",\"Slash Weapon Style\",\"Light source\",\"Knife\",\"Rope\",\"Any Pickaxe\",\"Any bow\",\"Arrows for bow\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat Gear\",\"Waterskins\",\"Necklace of Passage\",\"Spear or Hasta for the 3 weapon styles\",\"Coins for magic carpet\",\"Food\"],\"enemies\":[\"Black Golem, Grey Golem, White Golem (Level 75)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"8,000 Prayer XP\",\"1,000 Thieving XP\",\"1,000 Magic XP\",\"Access to Nardah's Fountain and Shrine\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting Off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Awusah the Mayor in Nardah.\",\"s\":[\"I am an adventurer in search of quests.\",\"Any idea how you got this curse?\",\"Yes.\",\"Ok I will have a look around and see what I can do.\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Ghaslor the Elder, just north of Awusah.\",\"s\":[\"I am trying to find out the cause of this town's curse.\",\"River spirits, what are they?\"]},{\"t\":\"Open and search the cupboard in the north-west corner of the house that is north of the fountain.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the needle and thread on the torn robes (both top and bottom).\",\"i\":[\"Needle\",\"Torn Robe (bottom)\"]},{\"t\":\"Cast the Telekinetic Grab spell on the ancestral key on the table, on the east side of the same house.\",\"i\":[\"Air Rune\",\"Law Rune\"]}],\"i\":[\"Air Rune\",\"Law Rune\",\"Needle\",\"Thread (2)\"]},{\"n\":\"The Golems\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Follow the River Elid north from Nardah until it comes out of a cave as a waterfall, or use a necklace of passage to Eagle's Eyrie and go south-west. Use the rope on the root over the cave to enter.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip the Robes of Elidinis and use the ancestral key on the door.\",\"i\":[\"Ancestral Key\",\"Robe of Elidinis (top)\",\"Robe of Elidinis (bottom)\"]},{\"t\":\"Head east from the door you just opened to the three doors. Open the south one and fight the White Golem (level-75). You can only damage the Golem with the stab attack style.\",\"i\":[\"Stab Weapon Style\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the southern door again. Clear the Water Channel, then leave the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the door to the east and fight the Grey Golem (level-75). You can only damage the Golem with the slash attack style.\",\"i\":[\"Slash Weapon Style\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the eastern door again. Clear the Water Channel with your pickaxe, then leave the room.\",\"i\":[\"Any Pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the door to the north-east and fight the Black Golem (level-75). You can only damage the Golem with the crush attack style.\",\"i\":[\"Crush Weapon Style\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the north-eastern door again. Clear the Water Channel by shooting the target, then leave the room.\",\"i\":[\"Any bow\",\"Arrows for bow\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the door to the north near the lake.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Water Spirits on the north side of the lake.\",\"s\":[\"I come as an emissary from the people of Nardah.\",\"Is there anything they can do to get their fountain working again?\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ancestral Key\",\"Robe of Elidinis (top)\",\"Robe of Elidinis (bottom)\",\"Rope\",\"Any Pickaxe\",\"Any bow\",\"Arrows for bow\",\"Crush Weapon Style\",\"Stab Weapon Style\",\"Slash Weapon Style\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"The Genie\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Nardah and speak to Awusah the Mayor.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the shoes near the doorway then leave Awusah's house.\",\"i\":[\"Shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a knife on the shoes to cut out the sole.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Go west from the Nardah general store to the crevice. Use your rope on it to climb down, with a light source in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Light source\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Genie in the Crevice.\",\"s\":[\"I'm after a statue that was thrown down here.\",\"Maybe I can make a deal for it?\",\"Ok I agree to the deal.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Genie again with the sole.\",\"i\":[\"Sole\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Nardah and use the statuette on the statuette plinth in the northern house.\",\"i\":[\"Statuette\"]}],\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Rope\",\"Light source\"]}]}"
        "Swan Song" -> "{\"n\":\"Swan Song\",\"items\":[\"Mist rune (10)\",\"Lava rune (10)\",\"Blood rune (5)\",\"Bones (7)\",\"Pot\",\"Pot lid\",\"Iron bar (5)\",\"Any log\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Hammer (obtainable in quest)\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport to Draynor Village\",\"Piscatoris teleport (2)\",\"Yanille teleport or Nightmare Zone minigame teleport\",\"Crafting Guild teleport\",\"Cooking gauntlets for lower burn chance on monkfish\"],\"enemies\":[\"11 Sea trolls (levels 65/79/87/101)\",\"Sea troll queen (level 170)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"15,000 Magic XP\",\"10,000 Prayer XP\",\"50,000 Fishing XP\",\"25000 x Coins\",\"Access to the Piscatoris Fishing Colony\",\"The ability to fish Monkfish\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Herman Caranos outside the Piscatoris Fishing Colony, north of fairy ring AKQ.\",\"s\":[\"What's the rush?\",\"Do you need any help?\",\"I'm a brave adventurer! Can I try?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.\",\"s\":[\"Draynor Village\",\"You used to be a famous adventurer, didn't you?\"],\"i\":[\"Blood rune (5)\",\"Lava rune (10)\",\"Mist rune (10)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Blood rune (5)\",\"Mist rune (10)\",\"Lava rune (10)\"],\"tr\":[\"Piscatoris teleport\",\"Teleport to Draynor Village\"]},{\"n\":\"Entering the colony\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Wise Old Man outside the Fishing Colony. Be prepared to fight sea trolls.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready to fight.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"If you aren't inside the Fishing Colony yet, enter through the hole next to the Wise Old Man. Kill the sea trolls.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Any log\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Iron bars (5)\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Go into the building in the east of the Fishing Colony and talk to Herman. Tap the floor inside the building first, as tapping Herman from outside can send you running around to the north.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Any log\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Iron bar (5)\",\"Hammer (obtainable in quest)\"],\"tr\":[\"Piscatoris teleport\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"11 Sea trolls (levels 65/79/87/101)\"]},{\"n\":\"Helping Franklin\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Franklin in the middle of the Fishing Colony.\"},{\"t\":\"Add some logs to the firebox in the building with a furnace.\",\"i\":[\"Any log\"]},{\"t\":\"Light the logs in the firebox in the building with a furnace.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Flatten 5 iron bars using the metal press.\",\"i\":[\"Iron bars (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Repair all 5 broken walls to the west, using an iron sheet on each. If you have no hammer, tell Franklin you have the iron sheets and he will give you one.\",\"i\":[\"Iron sheet (5)\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Franklin again.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Any log\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Iron bar (5)\",\"Hammer (obtainable in quest)\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Helping Arnold\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Arnold at the bank in the Fishing Colony.\"},{\"t\":\"Fish at least 5 fresh monkfish at the fishing spot in the north-west of the colony, using a small fishing net (Arnold gives you one if you have none). Sea Trolls will appear, and you'll need to kill them.\",\"i\":[\"Small fishing net\",\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook 5 monkfish on the stove in the kitchen, south of the fishing spot. If you burn any, catch some more.\",\"i\":[\"Fresh monkfish (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the monkfish to Arnold at the bank.\",\"i\":[\"Fresh monkfish (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Herman in the east of the colony again.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"r\":[\"Cooking gauntlets for lower burn chance on monkfish\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Making an army\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Wizard Frumscone in the Wizards' Guild basement.\",\"s\":[\"I'll see what the necromancer needs me to do.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Malignius Mortifer, south of Falador and north of Port Sarim, a little north-west of Betty's magic shop.\",\"s\":[\"I need help with saving a fishing colony.\"],\"i\":[\"Bones (7)\"]},{\"t\":\"Wear the brown apron Malignius gave you to enter the Crafting Guild, then talk to the Master Crafter with dreadlocks on its east side.\",\"s\":[\"Swan Song.\"],\"i\":[\"Brown apron\"]},{\"t\":\"Add a pot lid to a pot.\",\"i\":[\"Pot\",\"Pot lid\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the airtight pot and 7 bones to Malignius Mortifer near Port Sarim. Make sure you're equipped for the fight before speaking to Malignus.\",\"s\":[\"I've spoken to the master crafter...\"],\"i\":[\"Airtight pot\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bones (7)\",\"Pot\",\"Pot lid\",\"Ranged or melee combat gear\"],\"tr\":[\"Yanille teleport or Nightmare Zone minigame teleport\",\"Crafting Guild teleport\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Defeating the trolls\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Be prepared to fight, and talk to Herman in the colony.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready. Let's fight!\"],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Sea Troll Queen.\",\"s\":[\"No, I'm ready to move on with the quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Herman to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"11 Sea trolls (levels 65/79/87/101)\",\"Sea troll queen (level 170)\"]}]}"
        "Tai Bwo Wannai Trio" -> "{\"n\":\"Tai Bwo Wannai Trio\",\"items\":[\"Coins (30)\",\"Hammer\",\"Small Fishing Net\",\"Pestle And Mortar\",\"Iron spear or better (You will lose the spear)\",\"Agility Potion (4)\",\"Ranged or Magic equipment to kill a level 3 monkey\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Sliced banana or a knife\",\"Any logs to make a fire\",\"Raw karambwan\"],\"rec\":[\"Jogre Bones\",\"Extra Raw Karambwans in case you burn the one given\",\"Any Antipoisons\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Dramen staff if you have access to fairy rings\",\"Sliced Banana (Use a knife on a banana)\",\"Food\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"5,000 Cooking XP\",\"5,000 Fishing XP\",\"2,500 Attack XP\",\"2,500 Strength XP\",\"2000 x Coins\",\"Ability to catch and cook Karambwans (after talking to Tinsay after the quest)\",\"Ability to use Tai Bwo Wannai teleport scrolls\",\"Ability to complete the smithing section of Barbarian Training\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting Off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb the ladder in Timfraku's house, the north-west house of Tai Bwo Wannai with a quest icon, and talk to him upstairs.\",\"s\":[\"I am a roving adventurer.\",\"I am a travelling explorer.\",\"I am a wandering wayfarer.\",\"Who me? Oh I'm just a nobody.\",\"Trufitus sent me.\",\"Your gratitude is all I deserve.\",\"Well, some gold would be nice.\",\"So far??\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Small Fishing Net\",\"Pestle And Mortar\",\"Iron spear or better (You will lose the spear)\",\"Agility Potion (4)\",\"Ranged or Magic equipment to kill a level 3 monkey\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Sliced banana or a knife\",\"Any logs to make a fire\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Gathering quest materials\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Using your small fishing net, catch atleast 23 raw karambwanji just south of Tai Bwo Wannai.\",\"i\":[\"Small Fishing Net\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the fishing spots south of the Brimhaven house portal and talk to Lubufu. You have to talk to him multiple times. You'll need to ask him twice about what he does, then talk to him to give him the karambwanji.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about him...\",\"What do you do?\",\"What do you do with your Karambwan?\",\"I could help collect the bait.\",\"You sound like you could do with the help.\",\"What do you use to catch Karambwan?\",\"Yes!\"],\"i\":[\"Or More Raw Karambwanji (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Get a Vessel from Lubufu by asking what he uses to catch them multiple times. Drop it, and talk to him go get another, then pick up the one you dropped. You can get as many as you want but you need 2 to complete this quest.\",\"s\":[\"What do you use to catch Karambwan?\",\"Yes!\",\"Actually, I've lost my Karambwan vessel.\",\"... a shark ate it!\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a karambwanji on a karambwan Vessel to fill it.\",\"i\":[\"Or More Raw Karambwanji (23)\",\"Karambwan Vessel\"]},{\"t\":\"Go east to Musa Point and buy some Karamjan rum from Zambo at the pub.\",\"i\":[\"Coins (30)\"]},{\"t\":\"Slice a banana with a knife. You can get a banana from one of the trees in the plantation.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Banana\"]},{\"t\":\"Add banana slices to the karamjan rum to make Karamjan rum with banana slices.\",\"i\":[\"Sliced Banana\",\"Karamjan Rum\"]}],\"i\":[\"Small Fishing Net\",\"Sliced banana or a knife\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Helping Tiadeche\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Tiadeche in east Karamja, near the fairy ring DKP. You can teleport off Karamja; the Karamjan rum with banana will not break.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a filled vessel on Tiadeche. Make sure to finish the dialogue with him and accept the karambwan he offers!\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Karambwan Vessel (full)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Tiadeche more, until he asks you to take a Karambwan vessel to his brother Tinsay.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Collecting final items\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pickup some seaweed from Karamja's coast.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Seaweed\"]},{\"t\":\"Get some jogre bones. You can kill the jogres south of Tiadeche.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a tinderbox on the jogre bones to set them on fire.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Wait for the bones to burn, then pick them up.\",\"i\":[\"Burnt Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on a karambwanji.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle And Mortar\",\"Or More Raw Karambwanji (23)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the karambwanji paste on the burnt jogre bones.\",\"i\":[\"Karambwanji paste\",\"Burnt Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"You should still have the raw karambwan Tiadeche gave you. If you lost it or burnt it, fish another next to him with a loaded vessel (65 Fishing), or buy one from the Grand Exchange.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the pasty jogre bones and choose Use, then tap a fire. A plain tap would bury them. You can either make a fire yourself, or use the fire south of Tai Bwo Wannai.\",\"i\":[\"Pasty Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the karambwan for a poison karambwan. Note you may fail this and need to try again.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on a poison karambwan.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle And Mortar\",\"Poison karambwan\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the karambwan paste on a iron or better spear.\",\"i\":[\"Karambwan paste\",\"Iron spear or better (You will lose the spear)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Or More Raw Karambwanji (23)\",\"Pestle And Mortar\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Helping Tamayu and Tinsay\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Tamayu at the mine north of Shilo Village, north-east of fairy ring CKR, by the mining symbol on the map. Talk to him twice and watch the cutscene.\",\"s\":[\"When will you succeed?\",\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Use an agility potion (4) on Tamayu.\",\"i\":[\"Agility Potion (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a poisoned spear on Tamayu.\",\"i\":[\"Iron spear or better (kp) (You will lose the spear)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go on a hunt with Tamayu.\",\"s\":[\"Take me on your next hunt for the Shaikahan.\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill a monkey to get its corpse, there are plenty of monkeys around Karamja and you will need either magic or range to kill one.\",\"i\":[\"Ranged or Magic equipment to kill a level 3 monkey\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your monkey corpse on Tamayu to have him skin it for you.\",\"i\":[\"Monkey Corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your seaweed on your monkey skin to make a seaweed sandwich.\",\"i\":[\"Seaweed\",\"Monkey Skin\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to Cairn Isle, west of Shilo Village, near fairy ring CKR. Climb the rock slide (15 Agility) and cross the bridge. Talk to Tinsay and keep talking, giving him the items he asks for.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the vessel on Tinsay.\",\"i\":[\"Karambwan Vessel\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back to Tiadeche, just north-east of fairy ring DKP. Talk to him, then use the crafting manual on him.\"}],\"i\":[\"Agility Potion (4)\",\"Iron spear or better (kp) (You will lose the spear)\",\"Karamjan Rum (with banana slices)\",\"Marinated Jogre Bones\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finishing the quest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb the ladder in Timfraku's house in Tai Bwo Wannai and talk to him upstairs to finish the quest. The option you choose doesn't matter. Afterwards, talk to each of the brothers in their houses in southern Tai Bwo Wannai for your experience rewards and the ability to cook karambwan.\",\"s\":[\"Oh it was nothing really.\"]}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Tale of the Righteous" -> "{\"n\":\"Tale of the Righteous\",\"items\":[\"A pickaxe\",\"Runes for a few casts of a combat spell\",\"Any ranged weapon + ammo\",\"Rope\"],\"rec\":[\"Xeric's Talisman\",\"Antipoison for lizardmen\"],\"enemies\":[\"Corrupt Lizardman (level 46)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"8000 x Coins\",\"A Memoir Page\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Phileas Rimor in his house, just west of The Cloak and Stagger tavern in Shayzien.\",\"s\":[\"Do you need help with anything?\",\"Yes.\",\"What do you need?\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Discovery\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bring a melee weapon, ranged weapon, and runes for magic attacks and talk to Archeio in the Arceuus Library.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please!\"],\"i\":[\"Any ranged weapon + ammo\",\"Runes for a few casts of a combat spell\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Pagida in the Library Historical Archive.\",\"s\":[\"I have a question about King Shayzien VII.\",\"Yes please.\"]},{\"t\":\"Solve the crystal puzzle. Push the strange device all the way west. Attack it with magic from the north side, then with melee from the south side. Push the device all the way east, then attack it with ranged from the south side.\"},{\"t\":\"Investigate the skeleton in the north cell.\"},{\"t\":\"Report back to Phileas Rimor in Shayzien.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Shiro upstairs in the War Tent located on the west side of the Shayzien Encampment.\"}],\"i\":[\"Any ranged weapon + ammo\",\"Runes for a few casts of a combat spell\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Investigate Quidamortem\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Travel to the top of Mount Quidamortem by the Lovakengj minecart, Xeric's Talisman (Xeric's Honour) or fairy ring BLS, if you have them unlocked. Talk to Historian Duffy, near the water symbol on the minimap.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the crevice west side of Quidamortem.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"A pickaxe\",\"Combat gear for a level 46 corrupt lizardman\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the crevice west side of Quidamortem, ready to fight a corrupted lizardman (level 46).\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"A pickaxe\",\"Combat gear for a level 46 corrupt lizardman\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine the rockfall.\",\"i\":[\"A pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Push the boulder further along the path.\"},{\"t\":\"Attempt to enter the magic gate to the south room. You will need to kill the corrupted lizardman who appears.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the Unstable Altar in the south room.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Historian Duffy.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the crevice west side of Quidamortem again.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Historian Duffy near the Unstable Altar.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Gnosi near the Unstable Altar.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"A pickaxe\",\"Combat gear for a level 46 corrupt lizardman\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Shiro upstairs in the War Tent located on the west side of the Shayzien Encampment.\"},{\"t\":\"Go inside Phileas Rimor's house in Shayzien. He won't be there: just walking in starts the conversation.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Shiro upstairs in the War Tent in west Shayzien to complete the quest.\"}]}]}"
        "Tears of Guthix" -> "{\"n\":\"Tears of Guthix\",\"items\":[\"Rope\",\"Sapphire lantern\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Chisel\",\"Any pickaxe\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,000 Crafting XP\",\"Access to Tears of Guthix\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Making a bowl\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"If you have no sapphire lantern, use a cut sapphire on an unlit bullseye lantern filled with lamp oil.\",\"i\":[\"Cut sapphire\",\"Bullseye lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the hole in Lumbridge Swamp. If it has no rope on it yet, use a rope on it. Light your sapphire lantern, then enter the hole.\",\"i\":[\"Sapphire lantern\",\"Rope\",\"Chisel\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Inside the Lumbridge Swamp Caves, head to the far south-east corner and enter the cave there. You'll cross an agility obstacle on the way. Wall beasts in the wall holes can grab you: wear a spiny helmet, or stop one square before each hole and then run past.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the rocks and talk to Juna.\",\"s\":[\"Okay...\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back up the rocks and use the lit sapphire lantern on one of the light creatures nearby.\",\"i\":[\"Sapphire lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine one of the rocks.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the magic stone.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Magic stone\"]},{\"t\":\"Head east and climb down the rocks to get back to Juna. Talk to her to complete the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Sapphire lantern\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Chisel\",\"Any pickaxe\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Temple of Ikov" -> "{\"n\":\"Temple of Ikov\",\"items\":[\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\",\"Knife to get the boots of lightness\",\"A light source to get the boots of lightness\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Able to survive multiple aggressive spiders (level 61) and demons (level 82)\",\"Fire Warrior of Lesarkus (level 84) with ranged\",\"If siding with Lucien, Guardian of Armadyl (level 43)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"10,500 Ranged XP\",\"8,000 Fletching XP\",\"Boots of Lightness\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Lucien in the pub north of East Ardougne castle.\",\"s\":[\"I'm a mighty hero!\",\"That sounds like a laugh!\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Defeat Lesarkus\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"You must weigh -1kg or less to cross the bridge, both ways. The boots of lightness in the temple take off 4.5kg, so weigh 2kg or less before you wear them. Bank what you can, or drop items just before the bridge and pick them up after.\",\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\",\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\"]},{\"t\":\"Wear the pendant of Lucien. Climb down the ladder into the Temple of Ikov, north of East Ardougne and just south of the Ranging Guild.\",\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the west stairs to get boots of lightness.\",\"i\":[\"A light source to get the boots of lightness\",\"Knife to get the boots of lightness\"]},{\"t\":\"Keep your light source with you, slash the web with your knife, and pick up the boots of lightness in the north east corner. Wear them.\",\"i\":[\"Boots of lightness\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back upstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Wearing the pendant of Lucien, go through the north gate. Cross the bridge in the north room weighing -1kg or less, open the large door and pick up the lever.\",\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Lever\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the lever on the lever bracket in the entrance room.\",\"i\":[\"Lever\"]},{\"t\":\"Pull the lever.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the south gate.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chests in the ice area of this room until you have at least 20 Ice Arrows or more to be safe. If using a throwable weapon (darts, knives) a single Ice Arrow is sufficient. A random chest has the arrows each time.\",\"i\":[\"Sufficient Arrows\"]},{\"t\":\"Return back to the entry room when you have enough arrows.\"},{\"t\":\"Go into the north room. On its north side, long-press the lever and choose to search it for traps, then pull it.\"},{\"t\":\"Try to enter the far north door. Be prepared to fight Lesarkus, who can only be hurt by ice arrows.\",\"i\":[\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Ice arrows\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Fire Warrior of Lesarkus. He can only be hurt by the ice arrows.\",\"i\":[\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Ice arrows\"]}],\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Knife to get the boots of lightness\",\"A light source to get the boots of lightness\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Fire Warrior of Lesarkus (level 84) with ranged\"]},{\"n\":\"Explore deeper\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go all the way north and talk to Winelda there.\",\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Give Winelda 20 unnoted limpwurts.\",\"i\":[\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Optional: follow the path past the skeletons and the level-82 lesser demons to pick up a shiny key. It opens a shortcut into this dungeon from McGrubor's Wood. You don't need it to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Shiny key\"]},{\"t\":\"Push the wall on the north side of this area.\"},{\"t\":\"Choose a side now. To help Lucien, do this step and the next, and you're finished. To help the Guardians of Armadyl, skip to the step starting \\\"Guardians route\\\". Lucien route: pick up the Staff of Armadyl from the table. You may have to kill a Guardian of Armadyl (level 43).\"},{\"t\":\"Lucien route: bring the Staff of Armadyl to Lucien in the house west of the Grand Exchange to finish the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes! Here it is.\"],\"i\":[\"Staff of Armadyl\"]},{\"t\":\"Guardians route: don't take the staff. Remove the pendant of Lucien and talk to a Guardian of Armadyl.\",\"s\":[\"I seek the Staff of Armadyl.\",\"Lucien will give me a grand reward for it!\",\"You're right, it's time for my yearly bath.\",\"Ok! I'll help!\"]},{\"t\":\"Guardians route: equip the Armadyl pendant and defeat Lucien in the house west of the Grand Exchange to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Armadyl pendant\"]}]}]}"
        "Temple of the Eye" -> "{\"n\":\"Temple of the Eye\",\"items\":[\"Bucket of water\",\"Chisel\",\"Pickaxe\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport to Varrock\",\"Teleport to Al Kharid\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"9,210 Runecraft XP\",\"Medium pouch\",\"Access to the Guardians of the Rift minigame\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"An Eye for a Favour\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Wizard Persten east of the Al Kharid gate.\",\"s\":[\"What's a wizard doing in Al Kharid?\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Teleport to Varrock\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Herbert and the Dark Mage\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Mage of Zamorak at the chaos altar in south-east Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help with an amulet.\"],\"i\":[\"Eye Amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Tea Seller near the Varrock east gate.\",\"s\":[\"Could I have a strong cup of tea?\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the strong tea to the Mage of Zamorak in the Varrock chaos temple.\",\"s\":[\"Could you help me with that amulet now?\",\"Yes.\",\"Could you help me with that amulet now?\"],\"i\":[\"Strong Cup of Tea\",\"Bucket of water\",\"Eye Amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Dark Mage in the Abyss. If you've left the Abyss, get back by talking to the Mage of Zamorak in the Wilderness north of Edgeville, and bring only quest items, as other players can kill you there.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help with an amulet.\",\"Could you teleport me to the Abyss?\"],\"i\":[\"Eye Amulet\",\"Bucket of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the six rune energies around the rift (earth, cosmic, death, nature, law and fire) to find their order, which differs per player. A right one turns white and the game says it reacts strangely to your touch. A wrong one does not respond and the order starts again, so touch the ones you've already found again, in order, before you try a new one. Write the order down as you go.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Dark Mage in the Abyss again to get the Abyssal Incantation.\",\"i\":[\"Eye Amulet\"],\"s\":[\"I need your help with an amulet.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\",\"Eye Amulet\"],\"tr\":[\"Teleport to Al Kharid\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Help from Some Wizards\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the fire rift to leave the Abyss, then take the portal out of the Fire Altar. You come out just east of Wizard Persten, who is east of the Al Kharid gate. Talk to her.\",\"s\":[\"About that incantation...\"],\"i\":[\"Eye Amulet\",\"Abyssal Incantation\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Wizard Persten again if the chat has ended, and say yes when she offers to teleport you to the Wizards' Tower.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Abyssal Incantation\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the ladder to the Wizards' Tower basement and bring the Abyssal Incantation to Sedridor.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help with an incantation.\"],\"i\":[\"Abyssal Incantation\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Wizard Traiborn on the Wizards' Tower 1st floor.\",\"s\":[\"I need your apprentices to help with an incantation.\"]},{\"t\":\"Get puzzle from Apprentice Felix.\"},{\"t\":\"Get puzzle from Apprentice Tamara.\"},{\"t\":\"Get puzzle from Apprentice Cordelia.\"},{\"t\":\"Tell Wizard Traiborn the solution to his puzzle is: 11\",\"s\":[\"I think I know what a thingummywut is!\"]}],\"i\":[\"Abyssal Incantation\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Enter the Gate\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Archmage Sedridor in the Wizard's Tower basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Archmage Sedridor to begin the incantation.\",\"s\":[\"Let's do it.\",\"So we're ready to perform the incantation?\"]},{\"t\":\"Watch the cutscene as the portal opens. If it doesn't take you through, enter the portal in the Wizards' Tower basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Apprentice Felix.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Apprentice Tamara.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Apprentice Cordelia.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak with Wizard Persten.\"},{\"t\":\"Experience the vision.\"},{\"t\":\"Listen as Wizard Persten and the apprentices go over what they found. If the talk doesn't start by itself, talk to Wizard Persten.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Guardians of the Rift\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Complete the Guardians of the Rift tutorial.\",\"i\":[\"Pickaxe\",\"Chisel\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Archmage Sedridor in the Wizard's Tower basement to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Pickaxe\",\"Chisel\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The Ascent of Arceuus" -> "{\"n\":\"The Ascent of Arceuus\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Access to Fairy Rings\",\"Battlefront teleports (2)\",\"Xeric's Talisman\",\"Skills necklace\"],\"enemies\":[\"5 Tormented Souls (level 16)\",\"Trapped Soul (level 30)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,500 Hunter XP\",\"500 Runecraft XP\",\"2000 x Coins\",\"A Kharedst's Memoirs page\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Mori, just north of the pub in the centre of Arceuus.\",\"s\":[\"What can I do to help?\",\"We should let someone know about this.\",\"Yes.\",\"Of course I'll help.\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the stairs in Kourend Castle and talk to Councillor Andrews on the east side of the first floor.\",\"s\":[\"There's been a death in Arceuus.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Mori in Arceuus.\",\"s\":[\"What should we do now?\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the Tower of Magic, just west of the Arceuus Library, ready to fight some level 16 Tormented Souls. Enter it, speaking to the Tower Mage outside the doors if you aren't let in.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the tormented souls.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in the Tower of Magic.\"},{\"t\":\"Upstairs, talk to Asteros Arceuus, the son of Lord Trobin Arceuus. If he has nothing new to say, talk to Lord Trobin instead.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"5 Tormented Souls (level 16)\"]},{\"n\":\"Freeing a Soul\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the centre of Mount Karuulm and take the elevator down. Talk to Kaal-Ket-Jor in the dungeon below.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the dungeon. Inspect the ancient grave south-east of Mount Karuulm, just west of the Battlefront and south of the water source. A Battlefront teleport takes you right there.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the tracks west from the grave, inspecting each thing in turn: a bush to the north-west, a plant further west, another plant further west, a tree stump further west, then a plant to the south.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the final plant and kill the Trapped Soul (level 30) which appears.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Kaal-Ket-Jor.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Trapped Soul (level 30)\"]},{\"n\":\"Saving Arceuus\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect the rocks around the Dark Altar, north of Arceuus, until you find a device. Fairy ring CIS or a games necklace to Wintertodt gets you close.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lord Trobin Arceuus to finish the quest.\"}]}]}"
        "The Blood Moon Rises" -> arrayOf(
            "{\"n\":\"The Blood Moon Rises\",\"items\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Vyre noble outfit\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Stamina potion\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"enemies\":[\"Vyrewatch (lvl 103)\",\"Vyrewatch Sentinel (lvl 151)\",\"Monk of Zamorak (lvl 34)\",\"Sanguidae (lvl 106)\",\"Venator (lvl 195)\",\"Ancient feral vyre (lvl 89)\",\"Nylocas (lvl 46, 82, 104)\",\"The Maiden of Sugadinti (lvl 340)\",\"Nylocas Vasilias (lvl 323)\",\"Wyrd (lvl 564)\",\"Lowerniel Drakan (lvl 927, 1063)\"],\"rewards\":[\"4 Quest points\",\"6 x 30,000 Experience Tomes (Any skill above 70)\",\"Sunspear\",\"Access to Vampyrium\",\"Access to Veliaf's pub in Burgh de Rott\",\"Vyres of morytania are now friendly to you without wearing a vyre noble outfit\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Take the boat to the Icyene Graveyard from southern Burgh de Rott, southern Meiyerditch or south-west of Slepe. Then talk to Sarius Guile there to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Icyene Graveyard.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the boat back to Meiyerditch, or use Drakan's medallion to Ver Sinhaza and walk out into Meiyerditch. Go to Old Man Ral's house in south Meiyerditch and go down the trapdoor inside it to the Myreque Hideout. Look for Ivan there.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the makeshift shrine in the Myreque Hideout below Old Man Ral's home in Meiyerditch.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan in the Myreque Hideout below Old Man Ral's home in Meiyerditch while wearing the vyre noble outfit, ready for a fight.\",\"s\":[\"Are you ready to go to Darkmeyer?\",\"I'm ready.\"],\"i\":[\"Vyre noble outfit\",\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the vyrewatches and defend Ivan Strom until he can teleport you both out. Kill the approaching acidic bloodvelds with a ranged weapon. Prioritize the Vyrewatch Sentinels.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan in the Myreque Hideout below Old Man Ral's home in Meiyerditch after escaping.\"}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Fast ranged weapon\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Vyre noble outfit\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Vyrewatch (lvl 103)\",\"Vyrewatch Sentinel (lvl 151)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Veliaf\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom in the graveyard outside the Slepe church.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Roy the bartender in Slepe and ask him about Veliaf's whereabouts.\",\"s\":[\"We're looking for a friend of ours.\"]},{\"t\":\"If Ivan Strom isn't following you, talk to him in the graveyard outside Slepe church. Go down the stairs south of the church's graveyard, head north through the dungeon to Kroy's laboratory, then climb up into Crombwick Manor.\"},{\"t\":\"Help Veliaf kill the vampyres in Crombwick Manor.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf after helping him kill the vampyres in Crombwick Manor.\"}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"The Writings\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go down the trapdoor on the east side of Paterdomus and talk with Ivan in the dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the Squire's journal Ivan just gave you.\",\"i\":[\"Squire's journal\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk with Ivan again after reading the Squire's journal.\"},{\"t\":\"Head west through the dungeon and climb the ladder. Go in through the doors of Paterdomus temple, then kill the monks of Zamorak on the ground floor.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the spiral stairs in the Paterdomus temple and talk to Ivan Strom on the first floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave six inventory spaces free. Search the bookcases on the first floor of the Paterdomus temple for six books, then place them on the plinths in this order from north to south: Pious Proceedings, The Life of Friar, Scruffy notebook, From Misthalin to Morytania, Sarl's journal, Essiandar's notes.\",\"s\":[\"Both.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom after solving the puzzle.\"},{\"t\":\"Read Ivandis' writings.\",\"i\":[\"Ivandis' writings\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom after reading Ivandis' writings.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Infiltrating Castle Drakan\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Stock up on combat gear and supplies, then go down the trapdoor on the east side of Paterdomus. Talk to Ivan Strom in the dungeon to head to Ivandis' tomb.\",\"s\":[\"Lead the way.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Investigate the blockage just south west of Ivandis' coffin.\"},{\"t\":\"Mine the blockage just south west of Ivandis' coffin. If you have no pickaxe, ask Ivan Strom for one.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Head through the cave entrance just south west of Ivandis' coffin, ready for a fight.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Head into the daeyalt processing room through the tunnel to the north-east.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill vampyres. Focus on the Vyrewatch Sentinels. Avoid the Blood orb. Lure Vyrewatches into the Blood orbs to deal massive damage to them.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan after killing the vampyres.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the Castle Drakan cellars through the entry to the north.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the stairs to the Castle Drakan lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Pray at the shrine to let your Drakan's Medallion teleport you here.\",\"i\":[\"Drakan's medallion\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the ominous red portal in the Castle Drakan lobby.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Melee combat gear\"]}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Vyrewatch (lvl 103)\",\"Vyrewatch Sentinel (lvl 151)\"]},{\"n\":\"Escaping Castle Drakan - Half moon key\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go through the east door of the dining room to enter the throne room.\"},{\"t\":\"Investigate the throne.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the second southern-most bust.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the southern-most bust.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the northern-most bust.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the second northern-most bust.\"},{\"t\":\"Investigate the throne again.\"},{\"t\":\"If you did not get the half moon key, search the throne again.\"}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Escaping Castle Drakan - Fixing the clocks\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the room south of the throne room.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the shelves for a small clock hand in the room south of the throne room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the throne room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the hallway west of the dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the western room, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the sparkling crate for a tinderbox.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the stairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the explosive barrel.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the room south of the explosive-barrel room.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the crate for a drakan emblem.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the explosive-barrel room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the northern door, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the northern room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the scratched door on the north wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the drakan emblem on the empty receptacle next to the southern door down the hall, avoiding traps on the way.\",\"i\":[\"Explosive barrel\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Drakan emblem\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter Vanescula's study.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the crate in the north-west corner of Vanescula's study for a large clock hand.\",\"i\":[\"Explosive barrel\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave Vanescula's study.\"},{\"t\":\"Return through the western hallway, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the first-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down to the ground-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the small clock hand on the western Grandfather clock.\",\"i\":[\"Small clock hand\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the western clock.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Set the big hand to 11 and the small hand to 9.\"},{\"t\":\"Close the clock.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the large clock hand on the eastern Grandfather clock.\",\"i\":[\"Large clock hand\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the eastern clock.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Set the big hand to 12 and the small hand to 4.\"},{\"t\":\"Close the clock.\"},{\"t\":\"Get the emblem from the fireplace in the dining room.\",\"s\":[\"Search the fireplace.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Explosive barrel\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Escaping Castle Drakan - Crescent moon key\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the ground-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up to the first-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the northern room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the scratched door on the north wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter Vanescula's study, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the emblem in Vanescula's study.\",\"i\":[\"Drakan emblem\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter Vanescula's chamber.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the explosive barrel on the cracked wall in Vanescula's chamber. If you have lost either item, the tinderbox is in the storage room and the explosive barrel is in the room above it.\",\"i\":[\"Explosive barrel\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole in the wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Remove the emblem from the room with the Venator. Protect from ranged or melee depending on if you're in melee range or not. Turn off your protection prayer when it shrieks.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the hole in the wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave Vanescula's chamber.\"},{\"t\":\"Take emblem from Vanescula's study.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave Vanescula's study.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the emblem out of the receptacle beside the door to Vanescula's study, the door you just came out of. You should now have three emblems.\"},{\"t\":\"Place an emblem in the empty receptacle by the east wall.\",\"i\":[\"Drakan emblem\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern door, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Place an emblem in the empty receptacle at the north door.\",\"i\":[\"Drakan emblem\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter Ranis' parlour.\"},{\"t\":\"Get the ornate skull from the table in the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave Ranis' parlour.\"},{\"t\":\"Remove emblem from the receptacle.\",\"i\":[\"Ornate skull\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the stairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Place an emblem in the receptacle to the west, avoiding the traps on the floor.\",\"i\":[\"Ornate skull\",\"Drakan emblem\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the western door, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Place an emblem in the empty receptacle by the western door.\",\"i\":[\"Drakan emblem\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the emblem gallery.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf Hurtz in the emblem gallery.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the northern part of the emblem gallery where you talked to Veliaf Hurtz.\"},{\"t\":\"The solution to this puzzle is Right Down Right Left Left.\"},{\"t\":\"If solving the chest did not give you the crescent moon key, search the chest again.\"}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Venator (lvl 195)\"]},{\"n\":\"Escaping Castle Drakan - New moon key\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave the emblem gallery through the western door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the south-west kitchen.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the bugs and take the Syringe barrel.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the crate in the south-east corner for a venator stomach.\",\"i\":[\"Syringe barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Retrieve the plug from the sink to the west.\",\"s\":[\"Remove the plug.\"],\"i\":[\"Syringe barrel\",\"Venator stomach\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the larder through the north-west door.\"},{\"t\":\"Put the sink plug into the sink.\",\"i\":[\"Sink plug\"]},{\"t\":\"Turn the tap on in the sink.\",\"s\":[\"Turn the tap on.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the pipe from the now-broken sink.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the broken pipe on the cabinet to reach behind it.\",\"i\":[\"Broken pipe\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the crate for a syringe plunger.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the kitchen.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the sharp kitchen knife on the venator corpse.\",\"i\":[\"Sharp knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the venator corpse for tongs.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the tongs on the sink to get a syringe needle.\",\"i\":[\"Tongs\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine the syringe parts to assemble a syringe.\",\"i\":[\"Syringe barrel\",\"Syringe plunger\",\"Syringe needle\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the empty syringe on the venator stomach in your inventory to draw blood from it.\",\"i\":[\"Empty syringe\",\"Venator stomach\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the full syringe on the chest to receive the left crest half.\",\"i\":[\"Full syringe\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the kitchen for the left crest half.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the kitchen.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the ground-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down to the basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern crescent moon door, ready to fight a Venator.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the Venator. Protect from ranged or melee depending on if you're in melee range or not. Turn off your protection prayer when it shrieks.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the weapons rack to the east for one battleaxe.\",\"s\":[\"Take a battleaxe.\"]},{\"t\":\"Place the battleaxe on the east-most empty statue.\",\"i\":[\"Battleaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the weapons rack to the east for two maces.\",\"s\":[\"Take a mace.\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a mace on the northern statue of the second pair of statues from the west.\",\"i\":[\"Mace\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a mace on the southern statue of the second pair of statues from the west.\",\"i\":[\"Mace\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the weapons rack to the east for a sword.\",\"s\":[\"Take a sword.\"]},{\"t\":\"Place a sword on the western empty statue.\",\"i\":[\"Sword\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest for the right half of a crest.\"},{\"t\":\"Combine the two pieces of crests in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Left crest half\",\"Right crest half\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the basement weapons room.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up to the ground-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the throne room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the study north of the throne room.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the full crest on the fireplace in the study, north of the throne room.\",\"i\":[\"Full crest\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the fireplace for the new moon key in the study, north of the throne room.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Venator (lvl 195)\"]},{\"n\":\"Escaping Castle Drakan - Gilded and gibbous keys\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the throne room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the ground-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down to the basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter through the new moon door to the north to free Safalaan and Vanescula.\"},{\"t\":\"Watch the cutscene.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the gibbous moon key from the bench.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the prison.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up to the ground-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up to the first-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the south-east gibbous moon door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the southern door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the south-east door, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the eastern crate for an ornate knife.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the lever to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the portal to the guest chamber storeroom.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the guest chamber storeroom.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the gibbous moon door on the eastern wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the Venator. Protect from ranged or melee depending on if you're in melee range or not. Turn off your protection prayer when it shrieks.\"},{\"t\":\"Light the fireplace. If you have lost your tinderbox, you can get another one from the storage room, through the hallway west of the ground-floor dining room.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the small lockbox.\",\"i\":[\"Lockbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the small lockbox using the code ⠿ ᴟ ⁘.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the fancy gem on the venator head.\",\"i\":[\"Fancy gem\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the south-west door.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the door using the code SPEAR.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the south-western bookcase.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the mysterious book.\",\"i\":[\"Mysterious book\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the library.\",\"i\":[\"Fancy gem\"]},{\"t\":\"Place the fancy gem on the venator head.\",\"i\":[\"Fancy gem\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the venator head for the ornate hourglass.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave via the western gibbous moon door.\"},{\"t\":\"Place the items on the display case.\",\"i\":[\"Ornate hourglass\",\"Ornate knife\",\"Ornate skull\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the display case for the gilded key.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Venator (lvl 195)\"]},{\"n\":\"Escaping Castle Drakan - Full moon key\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb down to the first-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the northern room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the western gilded door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the north-western door.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the Venator. Protect from ranged or melee depending on if you're in melee range or not. Turn off your protection prayer when it shrieks.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom after killing the Venator.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the northern bookcase for the gilded book.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the gilded book on the western bookcase.\",\"i\":[\"Gilded book\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the gilded bookcase to start rearranging the books.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Rearrange the symbols of the Vampyric Houses into alphabetical order. For help, search the south-eastern bookcase for a vampyre book.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the secret passage.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the full moon key from the table.\"}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Venator (lvl 195)\"]},{\"n\":\"Escaping Castle Drakan - Solid key\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave the secret room through the eastern door.\"},{\"t\":\"If you came out in the gilded bookcase room instead of the small hallway, go through the door to the small gilded-door hallway.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the gilded door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the scratched door on the north wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern door, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the stairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the western door, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern full moon door.\"},{\"t\":\"Search Shelves, taking one of each bottle.\",\"s\":[\"Take a cloudy grey potion.\",\"Take a weightless black potion.\",\"Take a thick red potion.\",\"Take a cold bluish-white potion.\"]},{\"t\":\"Pour the thick red potion into the north-west basin.\",\"i\":[\"Thick red potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Pour the cloudy grey potion into the south-west basin.\",\"i\":[\"Cloudy grey potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Pour the cold bluish-white potion into the south-east basin.\",\"i\":[\"Cold bluish-white potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Pour the weightless black potion into the north-east basin.\",\"i\":[\"Weightless black potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the altar for an ancient symbol.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the south-east door.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the lever.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the portal to the servants' quarters.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the servants' quarters.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern door.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the gibbous moon door at the east end of this hallway to the first-floor dining room, avoiding the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the northern full moon door.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the crate to the north for the ancient shield.\"},{\"t\":\"Combine the ancient shield and ancient symbol.\",\"i\":[\"Ancient shield\",\"Ancient symbol\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the room above the study.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the first-floor dining room.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the first-floor lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up to the display-case room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the gibbous moon door on the eastern wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the south-eastern full moon door.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the shield with symbol on the empty mount on the southern wall.\",\"i\":[\"Shield with symbol\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the mounted shield for the solid key.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Escaping Castle Drakan - Destroying the stockpile\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave through the northern full moon door.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave via the western gibbous moon door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the north-eastern full moon door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern solid door.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the shelves for 2 vials of water, 3 vials of blood, and 3 pure essence. You can destroy all keys, the tinderbox, and the pickaxe to make room in your inventory.\",\"s\":[\"Take a vial of water.\",\"Take a vial of blood.\",\"Take a piece of pure essence.\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine a vial of blood and pure essence on the refiner to make the first vial.\",\"i\":[\"Vial of blood\",\"Pure essence\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine a vial of blood and pure essence on the refiner to make the second vial.\",\"i\":[\"Vial of blood\",\"Pure essence\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine a vial of blood and vial of water on the refiner to make the third vial.\",\"i\":[\"Vial of blood\",\"Vial of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine a pure essence and vial of water on the refiner to make the fourth vial.\",\"i\":[\"Pure essence\",\"Vial of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Pour all the chemical vials into the basin. Fill the basin to the north until it reads 53. If something has gone wrong, overfill the basin and start over.\",\"i\":[\"Chemical vial (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the now-unlocked north-eastern door.\"},{\"t\":\"Destroy the blood stockpile.\"},{\"t\":\"Watch the cutscene.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back the way you came: through the door to the laboratory, through the solid door, then through the full moon door into the display-case room. Climb down to the first-floor lobby, then down again to the ground-floor lobby, and try to leave through the portal there.\"},{\"t\":\"Watch the cutscene.\"}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Let the hunt begin\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave Castle Drakan.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the crank wheel from the house east of the altar, north-west of where you started after the cutscene.\",\"i\":[\"Crank wheel\"]},{\"t\":\"Keep tapping the crank base outside the house to the north-west. Drakan will start chasing you. Run away if he gets too close.\",\"i\":[\"Crank wheel\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the house north of the crank base.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the bookshelf in the house north of the crank base for a dusty book, then read it to retrieve the vitur key.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the dusty book and retrieve the vitur key.\",\"i\":[\"Dusty book\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the north-eastern vitur manor and search the shed in the north-eastern room for a pair of bolt cutters.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the code TOOLS on the shed.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the building east of the altar and pick up the tooth half of key from the table.\",\"i\":[\"Tooth half of key\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the house south of the well. Use the bolt cutters on the chained door on its north side, go in, and pick up the loop half of key from the table.\",\"i\":[\"Loop half of key\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine the loop and tooth half of key into the myrmel key.\",\"i\":[\"Loop half of key\",\"Tooth half of key\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the bucket from the house with the myrmel door, east of the well.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bucket on the well outside the house.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the myrmel house with the bucket of water.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bucket of water on the northern barrel to retrieve the shadum key.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the trapdoor key from the shadum house south-west of the drawbridge.\",\"i\":[\"Trapdoor key\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the bank north-west of the well.\",\"i\":[\"Myrmel key\",\"Trapdoor key\",\"Crank wheel\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the crank base in the bank again and again until the yellow bar fills. Then open the gate.\",\"i\":[\"Trapdoor key\",\"Crank wheel\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the trapdoor.\",\"i\":[\"Trapdoor key\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the western room of the altar house.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the code 35158 on the chest to get the Jovkai key.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the altar room, then head to the smithy in the south-west.\",\"i\":[\"Jovkai key\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the old cog from the table in the smithy in the south-west.\",\"i\":[\"Old cog\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Vanescula by the drawbridge to the south-east. Drakan will chase you when you leave the smithy.\",\"i\":[\"Old cog\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom by the drawbridge if you want supplies. You can drop the bucket.\",\"s\":[\"Could I have those supplies you found?\"],\"i\":[\"Old cog\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Vanescula by the drawbridge to the south-east when you're ready to leave. Drakan will chase you through the woods. Dodge his attacks, protect from melee.\",\"i\":[\"Old cog\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Escaping the forest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Learn to fight Lowerniel Drakan. Protect from melee and dodge his attacks. During this tutorial segment, there will be glimmering sparks that attempt to show you where to tap to dodge his attacks.\"},{\"t\":\"Resupply at the shelter remains in the middle. When you've resupplied, tap the darkwood trees to the west to continue.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the ancient feral vyres. They swap positions and heal, so try to focus one at a time.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter Darkwood trees to continue.\"},{\"t\":\"If you have no axe, take the axe from the stump at the start.\"},{\"t\":\"Make your way through the tangle of trees to the darkwood trees in the north-east, chopping down and climbing over trees on the way. Trees can only be chopped once per direction. Turn off run before you go through the darkwood trees.\"},{\"t\":\"Turn off run. Avoid the Maxilla beasts. Running nearby, walking within 2 tiles, or standing on the maxilla beast will cause them to attack you and probably kill you. The first and third follow predetermined paths, while the second one moves randomly. Be extra careful when passing it.\"},{\"t\":\"Keep walking with run off and leave through the cave in the south-east.\"},{\"t\":\"Continue through the cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the nylocas. Pale ones (white or grey) with melee, and green or yellow ones with a ranged weapon. A nylocas attacked with the wrong style becomes immune to it. You can pick up the Spine near the Venator corpse to use as darts. If you do not kill them fast enough, they explode dealing 15 damage.\"},{\"t\":\"When all nylocas are dead, leave through the trees.\"},{\"t\":\"Wrangle the snakes, then combine them into one long snake. You must stand behind the snake when attempting to wrangle it.\",\"i\":[\"Dead blood serpent (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine the snakes into one long snake.\",\"i\":[\"Dead blood serpent (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the serpent rope on the long branched tree.\",\"i\":[\"Serpent rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Swing across the water with your newly created swing.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the trees.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Mysterious Woman.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Venator (lvl 195)\",\"Ancient feral vyre (lvl 89)\",\"Nylocas (lvl 46, 82, 104)\",\"Lowerniel Drakan (lvl 927, 1063)\"]},{\"n\":\"Curing Safalaan\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Efaritay Hallow in the west room to help her with her son.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the palace through the northern doors and pick some amitire leaves from the amitire plant, just east of the entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back into the palace. Search the shelves next to the sink, south of Efaritay, for a bowl.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the bowl with water.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Bowl\"]},{\"t\":\"Take a potato from the cupboard.\",\"s\":[\"Potato.\"],\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Bowl of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the potato in the bowl of water.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Bowl of water\",\"Potato\"]},{\"t\":\"Take some raw meat from the cupboard.\",\"s\":[\"Raw meat.\"],\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Incomplete stew\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the raw meat on the range.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Incomplete stew\",\"Raw impaler meat\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the cooked meat in the incomplete stew.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Incomplete stew\",\"Cooked meat\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the stew on the range.\",\"i\":[\"Uncooked stew\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the amitire leaves into the stew.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Stew\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the amitire stew, choose Use, then tap Safalaan Hallow. If he won't take it, talk to Efaritay first.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire stew\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Safalaan Hallow after feeding him the stew.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Efaritay Hallow after feeding Safalaan the stew.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Gearing up\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Free up seven inventory spaces. Search the workbench in the east room for a hammer.\",\"s\":[\"Hammer.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the workbench in the east room for a chisel.\",\"s\":[\"Chisel.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the workbench in the east room for a knife.\",\"s\":[\"Knife.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the northern-most crate for some blisterwood logs.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the eastern-most crate for a blessed silver sickle.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the eastern-most chest for a diamond.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Silver sickle (b)\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the unenchanted diamond on the blessed silver sickle.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Silver sickle (b)\",\"Diamond\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the western-most chest for a diamond tablet.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Diamond sickle (b)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enchant the diamond sickle with the enchant diamond tablet.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Diamond sickle (b)\",\"Enchant diamond\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine the blisterwood logs with your newly created enchanted diamond sickle to create an enhanced blisterwood sickle.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Enchanted diamond sickle (b)\"]},{\"t\":\"Take off your blisterwood flail so it is in your inventory, then smith a hallowed flail at the anvil.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Blisterwood sickle (e)\",\"Hallowed marks\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom after smithing the hallowed flail.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the workbench for a knife.\",\"s\":[\"Knife.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the northern-most crate for some blisterwood logs to craft stakes.\"},{\"t\":\"Fletch the logs into stakes.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Ivan Strom after crafting some stakes. You can craft more before continuing if you want to use them during the upcoming fights.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down the stairs at the south end of the palace to the dungeon and talk to Veliaf.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Vanescula Drakan.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf in the dungeon again.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back upstairs and talk to Sugadinti Vitur after helping out Ivan and Veliaf.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Guarding the palace\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get ready for combat. Resupply at the supply table in the kitchen if needed. Speak to the Aranei next to the table if you want to deposit any items into your bank. Then leave the palace.\"},{\"t\":\"Protect the palace. Use the silvthrill ballista you picked up to shoot the portals in the sky. One shot destroys a portal. Keep shooting until the defence ends.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the palace.\"},{\"t\":\"Heal fallen Aranei, repair damaged windows, and repair damaged pillars.\"},{\"t\":\"Pass through the barricade, ready to fight Lowerniel Drakan. You can resupply at the supply table in the kitchen. Protect from melee and dodge his attacks. Dodge at least one tile opposite of the telegraphed motion. When he holds his spear back, step to his side.\"},{\"t\":\"Watch the cutscene.\"}],\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Lowerniel Drakan (lvl 927, 1063)\"]},{\"n\":\"Night at the theatre\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom in the haunted woods.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down the trap",
            "door in the Burgh de Rott inn and talk to Veliaf Hurtz in the Myreque base.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sugadinti Vitur in Burgh de Rott.\"},{\"t\":\"Gear up for theatre of blood. Bring melee gear with a range and mage switch, some food & potions, then talk to Sugadinti Vitur in front of the theatre of blood.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight the waves. Nylocas first, with Protect from Missiles: hit white ones with melee, green ones with ranged and blue ones with magic. Kill the blue ones first and keep away from the white ones.\"},{\"t\":\"Fight the Maiden of Sugadinti with Protect from Magic, using ranged from the south side of the room. Kill the two healers as soon as they appear, or they heal her for 40. Avoid the blood puddles on the ground.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill a second wave of Nylocas the same way. Then fight the Nylocas Vasilias, which changes between white, green and blue: attack it with the matching style and pray against that style (white melee, green ranged, blue magic). Dying here is a normal death, so you would have to get your items back from your gravestone.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sugadinti Vitur.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Nylocas (lvl 46, 82, 104)\",\"The Maiden of Sugadinti (lvl 340)\"]},{\"n\":\"Safalaan's fate\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Head to the abandoned building north-east of Burgh de Rott and talk to Veliaf.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Hallowed flail\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Head to the abandoned building north-east of Burgh de Rott and enter the entry.\"},{\"t\":\"Fight the Wyrd. Pray Protect from Melee against his punches, and turn it off each time he is about to screech, as with the venators. Each punch pushes you back a tile, so keep space behind you.\",\"tip\":\"His attacks repeat: 2 punches, a screech, 2 punches, a screech, then he slams the ground twice on one side. Watch which arm he punches with in the second pair; once he screeches, step one tile to the other side to dodge the slams. Below about 60% health he sometimes covers the ground around him in blood pools instead of screeching: turn your prayer off and run away from him at once, through the gaps the lightning clears. Turn your prayer back on once the blue has gone.\"},{\"t\":\"Search for the escaped wyrd. Leave the lab, climbing over the broken fence, and follow the trail of blood north past Barrows to the walls of Castle Drakan. Inspect the broken fence there.\"}],\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Venator (lvl 195)\",\"Wyrd (lvl 564)\"]},{\"n\":\"Night of the blood moon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf Hurtz in the Burgh de Rott hideout.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sugadinti Vitur in the Burgh de Rott hideout, ready for another fight against Drakan.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Lowerniel Drakan. Protect from melee and dodge his attacks. Dodge at least one tile opposite of the telegraphed motion. When he holds his spear back, step to his side.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf Hurtz.\",\"s\":[\"I'll go now.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom inside Castle Drakan.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sugadinti Vitur inside Castle Drakan.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Efaritay Hallow in Icyene Graveyard.\",\"s\":[\"Icyene Graveyard.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the portal in Icyene Graveyard to get to Vampyrium, ready for the final confrontation.\",\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Melee combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the door, ready to fight Drakan. You can get supplies and deposit items at the chest next to the door.\",\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Melee combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Lowerniel Drakan. Protect from melee and dodge his attacks. Dodge at least one tile opposite of the telegraphed motion. When he holds his spear back, step to his side. Dodge over the blood waves. Protect from magic when he shoots his blood spears. Avoid shadows and blood pools on the ground. Step behind him when he raises his spear above his shoulder. When he rushes around you, dodge in the direction of his first cloud.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Efaritay Hallow in the icyene graveyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Congratulations on finishing the quest!\"}],\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Lowerniel Drakan (lvl 927, 1063)\"]}]}"
        ).joinToString("")
        "The Corsair Curse" -> "{\"n\":\"The Corsair Curse\",\"items\":[\"Combat gear + food to defeat Ithoi (level 34), who uses magic\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Ithoi the Navigator (level 34)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"Access to Yusuf's Bank in the Corsair Cove.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Travel to the cove\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Tock north of Port Sarim.\",\"s\":[\"What kind of help do you need?\",\"Sure, I'll try to help with your curse.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Tock west of Rimmington.\",\"s\":[\"Okay, I'm ready to go to Corsair Cove.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear + food to defeat Ithoi (level 34), who uses magic\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Solve the curse\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb the stairs of the south western hut and talk to Ithoi at the top.\",\"s\":[\"I hear you've been cursed.\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the stairs of the north west hut and talk to Gnocci at the top.\",\"s\":[\"I hear you've been cursed.\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the stairs of the central hut, the first house west of the dock, and talk to Arsen at the top.\",\"s\":[\"I hear you've been cursed.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Colin in the central hut.\",\"s\":[\"I hear you've been cursed.\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the tinderbox next to Gnocci.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the spade planted in the sand by the big tropical tree, directly south of Gnocci's hut, near the water.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Tock on the ship.\",\"s\":[\"Arsen says he gave you a sacred ogre relic.\",\"About that sacred ogre relic...\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the ship and go west of the Corsair Cove to the hole in the middle of four small pillars. Enter it and talk to Chief Tess in the dungeon below.\",\"s\":[\"I've come to return what Arsen stole.\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the cavern. Go to the beach far west of Ithoi's hut, just west of the fishing spot. Dig with your spade on the lump of sand, three squares east of the tropical tree.\",\"s\":[\"Search for the possessed doll and face the consequences.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go look through Ithoi's telescope.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Gnocci in the north west hut.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arsen in the central hut.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Colin in the central hut.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Discover betrayal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Tock on the ship.\",\"s\":[\"I've ruled out all the Corsairs' theories...\",\"So what do I do now?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Gnocci in the north west hut.\",\"s\":[\"I hear it happened straight after dinner.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arsen in the central hut.\",\"s\":[\"I hear Ithoi cooked the meal you ate that night.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ithoi in the south western hut.\",\"s\":[\"I hear you cooked the meal they ate before getting sick.\",\"Maybe because the Captain's thinking of firing you.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ithoi again.\",\"s\":[\"I know you've faked the curse.\",\"I bet I can prove you're well enough to get up.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your tinderbox on the driftwood under Ithoi's hut.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Tock on the ship.\",\"s\":[\"I've seen Ithoi running around. He's not sick at all.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Deal with Ithoi\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Kill Ithoi (level 35).\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Tock on the ship to finish the quest.\",\"s\":[\"I've killed Ithoi for poisoning your crew.\"]}]}]}"
        "The Curse of Arrav" -> "{\"n\":\"The Curse of Arrav\",\"items\":[\"Dwellberries (3)\",\"Ring of life\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Any crossbow\",\"Mith grapple\",\"Insulated boots\"],\"rec\":[\"Stamina potion\",\"Prayer potion\",\"Anti-venom\",\"Crush or ranged combat gear to fight the Golem guard\",\"Ranged or melee combat gear for killing Arrav\",\"Food\",\"Fairy Ring [DLQ]\",\"Trollheim Teleport\",\"Lumberyard teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"Golem guard (lvl 141)\",\"Arrav (lvl 339)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"40,000 Mining XP\",\"40,000 Thieving XP\",\"40,000 Agility XP\",\"Access to Zemouregal's Fort\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Tomb Raiding\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Elias south of Ruins of Uzer to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the tomb south-west of Elias.\",\"i\":[\"Dwellberries (3)\",\"Ring of life\",\"Crush or ranged combat gear to fight the Golem guard\"]},{\"t\":\"Head south to the cave beyond the first room and search the southernmost skeleton for the first Mastaba key.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the central room with the stone boat, east of the entrance. Search the skeleton north-west of the boat for the second Mastaba key.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the south-east corner of the tomb. Search the odd markings to the south to get past the trap, searching again if you fail. Pull the lever, then search the odd markings next to you to get out.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Mastaba Key\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the north-east corner of the tomb, east of the imposing doors. Search the odd markings to the north to get past the trap, searching again if you fail. Pull the lever, then search the odd markings next to you to get out.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Mastaba Key\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the imposing doors, ready to fight the Golem guard.\"},{\"t\":\"Fight the Golem guard. It is weak to crush style weapons. Use Protect from Melee to avoid damage from his attacks. When the screen shakes, step away from him to avoid taking damage.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb the stairs down the tomb basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Cross the coloured floor tiles by walking on either the blue and green tiles or the yellow and red tiles on the south side. Stepping on the wrong pair after you start does moderate damage. On the other side, pull the lever to disable the tiles.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the shelves to the west for an oil-filled canopic jar.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the room to the south with the Tumeken statue and inspect the southern mural.\",\"i\":[\"Oil-filled canopic jar\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the Dwellberries in the Canopic jar.\",\"i\":[\"Oil-filled canopic jar\",\"Dwellberries (3)\",\"Ring of life\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the Ring of life in the Canopic jar.\",\"i\":[\"Canopic jar (oil and berries)\",\"Ring of life\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Elias south of Ruins of Uzer, north-east of the tomb's entrance. Walk out of the tomb, or hop worlds to land just outside it.\",\"i\":[\"Canopic jar (full)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Dwellberries (3)\",\"Ring of life\",\"Crush or ranged combat gear to fight the Golem guard\"],\"tr\":[\"Fairy Ring [DLQ]\"],\"r\":[\"Stamina potion\",\"Prayer potion\",\"Food\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Golem guard (lvl 141)\"]},{\"n\":\"Fort Invasion\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Take the path just north-west of Trollheim towards the ice gate, and enter the cave directly west of the gate. You can use a Trollheim teleport tablet or the GWD Ghommal's Hilt teleport to get close.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Continue through the Trollheim cave, exiting at the Crevasse to the north-west. Use Protect from Melee to avoid taking damage from the Ice Trolls.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Trollweiss cave to the east.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine the rubble to clear a path to the end of the cave. Some piles can only be mined once from each side, so you may have to run around and mine the same rubble from another direction.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the stairs in the room with the red tile floor and talk to Arrav.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arrav.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the room to your east and search the tapestry for something to help you with your heist.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the tapestry in the south of the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Elias south of Ruins of Uzer and ask him for help interpreting the plans.\",\"i\":[\"Base plans\",\"Base key\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"],\"tr\":[\"Fairy Ring [DLQ]\",\"Trollheim Teleport\"],\"r\":[\"Stamina potion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arrav (lvl 339)\"]},{\"n\":\"Hearty Heist\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Head to Zemouregal's base east of Varrock's sawmill and talk to Elias.\",\"s\":[\"Ready when you are.\"],\"i\":[\"Any crossbow\",\"Mith grapple\",\"Ranged or melee combat gear for killing Arrav\",\"Insulated boots\",\"Canopic jar (full)\",\"Base key\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter Zemouregal's base east of Varrock's sawmill.\",\"i\":[\"Any crossbow\",\"Mith grapple\",\"Ranged or melee combat gear for killing Arrav\",\"Insulated boots\",\"Canopic jar (full)\",\"Base key\"]},{\"t\":\"Make your way to the back of Zemouregal's base. Open the gate, the next gate, then the door, which uses your base key, and the gate into the kitchen, shown by the cooking range icon on the map. Wear your insulated boots and enter the sewers by the pipe on the south wall. Follow the path to its end and leave by the pipe there. Protect from Melee against the zombies to avoid most damage.\",\"i\":[\"Base key\",\"Insulated boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the storage room to the south-east.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the western table for some decoder strips.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the chest for the code key.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the code key in your inventory and note its four letters.\",\"i\":[\"Code key\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the storage room, go north to the metal doors and try to open them.\",\"i\":[\"Code key\"]},{\"t\":\"On the decoder strips, set strip 1 to the first letter, strip 2 to the second, strip 3 to the third and strip 4 to the fourth, and note the number each strip shows. Enter those four numbers using the up and down arrows, pressing the right arrow after each number.\",\"i\":[\"Code key\"]},{\"t\":\"Step through the metal doors.\",\"i\":[\"Canopic jar (full)\",\"Any crossbow\",\"Mith grapple\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip your crossbow and mith grapple, then grapple across the pipe above the fire traps.\",\"i\":[\"Canopic jar (full)\",\"Any crossbow\",\"Mith grapple\"]},{\"t\":\"Attempt to take Arrav's heart from the pedestal, ready for a fight with Arrav. Kill zombies as they appear (ranged weapons are handy here). Avoid the venom pools they spawn. Use Protect from Melee to avoid some of the incoming damage. When Arrav throws an axe towards you, step to the side or behind him.\",\"i\":[\"Canopic jar (full)\",\"Ranged or melee combat gear for killing Arrav\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Arrav. Kill zombies as they appear (ranged weapons are handy here). Avoid the venom pools they spawn. Use Protect from Melee to avoid some of the incoming damage. When Arrav throws an axe towards you, step to the side or behind him.\",\"i\":[\"Canopic jar (full)\"]},{\"t\":\"Elias teleports you back to the Uzer Oasis, south of the Ruins of Uzer. Talk to him there to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Base plans\",\"Base key\",\"Any crossbow\",\"Mith grapple\",\"Ranged or melee combat gear for killing Arrav\",\"Insulated boots\",\"Canopic jar (full)\"],\"tr\":[\"Lumberyard teleport\"],\"r\":[\"Stamina potion\",\"Prayer potion\",\"Anti-venom\",\"Food\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arrav (lvl 339)\"]}]}"
        "The Depths of Despair" -> "{\"n\":\"The Depths of Despair\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[\"Skills necklace\",\"Xeric's Talisman\",\"Food (if low level)\",\"Super Energy or Stamina potions\",\"Access to Fairy Rings\"],\"enemies\":[\"Sand Snake (level 36)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,500 Agility XP\",\"4000 x Coins\",\"A Kharedst's Memoirs page\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Lord Kandur Hosidius in the house west of the vinery.\",\"s\":[\"Anything I can help you with?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Chef Olivia in Lord Kandur's kitchen.\"}]},{\"n\":\"The Envoy to Varlamore\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Galana in the Arceuus Library.\"},{\"t\":\"Find the Varlamore Envoy. Ask Galana for the approximate location if you can't find it.\",\"i\":[\"Varlamore Envoy\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the Varlamore Envoy.\",\"i\":[\"Varlamore Envoy\"]}]},{\"n\":\"The Crabclaw Caves\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Crabclaw Caves, south of the Woodcutting Guild near the water, shown by the dungeon icon on the map.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the crevice. Kill a sandcrab for the easy diary while you're here.\"},{\"t\":\"Cross the stepping stones.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb the rocks.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the tunnel at the end.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Artur Hosidius.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the Sand Snake.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Food (if low level)\",\"A Weapon\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Sand Snake (level 36)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finishing up\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Lord Kandur Hosidius and talk to him.\"}]}]}"
        "The Dig Site" -> "{\"n\":\"The Dig Site\",\"items\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Vial\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Cup of tea\",\"Rope (2)\",\"Opal\",\"Charcoal\"],\"rec\":[\"Digsite teleports (2)\",\"Varrock teleports (2)\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"15,300 Mining XP\",\"2,000 Herblore XP\",\"2 x Gold Bars\",\"Ability to clean specimens in the Varrock Museum\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to an Examiner in the Exam Centre south east of Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Can I take an exam?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Curator Haig in the Varrock Museum.\",\"s\":[\"Have you any interesting news?\"],\"i\":[\"Unstamped letter\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to an Examiner in the Exam Centre south east of Varrock.\",\"i\":[\"Sealed letter\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the hilltop north of the Exam Centre with the blue urn. Search the second bush east of the urn for a teddy.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the tray in the south east of the dig site.\",\"i\":[\"Panning tray\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the cup of tea, choose Use, then tap the Panning Guide nearby.\",\"i\":[\"Cup of tea\"]},{\"t\":\"Pan at a panning point in the river, then search the full panning tray. Repeat until you find a special cup.\",\"i\":[\"Panning tray\"]},{\"t\":\"Pickpocket workmen until you get an animal skull and a specimen brush.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the female student in the north west of the Digsite with the teddy in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Teddy\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the female student again to get her exam answer.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the student in an orange shirt in the north east of the Digsite with the special cup in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Special cup\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the student in an orange shirt again to get his exam answer.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the student in a green shirt in the south of the Digsite with the animal skull in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Animal skull\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the student in a green shirt again to get his exam answer.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to an Examiner in the Exam Centre to take the first test.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I certainly am.\",\"The study of the earth, its contents and history.\",\"All that have passed the appropriate Earth Sciences exam.\",\"Gloves and boots to be worn at all times; proper tools must be used.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Cup of tea\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Exam 2\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the female student in the north west of the Digsite.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the student in an orange shirt in the north east of the Digsite.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the student in a green shirt in the south of the Digsite.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to an Examiner in the Exam Centre to take the second test.\",\"s\":[\"I am ready for the next exam.\",\"Samples taken in rough form; kept only in sealed containers.\",\"Finds must be carefully handled, and gloves worn.\",\"Always handle with care; strike cleanly on its cleaving point.\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Exam 3\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the female student in the north west of the Digsite.\",\"i\":[\"Opal\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the female student again.\",\"i\":[\"Opal\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the student in an orange shirt in the north east of the Digsite.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the student in a green shirt in the south of the Digsite.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to an Examiner in the Exam Centre to take the third test.\",\"s\":[\"I am ready for the last exam...\",\"Samples cleaned, and carried only in specimen jars.\",\"Brush carefully and slowly using short strokes.\",\"Handle bones very carefully and keep them away from other samples.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Opal\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Discovery\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the cupboard on the south wall of the west room of the Exam Centre for a specimen jar.\"},{\"t\":\"Dig in the north east dig spot in the Digsite until you get a talisman.\",\"i\":[\"Trowel\",\"Specimen jar\",\"Specimen brush\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Archaeological expert in the Exam Centre.\",\"i\":[\"Ancient talisman\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the invitation letter on a Digsite workman you can pickpocket. The workman by the west winch won't take it. If you lost the letter, ask the Archaeological expert in the Exam Centre for another.\",\"s\":[\"I lost the letter you gave me.\"],\"i\":[\"Invitation letter\"]}],\"i\":[\"Trowel\",\"Specimen brush\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Digging deeper\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the west winch.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the west winch.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up some arcenia root, just north of the rope.\",\"i\":[\"Arcenia root\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the bricks to the east of the rope.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb back to the surface.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the north east winch.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the north east winch.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Doug Deeping.\",\"s\":[\"How could I move a large pile of rocks?\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave Doug's cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the key on the chest in the tent in the south of the Digsite.\",\"i\":[\"Chest key\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a trowel on the centre barrel just west of the chest's tent.\",\"i\":[\"Trowel\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a vial on the barrel west of the chest's tent.\",\"i\":[\"Vial\"]},{\"t\":\"Don't just tap the liquid, or you'll empty it. Long-press the unidentified liquid, choose Use, then tap the Archaeological expert in the Exam Centre.\",\"i\":[\"Unidentified liquid\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the powder on the Archaeological expert in the Exam Centre.\",\"i\":[\"Chemical powder\"]},{\"t\":\"Mix the nitroglycerin and ammonium nitrate together.\",\"i\":[\"Nitroglycerin\",\"Ammonium nitrate\"]},{\"t\":\"Grind charcoal with a pestle and mortar.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Charcoal\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the ground charcoal to the vial.\",\"i\":[\"Ground charcoal\",\"Mixed chemicals\"]},{\"t\":\"Add arcenia root to the vial.\",\"i\":[\"Arcenia root\",\"Mixed chemicals\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the rope on the west winch.\",\"i\":[\"Chemical compound\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the compound on the bricks to the east of the rope, not on the rocks.\",\"i\":[\"Chemical compound\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a tinderbox on the bricks to the east of the rope.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the stone tablet in the south room.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the tablet on the Archaeological expert in the Exam Centre to complete the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Stone tablet\"]}],\"i\":[\"Rope (2)\",\"Trowel\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Vial\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Charcoal\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The Eyes of Glouphrie" -> "{\"n\":\"The Eyes of Glouphrie\",\"items\":[\"Bucket of sap\",\"Mud rune\",\"Maple logs\",\"Oak logs\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Pestle and mortar\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Evil creature (x6)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"12,000 Magic XP\",\"2,500 Woodcutting XP\",\"6,000 Runecraft XP\",\"250 Construction XP\",\"A Crystal Saw Seed\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Learning\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go talk to Brimstail in his cave in west Tree Gnome Stronghold.\",\"s\":[\"What's that cute creature wandering around?\",\"Yes, that sounds fascinating...\",\"Oh, yes I love a bit of History.\",\"Of course!\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the singing bowl in the west room.\"},{\"t\":\"Attempt to unlock oaknock's machine in the north of the cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brimstail again.\",\"s\":[\"I've had a look in the other room now.\",\"Of course, I'd love to!\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to Hazelmere's hut east of Yanille (Fairy Ring CLS), climb the ladder and talk to him upstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brimstail.\",\"s\":[\"I've visited Hazelmere, he told me all sorts of interesting things.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the pestle and mortar on some mud runes.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Mud rune\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the ground mud runes on the bucket of sap.\",\"i\":[\"Ground mud runes\",\"Bucket of sap\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the magic glue on oaknock's machine in the north of the cave.\",\"i\":[\"Magic glue\",\"Oak logs\",\"Maple logs\",\"Saw\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brimstail.\",\"s\":[\"I think I've fixed the machine now!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brimstail twice more for more discs. If you need more and he won't give you any, drop your discs and talk to him again. You can also swap discs at the exchanger next to the machine.\",\"s\":[\"I can't work out what to do with these discs!\"]},{\"t\":\"Unlock the machine.\"},{\"t\":\"Operate the machine.\"}],\"i\":[\"Bucket of sap\",\"Mud rune\",\"Maple logs\",\"Oak logs\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Pestle and mortar\"]},{\"n\":\"Kill the spies\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Brimstail again.\",\"s\":[\"Phew! I've got that machine working now. What do I need to do now?\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the evil creature next to Brimstail.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the evil creature next to the Stronghold's entrance. It must die inside the walls: if you killed it outside, wait for it to reappear and kill it again. Wait for its death animation to finish before you leave.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the evil creature next to the Stronghold's Spirit Tree.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the evil creature by the giant tortoises north-west of the Grand Tree, in the pen north of the swamp.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the evil creature at the top of the Grand Tree.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the evil creature next to Narnode.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Narnode to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Evil creature (x6)\"]}]}"
        "The Feud" -> "{\"n\":\"The Feud\",\"items\":[\"Coins (800)\",\"Leather or Graceful Gloves\",\"Combat Gear bring Range or Mage Gear if safe spotting.\"],\"rec\":[\"Ring of dueling\",\"Pollnivneach teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"Bandit Champion (level 70) - Safespottable\",\"Tough Guy (level 75) - Safespottable\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"15,000 Thieving XP\",\"500 x Coins\",\"Oak Blackjack\",\"Desert Disguise\",\"Willow Blackjack\",\"An Adamant Scimitar\",\"Ability to blackjack.\",\"Access to the Rogue Trader minigame\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting out\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali Morrisane in Al Kharid to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Are you really the greatest salesman in the world?\",\"If you are, then why are you still selling goods from a stall?\",\"I'd like to help you, but...\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins\"]},{\"n\":\"Pollnivneach\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali Morrisane again and buy a Kharidian Headpiece and a Fake Beard to create a disguise.\",\"s\":[\"Okay.\"],\"i\":[\"Coins\"]},{\"t\":\"Create a disguise by using the Kharidian Headpiece on the Fake Beard.\",\"i\":[\"Kharidian Headpiece\",\"Fake Beard\"]},{\"t\":\"If you don't have a Shantay pass, buy one from Shantay, just north of the gate. Go through Shantay Pass.\",\"i\":[\"Shantay Pass\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the rug merchant and travel to Pollnivneach via magic carpet.\",\"s\":[\"Pollnivneach\"],\"i\":[\"Coins\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the bar in the south-east of Pollnivneach. Buy 3 beers from Ali the Barman and use them on Drunken Ali to get him to explain where his son is. Talk with him in full between beers.\",\"i\":[\"Beer (3)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins\"]},{\"n\":\"Find the beef between the two factions\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to a Menaphite Thug, just west of the bar, to figure out how their dispute started with the bandits.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to a bandit by the general store in the north of Pollnivneach to figure out their issues with the Menaphites.\"},{\"t\":\"With 500 coins and 2 free inventory spaces, talk to Ali the Camel Man at the camel store, just north-west of the bar, to try and get two camels to solve the dispute.\",\"s\":[\"Are those camels around the side for sale?\",\"What price do you want for both of them?\",\"Would 500 gold coins for the pair of them do?\"]},{\"t\":\"Tell the bandits that the Menaphites have agreed to return the camel.\"},{\"t\":\"Tell the Menaphites that the bandits have agreed to return the camel.\"}],\"i\":[\"Coins\"]},{\"n\":\"First job\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali the Operator in the big purple tent in the south-west of Pollnivneach to get a job from him.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, of course, those bandits should be taught a lesson.\"]},{\"t\":\"Try to pickpocket a villager once. It is meant to fail. Then talk to Ali the Operator and choose \\\"Yeah, I could do with a bit of advice.\\\"\"},{\"t\":\"Find a street urchin around the bar or the town well, close to a villager, and pay him 10 coins to distract the villager. Quickly pickpocket the villager with the flashing arrow over his head, from behind. If it fails, talk to the urchin again.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali the Operator to get a blackjack.\",\"s\":[\"Yeah, I could do with a bit of advice.\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip the oak blackjack. Lure a villager to a secluded place or an empty building, knock them out and then pickpocket them.\",\"i\":[\"Oak Blackjack\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins\"]},{\"n\":\"Second job\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali the Operator to get the second job.\"},{\"t\":\"Wear your desert disguise and leather or graceful gloves. Hide behind the large cactus near the mayor's house, the large house in the east of town by the fountain.\",\"i\":[\"Leather or Graceful Gloves\",\"Desert Disguise\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the keys on the door of the mayor's house.\",\"i\":[\"Keys\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the painting to reveal the safe. Enter the code 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8.\"},{\"t\":\"Give Ali the Operator the jewels to get your final task from him.\"}],\"i\":[\"Desert Disguise\",\"Leather or Graceful Gloves\"]},{\"n\":\"Rising up\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to a Menaphite member to find the traitor.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali and tell him you have found the traitor.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali the Barman to find out where Traitorous Ali is.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for Traitorous Ali.\",\"No thanks I'm ok.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali the Hag, north-west of the well in the middle of town, to ask her to make some poison for you.\"},{\"t\":\"Use coins on the snake charmer's money pot, just south of the bar, to get a snake charm and a snake basket. You need 2 free inventory spaces.\",\"s\":[\"Wow, a snake charmer. Can I have a go? Can I have a go? Please?\"],\"i\":[\"Coins\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the Snake Charm on a snake, just north of Ali the Operator's big purple tent, to capture it.\",\"i\":[\"Snake Charm\",\"Snake Basket\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the snake to Ali the Hag.\",\"i\":[\"Snake Basket (Full)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali the Kebab Salesman, north-west of the well in the middle of town, to get a special sauce to use.\",\"s\":[\"Would you sell me that bottle of special kebab sauce?\",\"No thanks, I'm good.\"]},{\"t\":\"If you have no empty bucket, pick one up just north-east of the trough.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the Red Hot Sauce on the trough behind the camel shop and wait for a Camel to poop out the dung. If you plan to do \\\"My Arm's Big Adventure\\\" or \\\"Forgettable Tale of a Drunken Dwarf\\\" then you may want to grab four more Ugthanki dung.\",\"i\":[\"Red Hot Sauce\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bucket on the dung. Only pick up brown/Ugthanki dung.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali the Hag and give her the dung.\",\"i\":[\"Dung\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the poison on the beer glass on the table in the bar to kill Traitorous Ali.\",\"i\":[\"Hag's Poison\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali the Operator and tell him he is dead.\"}],\"i\":[\"Coins\"]},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Menaphite Leader, just outside Ali the Operator's big purple tent, and prepare for a fight against a tough guy. You can safespot him inside the tent by using a chair. If he doesn't appear, talk to the Menaphite Leader again.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to a villager and they will be angry you broke the balance of power.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Bandit Leader, who wanders around the magic carpet station in the north of town, and be prepared to fight a Bandit Champion. You can safe spot him with the stool in the house to the east. If he doesn't appear, talk to the Bandit Leader again.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to a villager and they will be angry still.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali the Mayor, by the well in the centre of town, and get your due congratulations.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ali Morrisane in Al Kharid to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat Gear bring Range or Mage Gear if safe spotting.\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Bandit Champion (level 70) - Safespottable\",\"Tough Guy (level 75) - Safespottable\"]}]}"
        "The Final Dawn" -> "{\"n\":\"The Final Dawn\",\"items\":[\"Any type of bone or raw meat\",\"Melee Combat gear\"],\"rec\":[\"Ranged/Magic Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions (3)\",\"Pendant of ates\",\"Quetzal whistle\",\"Civitas illa fortis teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"Emissary Enforcer (lvl-196)\",\"Chimalli (lvl-160) and Lucius (lvl-160)\",\"Multiple waves of Twilight Emissaries (lvl-70 to lvl-90)\",\"Ennius Tullus (lvl-306)\",\"Augur Metzli (lvl-396)\"],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"55,000 Thieving XP\",\"25,000 Fletching XP\",\"25,000 Runecraft XP\",\"55,000 Experience Lamps (Combat Skills)\",\"Arkan blade\",\"The Arkan Blade\",\"Access to Mokhaiotl\",\"Access to Crypt of Tonali\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Servius in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Take a quetzal to the Salvager Overlook and run south, or use the pendant of ates to teleport to the Twilight Temple. If you don't have emissary robes, search the chest in the south of the Tower of Ascension, south of Salvager Overlook. You need 4 free inventory spaces.\"},{\"t\":\"Wear the emissary robes, then enter the Twilight Temple, south-east of Salvager Overlook.\",\"i\":[\"Emissary robes\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the stairs in the temple. The passphrase is 'Final' and 'Dawn'.\",\"s\":[\"Final.\",\"Dawn.\"],\"i\":[\"Emissary robes\",\"Combat weapon\",\"Food\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the far eastern room. Avoid the patrolling guard.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the bed in the south room.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the drawers in the north room with the key from the bed. The canvas piece is in these drawers or the ones in the south room. If you found it here, skip the next step.\"},{\"t\":\"Only if the north room's drawers had no canvas piece: open the drawers in the south room, where the bed is.\"},{\"t\":\"Use canvas piece on the painting in the east of the middle room of the eastern rooms.\",\"i\":[\"Canvas piece\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the passage behind the painting.\",\"s\":[\"Enter the passage.\"]},{\"t\":\"Picklock the chest in the hidden room. Tap the slots above the tumblers to move them, then tap confirm. Leave any tumbler that shows green, move the others up by one and confirm again. It takes at most eight tries. Be ready for a fight afterwards.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat the enforcer. You cannot use prayers, or teleport out. Step away each time he goes to attack, and step behind him or sideways if he says 'Traitor!' or 'Thief!'.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the emissary scroll.\",\"i\":[\"Emissary scroll\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the emissary scroll.\",\"i\":[\"Emissary scroll\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat weapon\",\"Food\"],\"tr\":[\"Civitas illa fortis teleport\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"The hideout\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the queen on the top floor of the Sunrise Palace.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Vibia south of Civitas illa Fortis' west bank.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the window on the east side of the house north of Captain Vibia, and then enter it.\",\"s\":[\"Force open the window.\"],\"i\":[\"Any type of bone or raw meat\"]},{\"t\":\"Use bones or some raw meat on the dog to calm it down.\"},{\"t\":\"Pet the dog to see the code for the door. Open the door using the code 'GUS'.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the sack of potatoes (3).\",\"i\":[\"Potatoes (?)\"]},{\"t\":\"Empty the sack of potatoes.\",\"i\":[\"Potatoes (?)\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the knife.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the coin purse.\",\"i\":[\"Coin purse\"]},{\"t\":\"Empty the coin purse.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the top floor.\",\"s\":[\"Climb up.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the knife on the potted fan on the roof that is a lighter, off-green colour and looks diseased, to get a branch.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the empty coin purse on the plant pot in the north-west of the roof with sand in it.\",\"i\":[\"Empty coin purse\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the branch on the coin purse.\",\"i\":[\"Branch\",\"Sandy coin purse\"]},{\"t\":\"Show Captain Vibia the empty sack and makeshift blackjack.\",\"s\":[\"I'll get searching.\"],\"i\":[\"Empty sack\",\"Makeshift blackjack\"]},{\"t\":\"Search Janus.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the basement in the hideout.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the queen in the hideout basement.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, let's go.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any type of bone or raw meat\"]},{\"n\":\"The dwarves\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter Cam Torum.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Attala in Cam Torum's marketplace.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Servius in the house east of the bank in Cam Torum.\"},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs in the house.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the beer. Hop worlds if it's missing.\",\"i\":[\"Beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Go downstairs in the house.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the beer on Galna.\",\"i\":[\"Beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the house's basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the south-west cabinet for wizard's mind bomb.\",\"s\":[\"More options...\",\"Wizard's mind bomb.\"]},{\"t\":\"Place wizard's mind bomb on the south-east barrel.\",\"i\":[\"Wizard's mind bomb\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south-west cabinet for a beer.\",\"s\":[\"Beer.\"]},{\"t\":\"Place beer on the north barrel.\",\"i\":[\"Beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south-west cabinet for steamforge brew.\",\"s\":[\"More options...\",\"Steamforge brew.\"]},{\"t\":\"Place steamforge brew on the south-west barrel.\",\"i\":[\"Steamforge brew\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south-west cabinet for dwarven stout.\",\"s\":[\"Previous options...\",\"Dwarven stout.\"]},{\"t\":\"Place dwarven stout on the south barrel.\",\"i\":[\"Dwarven stout\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the beer from on top of the barrel near the staircase.\",\"i\":[\"Beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Drink a beer.\",\"i\":[\"Beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Place empty glass on the east barrel.\",\"i\":[\"Empty glass\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the fireplace.\",\"s\":[\"Pull it.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole in the south-east corner of the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Watch the cutscene with Ennius.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back through the hole into the Teumo's basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Servius in the house basement.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Ancient keys\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Neypotzli entrance in the far north of the cavern.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Eyatlalli.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the north-east entrance to the streambound cavern.\"},{\"t\":\"In the Streambound Cavern, stand about nine squares north and one square east of the cooking stove at the camp, then tap Locate on the keystone fragment. If nothing happens, move one square and try again until it reacts.\",\"i\":[\"Keystone fragment\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the earthbound cavern via the north cave entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Keystone fragment\"]},{\"t\":\"In the Earthbound Cavern, go to where you trap lizards and stand about five squares west of the bush you rustle, then tap Locate on the keystone fragment. If nothing happens, move one square and try again until it reacts.\",\"i\":[\"Keystone fragment\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the ancient prison via the large entrance in the south-west of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Keystone fragment\"]},{\"t\":\"In the Ancient Prison, go to the south-east room with a statue and tap Locate on the keystone fragment. If nothing happens, move one square and try again until a glowing symbol appears.\",\"i\":[\"Keystone fragment\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the glowing symbol that appeared. Be ready for a fight.\",\"i\":[\"Melee Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the cultists. Step into golden circle to avoid the mage's special. Avoid the arrow barrage from the ranger. When you defeat one of the cultists, the other will become enraged.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Attala.\"}],\"i\":[\"Melee Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions (3)\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Crypt of Tonali\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Servius in Tal Teklan in the Tlati Rainforest, in the north-west of Varlamore. The easiest way here is via quetzal.\",\"i\":[\"Melee Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions (3)\",\"Ranged/Magic Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the passageway in the tree south-east of Tal Teklan, into the Crypt of Tonali.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat the attacking cultists.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Ennius. Protect from Melee. Stand on the circles to avoid damage when they appear. Avoid the lines of yellow star icons on the floor when they appear. When they reach 0 health, they'll gain some back and do more damage.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down both flights of stairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Step onto the red teleporter to the north-east.\"},{\"t\":\"Step onto the blue teleporter to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Step on the red teleporter to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Step onto the blue teleporter to the north-west.\"},{\"t\":\"Step on the red teleporter to the north.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb the rope up to the north-east.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the strange platform nearby to activate a shortcut lift from the surface.\"},{\"t\":\"Step on the red teleporter to the north-east of the lift.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the statue in the middle of the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the urns in the area for some essence.\"},{\"t\":\"Solve the sun puzzle. Inspect the statue in the middle of the room. The first word is the altar Itzla must stand at, the second word is the altar where you imbue the essence, and the third word is not used. The words mean: Oma = 2, Naui = 4, Kuli = 5, Chaki = 6, Koma = 7, Ueai = 8. The altars go clockwise: 1 north-east, 2 east, 3 south-east, 4 south, 5 south-west, 6 west, 7 north-west, 8 north.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Itzla, ask him to go to an altar and pick his direction (look under the more options choice if it isn't listed). Then imbue the essence at your own altar. A wrong try costs 5 damage. Inspect the statue again for the next words. The puzzle is done after three successful imbues, and you can search the urns if you run out of essence.\",\"s\":[\"Can you go to an altar for me?\"]},{\"t\":\"Step on the red teleporter to go back up to the main area.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the blue teleport to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Move-Itzla to the platform north of him by tapping on it to see which torches around the room light up.\"},{\"t\":\"Move-Itzla to the platform south of him by tapping on it to see which torches around the room light up.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull some tree roots.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the old tools for a knife blade. Avoid the lines of fire by having Itzla go on the north platform to remove dark flames, and the south one for light flames.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the knife blade on the ancient roots to fletch them into kindling.\",\"i\":[\"Ancient roots\"]},{\"t\":\"Count the lit braziers with Itzla on the north platform, then count them again with him on the south platform. Add the two numbers together and put that much root kindling into the statue.\",\"i\":[\"Root kindling\"]},{\"t\":\"Repeat this two more times. Count the braziers again each round, as the number changes.\"},{\"t\":\"Step on the blue teleporter to leave the moon puzzle room.\"}],\"i\":[\"Melee Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions (3)\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Doom\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Try to open the door to the north. Be ready for the final boss!\",\"i\":[\"Ranged/Magic Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Approach Augur Metzli, ready for a fight.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Metzli. Start with Protect from Missiles. Use the gaps in the wave attacks to dodge the walls as they approach. If circles appear, stand where they appeared. Every time a teleporter appears to jump over a wave, the boss will switch attack styles alternating between mage and ranged. The boss will enter an enrage phase, it is much easier to range but melee is still possible. Attack the boss and then immediately tap on the next teleporter to avoid taking damage.\"},{\"t\":\"Watch Metzli's cutscene.\"},{\"t\":\"Head west from where you fought Metzli and go down the stairs to the lower level.\"},{\"t\":\"Cross the lower level, climb back up on the far west side, then go north, east and north again to the entrance at the north end of the area. Enter it. With 75 Agility you can go back up and cross the pillar shortcut straight to the north instead.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the ralos pillar south-west of the north door.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the ranul pillar south-east of the north door.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the entrance in the north of the area again.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the skeleton west of the north door.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the stone tablet.\",\"i\":[\"Stone tablet\"]},{\"t\":\"You return to the Crypt of Tonali automatically. Talk to Prince Itzla Arkan there, near where you fought Ennius, to complete the quest! If you're outside, enter through the passageway in the tree south-east of Tal Teklan.\"}],\"i\":[\"Ranged/Magic Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions (3)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Augur Metzli (lvl-396)\"]}]}"
        "The Forsaken Tower" -> "{\"n\":\"The Forsaken Tower\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[\"Games necklace for accessing Wintertodt\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"500 Mining XP\",\"500 Smithing XP\",\"6000 x Coins\",\"A page for Kharedst's memoirs.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Lady Vulcana Lovakengj in the south of Lovakengj.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"I'm looking for a quest.\",\"I'll get going.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Undor at the entrance to Wintertodt. If you've never talked to Ignisia before, you'll need to talk to her first. She is just north east of Undor. You can teleport there using a Games Necklace, or run north through Arceuus.\",\"s\":[\"I've been sent to help you.\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"To the Forsaken Tower\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Forsaken Tower, west of Lovakengj.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the display case in the Forsaken Tower.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Furnace puzzle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the cupboard on the north wall for a tinderbox.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the cupboard in the south west corner of the north room for a 5 and an 8 gallon jug.\",\"s\":[\"Take both.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the 5-gallon jug on the Coolant Dispenser.\",\"s\":[\"5-gallon jug.\"],\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the 5-gallon jug on the 8-gallon jug.\",\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\",\"8-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the 5-gallon jug on the Coolant Dispenser.\",\"s\":[\"5-gallon jug.\"],\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the 5-gallon jug on the 8-gallon jug.\",\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\",\"8-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Check the 8-gallon jug and empty it.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the 5-gallon jug on the 8-gallon jug.\",\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\",\"8-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the 5-gallon jug on the Coolant Dispenser.\",\"s\":[\"5-gallon jug.\"],\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the 5-gallon jug on the 8-gallon jug.\",\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\",\"8-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the 5-gallon jug on the Coolant Dispenser.\",\"s\":[\"5-gallon jug.\"],\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the 5-gallon jug on the 8-gallon jug.\",\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\",\"8-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the 5-gallon jug, which should contain 4 gallons, on the Furnace Coolant.\",\"i\":[\"5-gallon jug\"]},{\"t\":\"Light the furnace.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Power puzzle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb down the ladder into the tower's basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Search a crate in the north eastern cell for a generator crank\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the steam generator in the south of the room\",\"s\":[\"Start the generator.\"],\"i\":[\"Generator crank\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the power grid.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Solve the power puzzle.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Potion puzzle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the tower's 1st floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the refinery.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the cupboard on the east wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the old notes.\",\"i\":[\"Old notes\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the Potions (refinery) puzzle page, pick how \\\"Cleansing fluid\\\" appears in the old notes, and take that numbered fluid from the table. The right number differs per player. A wrong fluid deals 25 or more damage and poisons you.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the fluid on the refinery.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Activate the refinery.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Altar puzzle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb up the ladder to the top floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Move the four energy discs between the pylons. For each move, take a disc from the first pylon and put it on the second. In order: west to east, west to centre, east to centre, west to east, centre to west, centre to east, west to east, west to centre, east to centre, east to west, centre to west, east to centre, west to east, west to centre, east to centre.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get the hammer from the display case in the Forsaken Tower.\"},{\"t\":\"Return Dinh's Hammer to Undor at the entrance to Wintertodt.\",\"s\":[\"Let's talk about my quest.\",\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Dinh's hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Lady Vulcana in south Lovakengj to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The Fremennik Exiles" -> "{\"n\":\"The Fremennik Exiles\",\"items\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Mirror shield\",\"2x kegs of beer or 650 coins\",\"Molten glass\",\"Astral runes (100)\",\"Pet rock\",\"Rune thrownaxe, or a friend to help enter Waterbirth Isle Dungeon\",\"Fishing rod\",\"Fremennik shield\",\"Ice gloves or smiths gloves(i)\",\"Hammer\",\"Glassblowing pipe\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Seal of passage\"],\"rec\":[\"Food\",\"Rellekka teleports\",\"Restore potions\"],\"enemies\":[\"Basilisk Youngling (level 53)\",\"Basilisk (level 61)\",\"Monstrous Basilisk (level 135)\",\"Typhor (level 218)\",\"The Jormungand (level 363)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"50,000 Slayer XP\",\"50,000 Crafting XP\",\"30,000 Runecraft XP\",\"V's Shield\",\"Access to the Isle of Stone\",\"Ability to kill Basilisk Knights as a slayer task\",\"Ability to craft and equip the Neitiznot faceguard.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Investigating\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Buy 2 kegs of beer from Thora in Rellekka. She will be unavailable to trade later in the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Coins (650)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brundt in Rellekka's longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask for a quest.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Freygerd in north Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Mirror shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip your mirror shield, then search the sand pit near Freygerd, ready to fight a basilisk youngling.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Mirror shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the Basilisk Youngling.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Mirror shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the letter.\",\"i\":[\"Unsealed letter\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the letter.\",\"i\":[\"Unsealed letter\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the rockslide west of the sand pit.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the boxes south of Freygerd.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Freygerd with the items you found.\",\"i\":[\"Unsealed letter\",\"Fang\",\"Venom gland\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Brundt in Rellekka's longhall. If he gives you a note, read it, then talk to him again until the cutscene plays.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the investigation.\",\"Ask about the Jormungand.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brundt south east of Rellekka, asking him all available questions.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Mirror shield\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Basilisk Youngling (level 53)\",\"Basilisk (level 61)\"]},{\"n\":\"A Fremennik Shield\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"You can get a fremennik shield from dagannoths in Waterbirth Dungeon or Bardur in Waterbirth Dungeon for 150k, or for free with the Ring of Charos(a). You'll need a friend to get there, or a rune thrownaxe and a pet rock.\",\"i\":[\"Ring of Charos(a) or 150k coins\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ring of Charos(a) or 150k coins\",\"Pet rock\",\"Rune thrownaxe, or a friend to help enter Waterbirth Isle Dungeon\"]},{\"n\":\"Making Lunar Glass\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Baba Yaga in the chicken-legged house in the north of Lunar Isle's town.\",\"s\":[\"I was wondering if you could help me make Lunar Glass?\"],\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\",\"Molten glass\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the Astral Altar in the south-east of Lunar Isle and use it, with the molten glass (i) and 100 astral runes in your inventory, to make some lunar glass.\",\"i\":[\"Molten glass (i)\",\"Astral runes (100)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Seal of passage\",\"Molten glass\",\"Astral runes (100)\"]},{\"n\":\"Making V's Sigil\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the mine in the north east of Lunar Isle.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine 3 lunar ores from the stalagmites in the area.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Smelt the lunar ore into bars at any furnace.\",\"i\":[\"Lunar ore (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Make the V sigil on any anvil.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Lunar bar (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the strange altar on the small peninsula south-west of Rellekka. Interact with the altar to summon the Fossegrimen, then talk to her to enchant the sigil.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about V's Sigil.\"],\"i\":[\"V sigil\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"n\":\"Making a Polishing Rock\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect the geyser north of the Mountain Camp.\",\"s\":[\"It's for the good of the Province!\"],\"i\":[\"Pet rock\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Peer the Seer south west of the Rellekka market.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the geyser north of the Mountain Camp. Wear your ice gloves or smiths gloves (i), then inspect the geyser again.\",\"i\":[\"Pet rock\",\"Ice gloves or smiths gloves(i)\",\"Fishing rod\"]},{\"t\":\"Retrieve your rock from the geyser.\",\"i\":[\"Ice gloves or smiths gloves(i)\",\"Fishing rod\"]}],\"i\":[\"Pet rock\",\"Ice gloves or smiths gloves(i)\",\"Fishing rod\"]},{\"n\":\"Forging the shield\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use the shield parts together to make V's Shield.\",\"i\":[\"Fremennik shield\",\"Lunar glass\",\"Polishing rock\",\"V sigil (e)\",\"Glassblowing pipe\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brundt south east of Rellekka with V's shield.\",\"i\":[\"V's shield\",\"Kegs of beer (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brundt with 2 kegs of beer.\",\"i\":[\"Kegs of beer (2)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Fremennik shield\",\"Lunar glass\",\"Polishing rock\",\"V sigil (e)\",\"Glassblowing pipe\",\"Kegs of beer (2)\"]},{\"n\":\"Defending Rellekka\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Brundt in Rellekka's longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Jormungand.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill basilisks until you're told to stop.\",\"i\":[\"V's shield\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"]},{\"t\":\"Board the north-westernmost Fremennik boat in Rellekka, on the pier with the Waterbirth Island boat, to travel to the Island of Stone.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brundt outside the cave entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Attempt to open the door and solve the puzzle. The code is four runes from air, water, earth, fire, astral and cosmic, and a rune can appear more than once. After each guess, a green tick means a right rune in the right place, and a red tick means a right rune in the wrong place. To start, set all four slots to one rune: the green ticks show how many of that rune are in the code. Then swap runes around and use the ticks to place them. After nine wrong guesses the code changes and you start again.\"},{\"t\":\"Equip V's shield and keep it on for the whole fight. Then enter the door, ready to fight.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"V's shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Typhor, who attacks with both Melee and Magic. He is weak to crush.\",\"i\":[\"V's shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the Jormungand. When the screen turns red, have your character face away from him. When frozen in rock, tap repeatedly to break out.\",\"i\":[\"V's shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Watch the cutscenes. If the quest hasn't finished, talk to Brundt in Rellekka's longhall to complete it.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Basilisk (level 61)\",\"Typhor (level 218)\",\"The Jormungand (level 363)\"]}]}"
        "The Fremennik Isles" -> "{\"n\":\"The Fremennik Isles\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"10 Ice Trolls (level 74-82)\",\"Ice Troll King (level 122)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"5,000 Construction XP\",\"5,000 Crafting XP\",\"10,000 Woodcutting XP\",\"2 x 10,000 Exp. Lamp (Combat)\",\"Helm of Neitiznot\",\"Jester Outfit\",\"Around 20,000 coins in assorted rewards during quest\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Travel to Jatizso\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Mord Gunnars on a pier in north Rellekka.\"},{\"t\":\"Travel to Jatizso with Mord.\",\"s\":[\"Can you ferry me to Jatizso?\"]}],\"i\":[\"Raw tuna\",\"Mithril ore (6)\",\"Coal (7)\",\"Tin ore (8)\"]},{\"n\":\"Helping Gjuki\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to King Gjuki Sorvott IV on Jatizso. When his cat intervenes, use the raw tuna on the cat.\",\"i\":[\"Raw tuna\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Gjuki Sorvott IV on Jatizso. He asks for 6 mithril ore, 7 coal or 8 tin ore, based on your Mining level. You can mine them in the underground mine north west of Jatizso. Bring them to him, then talk to him again.\",\"i\":[\"Tin, coal or mithril ores (based on your Mining level)\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest behind Gjuki's throne for a silly jester outfit.\",\"s\":[\"Take the jester's hat.\",\"Take the jester's top.\",\"Take the jester's tights.\",\"Take the jester's boots.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Spy on Mawnis\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Rellekka with Mord at the dock south of the king, then travel to Neitiznot with Maria Gunnars, next to Mord. Wearing nothing but your Silly Jester outfit, with your weapon and shield slots empty, talk to Slug Hemligssen just north of the Neitiznot bank.\",\"s\":[\"Can you ferry me to Rellekka?\",\"Free stuff please.\",\"I am ready.\"],\"i\":[\"Silly jester hat\",\"Silly jester body\",\"Silly jester tights\",\"Silly jester boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Mawnis in the building just south of the Neitiznot bank to start spying on him. During the performance, do everything he asks using the jester control panel on screen.\",\"i\":[\"Silly jester hat\",\"Silly jester body\",\"Silly jester tights\",\"Silly jester boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Report back to Slug Hemligssen.\",\"s\":[\"Yes I have.\",\"They will be ready in two days.\",\"Seventeen militia have been trained.\",\"There are two bridges to repair.\"]},{\"t\":\"Take off the jester outfit, and talk to Mawnis.\"},{\"t\":\"Bring Mawnis the 8 split logs, 8 rope, and a knife, with one free inventory space. To make split logs, cut down the arctic pines nearby and split them on the woodcutting stump in central Neitiznot. Then talk to Mawnis again.\",\"i\":[\"Split logs (8)\",\"Rope (8)\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Thakkrad next to Mawnis to learn how to repair the bridges.\",\"s\":[\"How do I repair these bridges again?\"]},{\"t\":\"Turn on Protect from Missiles, as you'll automatically cross the aggressive trolls. Long-press each of the 2 bridges to the north of Neitiznot and choose Repair.\",\"i\":[\"Split logs (8)\",\"Rope (8)\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Report back to Mawnis.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Collecting window tax\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Travel back to Rellekka with Maria Gunnars at the dock in south-west Neitiznot, then to Jatizso with Mord. Report back to King Gjuki Sorvott IV.\",\"s\":[\"Can you ferry me to Jatizso?\"]},{\"t\":\"Collect 5000 coins from Keepa in north east Jatizso.\",\"s\":[\"But rules are rules. Pay up!\"]},{\"t\":\"Collect 5000 coins from Vanligga north of Gjuki's building.\",\"s\":[\"But, rules are rules. Pay up!\"]},{\"t\":\"Collect 6000 coins from Skuli in north west Jatizso.\",\"s\":[\"But, rules are rules. Pay up!\"]},{\"t\":\"Collect 8000 coins from Hring Hring in south west Jatizso.\",\"s\":[\"But rules are rules. Pay up!\"]},{\"t\":\"Report back to King Gjuki Sorvott IV on Jatizso.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Collecting beard tax\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Collect tax from Hring Hring in south west Jatizso.\",\"s\":[\"But rules are rules. Pay up!\"]},{\"t\":\"Collect tax from Raum in south west Jatizso.\",\"s\":[\"But rules are rules. Pay up!\"]},{\"t\":\"Collect tax from Skuli in north west Jatizso.\",\"s\":[\"But rules are rules. Pay up!\"]},{\"t\":\"Collect tax from Keepa in north east Jatizso.\",\"s\":[\"But rules are rules. Pay up!\"]},{\"t\":\"Collect tax from Flossi in north east Jatizso.\",\"s\":[\"But rules are rules. Pay up!\"]},{\"t\":\"Report back to King Gjuki Sorvott IV on Jatizso.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Spy on Mawnis again\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Rellekka with Mord, then travel to Neitiznot with Maria Gunnars. Wearing nothing but your Silly Jester outfit, talk to Slug Hemligssen just north of the Neitiznot bank.\",\"s\":[\"Can you ferry me to Rellekka?\"],\"i\":[\"Silly jester hat\",\"Silly jester body\",\"Silly jester tights\",\"Silly jester boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Mawnis in the building just south of the Neitiznot bank to start spying on him. During the performance, do everything he asks using the jester control panel on screen.\",\"i\":[\"Silly jester hat\",\"Silly jester body\",\"Silly jester tights\",\"Silly jester boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Report to Slug Hemligssen.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I am.\",\"They are in a secluded bay, near Etceteria.\",\"They will be given some potions.\",\"I have been helping Neitiznot.\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel back to Rellekka with Maria Gunnars at the dock in south-west Neitiznot, then to Jatizso with Mord. Report back to King Gjuki Sorvott IV.\",\"s\":[\"Can you ferry me to Jatizso?\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Rellekka with Mord, then travel to Neitiznot with Maria Gunnars. Take off your jester outfit and talk to Mawnis in the building just south of the bank.\",\"s\":[\"Can you ferry me to Rellekka?\"],\"i\":[\"Royal decree\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Killing the king\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Mawnis with full yak-hide armour. To make it, kill yaks for 3 hides, have Thakkrad next to Mawnis cure them, and use a needle and thread on them.\",\"i\":[\"Yak-hide armour (top)\",\"Yak-hide armour (bottom)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Mawnis with a Neitiznot shield. To make one, use 2 arctic pine logs, a bronze nail, a hammer and a rope on the woodcutting stump in central Neitiznot.\",\"i\":[\"Neitiznot shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave in the north east of the islands. Be prepared in your yak armour, Neitiznot shield, and a melee weapon.\",\"i\":[\"Yak-hide armour (top)\",\"Yak-hide armour (bottom)\",\"Neitiznot shield\",\"Melee gear\",\"Food + potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill 10 ice trolls.\"},{\"t\":\"Cross the rope bridge. Be prepared to fight the Ice Troll King. Use the Protect from Magic prayer for the fight.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the king. Use the Protect from Magic prayer for the fight.\"},{\"t\":\"Decapitate the king's head.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Mawnis with the Ice Troll King's head to complete the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Decapitated head\"]}],\"i\":[\"Neitiznot shield\",\"Melee gear\",\"Food + potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"10 Ice Trolls (level 74-82)\",\"Ice Troll King (level 122)\"]}]}"
        "The Fremennik Trials" -> "{\"n\":\"The Fremennik Trials\",\"items\":[\"Coins (5250)\",\"Raw shark, manta ray or sea turtle\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Knife\",\"Any axe\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear + food\",\"Rings of recoil for Koschei\",\"Camelot teleport\",\"Teleports to Rellekka\"],\"enemies\":[\"Koschei the deathless\",\"Draugen (level 69)\"],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"2,812 Agility XP\",\"2,812 Attack XP\",\"2,812 Crafting XP\",\"2,812 Defence XP\",\"2,812 Fishing XP\",\"2,812 Fletching XP\",\"2,812 Hitpoints XP\",\"2,812 Strength XP\",\"2,812 Thieving XP\",\"2,812 Woodcutting XP\",\"Access to Miscellania, Etceteria, Neitiznot, Jatizso and the facilities of Rellekka.\",\"Ability to wear and purchase Fremmennik Helms\",\"Free travel to Waterbirth Island\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Talk to Brundt\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Brundt in Rellekka's longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about anything else.\",\"Do you have any quests?\",\"Yes, I am interested.\",\"I want to become a Fremennik!\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins (5250)\",\"Raw shark, manta ray or sea turtle\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Knife\",\"Any axe\",\"Combat gear + food\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Olaf's task\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Olaf the Bard north east of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about becoming a Fremennik\",\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lalli to the south east of Rellekka.\",\"s\":[\"Other human?\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Rellekka and talk to Askeladden for a pet rock.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about becoming a Fremennik\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Lalli and use a onion, cabbage, potato, and pet rock on their stew. You can find the vegetables growing in the south east of Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Pet rock\",\"Cabbage\",\"Potato\",\"Onion\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lalli for the golden fleece.\"},{\"t\":\"Go south east of Rellekka and cut a branch from the swaying tree\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a knife on the branch to make an unstrung lyre\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Branch\"]},{\"t\":\"Spin the golden fleece into wool using a spinning wheel. The closest wheel is in Seers' Village.\",\"i\":[\"Golden fleece\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the golden wool on your unstrung lyre.\",\"i\":[\"Unstrung lyre\",\"Golden wool\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring your lyre to the Strange Altar south west of Rellekka. From the north end of the bridge south of Rellekka, walk a bit west to a narrow path heading south into the water. Use either a raw shark, raw sea turtle or raw manta ray on the altar.\",\"i\":[\"Lyre\",\"Raw shark, manta ray or sea turtle\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Rellekka and go in through the back door on the north-east side of the longhall, the one the Longhall Bouncer guards, to reach the stage. Play the enchanted lyre on stage, then talk to Olaf the Bard for his vote.\",\"i\":[\"Enchanted lyre\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Knife\",\"Raw shark, manta ray or sea turtle\",\"Empty inventory slots for vegetables and a pet rock (4)\"]},{\"n\":\"Manni's task\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Manni the Reveller in the Rellekka longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about becoming a Fremennik\",\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Get some beer. There is beer tankard in the Rellekka longhall.\",\"i\":[\"Beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the Council workman on the bridge south of Rellekka going to Seer's Village a beer.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Buy some alcohol free beer from the Poison Salesman in the Seer's Village pub.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the Fremennik Trials\",\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (250)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Rellekka with the strange object, a tinderbox, and low alcohol beer.\",\"i\":[\"Strange object\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Low alcohol keg\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the pipe outside the east wall of the longhall. Use a tinderbox on the strange object, then use the lit object on the pipe.\",\"i\":[\"Strange object\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up a keg of beer in the longhall.\",\"i\":[\"Keg of beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the low alcohol beer on the keg of beer whilst in the longhall.\",\"i\":[\"Low alcohol keg\",\"Keg of beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Manni the Reveller to cheat in the competition.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about becoming a Fremennik\",\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Keg of beer\"]}],\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Coins (250)\"]},{\"n\":\"Sigli's task\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sigli south of the longhall for a hunters' talisman.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about becoming a Fremennik\",\"What's a Draugen?\",\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the hunters' talisman and walk the way the chat message says. Keep doing this until you reach the exact spot, where the talisman makes the Draugen (level 69) appear. A small see-through butterfly follows it. Kill the Draugen.\"},{\"t\":\"Return the charged hunters' talisman to Sigli.\",\"i\":[\"Hunters' talisman\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear + food\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Draugen (level 69)\"]},{\"n\":\"Sigmund's task\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sigmund the Merchant in the Rellekka market.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Sailor on the docks.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Olaf the Bard east of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Yrsa in her shop west of the market.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brundt in the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\",\"Ask about anything else.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sigli south of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Skulgrimen north of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Fisherman on the pier north of the market.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Swensen the Navigator in his hut south west of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Peer the Seer south west of the market.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Thorvald north of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Manni the Reveller in the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Thora the Barkeep in the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Askeladden south of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\",\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the promissory note to Thora the Barkeep in the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Promissory note\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the cocktail to Manni the Reveller in the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Legendary cocktail\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the champions token to Thorvald north of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\",\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Champions token\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the warriors' contract to Peer the Seer south west of the market.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Warriors' contract\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the weather forecast to Swensen the Navigator in his hut south west of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Weather forecast\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the sea fishing map to the Fisherman on the pier north of the market.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Sea fishing map\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the unusual fish to Skulgrimen north of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Unusual fish\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the custom bow string to Sigli south of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Custom bow string\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the tracking map to Brundt in the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\",\"Ask about anything else.\"],\"i\":[\"Tracking map\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the fiscal statement to Yrsa in her shop west of the market.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Fiscal statement\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the sturdy boots to Olaf the Bard east of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Sturdy boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the ballad to the Sailor on the docks.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Merchant's trial\"],\"i\":[\"Fremennik ballad\"]},{\"t\":\"Finally, bring the exotic flower to Sigmund the Merchant in the Rellekka market.\",\"i\":[\"Exotic flower\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins (5000)\"]},{\"n\":\"Thorvald's task\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Thorvald north of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about becoming a Fremennik\"]},{\"t\":\"When you're ready to fight Koschei, go down the ladder.\",\"i\":[\"Nothing except for food, potions, and rings of recoil\",\"Optionally a Dramen branch + knife to make a dramen staff once inside Koschei's arena\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Koschei the Deathless and 'kill' him at least 3 times. Dying to his fourth phase is a SAFE death.\"}],\"i\":[\"Nothing except for food, potions, and rings of recoil\",\"Optionally a Dramen branch + knife to make a dramen staff once inside Koschei's arena\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Koschei the deathless\"]},{\"n\":\"Swensen's task\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Swensen the Navigator in his hut south west of the longhall.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about becoming a Fremennik\",\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down Swensen's ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the portals in this order: south, west, east, north, south, east, north (the first letters spell SWENSEN). Then climb up the ladder, and talk to Swensen if he doesn't give you his vote. A wrong portal leads to a dark room with webs and skeletons: climb the rope and start the portals again.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Peer's task\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Peer the Seer south west of the Rellekka market. You will need to bank all your items. Peer will offer to do this for you.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about becoming a Fremennik\",\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Try to enter Peer the Seer's house after banking all your items. Peer the Seer will offer to bank everything for you.\",\"s\":[\"Read the riddle\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the solution to Peer's door.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the bookcase in the north of the room for a red herring.\"},{\"t\":\"Study the bull's head for a wooden disk.\"},{\"t\":\"Study the unicorn's head for an old red disk.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the red herring on the cooking range to get sticky red goop.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the sticky red goop on the wooden disk to make a second red disk.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the trapdoor on the east side and go down.\"},{\"t\":\"Use both red disks on the abstract mural to get the vase lid. If you don't get it, search the mural.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back upstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the cupboard in the south-west of the room for an empty bucket.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the south of the room for an empty jug.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the empty bucket on the tap by the cooking range to fill it.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the full bucket on the empty jug. The bucket is left 2/5 full.\"},{\"t\":\"Empty the full jug into the drain.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the 2/5 full bucket on the empty jug.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the empty bucket on the tap to fill it again.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the full bucket on the 2/3 full jug. The bucket is left 4/5 full.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the 4/5 full bucket on the chest with a scale on it, in the north of the room, to get a vase. If the amounts went wrong, empty the jug and bucket and start again from filling the bucket.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the empty vase on the tap to fill it.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the vase lid on the filled vase.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the sealed vase on the frozen table to get a frozen key.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the frozen key on the cooking range to thaw it.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down the trapdoor on the east side, next to the frozen table. Leaving any other way means redoing parts of the puzzle.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the door to leave the Seer's house with the key.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Finish off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Brundt in Rellekka's longhall to finish the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about anything else.\"]}]}]}"
        "The Garden of Death" -> "{\"n\":\"The Garden of Death\",\"items\":[\"Secateurs (Obtainable in quest)\"],\"rec\":[\"Xeric's talisman\",\"Kharedst's memoirs or book of the dead for teleports\",\"Fairy ring access for quick access to Molch Island (DJR)\",\"Antipoisons\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"10,000 Farming XP\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the tent in the south east of the Kebos Lowlands. Fairy ring BLS is closest: head south-east from it.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the journal\",\"i\":[\"Kasonde's journal\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the camping equipment for some secateurs.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the nearby hole.\",\"i\":[\"Secateurs (Obtainable in quest)\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the north-west table.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the stone tablet.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Stone tablet\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the word translations.\",\"i\":[\"Word translations\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the 'Attempt Translation' button.\"},{\"t\":\"Type these words into the word translations, one at a time, choosing Yes. to enter another: Island, Water, Time, Vessel, North. Enter all five, or the hole on Molch Island won't appear.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the hole.\"}],\"i\":[\"Secateurs (Obtainable in quest)\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Investigating Molch\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Travel to Molch island via Boaty, located on the west/north/east sides of Lake Molch.\",\"s\":[\"Molch Island\"],\"i\":[\"Word translations\",\"Secateurs (Obtainable in quest)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole on Molch Island.\",\"i\":[\"Word translations\",\"Secateurs (Obtainable in quest)\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the vines to the south.\"},{\"t\":\"Cut the vines with secateurs.\",\"i\":[\"Secateurs (Obtainable in quest)\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south west stone table.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the stone tablet, and take the note after closing the tablet's interface.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Stone tablet\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the word translations.\",\"i\":[\"Word translations\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the 'Attempt Translation' button.\"},{\"t\":\"Type these words into the word translations, one at a time, choosing Yes. to enter another: West, Poison, Body, Food, Earth.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Secateurs (Obtainable in quest)\",\"Word translations\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Investigating Xeric's Shrine\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave the hole.\"},{\"t\":\"Travel via Boaty to Molch. From there, run west and then south to Xeric's Shrine.\",\"s\":[\"Molch\"],\"i\":[\"Word translations\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole next to Xeric's Shrine.\",\"i\":[\"Word translations\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south east stone table.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the stone tablet.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Stone tablet\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the word translations.\",\"i\":[\"Word translations\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the 'Attempt Translation' button.\"},{\"t\":\"Type these words into the word translations, one at a time, choosing Yes. to enter another: Make, Yes, No, Move, Arrive, East, South.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Word translations\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Investigating the Ruins of Morra\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave the hole.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole in the Ruins of Morra, south west of Shayzien.\",\"i\":[\"Word translations\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south stone table.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the stone tablet.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Stone tablet\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the word translations.\",\"i\":[\"Word translations\"]},{\"t\":\"Tap the 'Attempt Translation' button.\"},{\"t\":\"Type these words into the word translations, one at a time, choosing Yes. to enter another: Few, Big, Sun, Moon, Life, Death, Mind, Home, Air, Fire.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the final stone tablet again.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Stone tablet\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the warning note.\",\"i\":[\"Warning note\"]}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The General's Shadow" -> "{\"n\":\"The General's Shadow\",\"items\":[\"Coins (40)\",\"Ghostly hood\",\"Ghostly robe (top)\",\"Ghostly robe (bottom)\",\"Ghostly gloves\",\"Ghostly boots\",\"Ghostly cloak\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Combat gear\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleports to Rellekka\",\"Necklace of Passage, or a teleport to Tree Gnome Stronghold\",\"Teleport to Al Kharid\",\"Teleport to Tai Bwo Wannai\",\"Teleport to Draynor Manor\",\"Teleport to Seer's Village\",\"Teleport to Fishing Guild\"],\"enemies\":[\"Bouncer (level 160, can't use prayer)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2,000 Slayer XP\",\"The Shadow Sword\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Proving your Sin\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Wear all your ghostly robes, the ring of visibility and the ghostspeak amulet whenever you talk to Khazard or the scouts. Talk to General Khazard just north of the log balance, south-east of Rellekka.\",\"s\":[\"I just have one of those faces.\",\"I'm a very trustworthy person.\"],\"i\":[\"Ghostly hood\",\"Ghostly robe (top)\",\"Ghostly robe (bottom)\",\"Ghostly cloak\",\"Ghostly boots\",\"Ghostly gloves\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the ladder in the spinning wheel house in Seers' Village and talk to the Sin Seer upstairs. You need one free inventory slot.\",\"s\":[\"Bribe\",\"Here's the money.\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (40)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to General Khazard south east of Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Sin seer's note\",\"Ghostly robes\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ghostly robes\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\",\"Coins (40)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding the Scouts\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the scout near The Outpost, south of the Tree Gnome Stronghold.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostly robes\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the scout west of Draynor Manor.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostly robes\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the scout south of the Shantay Pass.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostly robes\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the scout south east of Tai Bwo Wannai.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostly robes\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to General Khazard south east of Rellekka.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostly robes\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ghostly robes\",\"Ring of visibility\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"n\":\"Defeat Bouncer\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the cave south east of the Fishing Guild. Be prepared to fight Bouncer (level 160).\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Severed leg\"]},{\"t\":\"Inside the cave, head north, then take the first passage east into a larger cavern. Enter the crack in the south wall of that cavern. You need the severed leg in your inventory.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Severed leg\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Bouncer. You cannot use prayers.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Severed leg\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Severed leg\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Bouncer (level 160, can't use prayer)\"]}]}"
        "The Giant Dwarf" -> "{\"n\":\"The Giant Dwarf\",\"items\":[\"coins (2500)\",\"Logs\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Coal\",\"Iron bar\",\"Law rune\",\"Air rune\",\"Cut sapphires (3)\",\"Various ores and bars\",\"Redberry pie\"],\"rec\":[\"A house teleport if your house is in Rimmington and if you have no faster way to Mudskipper Point\",\"A Camelot/Rellekka teleport (for starting the quest)\",\"Access to fairy rings\",\"Some stamina potions (when collecting the ores)\",\"A ring of wealth/amulet of glory/Varrock teleport\",\"Clay (10)\",\"Copper ore (10)\",\"Tin ore (10)\",\"Iron ore (10)\",\"Coal (10)\",\"Silver ore (10)\",\"Gold ore (10)\",\"Mithril ore (10)\",\"Bronze bar (10)\",\"Iron bar (10)\",\"Silver bar (10)\",\"Gold bar (10)\",\"Steel bar (10)\",\"Mithril bar (10)\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"2,500 Mining XP\",\"2,500 Smithing XP\",\"2,500 Crafting XP\",\"1,500 Magic XP\",\"1,500 Thieving XP\",\"1,500 Firemaking XP\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting out\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Keldagrim entrance tunnel, north-east of Rellekka. Inside, go through the cave entrance straight ahead, between the two statues, and speak to the Dwarven Boatman.\",\"s\":[\"That's a deal!\",\"Yes, I'm ready and don't mind it taking a few minutes.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Finish speaking to Commander Veldaban.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I will do this.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Blasidar the sculptor in the east of Keldagrim.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I will do this.\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Clothes fit for a king\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Vermundi, the silk trader in the east market, west of Blasidar.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'm looking for some special clothes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Librarian in the library at the north-east corner of West Keldagrim, across the bridge.\",\"s\":[\"Do you know anything about King Alvis' clothes?\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb any bookcase to find a book on costumes.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Vermundi with the book on costumes.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, about those special clothes again...\"],\"i\":[\"Book on costumes\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your coal on the spinning machine next to Vermundi, with logs in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Coal\",\"Logs\"]},{\"t\":\"Start the spinning machine with a tinderbox.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Vermundi again and pay 200gp.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, about those special clothes again...\",\"I'll pay.\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (200)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Weight below 30 kg\",\"Logs\",\"Coal\",\"Tinderbox\",\"coins (2500)\",\"Free inventory slot\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Boots fit for a king\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Saro at the anvil south-west of the bank in West Keldagrim.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'm looking for a pair of special boots.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Dromund in his house just north of the West Keldagrim bank.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the Left boot when Dromund isn't looking.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the Right boot from outside his window when he isn't looking using Telekinetic Grab.\",\"i\":[\"Law rune\",\"Air rune\"]}],\"i\":[\"Law rune\",\"Air rune\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"An axe fit for a king\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Santiri at the weapon shop in the north-west of West Keldagrim.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'm looking for a particular battleaxe.\",\"Blasidar the sculptor needs it for his statue.\",\"Perhaps I can repair the axe?\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the 3 sapphires on the axe, then talk to Santiri again.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'm looking for a particular battleaxe.\"],\"i\":[\"Dwarven battleaxe\",\"Cut sapphires (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Skip this step and the next one if you gave Thurgo a redberry pie during The Knight's Sword. Otherwise, talk to the Librarian about Imcando dwarves.\",\"s\":[\"Can you help me find an Imcando dwarf?\"]},{\"t\":\"Skip this step if you gave Thurgo a redberry pie during The Knight's Sword. Otherwise, talk to Reldo in Varrock Castle's library.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about Imcando dwarves.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Thurgo at Mudskipper Point, and keep talking to him until the axe is repaired. Offer him the redberry pie if the option appears.\",\"s\":[\"Something else.\",\"Would you like a redberry pie?\",\"Can you help me with this ancient axe?\",\"Can you repair that axe now?\",\"Return to Keldagrim immediately.\"],\"i\":[\"Redberry pie\",\"Iron bar\",\"Dwarven battleaxe\"]}],\"i\":[\"Cut sapphires (3)\",\"Iron bar\",\"Redberry pie\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Halfway there\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Riki the sculptor's model to give him the clothes, axe and boots.\",\"s\":[\"Return to Keldagrim immediately.\"],\"i\":[\"Exquisite clothes\",\"Exquisite boots\",\"Dwarven battleaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Blasidar the sculptor.\"}],\"i\":[\"Exquisite clothes\",\"Exquisite boots\",\"Dwarven battleaxe\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Joining the consortium\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the upper floor of the market.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the secretary of any company except the Red Axe, and only work for that one company. Complete the tasks given. If you don't want a task, tap the secretary again for a different one instead of refusing it. Stop when the secretary says there's no more work and you should speak directly to the director.\",\"s\":[\"Is there anything I can help you with?\",\"I'll take it.\",\"Do you have another task for me?\"]},{\"t\":\"Keep talking to the director of the same company and complete the tasks given. If you don't want a task, tap the director again for a different one before continuing the chat. Stop when the director asks if you've considered joining the company.\",\"s\":[\"Do you have any more tasks for me?\",\"I'll take it.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the director to join the company.\",\"s\":[\"I'd like to officially join your company.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the director after joining the company. For the last choice, pick \\\"Yes! Long live the\\\" followed by your own company's name.\",\"s\":[\"Blasidar the sculptor has sent me.\",\"I would support you.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Commander Veldaban, west of the bank in West Keldagrim.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Various ores and bars\",\"Some stamina potions (when collecting the ores)\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The Golem" -> "{\"n\":\"The Golem\",\"items\":[\"Soft clay (4)\",\"Vial\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Papyrus\"],\"rec\":[\"Varrock teleport\",\"Digsite teleport\",\"Necklace of passage to Eagle's Eyrie\",\"Waterskins\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,000 Thieving XP\",\"1,000 Crafting XP\",\"2 x Rubies (by using a chisel and hammer on the throne)\",\"2 x Emeralds (by using a chisel and hammer on the throne)\",\"2 x Sapphires (by using a chisel and hammer on the throne)\",\"Ability to take the Carpet ride from Shantay Pass to Uzer.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Golem in Uzer to start the quest. A necklace of passage to Eagle's Eyrie is a quick way there.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use 4 soft clay on the Golem in Uzer.\",\"i\":[\"Soft clay (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the letter on the floor in Uzer and read it.\",\"i\":[\"Letter\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Uzer ruins. You can drop the Letter you just read.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the strange implement in the north west corner of the ruin.\",\"i\":[\"Strange implement\"]}],\"i\":[\"Soft clay (4)\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finding the statuette\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Elissa in the north east of the Digsite.\",\"s\":[\"I found a letter in the desert with your name on.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the bookcase in the south east corner of the Digsite Exam Centre.\"},{\"t\":\"Read Varmen's notes.\",\"i\":[\"Varmen's notes\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Curator Haig in the Varrock Museum. You can drop Varmen's notes.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for a statuette recovered from the city of Uzer.\",\"I want to open a portal to the lair of an elder-demon.\"]},{\"t\":\"Pickpocket Curator Haig for the Display cabinet key.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up to the first floor of the Varrock Museum.\",\"i\":[\"Display cabinet key\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the golem statue's display case and choose Open. It's the second case from the west in the northernmost row.\",\"i\":[\"Display cabinet key\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Opening the portal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Uzer ruins. A necklace of passage to Eagle's Eyrie is a quick way there.\",\"i\":[\"Statuette\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Vial\",\"Papyrus\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the statue on the empty alcove.\",\"i\":[\"Statuette\"]},{\"t\":\"Turn each of the statuettes until they all point north, towards the double doors.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the portal.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the throne room through the portal to the south. Then climb back up the stairs you came down to leave the ruins.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Golem in Uzer.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up some black mushrooms next to the stairs east of the Golem.\"},{\"t\":\"Grind the mushrooms into a vial.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Black mushroom\",\"Vial\"]},{\"t\":\"Steal a feather from the desert phoenix north of Uzer. A necklace of passage to Eagle's Eyrie is a quick way there.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the phoenix feather on the ink.\",\"i\":[\"Phoenix feather\",\"Black mushroom ink\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the phoenix quill on the papyrus.\",\"i\":[\"Phoenix quill pen\",\"Papyrus\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the strange implement on the Golem in Uzer.\",\"i\":[\"Strange implement\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the golem program on the Golem in Uzer.\",\"i\":[\"Golem program\"]}],\"i\":[\"Vial\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Papyrus\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The Grand Tree" -> "{\"n\":\"The Grand Tree\",\"items\":[\"Coins to enter the Stronghold if you didn't help Femi previously (1000)\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear. Safespotting is possible.\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Energy restoration\",\"Access to Fairy Rings\",\"Transport to the Grand Tree\"],\"enemies\":[\"Black demon (level 172) (can be safespotted)\"],\"rewards\":[\"5 Quest points\",\"18,400 Attack XP\",\"7,900 Agility XP\",\"2,150 Magic XP\",\"Ability to use the Spirit Tree in the Tree Gnome Stronghold.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Getting started\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to King Narnode Shareen in the Grand Tree(Make sure to have two empty inventory slots to start the quest).\",\"s\":[\"You seem worried, what's up?\",\"I'd be happy to help!\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Hazelmere\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go up to Hazelmere, on the island east of Yanille. Fairy ring CLS or minigame teleport near Yanille.\",\"i\":[\"Translation Book\",\"Bark Sample\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Hazelmere.\",\"i\":[\"Translation Book\",\"Bark Sample\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bark Sample\",\"Translation Book\"]},{\"n\":\"Investigation\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to King Narnode in the Grand Tree.\",\"s\":[\"I think so!\",\"None of the above.\",\"A man came to me with the King's seal.\",\"I gave the man Daconia rocks.\",\"And Daconia rocks will kill the tree!\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the Grand Tree and head south. At the bottom of the incline, turn east and climb the ladder up to Glough's house.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Glough.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Narnode again in the Grand Tree.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Charlie on the top floor of the Grand Tree.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Glough's house and search the cupboard for Glough's Journal.\"},{\"t\":\"Confront Glough about his journal.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Charlie.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Narnode outside Charlie's cell.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the gnome glider pilot on top of the Grand Tree and travel to Karamja to escape.\",\"s\":[\"Take me to Karamja please!\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Karamja\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"The glider crashes near the shipyard. Run east past the jogres to the shipyard gate, open it and answer the worker.\",\"s\":[\"Glough sent me.\",\"Ka.\",\"Lu.\",\"Min.\"]},{\"t\":\"Get the Lumber order from the Foreman on the southern docks. You can either kill him or talk to him. If you talk to him, answer his questions with these lines.\",\"s\":[\"Sadly his wife is no longer with us!\",\"He loves worm holes.\",\"Anita.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Coins to enter the Stronghold if you didn't help Femi previously (1000)\"]},{\"n\":\"Tuzo\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to the Grand Tree. You can't walk in through the Stronghold's main gate. Talk to Femi outside it to be snuck in, which costs 1,000 coins if you didn't help her earlier. If you've finished Tree Gnome Village, you can use a Spirit Tree instead, such as the one at the Grand Exchange. Show the lumber order to King Narnode, then talk to Charlie on the top floor of the Grand Tree.\",\"i\":[\"Lumber order\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in Anita's house, west of the Grand Tree, and talk to her.\",\"s\":[\"I suppose so.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in Glough's house.\",\"i\":[\"Glough's key\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the invasion plans to King Narnode in the Grand Tree.\",\"i\":[\"Invasion plans\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the ladder to Glough's house, then climb the tree on the east side of the room, by the chest, to reach the watchtower.\",\"i\":[\"Twigs (T)\",\"Twigs (U)\",\"Twigs (Z)\",\"Twigs (O)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the twigs on the four pillars to spell TUZO, starting from the far left. Return to King Narnode if you lost any.\",\"i\":[\"Twigs (T)\",\"Twigs (U)\",\"Twigs (Z)\",\"Twigs (O)\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Defeat the Black Demon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go down the trap door. Be prepared for the fight against a Black Demon (level 172).\"},{\"t\":\"Glough appears when you come down: finish the whole chat without tapping anything else. The Black Demon (level 172) then attacks. Run at once to the tile directly north of the ladder you came down. The demon gets stuck behind the rocks in front of you, so attack it with Ranged, Magic or a halberd. Kill it within 10 minutes or it leaves.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Narnode deeper in the cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the roots under the Grand Tree until you find the Daconia stone. If you lose the rock, it will be in the same root again.\"},{\"t\":\"Give the Daconia stone to King Narnode under the Grand Tree.\",\"i\":[\"Daconia stone\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear. Safespotting is possible.\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Black demon (level 172) (can be safespotted)\"]}]}"
        "The Great Brain Robbery" -> "{\"n\":\"The Great Brain Robbery\",\"items\":[\"Fishbowl helmet\",\"Diving apparatus\",\"10 Wooden cats, or 10 planks and 10 furs to make them\",\"Plank (8)\",\"Hammer\",\"Nails (200)\",\"Holy symbol\",\"Ring of Charos\",\"No pet following you or in your inventory\"],\"rec\":[\"Ectophial or Mos le'harmless teleport\",\"Monastery teleport\",\"Fenkenstrain's Castle teleport\",\"Watermelon seeds to plant on Harmony for Hard Morytania Diary (3)\",\"Combat gear for safespotting\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potion\"],\"enemies\":[\"Barrelchest (level 190, safespottable)\",\"4 Sorebones (level 57)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"6,000 Prayer XP\",\"2,000 Crafting XP\",\"2,000 Construction XP\",\"Barrelchest Anchor\",\"5,000 Exp Reward Lamp (Any skill above 30)\",\"Prayer Book\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Cross the gangplank to Bill Teach's ship at Port Phasmatys and talk to him to travel to Mos Le'Harmless. Talk to Brother Tranquility near the dock, and keep talking to him on Harmony until the chat ends.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"Yes, please.\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the windmill and head north. Wear your fishbowl helmet and diving apparatus, pull the saradomin statue, then enter it. Plant the watermelon seeds in the patch first if you brought them for the Hard Morytania Diary.\",\"i\":[\"Fishbowl helmet\",\"Diving apparatus\",\"Hammer\",\"Plank (4)\",\"Nails (100)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the water.\"},{\"t\":\"Repair the stairs to the east.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Plank (4)\",\"Nails (100)\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb up the stairs to the east.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Peer through the nearby peephole.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Brother Tranquility.\"}],\"i\":[\"Plank (4)\",\"Nails (100)\",\"Hammer\",\"Fishbowl helmet\",\"Diving apparatus\",\"Holy symbol\",\"No pet following you or in your inventory\"]},{\"n\":\"Protecting the windmill\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the south west bookcase in the Edgeville Monastery.\",\"s\":[\"Monastery\"],\"i\":[\"Holy symbol\"]},{\"t\":\"Read the prayer book.\",\"i\":[\"Prayer book\"]},{\"t\":\"Wear your holy symbol and return to Harmony: take Bill Teach's ship from Port Phasmatys to Mos Le'Harmless, then talk to Brother Tranquility near the dock to be taken there.\",\"i\":[\"Prayer book\",\"Holy symbol\"]},{\"t\":\"Keep your holy symbol on. Inside the windmill on Harmony, long-press the prayer book and choose Recite prayer.\",\"i\":[\"Prayer book\",\"Holy symbol\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brother Tranquility again.\"}],\"i\":[\"Holy symbol\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding a Doctor\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"In Fenkenstrain's Castle, go up either staircase, go through the metal gate into the jail cell in the middle of the room, and climb the ladder there. Talk to Dr. Fenkenstrain at the top.\"},{\"t\":\"Wear your Ring of Charos and keep it on for this section. Talk to Rufus in Canifis' food store.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about the meat shipment\"],\"i\":[\"Ring of Charos\"]},{\"t\":\"Either buy 10 wooden cats from the G.E., or make them on a clockmaker's bench in your POH.\",\"s\":[\"Wooden cat\"],\"i\":[\"10 Wooden cats, or 10 planks and 10 furs to make them\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Dr. Fenkenstrain and build the crate next to him.\",\"i\":[\"Ring of Charos\",\"Plank (4)\",\"Nails (100)\",\"Hammer\",\"Wooden cat (10)\",\"Crate part (6)\",\"Wolf whistle\"]},{\"t\":\"Add a bottom to the crate.\",\"i\":[\"Plank (4)\",\"Nails (100)\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the crate next to Fenkenstrain with wooden cats.\",\"i\":[\"Wooden cat (10)\"]},{\"t\":\"Blow the wolf whistle.\",\"i\":[\"Wolf whistle\",\"Ring of Charos\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Dr. Fenkenstrain and place the shipping order on the crate..\",\"i\":[\"Shipping order\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ring of Charos\",\"10 Wooden cats, or 10 planks and 10 furs to make them\",\"Plank (4)\",\"Nails (100)\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"n\":\"Saving the Monks\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Dr. Fenkenstrain in the Harmony Windmill basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the windmill basement and wear your fishbowl helmet and diving apparatus. Go north to the shipwreck and search the locker on the ship for a fuse.\",\"i\":[\"Fishbowl helmet\",\"Diving apparatus\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the ship's ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Take a tinderbox.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Take a keg.\",\"i\":[\"Keg\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the ship's ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the keg on the church's door.\",\"i\":[\"Keg\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the fuse on the keg.\",\"i\":[\"Fuse\"]},{\"t\":\"Light the fuse.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill sorebones in the church until you have a cranial clamp, brain tongs, 3 bell jars and 30 skull staples.\",\"i\":[\"Cranial clamp\",\"Brain tongs\",\"Bell jar (3)\",\"Skull staple (30)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Dr. Fenkenstrain in the Harmony Windmill basement.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Cranial clamp\",\"Brain tongs\",\"Bell jar (3)\",\"Skull staple (30)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brother Tranquility on Harmony.\"}],\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Fishbowl helmet\",\"Diving apparatus\",\"Combat gear for safespotting\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"4 Sorebones (level 57)\"]},{\"n\":\"Defeating a Barrelchest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the church, ready to fight Barrelchest. If after initially entering you leave then re-enter, the Barrelchest will get stuck and you can safespot it from the door.\",\"i\":[\"Fishbowl helmet\",\"Diving apparatus\",\"Combat gear for safespotting\"]},{\"t\":\"Confront Migor.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat the barrelchest. You can safespot it from the door if you leave and re-enter the instance.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the anchor the Barrelchest dropped, then talk to Brother Tranquility on Harmony to complete the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Fishbowl helmet\",\"Diving apparatus\",\"Combat gear for safespotting\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Barrelchest (level 190, safespottable)\"]}]}"
        "The Hand in the Sand" -> "{\"n\":\"The Hand in the Sand\",\"items\":[\"Beer or 2 gp\",\"Coins or more for boat travel (150)\",\"Vial (2)\",\"Redberries\",\"White berries\",\"Lantern lens\",\"Earth runes (5)\",\"Bucket of sand\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleports to Yanille, such as dueling ring or minigame teleport (3)\",\"Teleports to Brimhaven, or to near a boat to Brimhaven (2)\",\"Teleport to Port Sarim\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,000 Thieving XP\",\"9,000 Crafting XP\",\"Daily sand from Bert in Yanille.\",\"Access to the Wizards Guild rune store.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Bert in west Yanille.\",\"s\":[\"Eww a hand, in the sand! Why haven't you told the authorities?\",\"Sure, I'll give you a hand.\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Investigating\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Give the Guard Captain in the pub south of Bert a beer. You can buy one for 2gp from the pub.\",\"i\":[\"Beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Ring the bell outside the Wizards' Guild in Yanille. Talk to Zavistic Rarve when he appears.\",\"s\":[\"I have a rather sandy problem that I'd like to palm off on you.\"],\"i\":[\"Beer soaked hand\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Bert in west Yanille.\"},{\"t\":\"Travel to Brimhaven, then enter Sandy's building south of the restaurant. Search Sandy's desk for Sandy's rota.\"},{\"t\":\"Pickpocket Sandy for some sand.\"}],\"i\":[\"Beer or 2 gp\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Making a truth serum\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Bert in west Yanille with the rota and sand.\",\"i\":[\"Bert's rota\",\"Sandy's rota\"]},{\"t\":\"Ring the bell outside the Wizards' Guild in Yanille. Talk to Zavistic Rarve when he appears.\",\"s\":[\"I have a rather sandy problem that I'd like to palm off on you.\"],\"i\":[\"A magic scroll\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Zavistic Rarve again to get teleported to Port Sarim.\",\"s\":[\"Can you help me more?\",\"Yes, that would be great!\",\"I have a rather sandy problem that I'd like to palm off on you.\"],\"i\":[\"Vial\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel to Port Sarim, and talk to Betty in the magic shop.\",\"s\":[\"Talk to Betty about the Hand in the Sand.\"],\"i\":[\"Vial\"]},{\"t\":\"Use redberries on the bottled water.\",\"i\":[\"Bottled water\",\"Redberries\"]},{\"t\":\"Use whiteberries on the red bottled water\",\"i\":[\"Red dye\",\"White berries\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the pink dye on a lantern lens.\",\"i\":[\"Pink dye\",\"Lantern lens\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Betty with the pink lens.\",\"s\":[\"Talk to Betty about the Hand in the Sand.\"]},{\"t\":\"Stand in Betty's doorway and use the rose-tinted lens on the counter.\",\"i\":[\"Rose-tinted lens\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Betty again.\",\"s\":[\"Talk to Betty about the Hand in the Sand.\"],\"i\":[\"Truth serum\",\"Sand\"]}],\"i\":[\"Vial (2)\",\"Lantern lens\",\"Redberries\",\"White berries\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Uncover the truth\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sandy in Brimhaven again with the truth serum. Select distractions until one works.\",\"i\":[\"Truth serum\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the truth serum on Sandy's coffee mug.\",\"i\":[\"Truth serum\"]},{\"t\":\"Activate the magical orb next to Sandy.\",\"i\":[\"Magical orb\"]},{\"t\":\"Ask Sandy all questions available with the Magical orb (a) in your inventory.\",\"s\":[\"Why is Bert's rota different from the original?\",\"Why doesn't Bert remember the change in his hours?\",\"What happened to the wizard?\"],\"i\":[\"Magical orb\"]}],\"i\":[\"Truth serum\",\"Magical orb\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to the Wizards' Guild in Yanille and ring the bell outside. Talk to Zavistic Rarve when he appears.\",\"s\":[\"I have a rather sandy problem that I'd like to palm off on you.\"],\"i\":[\"Magical orb\",\"Earth runes (5)\",\"Bucket of sand\"]},{\"t\":\"Give Zavistic Rarve 5 earth runes and a bucket of sand.\",\"s\":[\"I have a rather sandy problem that I'd like to palm off on you.\"],\"i\":[\"Earth runes (5)\",\"Bucket of sand\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel to Entrana (bank all combat gear), and talk to Mazion at the sand pit.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the Wizards' Guild in Yanille and ring the bell outside. Talk to Zavistic Rarve when he appears to finish the quest.\",\"s\":[\"I have a rather sandy problem that I'd like to palm off on you.\"],\"i\":[\"Wizard's head\"]}],\"i\":[\"Earth runes (5)\",\"Bucket of sand\"],\"tr\":[\"Teleport to Port Sarim\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The Heart of Darkness" -> "{\"n\":\"The Heart of Darkness\",\"items\":[\"Coins (30)\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food (10)\",\"Prayer potions (2)\"],\"rec\":[\"Quetzal feed (10)\",\"Limestone brick (3)\",\"Soft clay (4)\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Civitas illa fortis teleport\"],\"enemies\":[\"Several Emissary Brawlers (levels 74 and 86)\",\"Several Emissary Conjurers (level 71)\",\"Prince Itzla Arkan (level 167)\",\"Amoxliatl (level 263)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"8,000 Mining XP\",\"8,000 Thieving XP\",\"8,000 Slayer XP\",\"8,000 Agility XP\",\"Access to Tapoyauik\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Prince Itzla Arkan at the Teomat. You can travel here using Renu the quetzal.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel on Renu to the Quetzacalli Gorge.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Bartender in the pub in the Gorge.\",\"s\":[\"I'd like to rent the basement room.\",\"I'll take it.\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (30)\"]},{\"t\":\"Rest in the bed in the south-eastern room of the pub.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Prince Itzla Arkan in the bedroom.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the shopkeeper east of the pub.\",\"s\":[\"I hear you can offer help to those in need.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Prince Itzla Arkan in the bedroom.\"}],\"i\":[\"Coins (30)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Prince Itzla Arkan (level 167)\"]},{\"n\":\"The Tower\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Optional: if you brought 10 quetzal feed, 3 limestone bricks and 4 soft clay, build the landing site in the north of the salvager overlook before going to the tower. Otherwise, skip this step.\",\"i\":[\"Quetzal feed (10)\",\"Limestone brick (3)\",\"Soft clay (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"If you're still at the pub, go through the large gate to the north. Run east past the proudspire to the Tower of Ascension, south-east of the salvager overlook. Talk to the prince just outside the tower's entrance.\",\"s\":[\"Alright, I'll get mingling.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Felius outside the tower.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Caritta outside the tower.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sergius outside the tower.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Nova outside the tower.\"},{\"t\":\"Make sure no pet is following you, then talk to the prince at the Tower of Ascension to the south-east of the salvager overlook again.\",\"s\":[\"Could you remind me what Ximoua is?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Forebearer Janus inside the tower.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the staircase in the tower to the first challenge.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food (10)\"],\"tr\":[\"Quetzal feed (10)\"],\"r\":[\"Stamina potions\",\"Limestone brick (3)\",\"Soft clay (4)\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"First Trial\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pickpocket one of the emissary ascended.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the key to open the gate in the south-east corner of the room.\",\"i\":[\"Tower key\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south-east chest for a book and some paper.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the book.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the south-west chest.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the chest using the code from the book: the first letter of each white word, in order.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the poem.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the prince in the room and ask him to translate the words in the poem.\",\"s\":[\"Makt.\",\"Takam.\",\"Silam.\",\"Thanks! Could you translate another?\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the north-west chest.\"},{\"t\":\"Solve the arrow puzzle by tapping them in the right order. The four white words in the poem give the order: Makt is Up, Takam is Right, Uitt is Down and Silam is Left.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect one of the scraps to combine them.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the completed note.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Janus on this floor and tell him the passcode from the note. Do not go downstairs to speak to him, as that resets the trial.\",\"s\":[\"About that passphrase...\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Second Trial\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Forebearer Janus, ready to fight.\",\"s\":[\"Yes! I'm ready.\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the waves of enemies. Use Protect from Melee. You can heal yourself and the prince using bandages from the chests in the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Forebearer Janus again to progress to the third trial.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"Proceed to the next trial.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Third Trial\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the prince in the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Tenoch.\",\"s\":[\"Interrogate Tenoch.\",\"Tell me about the Final Dawn.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Silia.\",\"s\":[\"Interrogate Silia.\",\"Tell me about the Final Dawn.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Adrius.\",\"s\":[\"Interrogate Adrius.\",\"Tell me about the Final Dawn.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Eleuia.\",\"s\":[\"Interrogate Eleuia.\",\"Tell me about the Final Dawn.\"]},{\"t\":\"The guilty emissary is the one who mentions Mictl when you ask \\\"Tell me about the Final Dawn.\\\" Talk to them again and choose to accuse them. If nobody mentions Mictl, leave the floor and come back.\",\"s\":[\"Tell me about the Final Dawn.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Janus to go to the final trial, ready for a fight.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Final Trial\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Defeat the prince. Use Protect from Melee. He will protect from any special attacks you do. He can do a sword swipe to turn off your prayers. Simply re-activate them straight away. If he says he's doing a slam attack, step on the tile behind him to dodge it.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Janus to wrap up the final trial.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Cult\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Janus at the bottom of the tower.\"},{\"t\":\"Make sure you have 4 free inventory slots, then search the chest in the south of the tower for some emissary robes.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the prince to have him follow you.\"},{\"t\":\"Wear all the emissary robes, then enter the temple to the east of the tower for a cutscene.\",\"i\":[\"Emissary robes\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the prince in the temple.\",\"i\":[\"Emissary robes\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Forebearer Fides in the temple.\",\"i\":[\"Emissary robes\"]}]},{\"n\":\"The Old Ones\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go down the stairs south-east of the temple. Be equipped for a fight.\"},{\"t\":\"Take a pickaxe from the nearby barrel.\"},{\"t\":\"Mine the nearby rocks.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Pull the lever in the south-east of the area. Make sure to avoid the wall spikes.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the ledge east of the lever.\"},{\"t\":\"From the bottom of the ledge, run east past the frost crabs, then north along the middle path to avoid the floor spike traps. Climb across the icy ledge at the north end.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the lever in the north-east room. Avoid the floor traps.\"},{\"t\":\"Jump over the frozen platforms to the north-west, and climb down the ledge there.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the third lever in the north-west room.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the final lever in the south-west, near the gate.\"},{\"t\":\"Pull the chain to unlock a shortcut.\"},{\"t\":\"Only if you left the area after unlocking the shortcut: climb down the shortcut chain to the west of the entrance. Otherwise, skip this step.\"},{\"t\":\"Go west through the gate you just opened. Inspect the air markings in the north-east of the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the earth markings in the south-east of the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the urn with an air symbol on it near to the earth markings in the south-east of the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the urn with an earth symbol on it near to the earth markings in the south-east of the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the water markings in the south-west of the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the fire markings in the north-west of the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the urn with an fire symbol on it near to the water markings in the south-west of the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the urn with an water symbol on it near to the water markings in the south-west of the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Fix the broken water statue in the west of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Water icon\"]},{\"t\":\"Fix the broken fire statue in the west of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Fire icon\"]},{\"t\":\"Fix the broken earth statue in the west of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Earth icon\"]},{\"t\":\"Fix the broken air statue in the west of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Air icon\"]},{\"t\":\"Activate the first statue in the order, in the west of the room. It's the element whose markings say Zema.\"},{\"t\":\"Activate the second statue in the order, in the west of the room. It's the element whose markings say Oma.\"},{\"t\":\"Activate the third statue in the order, in the west of the room. It's the element whose markings say Yeya.\"},{\"t\":\"Activate the fourth statue in the order, in the west of the room. It's the element whose markings say Naui.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the door to the west, ready for the boss.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Amoxliatl. Use Protect from Magic. Ice spikes will appear on the floor, move off the tile to avoid them. She may disable your prayers and shoot an icicle at you. Simply turn back on Protect from Magic. Ice blocks may appear. Use melee to destroy them all before they explode and heal the boss.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the palace in Civitas illa Fortis to complete the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"tr\":[\"Civitas illa fortis teleport\"],\"r\":[\"Food (10)\",\"Prayer potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Amoxliatl (level 263)\"]}]}"
        "The Ides of Milk" -> "{\"n\":\"The Ides of Milk\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"],\"enemies\":[\"Bull (level 30)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"Access to the cow boss\",\"Cow bell amulet and magic lamp (1,000 XP combat/Prayer) from Gillie Groats\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Cassius by the pond north-west of Lumbridge to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Investigation\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Gillie Groats at the cow field east of Lumbridge.\",\"s\":[\"Can you share what makes your cows so productive?\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Seth Groats at his farmhouse east of the River Lum.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the shelves in Seth's farmhouse for 'The groats principles'.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Milk tasting\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Cassius with the book.\",\"i\":[\"The groats principles\"]},{\"t\":\"Drink the milk sample near Cassius.\",\"i\":[\"Milk sample\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Cassius after drinking the milk sample.\"}]},{\"n\":\"The Duke's opinion\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Duke Horacio on the first floor of Lumbridge Castle.\",\"i\":[\"Milk sample\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Gillie Groats at the cow field.\"},{\"t\":\"Drink the milk sample near Gillie.\",\"i\":[\"Milk sample\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Gillie Groats after drinking the milk sample.\"}]},{\"n\":\"The bull fight\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Open the bull pen gate in the north-east corner of the cow field to fight the Bull (level 30). Protect from Melee blocks his basic attacks. His special attacks can hit over 15: when he snorts, step two tiles to either side or one tile back, and when he growls, step two tiles to either side.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Gillie Groats after defeating the Bull.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Bull (level 30)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finishing up\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Cassius to complete the quest. You can then speak to Gillie Groats for a cow bell amulet and magic lamp (1,000 XP combat/Prayer).\"}]}]}"
        "The Knight's Sword" -> "{\"n\":\"The Knight's Sword\",\"items\":[\"Redberry pie\",\"Iron bar (2)\",\"Any pickaxe\"],\"rec\":[\"A teleport to Varrock\",\"Teleports to Falador (3)\",\"A teleport near Mudskipper Point, such as POH teleport or Fairy Ring to AIQ (2)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Able to survive attacks from Ice Warriors (level 57) and Ice Giants (level 53)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"12,725 Smithing XP\",\"The ability to smelt Blurite ore.\",\"The ability to smith Blurite bars.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Squire in Falador Castle's courtyard.\",\"s\":[\"And how is life as a squire?\",\"I can make a new sword if you like...\",\"So would these dwarves make another one?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Reldo in Varrock Castle's library.\",\"s\":[\"What do you know about the Imcando dwarves?\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Finding an Imcando\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Thurgo south of Port Sarim and give him a redberry pie.\",\"s\":[\"Would you like a redberry pie?\"],\"i\":[\"Redberry pie\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Thurgo again.\",\"s\":[\"Something else.\",\"Can you make a special sword for me?\"]}],\"i\":[\"Redberry pie\"]},{\"n\":\"Find the portrait\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Squire in Falador Castle's courtyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the east ladder in Falador Castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up the staircase west of the ladder on the 1st floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the cupboard in the room south of the staircase. You'll need Sir Vyvin to be in the other room.\"},{\"t\":\"Bring Thurgo the portrait.\",\"s\":[\"About that sword...\"],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Iron bar (2)\",\"Portrait\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Making the sword\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go down the trapdoor east of Thurgo, south of Port Sarim. Be prepared for ice giants and ice warriors to attack you.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Iron bar (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Inside the dungeon, follow the path west, north and then east. Keep to the southern wall in the icy area and mine a blurite ore.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Thurgo with a blurite ore and two iron bars.\",\"s\":[\"Can you make that replacement sword now?\"],\"i\":[\"Blurite ore\",\"Iron bar (2)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Iron bar (2)\"]},{\"n\":\"Return the sword\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to the Squire with the sword to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Blurite sword\"]}]}]}"
        "The Lost Tribe" -> "{\"n\":\"The Lost Tribe\",\"items\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"A light source\"],\"rec\":[\"Lumbridge teleports (3)\",\"Varrock teleport\",\"Falador teleport\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"3,000 Mining XP\",\"Ring of Life\",\"Access to the Dorgesh-Kaan mine.\",\"Access to Nardok's Bone Weapon Store\",\"2 new goblin emotes.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sigmund on the first floor of Lumbridge Castle.\",\"s\":[\"Do you have any quests for me?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"In Lumbridge, ask the Cook, Father Aereck and Bob \\\"Do you know what happened in the castle cellar?\\\" and Hans \\\"Do you know what happened in the cellar?\\\" Stop when one of them tells you about seeing a goblin.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Duke Horacio on the first floor of Lumbridge Castle. Choose the line that names the person who told you about the goblin, such as \\\"The cook says he saw something in the cellar\\\".\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Investigating\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use a pickaxe on the rubble in the Lumbridge Castle basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole in Lumbridge Castle's basement.\"},{\"t\":\"With your light source lit, pick up the brooch on the cave floor, about 10 steps south-east of the hole. Then go straight back to the cellar, as walking further can drop you into a pit.\",\"i\":[\"Brooch\"]},{\"t\":\"Show the brooch to Duke Horacio on the first floor of Lumbridge Castle.\",\"s\":[\"I dug through the rubble...\"],\"i\":[\"Brooch\"]}],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"A light source\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Learning about goblins\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Reldo in the Varrock Castle Library and show him the brooch. Then search the north west bookcase, the northern one on the west wall, for the goblin symbol book.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the entire goblin symbol book.\",\"i\":[\"Goblin symbol book\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Goblin Generals in the Goblin Village.\",\"s\":[\"Have you ever heard of the Dorgeshuun?\",\"It doesn't really matter\",\"Well either way they refused to fight\",\"Well I found a brooch underground...\",\"Well why not show me both greetings?\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Making contact\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"With a lit light source, go through the hole in the Lumbridge Castle basement and follow the tunnels east to Mistag. Stay on the safe path: a wrong turn drops you in a hole and puts your light out. Goblin symbols on the rocks show the way: Rekeshuun means north, Idithuun south, Ekeleshuun east and Narogoshuun west. Tapping ahead on the minimap also follows the safe path.\",\"i\":[\"A light source\"]},{\"t\":\"Perform the Goblin Bow emote next to Mistag and talk to him.\",\"i\":[\"A light source\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Mistag to fast-travel back to Lumbridge. Then talk to Duke Horacio on the first floor of Lumbridge Castle.\",\"s\":[\"Can you show me the way out of the mines?\",\"I've made contact with the cave goblins...\"]}],\"i\":[\"A light source\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Resolving tensions\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pickpocket Sigmund for a key. He's on the first floor of Lumbridge Castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the chest in the room next to the Duke's room.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the H.A.M. hideout's trapdoor, north-west of Lumbridge Castle, and pick its lock. It may take a few tries. You don't need a lockpick, but one helps if your Thieving is low.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the trapdoor and search the crate just south of the ladder for the silverware.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the silverware to Duke Horacio.\",\"s\":[\"I found the missing silverware in the HAM cave!\"]},{\"t\":\"Go through the hole in the Lumbridge Castle basement and talk to Kazgar to travel to Mistag. Then talk to Mistag with the peace treaty in your inventory.\",\"s\":[\"Can you show me the way to the mines?\",\"What was I doing again?\"]}],\"i\":[\"A light source\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The Queen of Thieves" -> "{\"n\":\"The Queen of Thieves\",\"items\":[\"Stew\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"2,000 Thieving XP\",\"2000 x Coins\",\"A page for Kharedst's Memoirs\",\"Access to The Warrens.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Investigation\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Tomas Lawry outside the Port Piscarilius bank.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for a quest.\",\"What are you investigating?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to the poor looking woman in the house just south of the bridge in Port Piscarilius.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Robert O'Reilly in the house just west of the bridge, south of Tomas Lawry, and give him the bowl of stew.\",\"s\":[\"Okay.\"],\"i\":[\"Stew\"]}],\"i\":[\"Stew\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Gaining Trust\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Warrens through the manhole a short walk east of Robert O'Reilly's house, marked by the dungeon icon on the minimap.\"},{\"t\":\"From the bottom of the manhole, go a little south, then west over the two small bridges to the large island. Speak to Devan Rutter near the fish stall.\",\"s\":[\"Nope, sounds good to me.\"]},{\"t\":\"Exit the Warrens.\"},{\"t\":\"Murder Conrad King on the dock on the south side of the Piscarilius Foodhall, the largest building, east of the manhole.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the Warrens.\"},{\"t\":\"Tell Devan Rutter about the murder.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Exposing Hughes\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the tent just north of Devan Rutter and talk to the Queen of Thieves.\"},{\"t\":\"Exit the Warrens.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to Kingstown and head east to the council members' houses. Councillor Hughes' home is the house immediately north, south of the rare trees icon on the minimap. Go up the stairs inside.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick the locked chest.\"},{\"t\":\"Go downstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Tomas Lawry in Port Piscarilius.\",\"s\":[\"Let's talk about my quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Letter\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Warrens.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lady Shauna Piscarilius, the Queen of Thieves, in the tent north of Devan Rutter.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The Red Reef" -> "{\"n\":\"The Red Reef\",\"items\":[\"Ranged/Mage combat gear to skip boat combat, or a boat with cannons to deal with pirates. An upgraded keel helps with survival. (Mithril is more than enough)\",\"Combat gear\"],\"rec\":[\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Boat repair kits (5)\"],\"enemies\":[\"2 pirate ships, or the crew on the ship with ranged combat gear\",\"6 pirates (lvl 52)\",\"Black Eye Bethel (lvl 191)\",\"Giant lobster (lvl 112)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"15,000 Sailing XP\",\"5,000 Smithing XP\",\"Bosun's Workbench Schematic\",\"Access to the Great Conch sacred grove\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Finding Floopa\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Elder Raley at his home in The Great Conch to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Finn, south-east of Elder Raley's house, about Floopa's whereabouts.\"},{\"t\":\"Head to the entrance of The Sacred Grove, north of Finn, and talk to Elder Katt there. You can't walk straight north: go north-west out of town, round the west side, then follow the path east to the entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter The Sacred Grove and talk to Floopa.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Infiltrating the Red Reef\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Sail to Red Rock, north-west of The Great Conch.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the receptionist on Red Rock.\"},{\"t\":\"Familiarize yourself with the history of the Red Reef Trading Company by inspecting the display cases around the building.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Theodore Paxton.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Dealing with Black Eye Bethel\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get ready for boat combat, then sail south towards Last Light and deal with Black Eye Bethel. Protect from Missiles to avoid most damage. Repair your ship. Combat is over when all boats are sunk or all pirates are killed.\",\"i\":[\"Ranged/Mage combat gear to skip boat combat, or a boat with cannons to deal with pirates. An upgraded keel helps with survival. (Mithril is more than enough)\",\"Combat gear to fight Black Eye Bethel\"]},{\"t\":\"Disembark at Last Light.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill all six pirates at Last Light.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the staircase twice to reach Black Eye Bethel, then kill her. Use Protect from Melee to avoid some damage. Avoid her charge attack. Re-enable your prayers if she disables them.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear to fight Black Eye Bethel\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Theodore Paxton on Red Rock with the good news.\"}],\"i\":[\"Ranged/Mage combat gear to skip boat combat, or a boat with cannons to deal with pirates. An upgraded keel helps with survival. (Mithril is more than enough)\",\"Combat gear to fight Black Eye Bethel\"],\"r\":[\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Boat repair kits (5)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"6 pirates (lvl 52)\",\"Black Eye Bethel (lvl 191)\"]},{\"n\":\"Helping the Zenith\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Sail to and board the Zenith, east of Red Rock. If you don't see the Zenith there, try hopping to a different world.\",\"i\":[\"Any combat gear to fight a giant lobster\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Spencer Brentwood aboard the Zenith.\",\"i\":[\"Any combat gear to fight a giant lobster\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Spencer Brentwood again with the deep sea diving gear equipped to dive down to the bottom of the sea.\",\"s\":[\"Let's go.\"],\"i\":[\"Any combat gear to fight a giant lobster\",\"Deep sea helmet\",\"Deep sea apparatus\"]},{\"t\":\"Listen to Spencer Brentwood's instructions.\"},{\"t\":\"Head north and repair the Coral dredger, ready to fight a Giant lobster.\",\"i\":[\"Any combat gear to fight a giant lobster\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Giant lobster. Avoid the blue particles on the floor.\"},{\"t\":\"Repair the Coral dredger.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Spencer Brentwood near the eastern coral dredger.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Spencer Brentwood aboard the Zenith after repairing the coral dredgers.\"}],\"i\":[\"Any combat gear to fight a giant lobster\"],\"r\":[\"Food\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Giant lobster (lvl 112)\"]},{\"n\":\"Return to Floopa\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Spencer Brentwood to get off the Zenith and back onto your boat. Then sail to The Great Conch and return to Floopa at Elder Raley's house.\",\"s\":[\"Actually, I'd like to disembark.\"]}]}]}"
        "The Restless Ghost" -> "{\"n\":\"The Restless Ghost\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[\"Lumbridge teleports (2)\",\"Necklace of passage\"],\"enemies\":[\"A skeleton (level 13) you can run away from\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,125 Prayer XP\",\"Ghostspeak amulet\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Talk to Father Aereck\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Father Aereck in the Lumbridge Church.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for a quest!\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Get a ghostspeak amulet\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Father Urhney, west of the Lumbridge Swamp.\",\"s\":[\"Father Aereck sent me to talk to you.\",\"He's got a ghost haunting his graveyard.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Talk to the ghost\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Open the coffin in the Lumbridge Graveyard to spawn the ghost.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"If the ghost didn't appear when you opened the coffin, search the coffin to make it appear. Otherwise, skip this step.\",\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to the Ghost that appears whilst wearing your Ghostspeak Amulet.\",\"s\":[\"Yep, now tell me what the problem is.\",\"Yep, clever aren't I?.\",\"Yes, ok. Do you know WHY you're a ghost?\",\"Yes, ok. Do you know why you're a ghost?\"],\"i\":[\"Ghostspeak amulet\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Return the ghost's skull\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Wizards' Tower basement, south of Draynor village.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the Altar. A skeleton (level 13) will appear and attack you, but you can just run away.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the basement.\",\"i\":[\"Ghost's skull\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the ghost's coffin in the Lumbridge graveyard.\",\"i\":[\"Ghost's skull\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the ghost's skull on the open coffin to finish the quest. If nothing happens, search the coffin.\",\"i\":[\"Ghost's skull\"]}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"A skeleton (level 13) you can run away from\"]}]}"
        "The Ribbiting Tale of a Lily Pad Labour Dispute" -> "{\"n\":\"The Ribbiting Tale of a Lily Pad Labour Dispute\",\"items\":[\"Any axe\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Cuthbert, Lord of Dread (level 1)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"2,000 Woodcutting XP\",\"Access to a new Hardwood Farming Patch\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Toad-aly mad\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Marcellus near the Locus Oasis south of Civitas illa Fortis. AJP Fairy ring is fastest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the blue frogs in the north-east of the oasis.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Marcellus.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the blue frogs Sue and Gary in the north-east of the oasis.\"}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"n\":\"Rig-it\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the yellow frogs Jane and Dave to the south of Gary.\"},{\"t\":\"Chop down the orange tree next to the yellow frogs. If you have no axe, take the bronze axe from the logs next to Marcellus.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Sabotage the lily pad near to the yellow frogs.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Sue and Gary in the north-east of the oasis.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Hopping to conclusions\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Marcellus.\"},{\"t\":\"Go talk to Sue and Gary to discuss framing the flies.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the building next to Marcellus and enter the code NALIA.\"},{\"t\":\"Plant the plushy in the capybara dung east of Marcellus, south of the orange tree.\"},{\"t\":\"If Cuthbert doesn't appear when you plant the plushy, inspect the dung east of Marcellus, south of the orange tree.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Cuthbert, Lord of Dread.\"},{\"t\":\"Tell Marcellus about the plushy.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sue and Gary to resolve the dispute!\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Cuthbert, Lord of Dread (level 1)\"]}]}"
        "The Slug Menace" -> "{\"n\":\"The Slug Menace\",\"items\":[\"Commorb (can get another from Sir Tiffy)\",\"Swamp paste\",\"Rune/pure essence, 15 to be safe (5)\",\"Chisel\",\"Access to the Air, Water, Earth, Fire, and Mind runecrafting altars\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport near Air Altar\",\"Teleport near Earth Altar\",\"Teleport near Fire Altar\",\"Teleport near Water Altar\",\"Teleport near Mind Altar\",\"Ardougne teleports (3)\",\"Necklace of Passage\"],\"enemies\":[\"Slug Prince (level 62) (can only be hurt by melee)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"3,500 Runecraft XP\",\"3,500 Crafting XP\",\"3,500 Thieving XP\",\"Ability to purchase and equip Proselyte equipment.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sir Tiffy Cashien in Falador Park.\",\"s\":[\"Do you have any jobs for me yet?\"],\"i\":[\"Commorb (can get another from Sir Tiffy)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Commorb (can get another from Sir Tiffy)\"]},{\"n\":\"Investigating\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Col. O'Niall on the pier in Witchaven, east of Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Who are the important people in Witchaven?\",\"Nothing at the moment thanks.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brother Maledict in the church.\",\"s\":[\"That's enough for now.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Mayor Hobb in north west Witchaven. When Savant asks you to, scan with your commorb v2.\",\"s\":[\"I'm just looking around.\",\"Nothing at the moment thanks.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Holgart north of Witchaven.\",\"s\":[\"Nothing at the moment thanks.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Col. O'Niall on the pier in Witchaven.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the old ruin entrance west of Witchaven.\",\"s\":[\"That's enough for now.\"]},{\"t\":\"Push the wall just east of where you come down.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the path until you reach an imposing door, and try opening it. After, try scanning with the commorb v2.\",\"i\":[\"Commorb v2\"]},{\"t\":\"Try scanning with the commorb.\",\"i\":[\"Commorb (can get another from Sir Tiffy)\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the dead sea slug next to the imposing door.\",\"i\":[\"Dead sea slug\"]}],\"i\":[\"Commorb v2\"]},{\"n\":\"Uncovering the truth\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Jorral at the Outpost, north-west of Ardougne. A necklace of passage teleports you there.\",\"s\":[\"Translations\"],\"i\":[\"Door transcription\",\"Necklace of Passage\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Col. O'Niall on the pier in Witchaven.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Brother Maledict in the church.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the study desk in the Mayor's house for a page.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ezekial Lovecraft in the fishing shop in east Witchaven for a page.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Col. O'Niall on the pier in Witchaven for a page.\"},{\"t\":\"Use some swamp paste on one of the page fragments.\",\"i\":[\"Swamp paste\",\"Fragment 1\",\"Fragment 2\",\"Fragment 3\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Jeb north of Witchaven to travel to the Fishing Platform.\",\"i\":[\"Dead sea slug\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Bailey on the Fishing Platform.\",\"i\":[\"Dead sea slug\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the slug glue on one of the fragments.\",\"i\":[\"Sea slug glue\",\"Fragment 1\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine the fragments.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press each page and choose its shape option to turn rune or pure essence into empty runes. Take each empty rune and use it on its respective Runecrafting Altar. Bring extra essence (~10 extra) as it is possible to accidentally destroy the essence upon creation.\",\"i\":[\"Page 1\",\"Page 2\",\"Page 3\",\"Rune or Pure Essence\",\"Chisel\"]}],\"i\":[\"Door transcription\",\"Commorb v2\",\"Dead sea slug\",\"Swamp paste\",\"Chisel\",\"Rune/pure essence, 15 to be safe (5)\",\"Access to the Air, Water, Earth, Fire, and Mind runecrafting altars\"]},{\"n\":\"Facing the prince\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Prepare to fight the Slug Prince (level 62). Only melee can hurt it. Then, enter the old ruin entrance west of Witchaven.\",\"i\":[\"Melee weapon to fight the Slug Prince\",\"Air rune\",\"Water rune\",\"Earth rune\",\"Fire rune\",\"Mind rune\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the wall just east of where you come down.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the runes on the imposing doors at the end of the path.\",\"i\":[\"Air rune\",\"Water rune\",\"Earth rune\",\"Fire rune\",\"Mind rune\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Slug Prince. Only melee can hurt it.\"},{\"t\":\"Report back to Sir Tiffy Cashien in Falador Park.\",\"s\":[\"Slug Menace.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Melee weapon to fight the Slug Prince\",\"Air rune\",\"Water rune\",\"Earth rune\",\"Fire rune\",\"Mind rune\",\"Commorb v2\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Slug Prince (level 62) (can only be hurt by melee)\"]}]}"
        "The Tourist Trap" -> "{\"n\":\"The Tourist Trap\",\"items\":[\"Desert shirt\",\"Desert robe\",\"Desert boots\",\"Bronze bars (3)\",\"Hammer\",\"Feather (50)\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Waterskins\",\"Knife\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Coins (100)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Mercenary Captain (level 47)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"2 x 4,650 Exp. Lamps (Agility, Fletching, Smithing or Thieving)\",\"Ability to smith darts.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Investigating the trap\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Irena south of the Shantay Pass.\",\"s\":[\"What's the matter?\",\"Is there a reward if I get her back?\",\"I'll look for your daughter.\",\"Okay Irena, calm down. I'll get your daughter back for you.\",\"Yes, I'll go on this quest!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Mercenary Captain outside the Desert Mining Camp. When he attacks you, kill him for a key.\",\"s\":[\"Wow! A real captain!\",\"I'd love to work for a tough guy like you!\",\"Can't I do something for a strong Captain like you?\",\"Sorry Sir, I don't think I can do that.\",\"It's a funny captain who can't fight his own battles!\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"UNEQUIP ALL COMBAT GEAR and enter the camp. Wearing armour or weapons in the camp gets you jailed. If you're jailed, bend the cell window and escape through it, climb the rocks, climb the cliff, then climb down the west of the cliff. If you're sent to the mining room, mine 15 rocks to be able to leave.\",\"i\":[\"Desert shirt\",\"Desert robe\",\"Desert boots\",\"Metal key\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Male Slave to the east to trade your desert robes for his slave robes.\",\"s\":[\"I've just arrived.\",\"Okay, you caught me out.\",\"Oh yes, that sounds interesting.\",\"What's that then?\",\"I can try to undo them for you.\",\"It's funny you should say that...\",\"Yeah, okay, let's give it a go.\",\"Yes, I'll trade.\"],\"i\":[\"Desert shirt\",\"Desert robe\",\"Desert boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip the slave clothes, and enter the mine door in the north east of the camp.\",\"i\":[\"Slave shirt\",\"Slave robe\",\"Slave boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the cave around and talk to a guard guarding the deeper cave.\",\"s\":[\"I'd like to mine in a different area.\",\"Yes sir, you're quite right sir.\",\"Yes sir, we understand each other perfectly.\"],\"i\":[\"Slave shirt\",\"Slave robe\",\"Slave boots\"]}],\"i\":[\"Desert shirt\",\"Desert robe\",\"Desert boots\",\"Bronze bars (3)\",\"Hammer\",\"Feather (50)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Mercenary Captain (level 47)\"]},{\"n\":\"Helping out\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to the surface, then UNEQUIP THE SLAVE CLOTHES and leave the camp. Go west to the Bedabin Camp and talk to Al Shabim in its south tent.\",\"s\":[\"I am looking for a pineapple.\",\"Yes, I'm interested.\"]},{\"t\":\"UNEQUIP ALL COMBAT GEAR and enter the camp.\",\"i\":[\"Metal key\",\"Bedabin key\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb up the ladder in the northern building of the camp.\",\"i\":[\"Bedabin key\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south west bookcase.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Captain Siad about sailing to distract him.\",\"s\":[\"I wanted to have a chat?\",\"You seem to have a lot of books!\",\"So, you're interested in sailing?\",\"I could tell by the cut of your jib.\"],\"i\":[\"Bedabin key\"]},{\"t\":\"While Captain Siad is distracted, search the chest.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Al Shabim in the Bedabin Camp with the plans.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'm very interested.\",\"Yes, I'm kind of curious.\"],\"i\":[\"Technical plans\",\"Bronze bar\",\"Hammer\",\"Feather (50)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the north tent and attempt to make a prototype dart tip on the anvil. Bring all 3 bars with you for this.\",\"s\":[\"Yes. I'd like to try.\"],\"i\":[\"Technical plans\",\"Bronze bar\",\"Hammer\",\"Feather (50)\"]},{\"t\":\"Add 10 feathers to the prototype dart tip.\",\"i\":[\"Prototype dart tip\",\"Feather (50)\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the prototype dart to Al Shabim.\",\"i\":[\"Prototype dart\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bronze bars (3)\",\"Hammer\",\"Feather (50)\"]},{\"n\":\"Freeing Ana\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"UNEQUIP ALL COMBAT GEAR and enter the camp.\",\"i\":[\"Metal key\",\"Tenti pineapple\",\"Slave shirt\",\"Slave robe\",\"Slave boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip the slave clothes, and enter the mine door in the north east of the camp.\",\"i\":[\"Slave shirt\",\"Slave robe\",\"Slave boots\",\"Tenti pineapple\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the cave around and talk to a guard guarding the deeper cave.\",\"i\":[\"Slave shirt\",\"Slave robe\",\"Slave boots\",\"Tenti pineapple\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the deeper mines.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the barrel next to the mine cart and choose Search to get a barrel.\",\"s\":[\"Yeah, cool!\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the mine cart and choose Search to ride it to the next room.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, of course.\"],\"i\":[\"Barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the path west then north until you find Ana. Use the barrel on her.\",\"i\":[\"Barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Use Ana on the mine cart you came in on.\",\"i\":[\"Ana in a barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Return in the mine cart you came in on.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, of course.\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the barrel next to the mine cart and choose Search to find Ana.\"},{\"t\":\"Use Ana in a barrel on the winch bucket in the north-west of the room to send her to the surface.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please.\",\"I said you were very gregarious!\"],\"i\":[\"Ana in a barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the surface. If Ana was captured again, search the barrel next to the mine cart for her.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the winch in the south-west of the camp and choose Operate.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the barrel west of the winch and choose Search. If it's empty, operate the winch again.\"},{\"t\":\"Use Ana on the cart in the middle of the camp.\",\"i\":[\"Ana in a barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Mine Cart Driver to escape. Once he's agreed to take you, long-press the wooden cart and choose Search to escape.\",\"s\":[\"Nice cart.\",\"One wagon wheel says to the other, 'I'll see you around'.\",\"'One good turn deserves another'\",\"Fired... no, shot perhaps!\",\"In for a penny in for a pound.\",\"Well, you see, it's like this...\",\"Prison riot in ten minutes, get your cart out of here!\",\"You can't leave me here, I'll get killed!\",\"Yes, I'll get on.\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring Ana to Irena south of the Shantay Pass.\",\"i\":[\"Ana in a barrel\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ana outside the Shantay Pass.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Irena south of the Shantay Pass to finish the quest!\"}],\"i\":[\"Slave shirt\",\"Slave robe\",\"Slave boots\"]}]}"
        "Throne of Miscellania" -> "{\"n\":\"Throne of Miscellania\",\"items\":[\"Iron bar\",\"Logs\",\"Any non-silver ring you are willing to lose\",\"Flowers\",\"Any normal/oak/willow/maple/yew shortbow or longbow (if courting Astrid)\",\"Cake (if courting Brand)\",\"One of these, to raise approval: an axe (45 Woodcutting), a rake (10 Farming), a pickaxe (35 Mining), or a harpoon or lobster pot (35 Fishing)\"],\"rec\":[\"Dramen staff if travelling via Fairy Ring CIP\",\"Potions/Items to restore run energy\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"Ability to manage Miscellania.\",\"Ability to teleport to Miscellania with the Ring of Wealth.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Talk to King Vargas\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Travel to Miscellania. You can take a boat from Rellekka. You can also use Fairy Rings to teleport there with the code CIP If you've unlocked them.\"},{\"t\":\"Buy some flowers from the Flower Girl in the courtyard of Miscellania castle for 15gp.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, please.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs in Miscellania castle and talk to King Vargas. You can choose whether to get Brand's or Astrid's approval.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"If I may be so bold...\"]}],\"i\":[\"Flowers\",\"Any normal/oak/willow/maple/yew shortbow or longbow (if courting Astrid)\",\"Cake (if courting Brand)\",\"Any non-silver ring you are willing to lose\",\"Iron bar\",\"Logs\",\"One of: \"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Win over Astrid (only if you chose her)\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Only do this section if you chose Princess Astrid. If you chose Prince Brand, skip to the section \\\"Win over Brand (only if you chose him)\\\". Go upstairs in the Miscellania castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Keep talking to Princess Astrid, in the room directly north of the King, until she only says \\\"Good day\\\".\",\"s\":[\"Archery is a noble art!\",\"He's been very helpful.\",\"Hahahaha!\"]},{\"t\":\"Use flowers on Astrid.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Flowers\"]},{\"t\":\"Dance in Princess Astrid's room.\"},{\"t\":\"Keep talking to Princess Astrid until she only says \\\"Good day\\\".\",\"s\":[\"What happened next?\",\"That sounds like a good idea.\",\"I'm quite fond of it myself.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use any bow on Astrid.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Any normal/oak/willow/maple/yew shortbow or longbow (if courting Astrid)\"]},{\"t\":\"Keep talking to Princess Astrid until she calls you \\\"Dear\\\" or \\\"Darling\\\".\",\"s\":[\"It's a lovely little country.\",\"I suppose you don't have much opportunity to.\",\"And what a great bard he makes!\"]},{\"t\":\"Blow kiss emote next to Princess Astrid.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a ring on Astrid.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Any non-silver ring you are willing to lose\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Win over Brand (only if you chose him)\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Only do this section if you chose Prince Brand. If you won over Princess Astrid, skip to the section \\\"Establish peace\\\". Go upstairs in the Miscellania castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Keep talking to Prince Brand, in the room directly south of the King, until he only says \\\"Good day\\\".\",\"s\":[\"Be still, my heart.\",\"You will be the greatest bard!\",\"They don't understand your poetry as I do.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use flowers on Prince Brand.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Flowers\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the Clap emote next to Prince Brand\"},{\"t\":\"Keep talking to Prince Brand until he only says \\\"Good day\\\".\",\"s\":[\"A much nobler pursuit, to be sure.\",\"How inspiring!\",\"How poetic.\"]},{\"t\":\"Give Prince Brand a cake.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Cake (if courting Brand)\"]},{\"t\":\"Keep talking to Prince Brand until he greets you with \\\"Hello, dear\\\" or \\\"Hello, darling\\\".\",\"s\":[\"I'm glad to hear it.\",\"I wouldn't presume to have the skill...\",\"That was lovely. I'm touched!\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the blow kiss emote next to Prince Brand\"},{\"t\":\"Use a ring on Prince Brand.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Any non-silver ring you are willing to lose\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Establish peace\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave the castle and head east, across the bridge, to Etceteria castle. Go upstairs and talk to Queen Sigrid.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Vargas.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Queen Sigrid.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Prince Brand in Miscellania castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Advisor Ghrim.\",\"s\":[\"How do I make peace with Etceteria?\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Queen Sigrid in Etceteria castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to King Vargas.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Derrik in the north of Miscellania.\",\"s\":[\"I have a slightly strange request...\"],\"i\":[\"Iron bar\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the giant nib on some logs. Cut a nearby evergreen if you don't have logs.\",\"i\":[\"Giant nib\",\"Logs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Vargas with the giant pen.\",\"i\":[\"Giant pen\"]}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Get support\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Reach 75% support. Talk to Advisor Ghrim, next to King Vargas upstairs in the castle, to check your rating. You can do any of the following: Rake the farming patches (10 Farming). Mining coal (30 Mining). Cutting maple trees (45 Woodcutting). Fish tuna with a harpoon or lobsters with a lobster pot.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Rake\",\"Harpoon\",\"Lobster pot\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to King Vargas to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"One of: \"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Tower of Life" -> "{\"n\":\"Tower of Life\",\"items\":[\"Beer\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\"],\"rec\":[\"Raw swordfish (for diary task)\",\"Raw chicken (for diary task)\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"1,000 Construction XP\",\"500 Crafting XP\",\"500 Thieving XP\",\"Access to Creature Creation.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Effigy outside the Tower of Life, south of East Ardougne. Fairy ring DJP is closest: he's south-west of it.\",\"s\":[\"Sure, why not.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Bonafido by the boxes just north of the tower's entrance.\"}],\"i\":[\"Saw\",\"Hammer\",\"Beer\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Get the Builders' outfit\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get the Hard Hat from 'Black-eye' by answering his three questions.\",\"s\":[\"Three\",\"Torn curtains\",\"10 clay pieces\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to 'No fingers'.\"},{\"t\":\"Pickpocket 'No fingers'.\"},{\"t\":\"Get a Beer for 'The Guns'.\",\"i\":[\"Beer\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to 'The Guns'.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the bushes to the south for some Builder's Trousers. (Hint: try the south-east bushes first).\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Bonafido wearing the Builder's outfit and answer his questions.\",\"s\":[\"Tea\",\"Whistle for attention\",\"Your legs are getting a bit cold\",\"Carry on, it'll fix itself\"],\"i\":[\"Hard Hat\",\"Builder's Shirt\",\"Builder's Trousers\",\"Builder's Boots\"]}],\"i\":[\"Beer\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Fix the tower\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the tower.\",\"i\":[\"Hard Hat\",\"Builder's Shirt\",\"Builder's Trousers\",\"Builder's Boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the crates on the ground floor for 3 metal sheets and 4 coloured balls (west side) and 4 valve wheels (east side). Go up the stairs on the west side and build the Pressure Machine on the north side of the first floor.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Saw\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Calibrate the machine. The wheels are numbered 1 to 4 from the left, and both levers start up. Wheel 1: turn left twice, until the ball plugs the hole, then right until the pipe is full. Pull the left lever down. Wheel 2: turn left twice, until the ball plugs the hole, then right until the pipe is full. Wheel 3: turn right twice, until water starts dripping, then left once to plug the hole, then right until the pipe is full. Pull the right lever down. Wheel 4: turn right three times, until water starts dripping, then left once to plug the hole, then right until the pipe is full. A message says the machine is working.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back down to the ground floor and search the crates for 4 pipes and 5 pipe rings (north side) and 6 rivets (east side). Go up the west stairs, then the east stairs on the next floor, and build the Pipe Machine on the south side of the second floor.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Calibrate the pipe machine. It works like a jigsaw: select a pipe piece and use the arrow and rotation controls at the bottom to move it into place. A piece locks when it is in the correct spot, and only the largest piece needs rotating.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back down to the ground floor and search the crates at the south end for 5 metal bars and 4 binding fluid. Go up the west stairs, the east stairs, then climb up from the second floor to the top floor and build the cage.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Assemble the cage. Tap horizontal or vertical to make a bar, use + and - to set its size, then tap place bar. A bar that doesn't fit disappears, and you can try again. Each side takes one of these four sets of three bars. A: horizontal 2, horizontal 3, vertical 2. B: horizontal 2, vertical 2, vertical 4. C: horizontal 4, vertical 2, vertical 3. D: horizontal 2, horizontal 2, vertical 2. Start with set A. If a bar from the set disappears, try the next set on that side (after D comes A). When a side has all three bars, turn the cage with the right arrow and use the next set. A message says the cage is complete.\"}],\"i\":[\"Saw\",\"Hammer\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"The Alchemists' Secret\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go back and talk to Effigy.\"},{\"t\":\"Wearing the Builder's outfit, go back into the tower and up to the top floor to follow the alchemists. Watch the cutscene.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back down and talk to Effigy outside the tower.\"},{\"t\":\"Go back up to the top floor and talk to the homunculus. Pick the magic answer to each question until the bar at the top of the screen is fully on Magic. The questions repeat if it isn't full yet. The magic answers are: \\\"With the aid of 5 fire runes.\\\" \\\"With the help of the magical dragonstones!\\\" \\\"Runecraft, enchant jewellery, perform alchemy.\\\" \\\"Turn them into bananas or peaches!\\\" \\\"Depends where you are headed, but teleport spells are a safe bet.\\\" \\\"Yes, you can make magic potions to boost your skills.\\\" \\\"By harnessing the power of the gods!\\\" \\\"Yep, you can use the Telekinetic Grab spell.\\\" \\\"Through the power of alchemy.\\\" \\\"You have special powers - no surprise seeing how you were created.\\\" \\\"How about Magic and Runecrafting?\\\" \\\"Can't see why not, anything is possible.\\\" \\\"Your very existence speaks of mystical forces.\\\" \\\"Magic.\\\"\"},{\"t\":\"Go back down and talk to Effigy outside the tower again.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the tower, go down the trapdoor in the south of the ground floor, and talk to the homunculus in the basement to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Tree Gnome Village" -> "{\"n\":\"Tree Gnome Village\",\"items\":[\"Logs (6)\",\"Combat gear (magic is best)\"],\"rec\":[\"Food\"],\"enemies\":[\"Khazard Warlord (level 112)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"11,450 Attack XP\",\"Gnome amulet\",\"Use of the Spirit Tree transportation method.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Getting started\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Walk through the maze from its entrance on the north-west side. Letters are compass directions and numbers are tiles: E7, S2, E20, S6, W3, S1, W6, N4, W2, S6, W7, S2, E13, N2, E2, S2, E2, N2, E2, S2, E11, S3, E5, S9, W4, S6, E5, S3, W2, S11, W10, N5, E3, S2, E3, N2, E1, N6, W25, N3, W5. You're now inside the village: go north, then east to King Bolren in the centre.\",\"s\":[\"Can I help at all?\",\"I would be glad to help.\",\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"The three trackers\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak with Commander Montai, north-east of the maze entrance.\",\"s\":[\"Ok, I'll gather some wood.\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak with Commander Montai again to give him the wood.\",\"i\":[\"Logs (6)\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak with Commander Montai.\",\"s\":[\"I'll try my best.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the first tracker gnome to the north-west of the battlefield for the height coordinate.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the second tracker gnome in the jail, a building on the east side of the Khazard Stronghold, for the y coordinate.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the third tracker gnome to the south-west of the jail.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the ballista in the south-west corner of the battlefield, past the bridge (not the catapult next to Commander Montai), and fire it. Pick the number that matches what the third tracker told you: \\\"Less than my hands\\\" is 0001, \\\"More than my head, less than my fingers\\\" is 0002, \\\"More than we, less than our feet\\\" is 0003, and \\\"My legs and your legs\\\" is 0004. If you miss, fire again and try another number.\"}],\"i\":[\"Logs (6)\"]},{\"n\":\"Retrieving the orbs\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Walk north to the Khazard Stronghold, the building where the first tracker gnome was, and climb over the crumbled wall. A level 48 Khazard commander attacks you: kill him or ignore him.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the western room and climb the ladder. Another Khazard commander attacks up there. Search the chest for the first orb.\"},{\"t\":\"Return the Orb of protection to King Bolren in the centre of the Tree Gnome Maze. Elkoy, outside the maze, can take you to the centre.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please.\",\"I will find the warlord and bring back the orbs.\"],\"i\":[\"Orb of protection\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Khazard warlord, south west of West Ardougne, ready to fight him.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat the Khazard warlord and retrieve orbs.\"},{\"t\":\"Return the Orbs of protection to King Bolren in the centre of the Tree Gnome Maze. Elkoy, outside the maze, can take you to the centre.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please.\"],\"i\":[\"Orbs of protection\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear (magic is best)\",\"Food\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Khazard Warlord (level 112)\"]}]}"
        "Tribal Totem" -> "{\"n\":\"Tribal Totem\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[\"Coins or more for boat trips (90)\",\"Amulet of glory\",\"Ardougne teleport\",\"Brimhaven teleports (2)\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,775 Thieving XP\",\"5 x Swordfish\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Retrieving the totem\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Kangai Mau in the Brimhaven food store.\",\"s\":[\"I'm in search of adventure!\",\"Ok, I will get it back.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel to the GPDT depot in Ardougne, just south of the eastern bank, and investigate the most northeastern crate for a label.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the address label on the crate two squares south of the crate where you found the label.\",\"i\":[\"Address label\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to a nearby GPDT employee.\",\"s\":[\"So, when are you going to deliver this crate?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Wizard Cromperty in north east Ardougne.\",\"s\":[\"Chat.\",\"So what have you invented?\",\"Can I be teleported please?\",\"Yes, that sounds good. Teleport me!\"]},{\"t\":\"Work out and enter the password for the door to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"FIRST long-press the stairs and choose Investigate to disable a trap, then climb the stairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the chest on the top floor and search it for the totem.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Kangai Mau in Brimhaven.\",\"i\":[\"Totem\"]}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Troll Romance" -> "{\"n\":\"Troll Romance\",\"items\":[\"Iron bar\",\"Maple/yew logs\",\"Rope\",\"Cake tin\",\"Swamp tar\",\"Bucket of wax\",\"Combat gear, food, and potions\",\"Climbing boots\"],\"rec\":[\"Games necklace\"],\"enemies\":[\"Arrg (level 113) can be safe spotted. Please check the wiki for instructions to setup a safe spot.\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"8,000 Agility XP\",\"4,000 Strength XP\",\"Diamond\",\"2 x Rubies\",\"4 x Emeralds\",\"A Sled\",\"Sledding route from Trollweiss Mountain.\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Troll Stronghold and climb down the north staircase to the middle level. Talk to Ug in the south-west room there. If you end up in the prison, go back up its stairs.\",\"s\":[\"Awww, you poor troll. What seems to be the problem?\",\"Don't worry now, I'll see what I can do.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Aga north of Ug, then go back and talk to Ug again.\",\"s\":[\"So... how's your... um... love life?\"]}],\"i\":[\"Climbing boots\"]},{\"n\":\"Make a sled\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Tenzing west of Burthorpe.\",\"s\":[\"Do you know where I can find Trollweiss?\",\"What would I need to make such a sled?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Dunstan in north east Burthorpe.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about a quest.\",\"I need a sled!!\"],\"i\":[\"Iron bar\",\"Maple/yew logs\",\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Dunstan again.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about a quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Iron bar\",\"Maple/yew logs\",\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Use some swamp tar on a bucket of wax.\",\"i\":[\"Swamp tar\",\"Bucket of wax\",\"Cake tin\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the wax on the sled.\",\"i\":[\"Wax\",\"Sled\"]}],\"i\":[\"Maple/yew logs\",\"Iron bar\",\"Rope\",\"Swamp tar\",\"Bucket of wax\",\"Cake tin\"]},{\"n\":\"Get flowers\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"From Trollheim, take the narrow path out of the north-west side, going north, west and north again, past the ice gates and the troll child. Enter the cave there, not the icy gate. There are high leveled ice trolls inside, so Protect from Melee and be careful!\",\"i\":[\"Sled\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the cave via the north crevice.\"},{\"t\":\"Equip the sled.\",\"i\":[\"Sled\"]},{\"t\":\"Sled to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Sled\"]},{\"t\":\"After the sled ride, take off the sled and walk west to the flower patch. Pick a rare flower before doing anything else, and don't sled down the next slope to the south.\"}],\"i\":[\"Sled\"]},{\"n\":\"Fighting for Aga\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Ug with the trollweiss flowers.\",\"i\":[\"Trollweiss\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the room north of Ug and challenge Arrg to a fight. He teleports you to an arena and attacks at once, with melee and thrown rocks.\",\"s\":[\"I am here to kill you!\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food, and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"To safespot him, turn on Protect from Melee and run to the centre of the raised land in the north-west of the arena. When Arrg is on it too, run to the west gate, and he should get stuck against the mountain wall. Be quick: he disappears after a few minutes.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Arrg.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ug in the south west room to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Trollweiss\",\"Combat gear, food, and potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arrg (level 113) can be safe spotted. Please check the wiki for instructions to setup a safe spot.\"]}]}"
        "Troll Stronghold" -> "{\"n\":\"Troll Stronghold\",\"items\":[\"Climbing boots or 12 coins\"],\"rec\":[\"Games necklace\",\"Food + prayer potions\",\"Mage or ranged gear for safe spotting\"],\"enemies\":[\"Dad (level 101) (safespottable)\",\"Troll General (level 113) (safespottable)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"Law Talisman\",\"Ability to make Law Runes\",\"Access to Trollheim and the Troll Stronghold\",\"Access to the God Wars Dungeon\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Denulth in Burthorpe.\",\"s\":[\"How goes your fight with the trolls?\",\"Is there anything I can do to help?\",\"I'll get Godric back!\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Reach the Stronghold\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Follow the path west of Burthorpe, then go along the path going south to Tenzing's hut. If you don't have climbing boots, buy a pair from Tenzing for 12 coins.\",\"s\":[\"Can I buy some Climbing boots?\",\"OK, sounds good.\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb over the stile north of Tenzing.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the path until you reach some rocks. Climb over them.\",\"i\":[\"Climbing boots\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the path from here east until you enter the arena.\"},{\"t\":\"Fight Dad until he gives up. You can safe spot him from the gate you entered through.\",\"s\":[\"I accept your challenge!\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave the arena and continue through the cave to the north.\",\"s\":[\"I'll be going now.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave entrance.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through cave's north exit.\"},{\"t\":\"Follow the path around Trollheim until you reach the Stronghold's entrance. Be wary of thrower trolls on the path, you'll want to use Protect from Ranged.\"}],\"i\":[\"Climbing boots or 12 coins\",\"Mage or ranged gear for safe spotting\",\"Food + prayer potions\"]},{\"n\":\"Free the prisoners\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the west rooms and kill any of the Troll Generals for a prison key.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the north staircase.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the prison door.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the stairs to the prison.\"},{\"t\":\"Pickpocket or kill Berry for a cell key.\"},{\"t\":\"Unlock Eadgar's cell.\"},{\"t\":\"Pickpocket or kill Twig for a cell key.\"},{\"t\":\"Unlock Godric's cell.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Troll General (level 113) (safespottable)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finish off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Dunstan in north east Burthorpe to finish the quest.\"}]}]}"
        "Troubled Tortugans" -> "{\"n\":\"Troubled Tortugans\",\"items\":[\"Any axe\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Gryphon (lvl 95)\",\"Shellbane gryphon (lvl 235)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"10,000 Sailing XP\",\"8,000 Slayer XP\",\"Access to the Great Conch\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Find the stranded Tortugan\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Injured Tortugan on the small island north-west of The Great Conch to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Shake one of the nearby palm trees and pick up the palm leaf. Pick up seaweed from the shore. Use the seaweed on the palm leaf to make makeshift bandages, then talk to the Injured Tortugan and give them to her.\",\"i\":[\"Makeshift bandages\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Injured Tortugan again.\"}]},{\"n\":\"The Great Conch\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Sail to the docks at the southern edge of The Great Conch with Floopa.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elder Korel at the docks of The Great Conch.\"},{\"t\":\"Head into The Summer Shore to the north and talk to Elder Raley in the south-east building.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Making repairs\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Gather materials and repair the objects around the town. Clear your inventory until you have 22 slots free for the material to speed up repairing.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Hammer\",\"Saw\"]},{\"t\":\"Gather sea shells on the beach south of The Summer Shore.\",\"i\":[\"Sea Shells (6)\"]},{\"t\":\"Gather Tortugan scutes around the town.\",\"i\":[\"Tortugan scutes (6)\"]},{\"t\":\"Chop Jatoba trees for jatoba logs. A big cluster of these trees can be found to the west of the town.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Jatoba Logs (10)\"]},{\"t\":\"Repair Elder Krill's broken fish stall, on the north side of the marketplace.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Sea Shells\",\"Tortugan scutes\",\"Jatoba Logs (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Repair Elder Krill's damaged wall: the south wall of his store, directly north of his stall.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Tortugan scutes (2)\",\"Jatoba Logs (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Repair Elder Strom's damaged wall: the north wall of his store, west of the marketplace.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Tortugan scutes (2)\",\"Jatoba Logs (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Repair Elder Strom's broken crate, just outside the east side of his store, on the west side of the marketplace.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Sea Shells (2)\",\"Jatoba Logs\"]},{\"t\":\"Repair Elder Coco's broken crafting stall, on the south side of the marketplace.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Sea Shells\",\"Tortugan scutes\",\"Jatoba Logs (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Repair Elder Coco's broken coconut crate, directly south of his stall.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Saw\",\"Sea Shells (2)\",\"Jatoba Logs\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elder Raley after completing the town repairs.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Tracking the Gryphon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect the monument in the middle of town to pick up the Gryphon's trail.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the Gryphon tracks west of town and inspect the red plant.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the Gryphon tracks north and inspect the rockslide.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the Gryphon tracks north up the hill and inspect the plant on the east side.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the Gryphon tracks east and inspect the plant to reveal the final set of tracks.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the Gryphon tracks east and unblock the cave entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Gryphon's cave, prepared for a fight.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the Gryphon. It hits with melee, and does a special attack if your worn weight is less than 40kg.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Elder Raley with news about the Gryphon's defeat.\"}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\",\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Gryphon (lvl 95)\"]},{\"n\":\"Attack on the Little Pearl\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Elder Blunn at the north-eastern stall in the marketplace for a Tortugan shield. It goes in your cape slot: wear it for the fight.\"},{\"t\":\"Sail to Little Pearl island, south-east of The Great Conch, to confront the Shellbane gryphon.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\",\"Tortugan shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the Shellbane gryphon. Have your worn weight be at least 40kg to avoid some damage. Protect from ranged if you're ranging it, and protect from melee when in melee range. Avoid tornadoes. Move when it spits a slow blob at you.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Food\",\"Prayer restore\",\"Tortugan shield\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elder Korel after defeating the Shellbane gryphon.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Elder Raley at The Great Conch to complete the quest.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Gryphon (lvl 95)\",\"Shellbane gryphon (lvl 235)\"]}]}"
        "Twilight's Promise" -> "{\"n\":\"Twilight's Promise\",\"items\":[\"Two combat styles\"],\"rec\":[\"Stamina potions (3)\"],\"enemies\":[\"Knight of Varlamore (level 81)\",\"8 Cultists (level 34)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"3,000 Thieving XP\",\"Ability to use the Civitas illa Fortis Teleport spell\",\"Ability to use the Quetzal Transport System\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Cryptic\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Regulus Cento outside Varrock's East Gate to travel to Varlamore.\",\"s\":[\"Let's do it!\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ennius Tullus just west of where you arrived, next to the fountain.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Metzli in the temple in the south of the city.\",\"s\":[\"I'm meant to be meeting Prince Itzla here.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the temple's crypt.\",\"s\":[\"I'd better head down there.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Prince Itzla Arkan in the north room.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the crypt.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Ennius Tullus, who is now in the palace.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Knights - Bazaar\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Knight of Varlamore in the bazaar south of the palace.\",\"i\":[\"Varlamore crest\"]},{\"t\":\"Pickpocket the citizen in turquoise robes in the bazaar.\"},{\"t\":\"Return the amulet to the knight in the bazaar.\",\"i\":[\"Stolen amulet\"]}],\"i\":[\"Varlamore crest\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Knight of Varlamore (level 81)\"]},{\"n\":\"Knights - Cothon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Knight of Varlamore on the south western part of the Fortis Cothon (docks) in the east of the city.\",\"i\":[\"Varlamore crest\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the crate in the north-east of the Cothon, next to two barrels of fish.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the Knight of Varlamore on the south part of the Fortis Cothon.\"}],\"i\":[\"Varlamore crest\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Knight of Varlamore (level 81)\"]},{\"n\":\"Knights - Pub\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Knights of Varlamore in the pub OUTSIDE the walls of the city to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Varlamore crest\"]},{\"t\":\"Lead the knight to the fountain to the east. Whenever they stop following you, talk to them again.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the sobered knight at the fountain.\"}],\"i\":[\"Varlamore crest\"]},{\"n\":\"Knights - Colosseum\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Colosseum in the east of the city.\",\"i\":[\"Varlamore crest\",\"Two combat styles\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Knight of Varlamore in the north training room, ready to fight.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready. Let's do this.\"],\"i\":[\"Varlamore crest\",\"Two combat styles\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the knight, swapping combat styles to bypass his prayers.\",\"i\":[\"Two combat styles\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Knight of Varlamore in the northern training room once more.\"}],\"i\":[\"Varlamore crest\",\"Two combat styles\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Knight of Varlamore (level 81)\"]},{\"n\":\"Cost of Betrayal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Ennius Tullus in the palace.\"},{\"t\":\"Go to the top floor of the Kualti Headquarters, just west of the palace.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the south-east room on the south wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the incriminating letter.\",\"i\":[\"Incriminating letter\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Ennius and Furia in the palace.\"}]},{\"n\":\"The Twilight Emissaries\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"TALK to Regulus Cento south-east of the palace.\",\"s\":[\"I was told to ask you about getting to the Teomat.\"]},{\"t\":\"Feed Renu the feed.\",\"s\":[\"I was told to ask you about getting to the Teomat.\"],\"i\":[\"Quetzel feed\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel with Renu to Teomat.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Prince Itzla Arkan in the temple, near the altar.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Metzli in the northern building of the Teomat.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat the cultists.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Prince Itzla Arkan in Teomat, near the altar, to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"8 Cultists (level 34)\"]}]}"
        "Underground Pass" -> "{\"n\":\"Underground Pass\",\"items\":[\"Rope, multiple in case you fail an agility check\",\"Bow (not crossbow)\",\"Arrows (metal, unpoisoned)\",\"Spade\",\"Plank\",\"Bucket\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Combat Equipment\"],\"rec\":[\"Food\",\"Stamina Potions\",\"Coins (to buy food, 75 ea) (750)\",\"Agility Potions\",\"Telegrab Runes\"],\"enemies\":[\"3 Demons (level 91, safespottable)\",\"3 Paladins (level 62, safespottable)\",\"Kalrag (level 89)\",\"Disciple of Iban (level 13)\"],\"rewards\":[\"5 Quest points\",\"3,000 Agility XP\",\"3,000 Attack XP\",\"Iban's Staff\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting out\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in East Ardougne Castle to the first floor and talk to King Lathas.\",\"s\":[\"I am. What's our plan?\",\"I'm ready.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Koftik outside the West Ardougne cave.\",\"s\":[\"I'll take my chances.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"The Underground Pass\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the cave and run south at the first junction. Don't take the middle path, as its swamp drags you down. Climb over the rockslides and talk to Koftik by the fire.\"},{\"t\":\"If you have no oily cloth, search the abandoned equipment by the fire next to Koftik. Use the cloth on an arrow, then light it with a tinderbox or on the fire. Walk to the room north of Koftik, wield your bow and the lit arrow, and shoot the guide-rope.\",\"i\":[\"Bow (not crossbow)\",\"Lit Arrow\"]},{\"t\":\"Continue until you reach the water and a pit. Use your rope on the rock above the pit to swing across. If you fail, you lose the rope.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb over the rockslides to reach the large grid. Cross it by trial and error, keeping your health above 15, and remember the path for Regicide. Then pull the lever next to the gate.\"},{\"t\":\"Go west along the corridor past the five wall traps. For each one, either disable it or walk past it.\"},{\"t\":\"From the well, take the north path, using a plank on each flat rock to cross it, and take the first orb of light.\",\"i\":[\"Plank\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the second orb of light north west of the well.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the third orb of light west of the well. Remember to use a plank on the flat rocks to cross them.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the flat rock to remove the trap and take the fourth orb to the south west of the well.\",\"s\":[\"Yes, I'll give it a go.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the furnace to the east, and use the orbs on it.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the well.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope, multiple in case you fail an agility check\",\"Bow (not crossbow)\",\"Arrows (metal, unpoisoned)\",\"Spade\",\"Plank\",\"Bucket\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Combat Equipment\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Descending Deeper\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Head west to the cages and pick the lock of the first cage on the left, in the south-east. Inside, use a spade on the loose mud at the back to dig through.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Cross the narrow ledge, then get through the maze of raised beams: take the first right, then left, then left again. With 50 Thieving you can skip the maze by picking the lock of the gate a little further south. Then go south and enter the pipe to the next section.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the unicorn cage.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the railing on the boulder.\",\"i\":[\"Railing\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Cold-blooded Killing\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the cage again.\"},{\"t\":\"Travel through the tunnel to find some knights.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Sir Jerro and take his badge. Optionally: talk to one of the knights first to receive food and potions.\",\"i\":[\"Badge (Sir Jerro)\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Sir Harry and take his badge.\",\"i\":[\"Badge (Sir Harry)\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Sir Carl and take his badge.\",\"i\":[\"Badge (Sir Carl)\"]},{\"t\":\"Continue along the path, using your plank on a flat rock to cross it, until you reach a well. Use the badges and unicorn horn on the well.\",\"i\":[\"Plank\",\"Badge (Sir Jerro)\",\"Badge (Sir Harry)\",\"Badge (Sir Carl)\",\"Unicorn horn\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the door at the end of the path.\"}]},{\"n\":\"The Witch Kardia\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Run south along the edge of the cavern as far as you can and enter the cave in the south wall. Talk to Niloof the dwarf in the encampment on the lower level.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Klank to obtain his gauntlets. You need one free inventory slot. If you've done so before, you may need to pay 5,000gp for them.\",\"s\":[\"What happened to them?\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back up through the cave to Iban's Cavern. From the south-east corner of the bridges, follow them to the witch's cat. Letters are compass directions and numbers are tiles: E23, N14, E1, N7, W1, N14, W20, N1, W8, N2, W1, N8, W1, N2, W6, S3, W4, N8. The W20 and W8 stretches each cross a broken bridge: jump across it. Then retrieve the cat.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the cat on the witch's door in the south east corner of the area to distract her.\",\"i\":[\"Witch's Cat\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the witch's house. You'll need 4 empty inventory slots.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Imbuing the Doll\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"From the witch's house, head north, then west, then take the first path left (south) all the way down to the three demons. Kill Holthion and pick up his amulet.\",\"i\":[\"Amulet of Holthion\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Doomion and pick up his amulet.\",\"i\":[\"Amulet of Doomion\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Othainian and pick up his amulet.\",\"i\":[\"Amulet of Othanian\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest north of Doomion for Iban's shadow. With the doll in your inventory it goes onto the doll by itself. If it doesn't, use the shadow on the doll.\",\"i\":[\"Doll of Iban\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the dwarf encampment on the lower level.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a bucket on the brew barrel in the eastern house of the dwarf encampment. If you have no bucket, there's one in the corner of the larger house to the west.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bucket of brew on the tomb in the south east corner of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Dwarf brew\"]},{\"t\":\"Light the tomb with a tinderbox. With the doll in your inventory the ashes go onto it by themselves. If they drop on the ground instead, pick them up and use them on the doll.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Doll of Iban\"]},{\"t\":\"Run north from the tomb to the spider pit and kill Kalrag the spider. Protect From Melee can keep you safe in this fight.\",\"i\":[\"Doll of Iban\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave Kalrag's pit, head north-west and go up through the cave entrance to the upper level.\"},{\"t\":\"Wear Klank's gauntlets. Follow the ledge along the west wall to the first broken bridge on its east side and jump across. Go north at the junction, east at the next junction, then north, then west to a cage on a dead-end platform. Search that cage. The dove's remains go onto the doll by themselves, so watch the chat box, as there may be no pop-up.\",\"i\":[\"Klank's gauntlets\",\"Doll of Iban\"]}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Kalrag (level 89)\"]},{\"n\":\"Entering the Temple\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"From the cage where you got the dove, head south to the broken bridge you crossed earlier, then east, then south to the middle of the area. Kill a disciple of Iban and take their robes.\",\"i\":[\"Doll of Iban\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Temple of Iban wearing monk robes. Prepare to use Iban's doll on the well, as Iban can deal lots of damage quickly.\",\"i\":[\"Zamorak monk top\",\"Zamorak monk bottom\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the doll, choose Use, then tap the well. Don't choose Investigate. Standing north of the well can prevent Iban from hitting.\",\"i\":[\"Doll of Iban\"]}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Disciple of Iban (level 13)\"]},{\"n\":\"Foggy Memories\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Koftik.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to King Lathas to finish the quest.\"}]}]}"
        "Vale Totems" -> "{\"n\":\"Vale Totems\",\"items\":[\"Knife\",\"Oak log\",\"Oak shield/longbow/shortbow (4)\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"Unlocks the Auburnvale fletching minigame\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Repair the totem\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ranulph in the west part of Auburnvale to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Build the totem site just north of Ranulph.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Oak log\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Isadora to learn about carving.\"},{\"t\":\"Look at the spirit animals near the totem. They are different for every player. Tap the totem and pick each of those animals from the carving options.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Isadora after carving the spirit animals into the totem.\"},{\"t\":\"Decorate the totem with four decorative items (shield, longbow, or shortbow) of the same wood type you used to build/carve the totem.\",\"i\":[\"Oak shield/longbow/shortbow (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Isadora to talk after decorating the totem.\"},{\"t\":\"Claim the offering the Ent left next to your totem.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Isadora to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Oak log\",\"Oak shield/longbow/shortbow (4)\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Vampyre Slayer" -> "{\"n\":\"Vampyre Slayer\",\"items\":[\"Hammer\",\"A beer, or 2 coins to buy one\",\"Combat gear + food to defeat Count Draynor\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport to Varrock\",\"Draynor manor teleport\",\"Garlic\"],\"enemies\":[\"Count Draynor (level 34)\"],\"rewards\":[\"3 Quest points\",\"4,825 Attack XP\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Morgan in the north of Draynor Village.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Get garlic\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Optional: climb the stairs in Morgan's house and search the cupboard upstairs for garlic, which weakens Count Draynor. If you don't want any, skip this step.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Get a stake\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Dr. Harlow in the Blue Moon Inn in Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help dealing with a vampyre.\",\"Morgan needs your help!\"],\"i\":[\"A beer, or 2 coins to buy one\"]},{\"t\":\"Buy a beer from the bartender in the Blue Moon Inn in Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"A glass of your finest ale please.\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Dr. Harlow again with a beer.\",\"s\":[\"Yes. Here you go.\"],\"i\":[\"Beer\"]}],\"i\":[\"A beer, or 2 coins to buy one\"]},{\"n\":\"Kill Count Draynor\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Prepare to fight Count Draynor (level 34), and enter Draynor Manor.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter Draynor Manor's basement using the stairs on the east side of the manor, not through the west room.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the coffin and kill Count Draynor.\"}],\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Stake\",\"Combat gear + food to defeat Count Draynor\"],\"r\":[\"Garlic\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Count Draynor (level 34)\"]}]}"
        "Wanted!" -> "{\"n\":\"Wanted!\",\"items\":[\"20 Rune or Pure Essence (UNNOTED)\",\"A light source\",\"A rope\",\"Combat gear\",\"A law rune, an enchanted gem and some molten glass OR 10k gp\"],\"rec\":[\"Amulet of glory\",\"Ring of Dueling\",\"A teleport to Falador\",\"A teleport to Varrock\",\"A teleport to Canifis\",\"A spiny helmet or slayer helm\"],\"enemies\":[\"Black Knight (level 33)\",\"Solus Dellagar (similar strength)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"5,000 Slayer XP\",\"Access to the White Knight's Armory\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Getting started\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sir Tiffy Cashien in Falador Park.\",\"s\":[\"Do you have any jobs for me yet?\",\"Yes, I'm interested.\",\"Ask about the Wanted! Quest\",\"How will all that help?\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the second floor of the White Knights' Castle. Tell Sir Amik Varze you wish to join the White Knights, BUT refuse to be a Squire.\",\"s\":[\"No, not right now...\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Sir Tiffy Cashien in Falador Park.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Wanted! Quest\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back to Sir Amik Varze on the second floor of the White Knights' Castle.\",\"s\":[\"Sure, I'll help you!\"]},{\"t\":\"Report back to Sir Tiffy Cashien in Falador Park.\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Wanted! Quest\"]},{\"t\":\"Get a Commorb from Sir Tiffy Cashien in Falador Park. Choose \\\"Buy One\\\" if you're paying 10,000 coins, or \\\"Have One Made\\\" if you brought a law rune, an enchanted gem and some molten glass. Then choose \\\"YES\\\".\",\"s\":[\"Ask about the Wanted! Quest\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the Commorb and choose Contact to contact Savant.\",\"s\":[\"Current Assignment\"],\"i\":[\"Commorb\"]}],\"i\":[\"A law rune, an enchanted gem and some molten glass OR 10k gp\"]},{\"n\":\"Daquarius\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter Taverley Dungeon and follow it north, then east, then south to the Black Knights' Base. Talk to Lord Daquarius in its south-westernmost room.\",\"i\":[\"Commorb\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill a Black Knight near Daquarius.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lord Daquarius in Taverley Dungeon again.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Commorb\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Black Knight (level 33)\"]},{\"n\":\"Mage of Zamorak\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"If you haven't started the Enter the Abyss miniquest, first talk to the Mage of Zamorak in the Wilderness just north of Edgeville. Then talk to the Mage of Zamorak in south east Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Solus Dellagar\"],\"i\":[\"Commorb\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the 20 rune or pure essence to the Mage of Zamorak in Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Solus Dellagar\"],\"i\":[\"Commorb\",\"20 Rune or Pure Essence (UNNOTED)\"]}],\"i\":[\"20 Rune or Pure Essence (UNNOTED)\",\"Commorb\"]},{\"n\":\"The Hunt for Solus\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to Canifis, and scan with your Commorb there until you find Solus.\",\"i\":[\"Commorb\"]},{\"t\":\"Hunt down Solus Dellagar across Gielinor. Long-press the Commorb and choose Scan. Savant describes an item: go to the place it points to and scan there. Repeat until you are given 20 noted pure essence, about 7 places in all. At the fourth place Solus hits you hard and you're sent to Falador. At the sixth a level 32 Black Knight attacks, and you don't have to kill it.\",\"i\":[\"Commorb\"]},{\"t\":\"What Savant describes, and where to scan. Cloak: Rellekka. Banana: Musa Point plantation. Wizard hat: Wizards' Tower, ground floor library. Very strange weapon: Dorgesh-Kaan mine, through the Lumbridge Castle cellar (bring a light source). Fur or cake: Ardougne Market. Cape: inside the Champions' Guild. Ticket: Castle Wars. Hat: Grand Tree, next to King Narnode. Ear muffs: Slayer Tower. Eye patch: Brimhaven pub. Fake beard: Ali Morrisane's stall in Al Kharid. Big frog legs: end of the Lumbridge Swamp Caves (bring a light source, a spiny helmet and, if it's your first time in, a rope). Goblin armour: Goblin Village. Beer: Dragon Inn in Yanille. Worm: McGrubor's Wood. Toy horse: Draynor Village, near Diango. Unholy symbol: Shrine of Scorpius, north of the Observatory.\"}],\"i\":[\"A light source\",\"A rope\",\"A spiny helmet or slayer helm\",\"Commorb\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Solus Dellagar (similar strength)\"]},{\"n\":\"Final battle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the Rune Essence mine by talking to any of the NPCs that can teleport you there.\",\"i\":[\"Commorb\",\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Solus Dellagar.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if you don't have Solus' hat: use the 'contact' option on the Commorb to get it from Savant. You need one free inventory slot.\",\"s\":[\"Current Assignment\"],\"i\":[\"Commorb\"]},{\"t\":\"Show Solus' hat to Sir Amik Varze on the second floor of the White Knights' Castle in Falador.\",\"i\":[\"Solus' hat\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Commorb\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Solus Dellagar (similar strength)\"]}]}"
        "Watchtower" -> "{\"n\":\"Watchtower\",\"items\":[\"Coins (20)\",\"Gold bar\",\"Death rune\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Dragon bones\",\"Rope (2)\",\"Guam potion (unf)\",\"A light source\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Bat bones\",\"Jangerberries\"],\"rec\":[\"Shields/potions that mitigate dragon's fire\"],\"enemies\":[\"Gorad (level 68)\",\"Able to survive blue dragons, ogres, and greater demons attacking you\"],\"rewards\":[\"4 Quest points\",\"15,250 Magic XP\",\"5000 x Coins\",\"Ability to use the Watchtower Teleport\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb the trellis on the north side of the Watchtower, north of Yanille, then climb the ladder to the top floor and talk to the Watchtower Wizard.\",\"s\":[\"What's the matter?\",\"So how come the spell doesn't work?\",\"Can I be of help?\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Investigate\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Climb down both ladders and search the far north-west bush, north of the Watchtower, for the fingernails.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the Watchtower Wizard with the fingernails.\",\"s\":[\"What do you suggest I do?\",\"So what do I do?\"],\"i\":[\"Fingernails\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Og north west of Yanille.\",\"s\":[\"I seek entrance to the city of ogres.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your rope on a branch to swing to the island west of Yanille.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Grew on the island west of Yanille.\",\"s\":[\"Don't eat me; I can help you.\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave Grew's island.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole south of Gu'Tanoth, shown by a dungeon icon south of Jiggig. Fairy ring AKS or a Feldip Hills teleport is the quickest way there.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill Gorad and pick up his tooth.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Toban on the island east of Gu'Tanoth.\",\"s\":[\"I seek entrance to the city of ogres.\",\"I could do something for you...\"]},{\"t\":\"Give Toban some dragon bones on the island east of Gu'Tanoth.\",\"i\":[\"Dragon bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the chest on the island east of Gu'Tanoth using Toban's Key.\",\"i\":[\"Toban's key\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Og with his stolen gold north west of Yanille.\",\"i\":[\"Toban's gold\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Grew with Gorad's teeth on the island west of Yanille.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the Watchtower Wizard with the relic pieces.\",\"i\":[\"Relic part 1\",\"Relic part 2\",\"Relic part 3\"]}],\"i\":[\"Dragon bones\",\"Rope (2)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Gorad (level 68)\"]},{\"n\":\"Enter Gu'Tanoth\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter Gu'Tanoth by the path at the north-east corner of the hills, then head west to the gate. Talk to the Ogre Guard there with the ogre relic in your inventory.\",\"i\":[\"Ogre relic\"]},{\"t\":\"Steal a rock cake from Gu'Tanoth's market.\"},{\"t\":\"From the market, go back to the upper walkway and head around to the south until you reach guards at a battlement. Talk to an Ogre Guard there.\",\"s\":[\"But I am a friend to ogres...\"]},{\"t\":\"Attempt to cross the battlement again with a rock cake.\",\"i\":[\"Rock cake\"]},{\"t\":\"Head north-east to the broken bridge. Long-press your side of the gap and choose Jump-over. Agree to pay the guards 20 coins.\",\"s\":[\"Okay, I'll pay it.\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the City Guard.\",\"s\":[\"I seek passage into the skavid caves.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the City Guard again.\",\"i\":[\"Death rune\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ogre relic\",\"Coins (20)\",\"Death rune\",\"Gold bar\",\"A light source\"]},{\"n\":\"Learn the Skavid language\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go back across the bridges, over the battlement and out through the north-west gate. Walk east, then south towards the second city gate. Enter the skavid cave just north of that gate.\",\"i\":[\"Skavid map\",\"A light source\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the scared skavid.\",\"s\":[\"Okay, okay, I'm not going to hurt you.\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave this cave. Enter the skavid cave north-east of Gu'Tanoth, along the main path into the city, and talk to the skavid. When it says \\\"Bidith tanath...\\\", answer Cur.\",\"s\":[\"I'll be fine without a tinderbox.\",\"Cur.\"],\"i\":[\"Skavid map\",\"A light source\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave north of Gu'Tanoth, near the start of the main path into the city, and talk to the skavid. When it says \\\"Gor cur...\\\", answer Ar.\",\"s\":[\"I'll be fine without a tinderbox.\",\"Ar.\"],\"i\":[\"Skavid map\",\"A light source\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave further north of Gu'Tanoth, south of the west gate to Yanille, and talk to the skavid. When it says \\\"Cur bidith...\\\", answer Ig.\",\"s\":[\"I'll be fine without a tinderbox.\",\"Ig.\"],\"i\":[\"Skavid map\",\"A light source\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave east of Gu'Tanoth, outside the city on the east side of the mountain, and talk to the skavid. When it says \\\"Tanath gor...\\\", answer Nod.\",\"s\":[\"I'll be fine without a tinderbox.\",\"Nod.\"],\"i\":[\"Skavid map\",\"A light source\"]},{\"t\":\"Try to go through the gate to the south east cave of Gu'Tanoth. Give the guard a gold bar and go through.\",\"i\":[\"Gold bar\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the mad skavid's cave.\",\"s\":[\"I'll be fine without a tinderbox.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the mad skavid. Answer what he says: \\\"Bidith ig...\\\" with Cur., \\\"Ar cur...\\\" with Gor., \\\"Gor nod...\\\" with Tanath., \\\"Cur tanath...\\\" with Bidith., \\\"Bidith tanath...\\\" with Cur., \\\"Tanath gor...\\\" with Nod., \\\"Cur bidith...\\\" with Ig. and \\\"Gor cur...\\\" with Ar.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up 2 cave nightshade. You can world hop to get a second one.\",\"i\":[\"Cave nightshade (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a nightshade on an Enclave Guard in the Gu'Tanoth market.\",\"i\":[\"Cave nightshade\"]}],\"i\":[\"Gold bar\",\"A light source\",\"Skavid map\"],\"r\":[\"Shields/potions that mitigate dragon's fire\"]},{\"n\":\"Getting the other crystals\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave the enclave: teleport out, or run past the blue dragons to the exit at the north-east end.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to the Watchtower Wizard at the top of the Watchtower.\"},{\"t\":\"Use some jangerberries on a guam potion (unf)\",\"i\":[\"Guam potion (unf)\",\"Jangerberries\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on some bat bones.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Bat bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the ground bat bones on the potion\",\"i\":[\"Ground bat bones\",\"Vial\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the Watchtower Wizard with the potion.\",\"i\":[\"Potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a nightshade on an Enclave Guard in the Gu'Tanoth market to enter the enclave again.\",\"i\":[\"Cave nightshade\",\"Magic ogre potion\",\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the magic ogre potion on all 6 ogre shamans.\",\"i\":[\"Magic ogre potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine the Rock of Dalgroth in the enclave.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the Watchtower Wizard with the crystals.\",\"i\":[\"Crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Use each crystal on the right pillar: yellow in the south-west, magenta in the north-east, cyan in the north-west and grey in the south-east.\",\"i\":[\"Crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Pull the lever to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Guam potion (unf)\",\"Jangerberries\",\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Bat bones\",\"Cave nightshade\",\"Any pickaxe\"]}]}"
        "Waterfall Quest" -> "{\"n\":\"Waterfall Quest\",\"items\":[\"Rope\",\"Air runes (6)\",\"Earth runes (6)\",\"Water runes (6)\"],\"rec\":[\"Games necklace\",\"Food\"],\"enemies\":[\"Able to survive enemies up to level 86 attacking you\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"13,750 Strength XP\",\"13,750 Attack XP\",\"2 x Diamonds\",\"2 x Gold Bars\",\"40 x Mithril Seeds\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Almera on top of Baxtorian Falls, south of Barbarian Outpost.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"n\":\"Investigate\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Board the log raft west of Almera.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Hudon.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the rock to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the dead tree.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Get in the barrel.\"},{\"t\":\"After the barrel washes you ashore, go into the large building to the north, where Hadley is, and go up the stairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the south east bookcase.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the book.\",\"i\":[\"Book on baxtorian\"]}],\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"n\":\"Get Glarial's Pebble\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Walk through the Tree Gnome Village maze from its entrance on the north-west side. Letters are compass directions and numbers are tiles: E7, S2, E20, S6, W3, S1, W6, N4, W2, S6, W7, S2, E13, N2, E2, S2, E2, N2, E2, S2, E11, S3, E5, S9, W4, S6, E5, S3, W2, S11, W10, N5, E3, S2, E3, N2, E1, N5, W11. Go down the ladder there, at the entrance to the village.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the off-coloured crate in the east room.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the gate in the west room.\",\"i\":[\"Key\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Golrie.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Loot Glarial's tomb\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bank everything besides the pebble and some food. Then use Glarial's pebble on Glarial's Tombstone east of Baxtorian Falls.\",\"i\":[\"Glarial's pebble\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the western room for Glarial's amulet.\"},{\"t\":\"Search Glarial's Tomb in the south room for Glarial's urn.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Put Glarial to rest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave Glarial's Tomb and get 6 air, water, and earth runes, a rope, glarial's amulet, glarial's urn, and some food.\",\"i\":[\"Air runes (6)\",\"Earth runes (6)\",\"Water runes (6)\",\"Glarial's amulet\",\"Glarial's urn\",\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Board the log raft west of Almera.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the rock to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the dead tree.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip Glarial's amulet.\",\"i\":[\"Glarial's amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the falls with Glarial's amulet equipped.\",\"i\":[\"Glarial's amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the crate in the east room for a key.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the west room with the key.\",\"i\":[\"Key\"]},{\"t\":\"Use 1 earth, water and air rune on each of the 6 pillars in the room. Afterwards, use Glarial's amulet on the statue of Glarial.\",\"i\":[\"Air rune\",\"Water rune\",\"Earth rune\"]},{\"t\":\"DO NOT TAP THE CHALICE, as taking the treasure washes you out of the cave! Use Glarial's urn on the Chalice to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Glarial's urn\"]}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Air runes (6)\",\"Earth runes (6)\",\"Water runes (6)\",\"Glarial's urn\",\"Glarial's amulet\"]}]}"
        "What Lies Below" -> "{\"n\":\"What Lies Below\",\"items\":[\"Bowl\",\"Chaos runes (15)\",\"Access to the Chaos Altar\"],\"rec\":[\"Chronicle for teleports to south of Varrock\"],\"enemies\":[\"5 outlaws (level 32)\",\"King Roald (level 47)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"8,000 Runecraft XP\",\"2,000 Defence XP\",\"The Beacon Ring\",\"Access to a shortcut to the Chaos Altar\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Rat Burgiss south of Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\",\"Shall I get them back for you?\",\"Of course! Tell me what you need me to do.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Help Rat\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to the outlaws' camp just west of the Grand Exchange and kill 5 outlaws for intel. Put the intel into the folder Rat gave you.\",\"i\":[\"Folder\",\"Rat's paper (5)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Rat Burgiss south of Varrock.\",\"i\":[\"Full folder\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Help Surok\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Surok Magis in the Varrock Library.\",\"s\":[\"Go on, then!\"],\"i\":[\"Letter to Surok\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel to the chaos altar with the wand and 15 chaos runes. You can either enter with a chaos talisman, or use the abyss.\",\"i\":[\"Wand\",\"Chaos runes (15)\",\"Access to the Chaos Altar\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the wand on the chaos altar.\",\"i\":[\"Wand\",\"Chaos runes (15)\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Surok Magis in the Varrock Library with the wand and a bowl.\",\"s\":[\"I have the things you wanted!\"],\"i\":[\"Infused wand\",\"Bowl\"]}],\"i\":[\"Chaos runes (15)\",\"Access to the Chaos Altar\",\"Bowl\",\"Wand\"]},{\"n\":\"Defeat Surok\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Rat Burgiss south of Varrock.\",\"s\":[\"Yes! I have a letter for you.\"],\"i\":[\"Surok's letter\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Zaff in the Varrock staff shop.\",\"s\":[\"Rat Burgiss sent me!\"]},{\"t\":\"Prepare to fight King Roald (level 47), then go talk to Surok Magis in the Varrock Library.\",\"s\":[\"Bring it on!\"],\"i\":[\"Beacon ring\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight King Roald. When he's almost dead and your character says \\\"Now would be a good time to summon Zaff!\\\", long-press the beacon ring and choose Operate.\",\"i\":[\"Beacon ring\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Rat Burgiss south of Varrock to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"King Roald (level 47)\"]}]}"
        "While Guthix Sleeps" -> "{\"n\":\"While Guthix Sleeps\",\"items\":[\"Knife\",\"Logs\",\"Coins (520)\",\"Seed dibber (only if not done barb training)\",\"Lantern lens\",\"Unpowered orb\",\"Bronze med helm\",\"Iron chainbody\",\"Lit sapphire lantern\",\"Astral rune (4)\",\"Cosmic rune (4)\",\"Air rune (8)\",\"Runes for any charge orb spell you have the level to cast\",\"Melee weapon\",\"Magic weapon\",\"Ranged weapon\",\"Food\"],\"rec\":[\"Taverley teleport (2)\",\"Khazard teleports, Ardougne cloak or Spirit tree (3) (2)\",\"Seers' Village teleport\",\"Falador teleport (4)\",\"Feldip hills teleport or Hunter/Max cape\",\"Teleport to Burthorpe\"],\"enemies\":[\"2 Assassins (level 167)\",\"2 Mercenary axemen (level 131)\",\"Mercenary mage (level 112)\",\"3 Elite Black Knights (level 138)\",\"Surok Magis (level 265)\",\"Balance Elemental (level 524)\",\"2 Tormented Demons (level 450)\"],\"rewards\":[\"5 Quest points\",\"80,000 Thieving XP\",\"75,000 Farming XP\",\"75,000 Herblore XP\",\"50,000 Hunter XP\",\"Elite black knight armour\",\"Dark squall robes\",\"100 x Death runes from Movario's base\",\"100 x Fire runes from Movario's base\",\"100 x Coal from Movario's base\",\"100 x Magic logs from Movario's base\",\"Duradel's notes, obtainable from Kuradel\",\"Access to Tormented Demons in the Ancient Guthixian Temple\",\"Access to Black Knight Catacombs\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivy Sophista in Taverley south of the witch's house.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the ladder next to Ivy.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Thaerisk.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the assassins. Use Protect from Ranged. If one says 'Now!' they will fire a hard-hitting ranged attack if not prayed against. Straight after, the other will say 'Nothing personal, adventurer', they will teleport to you and dragon dagger spec you. Protect from Melee straight after the strong ranged attack hits to be safe.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Thaerisk again.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"tr\":[\"Taverley teleport\"],\"r\":[\"Antipoison\",\"Food (15)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"2 Assassins (level 167)\"]},{\"n\":\"Investigating\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Khazard Launderer west of the Khazard Fight Arena.\",\"s\":[\"Would 500 coins change your mind?\"],\"i\":[\"Coins (500)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Hunting Expert in her hut in the middle of the Feldip Hills hunting area.\",\"s\":[\"Do you think you could help me with broavs?\",\"A creature to help track down a person.\"],\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Logs\"]},{\"t\":\"Set up the trap west of the Hunting Expert.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Logs\",\"Mort myre fungus\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the mort myre fungus on the trap west of the Hunting Expert.\",\"i\":[\"Mort myre fungus\"]},{\"t\":\"Wait for the broav to fall into the trap.\"},{\"t\":\"Dismantle the trap to retrieve the broav.\"},{\"t\":\"Bring the unconscious broav to the Feldip Hills hunting expert.\",\"s\":[\"Do you think you could train this broav for me?\",\"A creature to help track down a person.\"],\"i\":[\"Unconscious broav\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to the broken table in the middle of the Khazard side of the Khazard-Gnome battlefield.\",\"i\":[\"Broav\"]},{\"t\":\"Drop your broav.\",\"i\":[\"Broav\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the dirty shirt on your broav.\",\"i\":[\"Dirty shirt\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the broken table.\"}],\"i\":[\"Coins (500)\",\"Knife\",\"Logs\"],\"tr\":[\"Khazard teleports, Ardougne cloak or Spirit tree (3) (2)\",\"Feldip hills teleport or Hunter/Max cape\"]},{\"n\":\"Movario's Base\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter Movario's base under the broken table in the Khazard Battlefield.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the open chest in the far north of the area for some runes.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb down the stairs to the north-west.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the old battered door.\"},{\"t\":\"On the door's warning, one letter of the word PROHIBITED is styled like a rune, and it differs per player. Use that rune on the door. A wrong rune hits you for 20+ damage, but the blast's colour shows the right one: purple for mind, green for earth, white for air, red for fire and blue for water.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the old battered door. You must weigh more than 0 kg to enter, so take off weight-reducing gear such as graceful if you need to.\"},{\"t\":\"Solve the electricity puzzle. Search the bookcases until the chat box says you pulled a lever. Wires on the floor then light up from that bookcase: follow them to the next bookcase and search it. Keep following the lit wires until a message says the electric gate has been turned off.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the gate to the staircase.\"},{\"t\":\"Long-press the spiral staircase and choose Search.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the spiral staircase.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the desk north-west of the staircase.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick-up the waste-paper basket west of the desk.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the waste-paper basket.\",\"i\":[\"Waste-paper basket\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the ruby key on the most north-west bookcase.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ruby key\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs that appeared.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the bed.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the ruby key on the bed chest.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Ruby key\"]},{\"t\":\"Long-press the bed chest and choose Search to check it for traps. Don't choose Open, as the trap hits for 18 or more damage.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the second pair of notes from the bed chest.\"},{\"t\":\"Read Movario's notes (vol. 1).\",\"i\":[\"Movario's notes (volume 1)\"]},{\"t\":\"Read Movario's notes (vol. 2).\",\"i\":[\"Movario's notes (volume 2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back downstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the painting in the south of the room.\",\"s\":[\"Pull the lever.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Air rune\",\"Water rune\",\"Earth rune\",\"Fire rune\",\"Mind rune\"]},{\"n\":\"Weight puzzle\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Cross the broken wall into the south room. The pressure gauge shows how much you weighed on entering, in tickits (1 tickit = 1 kg). Check your weight now on the Equipment Stats screen, then take the difference from the pile of 1 kg, 2 kg and 5 kg weights.\"},{\"t\":\"Cross back over the broken wall into the north room. If you weighed more than the pressure gauge's number before taking the weights, use all of them on the statue in the north-east of the room. If you weighed less, keep them in your inventory.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the door in the north-east.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Gathering\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Thaerisk upstairs in Taverley with the notes.\",\"i\":[\"Movario's notes (volume 1)\",\"Movario's notes (volume 2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to McGrubor's Wood (fairy ring ALS) and enter the building through the loose railing to the east for a cutscene. Kill the mercenaries there. You can also destroy Movario's notes now.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Idria just north of McGrubor's Wood.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Akrisae in the White Knights' Castle, on the ground floor on the east side.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Akrisae again to teleport to Draynor Village.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the orb on the shady stranger near Draynor Village bank.\",\"i\":[\"Teleorb\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Akrisae in the White Knights' Castle.\",\"i\":[\"Lantern lens\"]},{\"t\":\"Get a snapdragon seed from Thaerisk for free.\",\"s\":[\"Could I have that seed?\",\"Sounds good to me.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Thaerisk to teleport to Port Sarim.\",\"s\":[\"Could you teleport me to Port Sarim?\",\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Snapdragon seed\",\"Lantern lens\",\"Coins (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Betty in Port Sarim's magic shop with a snapdragon seed and lantern lens.\",\"s\":[\"Could you help me make some enriched snapdragon?\"],\"i\":[\"Snapdragon seed\",\"Lantern lens\",\"Coins (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Betty in Port Sarim's magic shop for some pink dye.\",\"s\":[\"About that enriched snapdragon...\",\"Sounds good.\"],\"i\":[\"Lantern lens\",\"Coins (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the pink dye on a lantern lens.\",\"i\":[\"Pink dye\",\"Lantern lens\"]},{\"t\":\"Stand in Betty's doorway and use the rose-tinted lens on the counter.\",\"i\":[\"Rose-tinted lens\"]},{\"t\":\"Take the seed from Betty's counter.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Thaerisk with the enriched snapdragon seed.\",\"i\":[\"Enriched snapdragon seed\",\"Seed dibber (only if not done barb training)\"]},{\"t\":\"Plant the enriched snapdragon seed in the herb patch on the top floor of the west side of the White Knights' Castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Idria downstairs near Thaerisk.\"}],\"i\":[\"Lantern lens\",\"Seed dibber (only if not done barb training)\",\"Coins (20)\"],\"tr\":[\"Taverley teleport\",\"Seers' Village teleport\",\"Falador teleport (2)\"]},{\"n\":\"United Front\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Activate the lunar spellbook for NPC Contact. Either use the altar on Lunar Isle, your POH altar, or your Magic Cape.\",\"i\":[\"Astral rune (4)\",\"Cosmic rune (4)\",\"Air rune (8)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use NPC Contact to talk to Cyrisus.\",\"i\":[\"Astral rune\",\"Cosmic rune\",\"Air rune (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use NPC Contact to talk to Turael, or go talk to him in Burthorpe.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about Lucien.\"],\"i\":[\"Astral rune\",\"Cosmic rune\",\"Air rune (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use NPC Contact to talk to Mazchna, or go talk to him in Canifis.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about Lucien.\"],\"i\":[\"Astral rune\",\"Cosmic rune\",\"Air rune (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use NPC Contact to talk to Duradel, or go talk to him in Shilo Village.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about Lucien.\"],\"i\":[\"Astral rune\",\"Cosmic rune\",\"Air rune (2)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back onto the normal spellbook, then go harvest the enriched snapdragon in the herb patch on the top floor of the west side of the White Knights' Castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Thaerisk with the enriched snapdragon.\",\"i\":[\"Enriched snapdragon\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the enriched snapdragon on the serum.\",\"i\":[\"Enriched snapdragon\",\"Truth serum\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the drawers in the south-east of the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the cell just north of Thaerisk.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the super truth serum on the shady stranger in the cell near Thaerisk.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Super truth serum\",\"Charcoal\",\"Papyrus\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the shady stranger.\",\"i\":[\"Charcoal\",\"Papyrus\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the sketch on Idria.\",\"i\":[\"Suspect sketch\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ghommal outside of the entrance to the Warriors' Guild.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about Lucien.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Harrallak Menarous in the entrance to the Warriors' Guild.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about Lucien.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sloane on the first floor of the Warriors' Guild, in the north-east, through the heavy door.\",\"s\":[\"I need to talk to you about Lucien.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Astral rune (4)\",\"Cosmic rune (4)\",\"Air rune (8)\"],\"tr\":[\"Taverley teleport\",\"Falador teleport\",\"Teleport to Burthorpe\"]},{\"n\":\"Infiltration\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get ready first: use the normal spellbook, keep 9 inventory slots free, and wear a bronze med helm and iron chainbody (or your dark squall robes, if you have them). For the fight with Surok, bring runes for many casts of a Bind spell, a Weaken spell, Low Level Alchemy, Telekinetic Grab and all four elemental spells. Then return to Akrisae in the White Knights' Castle, on the ground floor on the east side.\",\"i\":[\"Unpowered orb\",\"Runes for any charge orb spell you have the level to cast\",\"Bronze med helm\",\"Iron chainbody\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Black Knights' Fortress. Akrisae will give you a one-off teleport there.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Unpowered orb\",\"Runes for any charge orb spell you have the level to cast\"]},{\"t\":\"Push the wall to enter a secret room.\"},{\"t\":\"Go down the ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the tile on the floor on the east side of the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Cast one of the charge orb spells on the tile.\",\"i\":[\"Unpowered orb\",\"Runes for any charge orb spell you have the level to cast\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the tile trapdoor.\"},{\"t\":\"Jump over the west bridge.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the northern wall in the north-east area.\"},{\"t\":\"Continue through the catacomb until you reach some solid doors in the north-west. Enter the west door.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the most northern solid door.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill elite black knights until you have the full helm, platebody and platelegs, with Protect from Melee on. If none is here, one stands with the elite dark warriors just past the west bridge you jumped. Then wear all three: the elite knights, warriors, mages and rangers stop attacking you while you wear them.\",\"i\":[\"Elite black full helm\",\"Elite black platebody\",\"Elite black platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the wardrobe to the north.\",\"i\":[\"Elite black full helm\",\"Elite black platebody\",\"Elite black platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the key rack just east of the northern wardrobe.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the wardrobe to the south.\",\"i\":[\"Elite black full helm\",\"Elite black platebody\",\"Elite black platelegs\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south table for a strange teleorb.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the west desk for a law and death rune.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the north-east table for some lobster and a restore potion. DON'T EAT OR DRINK EITHER.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the room back to the catacombs.\"},{\"t\":\"Open Silif's cell door in the north-east of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Cell key\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a lobster or other food on Silif.\",\"i\":[\"Lobster, or some other food\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a restore potion on Silif.\",\"i\":[\"Restore potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the elite black armour on Silif.\",\"i\":[\"Full elite black knight\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Silif until he follows you.\",\"s\":[\"Let's go.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the most northern solid door again.\"},{\"t\":\"Stand near the map just east of the door until Silif talks about it.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Silif near the map until he gives you a teleorb.\"},{\"t\":\"Wear the dark squall robes, then climb up the ladder to the east, ready to fight Surok.\",\"i\":[\"Dark squall hood\",\"Dark squall robe top\",\"Dark squall robe bottom\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat Surok. You must use magic to hurt him. You cannot use powered staves. He has three special attacks: 1. A henchman appears. Cast 'Weaken' on a 'Strong' one, or 'Bind' on a 'Agile' one. If they reach you you will take 40+ damage. 2. Surok throws an explosive orb. You must telegrab it, and then alch it, or you will take 45+ damage. 3. Surok casts a surge attack. Cast the opposite elemental spell back. Cast Air for Earth, Water for Fire, Earth for Air, Fire for Water.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the teleorb on Surok Magis.\",\"i\":[\"Teleorb\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Akrisae in the White Knights' Castle, on the ground floor on the east side.\",\"i\":[\"Strange teleorb\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bronze med helm\",\"Iron chainbody\",\"Magic weapon\",\"Melee weapon\",\"Unpowered orb\",\"Runes for any charge orb spell you have the level to cast\"],\"tr\":[\"Falador teleport\"],\"r\":[\"Many casts of a Bind spell\",\"Many casts of a Weaken spell\",\"Many casts of Low level alchemy spell\",\"Many casts of a Telekinetic grab\",\"Many casts of your strongest wind, water, earth, and fire spells\",\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Stamina potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"3 Elite Black Knights (level 138)\",\"Surok Magis (level 265)\"]},{\"n\":\"Confrontation\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"If you don't have the dark squall robes, talk to Silif near Akrisae for them. Wear the robes, then enter the cell near Akrisae.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"],\"i\":[\"Dark squall hood\",\"Dark squall robe top\",\"Dark squall robe bottom\"]},{\"t\":\"Only if you don't already have the strange teleorb, a law rune and a death rune: climb down the ladder to get them. If you have all three, skip this step and the next three.\",\"i\":[\"Full dark squall outfit\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the west desk for a law and death rune.\",\"i\":[\"Full dark squall outfit\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the south table for a strange teleorb.\",\"i\":[\"Full dark squall outfit\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb back up the ladder to the east.\",\"i\":[\"Strange teleorb\",\"Law rune\",\"Death rune\",\"Full dark squall outfit\"]},{\"t\":\"Stand in the middle of the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Activate the strange teleorb. Make sure your law and death rune are not in a rune pouch.\",\"i\":[\"Strange teleorb\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb the ice wall in the north-east, next to the chaos temple.\"},{\"t\":\"Jump across the ledge, and watch the following cutscene.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Delving Deeper\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Idria in Falador Castle.\"},{\"t\":\"Teleport to the Tears of Guthix using a games necklace, or travel there through the Lumbridge Swamp.\",\"s\":[\"Tears of Guthix.\"],\"i\":[\"Full dark squall outfit\",\"Lit sapphire lantern\",\"Melee weapon\",\"Ranged weapon\",\"Magic weapon\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Movario in the north-west of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Dark squall hood\",\"Dark squall robe top\",\"Dark squall robe bottom\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a lit sapphire lantern on one of the light creatures to descend into the abyss.\",\"s\":[\"Travel into the chasm.\"],\"i\":[\"Lit sapphire lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the remains to the north-east for a spade.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the remains in the middle of the area for a hammer and chisel.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a spade on the rocks in the north-east of the area.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the brazier in the north-east of the area.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Chisel\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a spade on the rocks in the north-west of the area.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the north-west brazier.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the south-west brazier.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the south-east brazier.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Look at the three recessed blocks next to the cavities to the far south: their symbols differ per player. Use the air orb on the one with the air symbol.\",\"i\":[\"Air orb\"]},{\"t\":\"You can drop the spade, chisel and hammer now. Use the fire orb on the recessed block with the fire symbol, next to one of the three cavities to the far south.\",\"i\":[\"Fire orb\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the earth orb on the recessed block with the earth symbol, next to one of the three cavities to the far south.\",\"i\":[\"Earth orb\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb up the walls to the south.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the water orb on the recessed block just to the south, in the skeleton's mouth.\",\"i\":[\"Water orb\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the fire block on the recessed block just to the south, in the skeleton's mouth.\",\"i\":[\"Fire block\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb back down.\"},{\"t\":\"Take off anything in your weapon and shield slots, then enter the western cavity.\"},{\"t\":\"Crawl to the end and look at the mechanism's symbol. Which element it needs differs per player: use the air, earth or water block with the matching symbol on the recess.\",\"i\":[\"Air block\",\"Earth block\",\"Water block\"]},{\"t\":\"Return back to the main area.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the middle cavity.\"},{\"t\":\"Crawl to the end and look at the mechanism's symbol. Which element it needs differs per player: use the air, earth or water block with the matching symbol on the recess.\",\"i\":[\"Air block\",\"Earth block\",\"Water block\"]},{\"t\":\"Return back to the main area.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the eastern cavity.\"},{\"t\":\"Crawl to the end and look at the mechanism's symbol. Which element it needs differs per player: use the air, earth or water block with the matching symbol on the recess.\",\"i\":[\"Air block\",\"Earth block\",\"Water block\"]},{\"t\":\"Return back to the main area.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the walls to the south.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the stone cube.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the skull's mouth to the south.\"}],\"i\":[\"Full dark squall outfit\",\"Lit sapphire lantern\",\"Stamina potions (2)\"],\"tr\":[\"Games necklace\"],\"r\":[\"Food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"n\":\"The Temple\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the skeleton north of the stone table.\"},{\"t\":\"Cast bloom near any of the roots for items to fill your druid pouch with.\",\"i\":[\"Silver sickle (b)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the druid pouch on nearby druid spirits for herblore ingredients.\"},{\"t\":\"Eight statues each need the ingredients of one potion, and which potion differs per player: examine a statue to see which potion it needs. Use the right ingredients on the statues up these paths, in this order: south-west path (down the south branch), north-west path, south-east path (up the north branch), west path, south-east path (down the south branch), north-east path, south-west path (up the north branch), east path. You can get ingredients by using your druid pouch on the druid spirits around the area.\"},{\"t\":\"Potion ingredients. Agility: toadflax, toad's legs. Energy: harralander, chocolate dust. Restoration: harralander, red spider's eggs. Attack: guam leaf, eye of newt. Strength: tarromin, limpwurt root. Defence: ranarr weed, white berries. Combat: harralander, goat horn dust. Ranged: dwarf weed, wine of Zamorak. Prayer: ranarr weed, snape grass. Hunter: avantoe, kebbit teeth dust. Fishing: avantoe, snape grass. Magic: lantadyme, potato cactus. Balance: harralander, red spider's eggs, garlic, silver dust.\"},{\"t\":\"Use all the dolmens on the stone table in the middle of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Dolmen\"]}],\"i\":[\"Lit sapphire lantern\"],\"tr\":[\"Games necklace\"]},{\"n\":\"The Stone\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Head through the now open entrance to the south and approach the Stone of Jas, ready to fight.\"},{\"t\":\"Fight the Balance Elemental. You need all 3 combat styles to defeat it. If you pray incorrectly against the first new style of attack, your stats will be majorly drained. As its health gets lower, it starts to attack faster. When it has a fire head, it attacks with ranged. When it has an air head, it attacks with melee. When it has a water head, it attacks with magic.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the Stone of Jas.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Movario.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat the Tormented Demons. Your stats are 255 each.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Idria to teleport back to Falador Castle.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Akrisae in the White Knights' Castle, on the ground floor on the east side, to finish the quest!\"}],\"i\":[\"Melee weapon\",\"Ranged weapon\",\"Magic weapon\"],\"tr\":[\"Games necklace\"],\"r\":[\"Food\",\"Super restore potions (4)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Balance Elemental (level 524)\",\"2 Tormented Demons (level 450)\"]}]}"
        "Witch's House" -> "{\"n\":\"Witch's House\",\"items\":[\"Cheese (multiple if you mess up)\",\"Leather gloves\",\"Combat gear and food for monsters up to level 53\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Witch's experiment (level 19, 30, 42 and 53)\"],\"rewards\":[\"4 Quest points\",\"6,325 Hitpoints XP\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Start the quest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Boy in Taverley to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"What's the matter?\",\"Ok, I'll see what I can do.\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Cheese (multiple if you mess up)\",\"Leather gloves\",\"Combat gear and food for monsters up to level 53\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Accessing the garden\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go west, then north from the Boy to the witch's house, across from the player-owned house portal. Look under the potted plant closest to the door for the house key.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the witch's house.\",\"i\":[\"Door key\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the ladder to the basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the gate whilst wearing gloves. If you don't have gloves, search the nearby boxes until you get a pair.\",\"i\":[\"Leather gloves\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the cupboard and get a magnet from it\"},{\"t\":\"Climb back up the ladder.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the cheese on the mouse hole in the south room, then use the magnet on the mouse which emerges.\",\"i\":[\"Cheese (multiple if you mess up)\",\"Magnet\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Read the witch's diary\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pick up the witch's diary from the table and read it to ensure the door stays unlocked.\",\"i\":[\"Witch's diary\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Defeat the witch's experiment\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the garden and sneak around the perimeter to search the fountain. If the witch spots you, you'll be teleported outside.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the shed key on the shed door to enter.\",\"i\":[\"Key\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill all four forms of the Witch's experiment (levels 19, 30, 42, and 53). You can safe spot the last two forms from the crate in the south of the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the ball.\",\"i\":[\"Ball\"]},{\"t\":\"Return the ball to the boy. Make sure the witch doesn't spot you or you'll have to get the ball back again..\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Witch's experiment (level 19, 30, 42 and 53)\"]}]}"
        "Witch's Potion" -> "{\"n\":\"Witch's Potion\",\"items\":[\"Onion\",\"Burnt meat\",\"Eye of newt\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Rat (level 1)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"325 Magic XP\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Hetty in Rimmington.\",\"s\":[\"I am in search of a quest.\",\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Onion\",\"Eye of newt\",\"Burnt meat\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Getting a rat's tail\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Kill a rat in the house to the west for a rat tail.\",\"i\":[\"Rat's tail\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Make the potion\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bring the ingredients to Hetty.\",\"i\":[\"Onion\",\"Eye of newt\",\"Burnt meat\",\"Rat's tail\"]},{\"t\":\"Drink from the cauldron to finish off the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rat's tail\",\"Onion\",\"Burnt meat\",\"Eye of newt\"]}]}"
        "X Marks the Spot" -> "{\"n\":\"X Marks the Spot\",\"items\":[\"Spade\"],\"rec\":[\"Amulet of Glory for faster teleport to Draynor Village.\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"300 Exp. Lamp (Any Skill)\",\"200 x Coins\",\"A Beginner Clue Scroll\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Speak to Veos\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Veos in The Sheared Ram pub in Lumbridge to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"I'm looking for a quest.\",\"Sounds good, what should I do?\",\"Can I help?\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Spade\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Solve the clue scroll\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Dig north of Bob's Brilliant Axes, on the west side of the plant against the wall of his house.\",\"s\":[\"Okay, thanks Veos.\"],\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Dig behind Lumbridge Castle, just outside the kitchen door: stand one tile south-west of the large crate there.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to Draynor Village. Dig north-west of the jail, by the wheat farm: four tiles north of the bush near Leela.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]},{\"t\":\"Dig just inside the pig pen in the Draynor Market.\",\"i\":[\"Spade\"]}],\"i\":[\"Spade\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Bring the casket to Veos\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Veos directly south of the Rusty Anchor Inn in Port Sarim to finish the quest.\",\"i\":[\"Ancient casket\"]}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Zogre Flesh Eaters" -> "{\"n\":\"Zogre Flesh Eaters\",\"items\":[\"Either brutal arrows or Crumble Undead for fighting Slash Bash\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Slash Bash (level 111)\",\"Zombie (level 39)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"2,000 Fletching XP\",\"2,000 Ranged XP\",\"2,000 Herblore XP\",\"3 x Ourg Bones\",\"2 x Zogre Bones\",\"Ability to make Relicym's balm\",\"Ability to fletch Comp Ogre Bows and Brutal Arrows\",\"Ability to wear Inoculation Bracelets\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Grish south of Castle Wars.\",\"s\":[\"What do you mean sickies?\",\"Can I help in any way?\",\"Ok, I'll check things out then and report back.\",\"Yes, I'm really sure!\",\"Yes, I want to help you out and find out about the zogres.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the guard east of Grish.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb over the crushed barricade east of the guard, then run east to the stairs and climb down.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the skeleton in the north west corner of this area.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the zombie which appeared, and pick up the ruined backpack that appeared.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the backpack for a knife and a dragon inn tankard.\",\"i\":[\"Ruined backpack\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the broken lecturn in the north west corner of the tombs.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the ogre coffin next to the skeleton.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a knife on the ogre coffin next to the skeleton.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the coffin next to the skeleton again. It may take a few attempts to open.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the coffin for a black prism.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Zombie (level 39)\"]},{\"n\":\"Investigating\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Zavistic Rarve at the Yanille Wizards' Guild. If you don't have 66 Magic, ring the bell outside the guild.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here about the sicks...err Zogres\"]},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs in the house north of the Wizards' Guild and talk to Sithik Ints in the bed to the west.\",\"s\":[\"Do you mind if I look around?\"]},{\"t\":\"Search Sithik's wardrobe.\"},{\"t\":\"Search Sithik's cupboard.\"},{\"t\":\"Search Sithik's drawers for more papyrus.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the book of portraiture on Sithik Ints, then use the papyrus on him with charcoal in your inventory to draw him. Use the portrait on him: he must praise its honesty. If he praises its truth, or its examine text isn't \\\"A classic realist charcoal portrait of Sithik.\\\", drop it, search the drawers for more papyrus and draw him again.\",\"i\":[\"Papyrus\",\"Charcoal\"]},{\"t\":\"Travel to the Dragon Inn in Yanille and use the dragon inn tankard on the bartender.\",\"i\":[\"Dragon inn tankard\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the portrait on the bartender.\",\"i\":[\"Sithik portrait\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the books, the signed portrait and the dragon inn tankard to Zavistic Rarve at the Yanille Wizards' Guild. If you don't have 66 Magic, ring the bell outside the guild.\",\"s\":[\"I'm here about the sicks...err Zogres\",\"I have some items that I'd like you to look at.\"],\"i\":[\"Signed portrait\",\"Book of 'h.a.m'\",\"Necromancy book\",\"Dragon inn tankard\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Discover the truth\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go upstairs and talk to Sithik in the house north of the Wizards' Guild.\",\"i\":[\"Strange potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the strange potion on the cup of tea next to Sithik.\",\"i\":[\"Strange potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Leave Sithik Int's house.\"},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs and talk to Sithik in the house north of the Wizards' Guild.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the transformed Sithik Ints and ask him all three questions.\",\"s\":[\"How do I remove the effects of the spell from the area?\",\"How do I get rid of the undead ogres?\",\"How do I get rid of the disease?\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Help the ogres\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Grish south of Castle Wars. Be prepared to fight Slash Bash. You'll need to use either brutal arrows or the Crumble Undead spell.\",\"s\":[\"I found who's responsible for the Zogres being here.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Grish south of Castle Wars again to learn how to make composite ogre bows.\",\"s\":[\"There must be an easier way to kill these zogres!\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb over the barricade east of Grish, prepared to fight Slash Bash.\",\"s\":[\"Sorry, I have to go.\"],\"i\":[\"Ogre gate key\"]},{\"t\":\"Climb down the stairs to the east.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the doors at the west side of the area.\",\"i\":[\"Ogre gate key\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the stairs to the boss.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the stand in the north east corner, and kill Slash Bash when he spawns.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the ogre artefact.\",\"i\":[\"Ogre artefact\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Grish with the ogre artefact.\",\"s\":[\"Yeah, I have them here!\"],\"i\":[\"Ogre artefact\"]}],\"i\":[\"Either brutal arrows or Crumble Undead for fighting Slash Bash\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Slash Bash (level 111)\"]}]}"
        else -> null
